		<rdfs:label>article-0000e75c-68cb-439b-b14d-dc19f65314d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden has insisted that the evacuation of Kabul was done as efficiently as possible. But key documents obtained by The New York Times suggest otherwise.</rdfs:comment>
