		<rdfs:label>article-00101ea3-cab3-4ce7-bdba-c8257d70f56a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Biden said the United States would cut off Russia’s largest banks and largest companies from the western financial markets, freeze assets of Russian elites and restrict exports of technology to Russia.</rdfs:comment>
