		<rdfs:label>article-00266ee9-cf48-4617-9ae9-de45ae2b76dd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hospitals are airlifting patients to facilities hundreds of miles away to handle an influx of Americans and U.S. green card holders sickened in Mexico.</rdfs:comment>
