		<rdfs:label>article-003667ba-f1a0-455a-9a92-6073624f006e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration is caught between critics in Congress and allies in Europe over returning to an accord to limit Iran’s nuclear ambitions without bending to Tehran’s demands for financial relief.</rdfs:comment>
