		<rdfs:label>article-003b2f27-9895-4c73-b905-4a8fc02200a6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nonviolent offenders, the medically vulnerable and those near the end of their sentences should be released. Those who remain deserve much better medical care.</rdfs:comment>
