		<rdfs:label>article-003e2ca6-3fbf-4016-9748-fb7f31e3cac2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Caroline Giuliani, the daughter of Rudolph W. Giuliani, President Trump’s personal lawyer and the former mayor of New York, on Thursday endorsed Joseph R. Biden Jr. for president, writing in Vanity Fair that “the only way to end this nightmare is to vote.”</rdfs:comment>
