		<rdfs:label>article-003ea2ce-1fc4-40fa-a198-34d51303df18</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a tumultuous year and the end of a presidency, voters say that Donald J. Trump’s second impeachment feels very different from his first.</rdfs:comment>
