	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0049ef87-d4ed-4541-9005-572f1e2e58c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-0049ef87-d4ed-4541-9005-572f1e2e58c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden blessed the plan to lower the income cap for Americans receiving checks of up to $1,400, a crucial concession to moderates whose backing is needed to pass the bill.</rdfs:comment>
