	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-004aeb01-cbe5-483a-8f3f-60614a3d8ddc">
		<rdfs:label>article-004aeb01-cbe5-483a-8f3f-60614a3d8ddc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“We’re here and they’re not.” The president shows that he didn’t need a party in a big arena when the White House lawn was available.</rdfs:comment>
