	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-004d6121-f9f9-4065-adcc-f89b240ceefa">
		<rdfs:label>article-004d6121-f9f9-4065-adcc-f89b240ceefa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A United States Capitol Police officer who was seriously injured during violent protests in Washington remained hospitalized on Thursday night, one day after the police were overwhelmed by a pro-Trump mob that stormed the Capitol and disrupted Congress.</rdfs:comment>
