		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0052b4f1-23fe-4431-ae5c-ecbba0e17e65">
		<rdfs:label>article-0052b4f1-23fe-4431-ae5c-ecbba0e17e65</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After contentious talks in Alaska, the visit by President Biden’s climate envoy could signal that the two countries are willing work together on some issues, even as they clash on others.</rdfs:comment>
