		<rdfs:label>article-005d6697-9a1a-4925-ac35-f9541dbc025a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The tool, essentially a standardized battery of questions and medical tests, can help determine the kind of care needed by people affected by the “anomalous health incidents.”</rdfs:comment>
