	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0062e6ae-0f34-4d9c-9c76-31dad080f219">
		<rdfs:label>article-0062e6ae-0f34-4d9c-9c76-31dad080f219</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He has a way of winning Wisconsin Senate races in spite of his weird behavior. Democrats see ousting him this fall as key to keeping the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
