	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-006bf3a4-93f3-4d55-a031-0ce64e85510a">
		<rdfs:label>article-006bf3a4-93f3-4d55-a031-0ce64e85510a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an appearance recorded 10 days after the draft opinion overturning Roe v. Wade was leaked in May, both maintained that relations on the court were warm and respectful.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-29"/>
