		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0076339f-14c1-494d-8d2a-df69f1093c9e">
		<rdfs:label>article-0076339f-14c1-494d-8d2a-df69f1093c9e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even before the “60 Minutes” interviews with the candidates aired, they attracted attention, in Mr. Biden’s case because of comments on the Supreme Court, and in Mr. Trump’s case because he walked out.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-577cfa39-5806-4396-ae24-cdf4ba406715"/>
