	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-007d7735-290c-45fb-8dca-9d3b0a69894f">
		<rdfs:label>article-007d7735-290c-45fb-8dca-9d3b0a69894f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hundreds of scientists and policy experts left the government during the Trump administration. The jobs remain unfilled six months into President Biden’s term.</rdfs:comment>
