	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-00839973-1b81-44b5-a90f-dd4013987b15">
		<rdfs:label>article-00839973-1b81-44b5-a90f-dd4013987b15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The penalties will affect Russia’s biggest banks, its weapons industry, its largest energy company and families close to President Vladimir V. Putin. The country’s stock market has plummeted.</rdfs:comment>
