		<rdfs:label>article-00891439-cddf-494c-9716-d248dc240524</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many in the state G.O.P. are expending significant effort to seek cover from the president’s outrage over his defeat, hoping to retain the support of his base.</rdfs:comment>
