	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-008c30b6-6817-451a-b871-a0f511e4e330">
		<rdfs:label>article-008c30b6-6817-451a-b871-a0f511e4e330</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a debate in Iowa, the Republican Senator Joni Ernst and her Democratic challenger, Theresa Greenfield, clashed on health care, abortion and policing.</rdfs:comment>
