	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0091ee1b-63ce-46d3-a974-52118557ce74">
		<rdfs:label>article-0091ee1b-63ce-46d3-a974-52118557ce74</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With millions of votes still left to be counted, President Trump early Wednesday falsely declared that he had won his race for re-election, warning that he would go to the Supreme Court to try to prematurely shut the election down.</rdfs:comment>
