		<rdfs:label>article-0095d150-9fbe-475d-a7a2-deb1a15048ad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wesley Hunt, a Black Republican poised to win a seat in Congress this fall, thinks his party’s future is in more candidates like him.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-843f7a86-cb21-42c6-b668-9e9388bb54e5"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0097490f-ec8f-4350-8ad6-10593c876ae8">
		<rdfs:label>article-0097490f-ec8f-4350-8ad6-10593c876ae8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The highly selective college in Massachusetts will be among the first elite schools in the country to abandon the practice, which has been a persistent barrier to increasing student diversity.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-60369502-b152-49d7-982e-93f0386300f3"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0097e1a7-bdf3-4192-acdf-8235e2e45c90">
		<rdfs:label>article-0097e1a7-bdf3-4192-acdf-8235e2e45c90</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than 10 percent of the Mississippi Band of Choctaw Indians has had the coronavirus, and the tribe is bracing for a second wave and more devastation.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-bdbbb05b-6fa3-49c7-aa85-71057abb04d2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-009c1412-d710-4a52-80df-dfacf70dc555">
		<rdfs:label>article-009c1412-d710-4a52-80df-dfacf70dc555</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a State of the Union watch party in Michigan, the president’s most loyal supporters dug in their heels.</rdfs:comment>
