	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-00a076df-b7aa-4cd3-aeba-ae96a4af1256">
		<rdfs:label>article-00a076df-b7aa-4cd3-aeba-ae96a4af1256</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A popular Netflix documentary has brought a Florida sheriff a flood of new theories in the unsolved disappearance.</rdfs:comment>
