	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-00a0ba42-58bf-43e0-a662-ad4f429a115e">
		<rdfs:label>article-00a0ba42-58bf-43e0-a662-ad4f429a115e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The campaign to recall the state’s governor shows that even a one-party stronghold like California can be rocked by the nation’s political polarization.</rdfs:comment>
