	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0139f953-3a70-4c31-9cd4-03ffdf55f206">
		<rdfs:label>article-0139f953-3a70-4c31-9cd4-03ffdf55f206</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Small towns in Texas and Arizona are seeing dozens of migrants arriving each day, in some cases straining local resources. More are coming, federal officials warn.</rdfs:comment>
