		<rdfs:label>article-01696d03-9f92-4c90-948b-649bf7e0eeba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Research has increasingly shown that warming is taking a deadly toll on human health. At the global climate summit in Glasgow, the issue has gained new prominence.</rdfs:comment>
