		<rdfs:label>article-018939a2-f837-449c-8fda-294f80914d30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Warnings from Democrats that Republicans and their Supreme Court nominee threaten the Affordable Care Act elicited reassuring words from both Senator Lindsey Graham and Judge Amy Coney Barrett.</rdfs:comment>
