	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-018f2c60-bc10-4c25-9bd8-651c02b65194">
		<rdfs:label>article-018f2c60-bc10-4c25-9bd8-651c02b65194</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The change, for now only visible to beta testers, reflects the popularity and shifting meaning of a symbol once mainly used to discuss blood donations.</rdfs:comment>
