	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0199f60b-8793-49f5-bcdc-7c9ac4d944f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-0199f60b-8793-49f5-bcdc-7c9ac4d944f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hospitals in Washington State, already strained, are taking on an influx of Covid patients from Idaho, where the governor has refused to require masks or vaccinations.</rdfs:comment>
