		<rdfs:label>article-01a5314a-8e6e-4b53-8d8d-1ad6e5c41f7a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The tumult and passion of the past weeks have left the surviving veterans of the civil rights era with trepidation and hope.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-91caa243-6ff4-4c6d-affc-51bd8da8617d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-17"/>
