		<rdfs:label>article-01ae3833-162d-411f-9319-6a716329744b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has been dissuaded from striking Iran in recent days after his aides warned it could escalate into a broader conflict in his last weeks in office.</rdfs:comment>
