		<rdfs:label>article-01afbd89-c3aa-47f1-bb0a-f21548f38ff7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A growing number of states are pausing plans to reopen, amid rising case counts. But Gov. Greg Abbott of Texas said shutting back down was the “last thing we want to do.”</rdfs:comment>
