		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-01b3fd97-c13b-4f32-86fb-cb3f1ad2919b">
		<rdfs:label>article-01b3fd97-c13b-4f32-86fb-cb3f1ad2919b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new legal and political front is coming into view as the nation starts to ease public health limits that have crippled the economy: Will business owners fear lawsuits and stay closed anyway?</rdfs:comment>
