	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-01bf95ad-ade7-4553-8c91-7ef5929616af">
		<rdfs:label>article-01bf95ad-ade7-4553-8c91-7ef5929616af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lacking effective legislative or legal ways to stop Republicans from introducing new voting limits, Democrats are applying pressure on their allies in Washington and trying to energize supporters.</rdfs:comment>
