	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-01f2d8c2-1cd7-48bc-8270-4a190ea6e4a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-01f2d8c2-1cd7-48bc-8270-4a190ea6e4a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The F.D.A. issued emergency approval for an antiviral drug. High school seniors appear reluctant to commit to a college for the fall.</rdfs:comment>
