		<rdfs:label>article-020c8d1c-748b-4252-baa2-aad34a022290</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If Republicans control the Senate, a Biden administration could take a cue from President Trump and find ways to act unilaterally on some economic issues.</rdfs:comment>
