		<rdfs:label>article-0213ccdc-1205-491e-b357-88d437e99eda</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Greg Abbott called the law, which will sharply curtail access to the ballot in Texas, a “paradigm” for other states looking to pass election bills.</rdfs:comment>
