	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-02170f3e-c221-44f3-bfee-89229a6d947d">
		<rdfs:label>article-02170f3e-c221-44f3-bfee-89229a6d947d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wednesday: A trustee ordered up to $25,000 in payments to fire victims, saying many are destitute. Also: A coronavirus update.</rdfs:comment>
