	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-02191aef-695d-4779-9071-7da1aa8baaaf">
		<rdfs:label>article-02191aef-695d-4779-9071-7da1aa8baaaf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Each candidate in Georgia’s pivotal Senate race booked 60 seconds of ads at a cost of $100,000 during the showdown between Tennessee and Georgia.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4bd1aa5-c807-421e-b8ae-1b3824d70300"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-021c37fa-88d2-40ac-89a1-38a8cced4588">
		<rdfs:label>article-021c37fa-88d2-40ac-89a1-38a8cced4588</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump hailed his acquittal in the Senate impeachment trial as vindication, but the struggle now moves back to the House, the campaign trail and, ultimately, the voters.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0221ec9e-2fb6-4a6e-944a-efd5bdb06a11">
		<rdfs:label>article-0221ec9e-2fb6-4a6e-944a-efd5bdb06a11</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Appearing with right-wing candidates in Pennsylvania and Ohio, the Florida governor signaled his desire to take over Donald Trump’s political movement. Whether Republican voters want that to happen remains to be seen.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-022602a7-8a48-476f-9274-a65008971bf9">
		<rdfs:label>article-022602a7-8a48-476f-9274-a65008971bf9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former campaign workers for Michael R. Bloomberg’s presidential bid reacted angrily on Monday to news that they would not work through the November election, as expected.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-864756c8-4d62-42e5-a6e4-482550bf62a9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-022a2aad-bb8c-41cc-9191-e0b626487f0c">
		<rdfs:label>article-022a2aad-bb8c-41cc-9191-e0b626487f0c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Desire for structural changes cuts across both parties, a Times/Siena College poll found, but for starkly different reasons. Even Democrats now question if the government is a force for good.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-022c7ab8-678d-4805-98b4-c691f0db10aa">
		<rdfs:label>article-022c7ab8-678d-4805-98b4-c691f0db10aa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Long before this week’s election chaos, experts had warned Georgia about its over $100 million voting system, saying paper ballots were simpler and safer.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-21d856ad-a6ae-406e-a9e4-9707218ad815"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-022dc7db-6a84-45ea-821e-cfc6d9557471">
		<rdfs:label>article-022dc7db-6a84-45ea-821e-cfc6d9557471</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>They include a woman and a girl killed by carbon monoxide poisoning in Houston, and several who died in car accidents on icy roads.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6bc8c5a9-d09c-4f66-9308-4f0bbc37ff83"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a8e16e77-2252-4f28-a3a1-fbe3392ad214"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ae47edf3-29dc-462d-b74b-f886ebf56402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0231d6d3-74b1-49a1-a19f-aff7ec77cf3c">
		<rdfs:label>article-0231d6d3-74b1-49a1-a19f-aff7ec77cf3c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>State and local health officials have found themselves at the center of regular news briefings amid the coronavirus outbreak, making them targets for harassment and threats.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3d0d7757-313d-444e-a4df-32876c51aaa0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0234874c-f0e4-4e22-b3d9-d52d7528ee9b">
		<rdfs:label>article-0234874c-f0e4-4e22-b3d9-d52d7528ee9b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A document released by court order showed how in 2019, Justice Department lawyers argued that President Donald J. Trump had not illegally impeded the Russia investigation.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2c183a13-1898-4deb-ad56-cc02fd034eaf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-92d6a2c3-4676-4b0a-b692-bac80f669045"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-023cc7bb-ec6e-490e-8f74-4a763d7d0545">
		<rdfs:label>article-023cc7bb-ec6e-490e-8f74-4a763d7d0545</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For all that narratives about crime shape American politics, survivors are rarely centered in the conversation, if they are heard at all. A campaign called #HealTheVote is trying to change that.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-023d23a4-67af-46f3-b2cd-926b084757b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-023d23a4-67af-46f3-b2cd-926b084757b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As federal agents patrol Portland and head to Chicago, Democrats call the president’s plan “an American crisis,” barely 100 days before the election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-10ca0ade-8ca5-4477-ab8b-c8056ef786ef"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-558cc815-e7e6-47a5-bd90-ac5a453042ba"/>
