		<rdfs:comment>Monday: Information about who’s eligible for state pandemic aid and how to get it. Also: The Golden Globes.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5d63bd62-89ce-492f-b9ae-e5b2f12971c8"/>
