	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0258945e-ae5b-46b9-837b-412cb0585950">
		<rdfs:label>article-0258945e-ae5b-46b9-837b-412cb0585950</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Flash flooding in Northern Colorado killed two people on Friday afternoon, according to the Larimer County Sheriff’s Office.</rdfs:comment>
