		<rdfs:label>article-027d9ed2-b2e0-4dd5-8c70-6964ab0c7a3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats have ratcheted up their criticism of Mr. Valentine in the final weeks of the campaign, but his outsize presence is a formidable campaign asset.</rdfs:comment>
