		<rdfs:label>article-027dc211-a9e6-4d95-88ba-8422be458f57</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden campaign has announced the release of five new ads — targeting Hispanic voters, rural communities, working families, the elderly and veterans — in 16 states, including all the major battlegrounds.</rdfs:comment>
