		<rdfs:label>article-029cdd5c-68d3-487d-9cc8-1af878d1593d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A rally on Saturday in Philadelphia was their first joint campaign appearance since President Biden took office, adding a twist to the relationship of what has always been a political odd couple.</rdfs:comment>
