		<rdfs:label>article-029cf0ad-d950-4b7f-ba05-c284a2126168</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The action paved the way for a historic vote on Friday that will make Lloyd J. Austin III, a retired four-star Army general, the first Black American to lead the Pentagon.</rdfs:comment>
