		<rdfs:label>article-0382ac58-4211-4690-9a76-1f2d1fc06bbe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With only a month before Election Day, a legal battle is erupting in Texas over an order this week by Gov. Greg Abbott, a Republican, to limit the number of drop-off locations for voters to cast absentee ballots.</rdfs:comment>
