	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-03844faf-84e7-480d-b11b-cacfd55f264d">
		<rdfs:label>article-03844faf-84e7-480d-b11b-cacfd55f264d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dispensing with his unity message, President Biden reached into the 2020 file cabinet and vowed to win “a battle for the soul of this nation,” the cornerstone of his successful election.</rdfs:comment>
