	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-03845c1a-5b9e-4485-9c58-ade39de0fce1">
		<rdfs:label>article-03845c1a-5b9e-4485-9c58-ade39de0fce1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democratic nominee spoke of Americans lost to the coronavirus, parried attacks over his son and proceeded cautiously on immigration.</rdfs:comment>
