		<rdfs:label>article-0386df07-ce2b-472f-8c28-9c1e42623cea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus has affected about two dozen Postal Service workers around the country, and fear of a greater outbreak grows.</rdfs:comment>
