	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0387d2f5-210b-4547-8187-fdeadacb0a39">
		<rdfs:label>article-0387d2f5-210b-4547-8187-fdeadacb0a39</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former President Donald Trump’s current woes extend beyond the report by the House Jan. 6 committee, but the case the panel laid out against him further complicates his future.</rdfs:comment>
