	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0387df31-cfcd-45ac-a18d-89a44934c7f4">
		<rdfs:label>article-0387df31-cfcd-45ac-a18d-89a44934c7f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite the president’s slow performance on the coronavirus and his series of falsehoods, some independent voters and Democrats are giving him a measure of credit for his handling of the crisis.</rdfs:comment>
