		<rdfs:label>article-0389b4eb-49c2-45ae-b8ed-24420c4a269d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s advisers want him to present an affirmative vision for the country. Joe Biden’s team is bracing for ugly attacks.</rdfs:comment>
