	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-03d246f4-0b7a-444e-ab80-fc15add70993">
		<rdfs:label>article-03d246f4-0b7a-444e-ab80-fc15add70993</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two of our correspondents break down highlights from the Democrats’ first virtual convention.</rdfs:comment>
