		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-03d3d0a5-b883-40b1-b74e-44c71e5542cc">
		<rdfs:label>article-03d3d0a5-b883-40b1-b74e-44c71e5542cc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The authorities say there has been a surge in fraud and cons seeking to capitalize on fears of the virus.</rdfs:comment>
