		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-03d92166-c2be-4ba4-a266-467c51d38c18">
		<rdfs:label>article-03d92166-c2be-4ba4-a266-467c51d38c18</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As in the “Swiss cheese model” of Covid prevention, a lot of small measures add up.</rdfs:comment>
