		<rdfs:label>article-0411b0f2-9805-4dc1-bacd-b262fb8ec58e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The charges come after Mr. Brooks was fatally shot during a confrontation outside of a fast-food restaurant. His family said prosecuting the officer was “the only way to heal some of these wounds.”</rdfs:comment>
