	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0412be47-c42b-4dd3-976a-b455a5f32ed7">
		<rdfs:label>article-0412be47-c42b-4dd3-976a-b455a5f32ed7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democrat is facing off for a second time against Brian Kemp, a Republican — but in a far-more-difficult political climate.</rdfs:comment>
