	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0414b219-ea8a-4872-b92d-e636ba9abbfc">
		<rdfs:label>article-0414b219-ea8a-4872-b92d-e636ba9abbfc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As with so much else with the former president, there is not one easy answer as to why he refused and ignited a legal firestorm. But here are some possibilities.</rdfs:comment>
