	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-04163065-933b-48c8-b64c-2c3690605cea">
		<rdfs:label>article-04163065-933b-48c8-b64c-2c3690605cea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The end of the federal ban on evictions came amid soaring rents that make it harder for people to find new places to live.</rdfs:comment>
