	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-04164b97-c8f1-4493-bc35-d015eea03d30">
		<rdfs:label>article-04164b97-c8f1-4493-bc35-d015eea03d30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two right-wing political operatives were charged with felonies in connection with a robocall scheme that Michigan’s attorney general said was part of a broad voter suppression effort.</rdfs:comment>
