	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-041a3d0a-eb69-42d5-818d-85b90d57bf30">
		<rdfs:label>article-041a3d0a-eb69-42d5-818d-85b90d57bf30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As senators prepare to return on Monday, Congress’s doctor warned that he does not have the capacity to test all 100 for coronavirus. At the White House, the president and many of his aides are tested repeatedly.</rdfs:comment>
