		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0420bd4e-2b7e-4fa8-9805-04ff97c79062">
		<rdfs:label>article-0420bd4e-2b7e-4fa8-9805-04ff97c79062</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Outflanked by five impatient and ambitious justices to his right, the chief justice has become powerless to pursue his incremental approach.</rdfs:comment>
