		<rdfs:label>article-0429f688-3c68-4f57-bbf1-c69f78d167f7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Public schools are increasingly using savings from solar energy to upgrade facilities, help their communities, and give teachers raises — often with no cost to taxpayers.</rdfs:comment>
