		<rdfs:label>article-042b6c10-eaf3-4feb-86f7-67eb1849f43a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Researchers found that sharp declines in food shortages, financial instability and anxiety coincided with the two most recent rounds of payments.</rdfs:comment>
