	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0471a89c-2e06-4edd-bcca-460bdbd647ac">
		<rdfs:label>article-0471a89c-2e06-4edd-bcca-460bdbd647ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Judge Merrick B. Garland prepares to take over the Justice Department, officials have already begun to reverse Trump-era policies denounced by Democrats and restore what longtime employees described as a less charged environment where they no longer feared retaliation from the president or public criticism from the attorney general.</rdfs:comment>
