	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-04732f1c-d35f-4a60-9495-99112f75f26a">
		<rdfs:label>article-04732f1c-d35f-4a60-9495-99112f75f26a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump campaign’s digital ads herald the death of Maj. Gen. Qassim Suleimani, a top Iranian commander. They then direct voters to the “Official Trump Military Survey.”</rdfs:comment>
