		<rdfs:label>article-04845431-e1e1-4def-be95-50a123535d68</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a judge dismissed most of her claims, two will go forward. Lawyers expect she will have to clear a high bar, and her case relies on a collection of election deniers.</rdfs:comment>
