		<rdfs:label>article-04874576-6d93-4630-952f-a0869a3c4ab5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As state and local governments confront a new wave of coronavirus infections, President Trump is sending mixed messages and Washington’s public health bully pulpit has gone silent.</rdfs:comment>
