	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-048fd3aa-19df-46d5-bcfc-361442ab2f6d">
		<rdfs:label>article-048fd3aa-19df-46d5-bcfc-361442ab2f6d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump returned to the White House, made a show of removing his mask and declared “I’m better,” while Joe Biden held a socially distanced town hall event and urged people to heed experts.</rdfs:comment>
