	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-04ae1409-774c-46a3-a7f0-d92b1bd7b0de">
		<rdfs:label>article-04ae1409-774c-46a3-a7f0-d92b1bd7b0de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden wants to heal the soul of the country in this moment of protest and loss, and win the White House. Simply telling people to vote in November may not help with either goal.</rdfs:comment>
