	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-04b27ed3-28c0-41fa-84a5-8f7501b9337e">
		<rdfs:label>article-04b27ed3-28c0-41fa-84a5-8f7501b9337e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The agreement, which falls short of the sprawling changes championed by Democrats, is a significant step toward ending a yearslong impasse over gun reform legislation.</rdfs:comment>
