		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-04fa6992-0021-4919-b292-35ebfffdf18a">
		<rdfs:label>article-04fa6992-0021-4919-b292-35ebfffdf18a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The proposal comes as lawmakers in both parties have expressed renewed interest in curtailing presidential authority on matters of war and peace.</rdfs:comment>
