		<rdfs:label>article-0688bd17-31a0-46ea-86e6-16e1da29708a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden rallied the party around him, with help from Barack Obama and Bernie Sanders. But even as Democrats reach out to disaffected moderates, they’re also holding together a fractured coalition.</rdfs:comment>
