	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-06b75afe-eb14-46e7-ba17-dcda20a0f930">
		<rdfs:label>article-06b75afe-eb14-46e7-ba17-dcda20a0f930</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Texas has been hit with an unrelenting heat wave. Nowhere is it more miserable than in low-income areas that have less access to shade and air-conditioning.</rdfs:comment>
