	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-06bb40ca-6702-444f-86dd-ef435c4e615f">
		<rdfs:label>article-06bb40ca-6702-444f-86dd-ef435c4e615f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first 100 days of the Biden administration are likely to see a flurry of executive actions on climate change.</rdfs:comment>
