		<rdfs:label>article-06c02e0d-586a-4d88-aca0-6a96b8305644</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Very few of Georgia’s more than 100,000 voting-age Native Americans cast ballots in November. Even a small increase could make a difference in the Senate runoffs.</rdfs:comment>
