	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-06cc623b-aa33-4873-92bf-2d9852c9105d">
		<rdfs:label>article-06cc623b-aa33-4873-92bf-2d9852c9105d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Vaccines have now been administered at long-term care facilities in several states, but administrators warn that they will not bring a quick end to the long siege of the virus.</rdfs:comment>
