		<rdfs:label>article-06d29100-ecef-4644-a2cb-9f162d49cbac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The upset of the veteran congressman from St. Louis sent tremors through the Democratic establishment in Missouri and Washington, D.C.</rdfs:comment>
