	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-06d3133e-1410-4905-80d6-d594a63dea0b">
		<rdfs:label>article-06d3133e-1410-4905-80d6-d594a63dea0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>School resource officers were supposed to prevent mass shootings and juvenile crime. But some schools are eliminating them amid a clamor from students after George Floyd’s death.</rdfs:comment>
