		<rdfs:label>article-07a5ef1c-65b4-4024-900c-4f42a1c6961b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The author of a new study said the combination of blackouts and extreme heat “may be the deadliest climate-related event we can imagine.”</rdfs:comment>
