	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-07a7f893-e6d0-4b41-b4d3-270cc18a0c36">
		<rdfs:label>article-07a7f893-e6d0-4b41-b4d3-270cc18a0c36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Remarks by President Biden and the C.D.C. director, Dr. Rochelle Walensky, came after Dr. Walensky overruled a recommendation by her agency’s panel of scientific advisers against booster shots of the Pfizer-BioNTech Covid vaccine for frontline workers.</rdfs:comment>
