		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-07ab284e-d604-44e7-8b6b-51aae48cd16a">
		<rdfs:label>article-07ab284e-d604-44e7-8b6b-51aae48cd16a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At every step in her political career, the California congresswoman had to be coaxed to run for a higher office. Now she’s a top contender to be Joe Biden’s running mate.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6cc67a-b3c2-45c5-af7a-92a423ab1249"/>
