	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-07ab2b6c-1b90-4db2-aaea-6f4bd2c4bcce">
		<rdfs:label>article-07ab2b6c-1b90-4db2-aaea-6f4bd2c4bcce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The policy, set to take effect next week, would have closed the doors of the United States to most asylum seekers.</rdfs:comment>
