	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-07ad6021-748f-444d-8c1d-cae7f4906db3">
		<rdfs:label>article-07ad6021-748f-444d-8c1d-cae7f4906db3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Far more law enforcement officers in the U.S. have died from Covid-19 than from any other work-related cause in 2020 and 2021. Even so, police unions are fighting vaccine mandates.</rdfs:comment>
