		<rdfs:label>article-07afc095-42e9-409b-9b96-9714e87f2254</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The governor supports a bill passed on Wednesday that repeals language allowing people to arrest someone who they witnessed committing a crime.</rdfs:comment>
