		<rdfs:label>article-07b50918-f6d0-4bc7-a5b2-56bf0dc4743e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s “American Families Plan,” which he will detail this week, will be offset in part by a tax enforcement effort that administration officials believe will raise $700 billion over a decade.</rdfs:comment>
