		<rdfs:label>article-07b81ec6-5658-479c-9487-4b5d20be779d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After doubt about its data, the university dropped to No. 18 from No. 2. But now many are asking, can the rating system be that easily manipulated?</rdfs:comment>
