		<rdfs:label>article-07bc030f-3e9c-4efd-89fc-229c0b754bdf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden, who came into office vowing to “reinvigorate our national science and technology strategy,” is now facing a leadership vacuum that may threaten his ambitious research agenda, which stretches well beyond fighting the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
