		<rdfs:label>article-07bc3c27-f6e8-4c2a-a5ef-fdd9185b36e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jonathan Braun’s 10-year sentence for running a drug ring was commuted by the departing president. The White House did not mention that he faces separate accusations of violence and threats.</rdfs:comment>
