	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-07dc806e-6643-4002-ae9e-5aaee89bc327">
		<rdfs:label>article-07dc806e-6643-4002-ae9e-5aaee89bc327</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He has contemplated trying to overturn the 2020 election, a legal impossibility that is a popular cause among Wisconsin Republicans.</rdfs:comment>
