	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-091fce65-b159-40d3-a7fd-113eaaf5435a">
		<rdfs:label>article-091fce65-b159-40d3-a7fd-113eaaf5435a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States just lost 20 million jobs. The wrong federal response could make those layoffs a permanent fixture of the U.S. economy and sentence thousands of companies to bankruptcy.</rdfs:comment>
