		<rdfs:label>article-098c384f-c626-4701-8cb9-d3e1af29a6d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Weeks ago, his advisers were counting on a strong economy and a Democratic opponent easily portrayed as too far left. But the political landscape has sharply shifted.</rdfs:comment>
