		<rdfs:comment>A possible motive behind the mass shooting at an L.G.B.T.Q. nightclub in Colorado Springs has started to come into focus, with the suspect, Anderson Lee Aldrich, 22, being held on five counts of murder and five counts of hate crimes.</rdfs:comment>
