		<rdfs:label>article-09c7bc91-a706-47b2-8b26-ad46cc0dbd6a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Peters, who has become a celebrity in far-right circles, was beaten by Ms. Anderson, a longtime election official who has been a vocal opponent of misinformation about the 2020 contest.</rdfs:comment>
