	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09c81ab0-8d30-475e-b006-28f67ffd0eb3">
		<rdfs:label>article-09c81ab0-8d30-475e-b006-28f67ffd0eb3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite plans to reopen states, equipment to protect workers from the coronavirus remains in high demand. “The need for an organized, equitable distribution system is dire,” a doctor said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2ea9c262-0fd2-4821-af91-3a44e787aaf8"/>
