	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09d87ee3-4e2f-4fde-9c91-6dcbb5708bf6">
		<rdfs:label>article-09d87ee3-4e2f-4fde-9c91-6dcbb5708bf6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Crime was on voters’ minds in California, and for Republican incumbents in the House, a vote for a bipartisan Jan. 6 inquiry loomed large.</rdfs:comment>
