	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09dd1b02-d4ed-448d-b442-565cd58d12f8">
		<rdfs:label>article-09dd1b02-d4ed-448d-b442-565cd58d12f8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Defense lawyers wanted a deposition from a Yemeni detainee who has been cleared for release, but the detainee said he feared his testimony would be used against him.</rdfs:comment>
