	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09dd36c2-46f6-4955-822f-0f994334804f">
		<rdfs:label>article-09dd36c2-46f6-4955-822f-0f994334804f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court’s surprising 6-to-3 ruling in favor of gay and transgender rights was perhaps the strongest evidence yet of how fundamentally and unpredictably American views have changed.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ebf4f94d-a728-4327-b424-d347782b7b17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ef6cc7eb-b6e8-4dba-84e0-6b42579e91d0"/>
