		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09de6c69-e407-496a-8988-e3b334b5fec1">
		<rdfs:label>article-09de6c69-e407-496a-8988-e3b334b5fec1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senators heard testimony from Georgians affected by a restrictive new voting law signed by Gov. Brian Kemp, a Republican. Their real aim was to sway a debate in Washington.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09dfa412-bc1d-43e5-9cc1-2fd8a0ed7790">
		<rdfs:label>article-09dfa412-bc1d-43e5-9cc1-2fd8a0ed7790</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The legislation is the source of scores of landmark regulations on air pollution.</rdfs:comment>
