	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-09e6121f-e415-4253-a6e3-918c7055b490">
		<rdfs:label>article-09e6121f-e415-4253-a6e3-918c7055b490</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The legislation had divided abortion opponents, many of whom objected to the idea of prosecuting women who end a pregnancy.</rdfs:comment>
