	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0a07a815-15da-4e88-a0ba-26cd9d21d8b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-0a07a815-15da-4e88-a0ba-26cd9d21d8b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Biden has spent months assailing President Trump’s handling of the coronavirus. With a bitter Supreme Court confirmation battle looming, he will seek to link the vacancy to the pandemic and the future of health care.</rdfs:comment>
