		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0a0bd90c-6f2a-42b6-ae0a-b4028d75ef5f">
		<rdfs:label>article-0a0bd90c-6f2a-42b6-ae0a-b4028d75ef5f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democrats had expected to flip several seats, but came up short. Their hopes to control the chamber now rest on a pair of races in Georgia.</rdfs:comment>
