		<rdfs:label>article-0a0fdff1-f256-43fb-97cd-86493641233e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two of Donald Trump’s most prominent Senate endorsements have already backfired. Now the month of May looms large to measure his pull on the party.</rdfs:comment>
