		<rdfs:label>article-0a164a83-6c8e-47ac-b7f5-076281f2b550</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The chief of the Capitol Police indicated he would resign after an angry mob of Trump supporters stormed past officers and into the legislative chambers.</rdfs:comment>
