		<rdfs:comment>Speaker Nancy Pelosi, the nation’s top elected Democrat, said on Thursday that former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. should not debate President Trump, telling reporters that she believed her party’s nominee should not “dignify that conversation with Donald Trump.”</rdfs:comment>
