		<rdfs:label>article-0ab3e4ac-58eb-4b86-866b-91ad248d575d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Disappointed by a defeat in Virginia and a closer-than-expected race in New Jersey, Democrats were working toward quick action on key bills to show they could govern.</rdfs:comment>
