	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0ad77a4b-dc3e-4bcc-b0e7-9ac35939f8b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-0ad77a4b-dc3e-4bcc-b0e7-9ac35939f8b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Owen Keehnen, a writer and historian in Chicago, is losing sleep over the election. About five times a week over the past few months, he wakes up around 3 a.m. in a panic, he said.</rdfs:comment>
