		<rdfs:label>article-0ae02ab5-7908-42f3-bba9-418b36278c09</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The tips encouraging handwashing, social distancing and other familiar practices were published after the White House rejected an earlier draft of recommendations.</rdfs:comment>
