		<rdfs:label>article-0aef9c45-3f13-4a8e-bb16-185ea7b15d05</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers in both parties are lining up to get their pet projects and policy priorities included in the expansive package.</rdfs:comment>
