	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0af28c10-3426-41f3-b1ad-d5f4fcea398b">
		<rdfs:label>article-0af28c10-3426-41f3-b1ad-d5f4fcea398b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The indictment marks the first charges lodged against conspirators linked to the radical gun rights group or involved with planning any of the political events held the week of the attack.</rdfs:comment>
