	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0af58c8f-c0b9-443c-9289-ac4bc44ac36c">
		<rdfs:label>article-0af58c8f-c0b9-443c-9289-ac4bc44ac36c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s decision not to begin mass evacuations of Afghans months ago has left thousands of people in limbo.</rdfs:comment>
