	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0af856ce-8094-43f0-be9c-129565069568">
		<rdfs:label>article-0af856ce-8094-43f0-be9c-129565069568</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The prisoner, John Marion Grant, convulsed and vomited as he was put to death by lethal injection. The court also cleared the way for another execution next month.</rdfs:comment>
