	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0af919a7-d687-4703-b2e2-9ad827f800ff">
		<rdfs:label>article-0af919a7-d687-4703-b2e2-9ad827f800ff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The liberal state, where Democrats often run against fellow Democrats in November thanks to an unconventional election system, is the unlikely backdrop of some of this year’s most bitter political campaigns.</rdfs:comment>
