		<rdfs:label>article-0b001e09-a88a-4ef2-8415-5697390ba1f3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new state law constricts teachers when it comes to race and history. And a politician is questioning why 850 titles are on library shelves. The result: “A lot of our teachers are petrified.”</rdfs:comment>
