		<rdfs:label>article-0b007aec-24fd-465a-a509-2bfc2701dd7f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Because of a recent law that prohibits the detention of immigrant children and families, Mexico has stopped accepting such families from South Texas.</rdfs:comment>
