		<rdfs:label>article-0b0562c7-38cb-4d8e-8eae-9c4e26e80af5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has tested negative “on consecutive days” using a rapid antigen coronavirus test not intended for that purpose, the White House physician Dr. Sean Conley said in a statement released Monday before the president began a rally in Florida.</rdfs:comment>
