		<rdfs:label>article-0b0852d4-747e-4e7c-bd64-895c603d0e42</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a closed-door meeting, Speaker Nancy Pelosi urged Democrats to “keep our eye on the ball” and mocked President Trump’s skin color: “The ball has an orange face.”</rdfs:comment>
