	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0b0a4b8f-5017-4222-adec-a5e14cb555a1">
		<rdfs:label>article-0b0a4b8f-5017-4222-adec-a5e14cb555a1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump hopes to end DACA, which has granted employment authorization to thousands of young immigrants. Already, some large employers are refusing to hire them.</rdfs:comment>
