	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0b0ac36c-5bbf-45fd-b52e-3e2983707acd">
		<rdfs:label>article-0b0ac36c-5bbf-45fd-b52e-3e2983707acd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The law passed despite dividing Republicans. Some of them said the measure was too restrictive; others objected to limited exceptions for rape and incest.</rdfs:comment>
