	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0b1390b3-12ef-4068-b3cc-d2bf69bf585f">
		<rdfs:label>article-0b1390b3-12ef-4068-b3cc-d2bf69bf585f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House hopes to use back-to-school physicals, pop-up clinics and other strategies to get more students inoculated.</rdfs:comment>
