	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0b150d43-8986-4f16-873b-dd087988279d">
		<rdfs:label>article-0b150d43-8986-4f16-873b-dd087988279d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the reopening plans of schools and businesses hinging on rapid test results, the Trump administration’s testing czar says a two- to three-day turnaround “is not possible.”</rdfs:comment>
