		<rdfs:label>article-0c1197b7-bf4d-4d3b-8685-215e8468b8af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The tiny town of Rawlins will soon be home to one of the nation’s largest wind farms. But pride in the fossil fuel past remains a powerful force.</rdfs:comment>
