	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0c1627d7-03cc-4ee2-ba49-6943211ed56d">
		<rdfs:label>article-0c1627d7-03cc-4ee2-ba49-6943211ed56d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: A conversation about how housing became the great problem of our time. Also: How a Central Valley town pushed back against an ICE facility.</rdfs:comment>
