	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0c162f1f-475e-422d-9441-19dd2cbddb3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-0c162f1f-475e-422d-9441-19dd2cbddb3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the nation grieves for the victims of several recent mass shootings, the president called for a ban on assault weapons and new “red flag” laws.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0c16c6f5-8c22-40f0-a84f-7c7c0bff352c">
		<rdfs:label>article-0c16c6f5-8c22-40f0-a84f-7c7c0bff352c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Daniel Darling was at the center of a media storm over the summer. He hopes to lead a more civil discussion at Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary in Texas.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c9e39358-a975-42ba-a74a-ab413e845336"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0c17da29-febd-47e1-b085-9c92fa9311ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-0c17da29-febd-47e1-b085-9c92fa9311ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>When the president asked why he couldn’t do something about assault weapons, people in the room recalled, his acting chief of staff replied: “You’d lose.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d8482953-a125-4fa7-a4ef-dc645e3472e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-27"/>
