	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0c1a8399-306a-46b8-a541-4e78a5235aff">
		<rdfs:label>article-0c1a8399-306a-46b8-a541-4e78a5235aff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new organization, Republican Voters Against Trump, is testing the premise of whether there are really any persuadable voters left.</rdfs:comment>
