	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0c1d573c-77d2-43c2-a84d-4d8fcb55dbfe">
		<rdfs:label>article-0c1d573c-77d2-43c2-a84d-4d8fcb55dbfe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Election law experts have some reassuring, and not so reassuring, assessments for us: “It’s reasonable to worry about low-probability, high-loss events.”</rdfs:comment>
