	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d1bcba6-b93e-4ab7-8a6e-504b29bfb93d">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d1bcba6-b93e-4ab7-8a6e-504b29bfb93d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some of California’s staunchest vaccine resisters are state employees and health care workers, all of whom will be required to get vaccinated or undergo testing starting next month.</rdfs:comment>
