		<rdfs:label>article-0d219991-6cac-4dbb-b5f2-b2d789499ac0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The emergency legislation enacted by Congress with support from Republicans and President Trump has intensified a long-running debate about whether the United States does enough in ordinary times to protect the needy.</rdfs:comment>
