	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d23ff87-a828-4062-9ea0-227693bcedf0">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d23ff87-a828-4062-9ea0-227693bcedf0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Oregon and other states have begun holding jury trials again, leading to courtroom drama that may have nothing to do with the charges.</rdfs:comment>
