	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d346148-0a68-45bc-87f5-a71c42aeb320">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d346148-0a68-45bc-87f5-a71c42aeb320</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As his poll numbers slide, the president and his aides have mounted an aggressive pitch in Congress and around the country for his spending plans on infrastructure and more.</rdfs:comment>
