	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d36de6b-d41e-4711-8a5e-75bf54e41e6c">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d36de6b-d41e-4711-8a5e-75bf54e41e6c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democratic-led House and Republican-led Senate, which had approved competing plans, failed to compromise before a weeklong special session ended.</rdfs:comment>
