	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d41c45f-4d27-460a-9923-c01cd17741b2">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d41c45f-4d27-460a-9923-c01cd17741b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States faces two distinct challenges, the movement by Republicans who refuse to accept defeat in an election and a growing disconnect between political power and public opinion.</rdfs:comment>
