	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d44dc07-23fd-48b5-a949-2056af7c1d1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d44dc07-23fd-48b5-a949-2056af7c1d1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Although opening up shots for children under 5 is a milestone, this long-awaited phase of the U.S. immunization effort is being greeted with mixed emotions.</rdfs:comment>
