		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d47d383-679b-48f0-b5aa-88bdd40f0bae">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d47d383-679b-48f0-b5aa-88bdd40f0bae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If lease sales happen in the final days of the Trump administration, they may face disputes in court or could be reversed by the Biden administration.</rdfs:comment>
