	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d4ab02f-ef02-4c13-a756-15b2137e7d68">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d4ab02f-ef02-4c13-a756-15b2137e7d68</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>LAS CRUCES, N.M. — When Democrats in New Mexico swept elections just two years ago, flipping a Republican-held congressional district that stretches across more than half the state ranked among their biggest wins.</rdfs:comment>
