		<rdfs:label>article-0d4b80e0-24b4-4f1d-9626-3f5bd9a493c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As coronavirus cases fall, states are rescinding mask mandates and reopening businesses and schools, prompting people to emerge after months of isolation despite uncertainty about the pandemic’s future.</rdfs:comment>
