	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d4c8e68-5a51-4a20-a33c-da50e2d29386">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d4c8e68-5a51-4a20-a33c-da50e2d29386</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new report finds an “alarming” drop in prosecutions over violations of the Clean Air Act and Clean Water Act, fundamental environmental laws.</rdfs:comment>
