	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d552070-3387-4e90-95b1-f1bda35a0310">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d552070-3387-4e90-95b1-f1bda35a0310</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The official, Miguel Cardona, sent letters expressing concern about the bans to Gov. Greg Abbott of Texas and Gov. Ron DeSantis of Florida.</rdfs:comment>
