		<rdfs:label>article-0d7aaf5f-b7d8-4dd5-a9c4-b512781d887f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The fund-raising total would exceed previous monthly hauls and is more than double what the former vice president raised in July.</rdfs:comment>
