	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0d8e3933-6d10-4761-ad49-abdf7d0ca661">
		<rdfs:label>article-0d8e3933-6d10-4761-ad49-abdf7d0ca661</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The storm carved a destructive path across six states on Sunday and Monday, causing widespread damage and cutting power to tens of thousands of customers.</rdfs:comment>
