		<rdfs:label>article-0d92c94f-7971-454d-a233-02c5f4f24845</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The journey north for migrants crossing into the U.S. from Mexico is usually dangerous and sometimes fatal. Dozens of migrants have died in crashes or trapped in hot, airless trailers.</rdfs:comment>
