		<rdfs:label>article-0d9325f5-f4ae-4056-b98d-ab8f85023d69</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican senator, 88, is the former head of two high-profile Senate committees and will spare his party a bitter primary fight to succeed him.</rdfs:comment>
