	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0dafa1e0-ebaf-4dd7-9489-6adba1bd06ec">
		<rdfs:label>article-0dafa1e0-ebaf-4dd7-9489-6adba1bd06ec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr’s administration is planning to undo the legacy of the Trump administration’s education policies by drastically increasing resources for public schools, expanding its civil rights advocacy for marginalized students and reasserting the department’s leadership in policymaking.</rdfs:comment>
