		<rdfs:label>article-0db145a9-0e77-4a05-9fbb-235154af970a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Times is hosting a series of virtual events ahead of global climate talks in November. This month’s topic: the demand for energy and what can be learned from the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
