		<rdfs:label>article-0df44994-239b-4d4f-a0e1-cebe9166a04d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a rally in a Las Vegas suburb Sunday night, President Trump delivered his counterfactual stump speech, making wildly inaccurate claims about the trend lines of the coronavirus and about his Democratic rival, Joseph R. Biden, Jr., whom he said was waging a “dangerous war on the police” and was also “too weak to be president.”</rdfs:comment>
