		<rdfs:label>article-0df4cd93-4621-457b-af7a-0c09b3a6e4f1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Mike Lee and Representative Chip Roy, once backers of President Donald J. Trump’s claims of a stolen election, eventually urged his top aide to change course.</rdfs:comment>
