		<rdfs:comment>President Biden, frustrated in his efforts to end America’s “Forever War” a decade ago,  announced on Wednesday a Sept. 11 deadline for withdrawal of U.S. troops from Afghanistan after 20 years, a move that immediately triggered similar action among the country’s NATO allies.</rdfs:comment>
