	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0ecc4063-570a-4498-8767-a39fd31c5e53">
		<rdfs:label>article-0ecc4063-570a-4498-8767-a39fd31c5e53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Federal Reserve officials indicated they expected the economic recovery from the pandemic-induced recession to be a slow one, with rates near zero for years.</rdfs:comment>
