	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0ee07886-5cb9-4352-ab48-4ddb6b2be0c6">
		<rdfs:label>article-0ee07886-5cb9-4352-ab48-4ddb6b2be0c6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In one of the most serious U.S. crackdowns yet over Covid-19, the governor ordered most businesses on the island to shut down. Other U.S. cities were imposing control measures of their own.</rdfs:comment>
