		<rdfs:label>article-0ee410fa-b107-42f0-9945-9c1ca9ee4e8c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a signing statement, the president undermined a key safeguard Democrats had insisted upon as a condition of approving $500 billion in corporate relief in the $2 trillion law.</rdfs:comment>
