		<rdfs:label>article-0ee53dab-67bd-4293-9f2f-a7cdf479fc22</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Lauren Boebert, a Republican, is being challenged by Adam Frisch, a Democrat.</rdfs:comment>
