	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0eeb8f91-5299-4518-a311-a944b15aca75">
		<rdfs:label>article-0eeb8f91-5299-4518-a311-a944b15aca75</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The economic strain of the coronavirus pandemic has more Americans turning to food banks and charity for help feeding their families.</rdfs:comment>
