	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0eef16bf-7dd6-4bca-b88c-d91d799a85c1">
		<rdfs:label>article-0eef16bf-7dd6-4bca-b88c-d91d799a85c1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid the nation’s worst Covid-19 outbreak, patients are trapped in remote communities and doctors are prioritizing treatment based on who is most likely to survive.</rdfs:comment>
