	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0ef0b900-2de1-4f29-8bdd-477d8325cb5b">
		<rdfs:label>article-0ef0b900-2de1-4f29-8bdd-477d8325cb5b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some of the president-elect’s choices for top posts have done work for undisclosed corporate clients and aided a fund that invests in government contractors.</rdfs:comment>
