		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0f102d84-6799-45c0-bb5d-36217fb7400e">
		<rdfs:label>article-0f102d84-6799-45c0-bb5d-36217fb7400e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Treasury Department’s removal of the designation provided a major concession to China just days before it is set to sign a trade deal with the United States.</rdfs:comment>
