	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0f25b773-f8bd-4995-bd48-56b786eaa525">
		<rdfs:label>article-0f25b773-f8bd-4995-bd48-56b786eaa525</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican says her crusade to stop Donald J. Trump will continue — even if she loses her primary next week. Restoring a “very sick” G.O.P. will take years, she says, “if it can be healed.”</rdfs:comment>
