	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0f26cdfc-6a22-409d-9600-bea1111a415a">
		<rdfs:label>article-0f26cdfc-6a22-409d-9600-bea1111a415a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>North Dakotans can’t grow enough feed for their cattle, so they’re selling off the animals before they starve.</rdfs:comment>
