	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0f2a26d6-cb25-4d75-be91-015374a840b1">
		<rdfs:label>article-0f2a26d6-cb25-4d75-be91-015374a840b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Barred so far from presenting witnesses, the House managers prosecuting the president have focused on turning his own words against him.</rdfs:comment>
