	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0f2c6b2b-26a3-403a-86fa-b541a7387e24">
		<rdfs:label>article-0f2c6b2b-26a3-403a-86fa-b541a7387e24</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new survey in five countries found significant support for stricter air quality regulations and enforcement of existing rules.</rdfs:comment>
