	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0f2d608b-e890-452a-a9ff-1601dc4a83b1">
		<rdfs:label>article-0f2d608b-e890-452a-a9ff-1601dc4a83b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But researchers caution this does not mean low-income families are escaping hardship. And they warn that when the aid expires next month, families could again be vulnerable.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9e94ebbb-365e-41ef-9a76-b300ca95c3d1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-21"/>
