		<rdfs:label>article-0fdb06a0-2f4f-4109-ba95-de6a5a81c4a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House committee investigating the Capitol attack said it was in discussions with the former president over his compliance ahead of an interview scheduled for this month.</rdfs:comment>
