	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0fdba2cf-ed63-4821-b352-7b9401983bb2">
		<rdfs:label>article-0fdba2cf-ed63-4821-b352-7b9401983bb2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With an explosion heard across Kabul, Americans destroyed the base so its contents would not fall to the Taliban.</rdfs:comment>
