	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0fdd2d55-e170-4d35-92f7-c6eb8bd678a8">
		<rdfs:label>article-0fdd2d55-e170-4d35-92f7-c6eb8bd678a8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New York Times photographers have documented Joseph R. Biden Jr. throughout 2020 from his Democratic primary struggles to his socially distant campaign against President Trump. </rdfs:comment>
