	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0fdee6a8-73e0-43a0-a51f-f8935eb8df0b">
		<rdfs:label>article-0fdee6a8-73e0-43a0-a51f-f8935eb8df0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One doesn’t find outright panic in airports and on airplanes across the United States. Rather, it’s anguish that the next sneeze might be the fateful one.</rdfs:comment>
