	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0fdf3a55-4371-4d7f-a2e3-8f16ef61bb8f">
		<rdfs:label>article-0fdf3a55-4371-4d7f-a2e3-8f16ef61bb8f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Following a call from federal health agencies, all 50 states quickly paused or recommend that providers pause the administration of Johnson &amp; Johnson’s Covid-19 vaccine after six women in the United States developed a rare disorder involving blood clots within one to three weeks of vaccination.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6bcf1d-e179-43a7-9f78-6139ef8f52e0"/>
