	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-0fe088da-5893-4be4-b670-200db149cf88">
		<rdfs:label>article-0fe088da-5893-4be4-b670-200db149cf88</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vote to fund the government through mid-February came after lawmakers staved off a Republican threat to force a shutdown over vaccine mandates.</rdfs:comment>
