		<rdfs:label>article-0fe425c5-8550-4207-8588-5dafa402a2d9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican old guard is protesting the direction of the party after it put forward two champions of Donald Trump’s election falsehoods for attorney general and secretary of state.</rdfs:comment>
