	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1049dca0-fa44-49ad-ac91-a08043954f99">
		<rdfs:label>article-1049dca0-fa44-49ad-ac91-a08043954f99</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Every major broadcast and cable news network — and even ESPN — broke into regular programming on Tuesday for live coverage of the Derek Chauvin verdict.</rdfs:comment>
