	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-104d00bc-9ae2-4166-ae8e-3372883cecc4">
		<rdfs:label>article-104d00bc-9ae2-4166-ae8e-3372883cecc4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The military that Gen. Mark A. Milley represents is facing what could be the worst schism with the American public since the fractious Vietnam War years.</rdfs:comment>
