	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-10503898-0f7a-4914-a1be-ae2459d4c352">
		<rdfs:label>article-10503898-0f7a-4914-a1be-ae2459d4c352</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new report on the auto industry cites extensive links to Xinjiang, where the U.S. government now presumes goods are made with forced labor.</rdfs:comment>
