	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1050efd5-9dde-46b1-9bec-f474a013a3b2">
		<rdfs:label>article-1050efd5-9dde-46b1-9bec-f474a013a3b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Triple-digit heat is afflicting much of the country for a third straight week.</rdfs:comment>
