	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1058e35b-7196-4c8d-a8ff-dd2bcb14576a">
		<rdfs:label>article-1058e35b-7196-4c8d-a8ff-dd2bcb14576a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Life expectancy, the most basic measure of the health of a society, rose slightly in 2018, after a rare and troubling decline driven by the opioid epidemic.</rdfs:comment>
