		<rdfs:label>article-106c5f74-df69-465c-88a7-83f8647bd16d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Yvon Chouinard has forfeited ownership of the company he founded 49 years ago. The profits will now be used to fight climate change.</rdfs:comment>
