	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-106cf143-5829-46d5-9ca6-b8eff8222c6d">
		<rdfs:label>article-106cf143-5829-46d5-9ca6-b8eff8222c6d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new leader of the Southern Baptist Convention has delivered sermons containing passages from those of his predecessor, causing a furor.</rdfs:comment>
