		<rdfs:label>article-10cd174d-f52f-4670-9f67-e4f755cdd726</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On an Election Day in the midst of a devastating pandemic and a clash of competing visions of America, anxiety was the great uniter, and motivator.</rdfs:comment>
