		<rdfs:label>article-10ce1898-b6f1-441f-86d0-b8fbb9255980</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New coronavirus mask guidelines from the C.D.C. have left Americans wondering whether they can trust one another. And it’s been a challenging year for trust.</rdfs:comment>
