		<rdfs:label>article-10d4ce5e-dfb4-4c03-afcd-591a517525f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Early voting in the primary was in line with previous midterm primaries, but new restrictions resulted in a surge of absentee ballots being rejected.</rdfs:comment>
