		<rdfs:label>article-10ddd89c-8058-4380-b4cb-047d0ef292e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His effort to stop the census count early, in the middle of a pandemic, is in line with his campaign of exclusion.</rdfs:comment>
