	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-11a3ce27-e162-4f01-bb30-630ee874f664">
		<rdfs:label>article-11a3ce27-e162-4f01-bb30-630ee874f664</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The presence in Washington of a longtime member of the Navy SEALs who was trained to identify misinformation reflects the partisan politics that helped lead to the assault.</rdfs:comment>
