	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-11aad79e-5847-4fd6-a7a7-4b1bc7b8ca66">
		<rdfs:label>article-11aad79e-5847-4fd6-a7a7-4b1bc7b8ca66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court sent the issue of abortion back to the states in an even more polarized era than when Roe v. Wade was introduced.</rdfs:comment>
