	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-11ab6229-2461-409c-a73a-ccb5f0da42da">
		<rdfs:label>article-11ab6229-2461-409c-a73a-ccb5f0da42da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The incoming Democratic president and top Senate Republican have personal ties and a history of deal-making that could shape the future of a Biden administration.</rdfs:comment>
