	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-11ac2e50-a2c6-4425-85fd-1f0d98955d64">
		<rdfs:label>article-11ac2e50-a2c6-4425-85fd-1f0d98955d64</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House has come under heavy pressure to protect Afghan allies who helped the United States and speed up the process of providing them with special immigrant visas.</rdfs:comment>
