		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-11bde9c1-7e01-441e-8fe8-e1136eb61e1e">
		<rdfs:label>article-11bde9c1-7e01-441e-8fe8-e1136eb61e1e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $1.9 trillion pandemic aid bill narrowly passed the House, but now must maneuver through a procedural and political thicket in the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
