		<rdfs:label>article-11cf8172-01e1-496d-86ed-011eb8dddeb2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a harsh alpine desert, the Great Basin bristlecone pines abide amid climate change. Among them is the oldest tree on Earth (if you can find it).</rdfs:comment>
