		<rdfs:label>article-11d44dc5-4b28-4dd9-bb85-aa9515c4f474</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As they learn more about it, voters have shown some receptiveness to the phrase, polling suggests. But they largely want to reinvest resources, not eliminate departments.</rdfs:comment>
