		<rdfs:label>article-11d7f851-e069-466a-a1e2-744bce9dccce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move allows financial dealings with civil servants at government institutions, even if those ministries are now overseen by Taliban members.</rdfs:comment>
