		<rdfs:label>article-11e2798c-38ca-49af-b305-84a5a00200b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A huge stretch of coastline from Naples to Sarasota appeared severely affected by lapping brown waves that drowned streets, homes and cars as frightened residents sought refuge.</rdfs:comment>
