		<rdfs:label>article-14e52581-7eec-4735-a545-16c9096ce671</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Texas statute that bans abortion after six weeks of pregnancy was seemingly undercut by two court rulings, but the reality on the ground has not changed.</rdfs:comment>
