		<rdfs:label>article-14e52d6a-e7a9-4000-be10-3c93bb062c01</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former President Donald J. Trump’s apparent plan to soon announce his candidacy is challenging Attorney General Merrick B. Garland’s desire to show that the Justice Dept. can operate above partisanship.</rdfs:comment>
