	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-14e7f8f0-614d-4617-9056-99e1379f99c8">
		<rdfs:label>article-14e7f8f0-614d-4617-9056-99e1379f99c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>David Perdue challenged Gov. Brian Kemp because of Donald Trump’s fury over his 2020 loss. Thoroughly outflanked and failing to gain traction, he is now staring down defeat.</rdfs:comment>
