	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-14f12c10-6a98-4abc-a8a3-5b6223868140">
		<rdfs:label>article-14f12c10-6a98-4abc-a8a3-5b6223868140</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Black elected officials in several states, from Congress down to the counties, have been drawn out of their districts this year or face headwinds to hold onto their seats.</rdfs:comment>
