		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-14f2da23-eb80-4b3e-a14b-d6b0183c96d4">
		<rdfs:label>article-14f2da23-eb80-4b3e-a14b-d6b0183c96d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For much of his life, Mr. Rittenhouse, now 18, tried on identities infused with bravery and service.</rdfs:comment>
