		<rdfs:label>article-154faaa2-0bce-4a6a-bae8-79842dbbed47</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The jury convicted Mr. Chauvin of second- and third-degree murder, as well as manslaughter. He faces up to 40 years in prison but is likely to be sentenced to far less time, based on state guidelines.</rdfs:comment>
