		<rdfs:label>article-1550376b-e323-417a-8957-6488f81130ba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Military veterans trying to defend the Capitol on Jan. 6 were taunted by veterans in the pro-Trump mob who were storming it. Both felt they were doing their patriotic duty in a fractured country.</rdfs:comment>
