		<rdfs:label>article-1570f697-ecdb-4949-998d-18ce2d374073</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Vladimir Putin could still reduce cities in Ukraine to rubble, officials say. But European countries say they are not as intimidated by Russian ground forces as they were in the past.</rdfs:comment>
