		<rdfs:label>article-1574024b-d424-405f-a68d-404447c1373c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As President Trump’s campaign barrels ahead with crowded rallies and in-person door-knocking, some Democratic officials in battleground states are warning that Joe Biden may not be doing enough to excite voters.</rdfs:comment>
