		<rdfs:label>article-1747c1b0-a32d-4046-a521-0c414af4a34b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Experts say the details of the spending will matter — and that, in some areas, more money will be needed to fix beleaguered roads, bridges and other infrastructure.</rdfs:comment>
