	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-174ac88c-0248-4af5-a98e-df2018135724">
		<rdfs:label>article-174ac88c-0248-4af5-a98e-df2018135724</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Conservative groups making a legal assault against state and local coronavirus restrictions are backed by the Justice Department’s willingness to “take action.”</rdfs:comment>
