	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-175c8f98-173e-45e5-84a0-18d2a4f15ab4">
		<rdfs:label>article-175c8f98-173e-45e5-84a0-18d2a4f15ab4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s baseless claims of voting fraud have prompted outrage among his loyalists and led to behavior that Democrats and even some Republicans say has become dangerous.</rdfs:comment>
