	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-175ce345-62bd-49d7-b215-ec9e07fc9bc2">
		<rdfs:label>article-175ce345-62bd-49d7-b215-ec9e07fc9bc2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The recusal of Col. Stephen Keane from hearing the case at Guantánamo Bay adds another roadblock to restarting pretrial hearings in the long-running case.</rdfs:comment>
