	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1768d33f-07bc-47c4-b2f0-c4b5e8ecb452">
		<rdfs:label>article-1768d33f-07bc-47c4-b2f0-c4b5e8ecb452</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. said on Saturday that he was “always going to lead with science and truth” as he announced top science and technology officials on his White House staff, reaffirming trust in the kind of expert research that the Trump administration often ignored or disdained.</rdfs:comment>
