		<rdfs:label>article-176b5b1a-a697-4852-b095-5f9bfaa085c4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Immigration and Customs Enforcement on Wednesday announced it would start reopening its detention centers to visitors for the first time since the beginning of the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
