		<rdfs:label>article-177e8dcf-9977-4c5d-9852-da45bd71bde7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The announcement removes a major hurdle to approving a plan to hunt for oil in the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge in Alaska, part of a push to allow drilling there by the Trump administration.</rdfs:comment>
