	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-18cab481-4951-4951-a296-251162e7785e">
		<rdfs:label>article-18cab481-4951-4951-a296-251162e7785e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As President Trump holds daily briefings, Mr. Biden has kept a low profile, worrying Democrats who feel the president needs to be challenged more robustly.</rdfs:comment>
