	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-18cd9448-2471-402d-a850-df1c757f6759">
		<rdfs:label>article-18cd9448-2471-402d-a850-df1c757f6759</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A proposal to eliminate payroll taxes through the end of the year, estimated to cost $700 billion, faces bipartisan opposition, but some version of it could be the basis for a broad agreement to provide aid.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
