	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-18e12f76-8a88-4b44-ab4c-1509179e288b">
		<rdfs:label>article-18e12f76-8a88-4b44-ab4c-1509179e288b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Cities from New York to Los Angeles consider changes to police funding, and others are banning chokeholds. Mr. Floyd’s brother will testify at a congressional hearing this week.</rdfs:comment>
