	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-18e8dda7-a59a-4584-953e-a4f7992c5b51">
		<rdfs:label>article-18e8dda7-a59a-4584-953e-a4f7992c5b51</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New research finds that gas stoves emit methane, a potent greenhouse gas, even when turned off and adds to the debate over electrifying homes.</rdfs:comment>
