	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-18edb353-9581-4af1-9a23-765d95859372">
		<rdfs:label>article-18edb353-9581-4af1-9a23-765d95859372</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“We have too bright a future to have it shipwrecked on the shoals of anger and hate and division,” Joe Biden said in a speech near the Civil War battlefield in Pennsylvania.</rdfs:comment>
