	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-18f0ae67-7f76-428c-8c47-2661f2733ceb">
		<rdfs:label>article-18f0ae67-7f76-428c-8c47-2661f2733ceb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump paid a call to a Republican office in Virginia on Tuesday and, despite trailing in the polls, predicted “a great night” and basked in the memories of the rallies he staged in his bid for a second term.</rdfs:comment>
