		<rdfs:label>article-19a7a2ce-defd-44fe-9fbf-305ece7ff97b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some administration officials say testing Americans with no symptoms of the coronavirus would hurt the economy and restrict civil liberties. Democrats and some prominent experts say it would slow the virus and bolster economic growth.</rdfs:comment>
