	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19b3d718-f56c-4e1b-bb97-7c0d0c5fbc60">
		<rdfs:label>article-19b3d718-f56c-4e1b-bb97-7c0d0c5fbc60</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Attorney General William P. Barr was also said to have asked prosecutors to explore whether to bring charges against the mayor of Seattle for allowing a police-free protest zone.</rdfs:comment>
