	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19d99691-462e-48b4-ad41-87f21ead0180">
		<rdfs:label>article-19d99691-462e-48b4-ad41-87f21ead0180</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus is forcing the SAT and ACT to develop digital versions of the standardized tests in case schools remain closed. Critics fear that could deepen inequities.</rdfs:comment>
