	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19da9e70-87b2-4837-9566-76e27fe805b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-19da9e70-87b2-4837-9566-76e27fe805b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But his announcement that he would freeze the U.S.’s contributions to the organization in the middle of a pandemic was denounced by Democrats as well as the U.S. Chamber of Commerce.</rdfs:comment>
