	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19db74a1-b5c8-4a9e-a130-17e32813bfe5">
		<rdfs:label>article-19db74a1-b5c8-4a9e-a130-17e32813bfe5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a pair of triumphant elections for women and people of color in American politics, in which records were smashed in 2018 and then broken again in 2020, diverse candidates made further progress this year.</rdfs:comment>
