		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19db8f26-93b0-4dc5-8546-92bfd5b0d41a">
		<rdfs:label>article-19db8f26-93b0-4dc5-8546-92bfd5b0d41a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Most of her opinions came from her time as a trial judge, and some scholars said such writings offered only hints about a judge’s legal philosophy.</rdfs:comment>
