	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19dfb2fe-e197-4a5a-a95b-40a4ed836cc0">
		<rdfs:label>article-19dfb2fe-e197-4a5a-a95b-40a4ed836cc0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Seattle-area officials announced sweeping changes to stop the spread, urging telecommuting and recommending that those 60 and over, pregnant, or with health problems stay home.</rdfs:comment>
