		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19e1608b-3be8-4b4e-ba4d-14eb59623b53">
		<rdfs:label>article-19e1608b-3be8-4b4e-ba4d-14eb59623b53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats are hoping ballot measures on abortion rights will drive up voter turnout. They’re looking to Michigan as a test run.</rdfs:comment>
