	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19e75e07-55f5-4793-95ba-2dea5c050f8d">
		<rdfs:label>article-19e75e07-55f5-4793-95ba-2dea5c050f8d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration has race and ethnicity data for just 52 percent of vaccine recipients. Next week, it will begin shipping doses directly to clinics in underserved communities.</rdfs:comment>
