	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19eb9d66-9e96-49ac-9015-446e4a4fef38">
		<rdfs:label>article-19eb9d66-9e96-49ac-9015-446e4a4fef38</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The demands for increased wages and better working conditions come as Puerto Rico tries to pull itself out of bankruptcy.</rdfs:comment>
