	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19ec2e3f-380e-4598-8c84-9e3a732f3d59">
		<rdfs:label>article-19ec2e3f-380e-4598-8c84-9e3a732f3d59</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Congressional Democrats and a slew of groups are preparing to push for the kinds of ethics and governance changes not seen since the post-Watergate era.</rdfs:comment>
