		<rdfs:label>article-19f1b3af-fa54-4c06-a8af-e985c2ac30ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It was long thought that surges in voting would help Democrats. So how does the party explain Glenn Youngkin’s victory?</rdfs:comment>
