	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-19fbbe2b-dc19-42f0-a9fc-1ebc486f902a">
		<rdfs:label>article-19fbbe2b-dc19-42f0-a9fc-1ebc486f902a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The acting director of Voice of America was reassigned on Tuesday, as part of what is most likely a broader bid to install loyalists for President Trump at the news outlet before the Biden administration takes over, two people familiar with the decision said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-83d40723-6a13-432d-8617-d546a58e6733"/>
