	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1a01a2be-9458-4180-83c5-824b2257242e">
		<rdfs:label>article-1a01a2be-9458-4180-83c5-824b2257242e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Monday: Hospital capacity is increasing in some areas. The vaccine rollout is still chaotic.</rdfs:comment>
