	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1a05919f-b8cd-4fa6-84e5-7cf3472ffecd">
		<rdfs:label>article-1a05919f-b8cd-4fa6-84e5-7cf3472ffecd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president, who owned slaves and whose policies forced Native Americans to relocate, is the latest target of those eager to remove memorials of marred historical figures.</rdfs:comment>
