		<rdfs:label>article-1a06d7ba-9ebb-420e-ad80-1f3d527d6955</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An Army National Guard officer at Lafayette Square plans to tell lawmakers that the Park Police unleashed an “unprovoked escalation” on peaceful protesters last month.</rdfs:comment>
