		<rdfs:label>article-1a0702e0-d432-4210-b023-c41ba140c4f9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For one couple, Oregon’s Bootleg Fire all but erased their home, leaving little except memories and a tan chimney spire.</rdfs:comment>
