	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1a07a248-c217-49c4-a78d-770caaae8c50">
		<rdfs:label>article-1a07a248-c217-49c4-a78d-770caaae8c50</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Days before his inauguration, President-elect Biden was eyeing a $1.3 trillion rescue plan aimed squarely at the middle class he has always championed, but pared down to attract some Republican support.</rdfs:comment>
