		<rdfs:label>article-1b0e4fcd-1d5c-44be-bacd-16f1c5368645</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Citing shortcomings of the state’s “red flag” law, the local prosecutor explained why he did not seek a ruling last year that would have barred Brandon Hole from possessing guns.</rdfs:comment>
