		<rdfs:label>article-1b125310-65ce-486d-aa9c-e2673d0c3202</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On a private call with governors, the vice president played down new outbreaks, stressing that some states were seeing what he called “intermittent” spikes. Experts have warned it’s not that simple.</rdfs:comment>
