		<rdfs:label>article-1b14f382-2e72-4120-bb87-ed222fdbd129</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the South, Black Democrats describe a party too slow in combating Republican voting limits. And Black lawmakers are wary that a major elections bill could reduce their power in Congress.</rdfs:comment>
