	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1b414772-5c97-4b91-a23b-edc273a16549">
		<rdfs:label>article-1b414772-5c97-4b91-a23b-edc273a16549</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Teen pregnancies have plummeted, as has child poverty. The result is a profound change in the forces that bring opportunity between generations.</rdfs:comment>
