		<rdfs:label>article-1b41e451-3a5c-47f8-9a55-cab4fbf1571e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Faculty and staff at Cambridge are planning a vote that would require the university to stop accepting fossil fuel money for research. It’s part of an expanding movement.</rdfs:comment>
