		<rdfs:label>article-1b435a0a-6d22-4fa2-9665-d84737ada820</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pointing to the conduct of the district attorney she defeated last year, Fani Willis concluded her office should not pursue the case against a former Atlanta officer who killed Mr. Brooks.</rdfs:comment>
