	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1b51e325-8d89-459b-99bd-4df95aa5c7f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-1b51e325-8d89-459b-99bd-4df95aa5c7f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some African countries, which have done little to cause the climate crisis, say they should. Many climate activists on the continent call the idea “folly.” We unpack the debate.</rdfs:comment>
