	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1b541a17-1502-4725-be8d-47a5efd26a23">
		<rdfs:label>article-1b541a17-1502-4725-be8d-47a5efd26a23</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move by the attorney general comes as the Justice Department prepares to step up its role in investigating allegations of racist and illegal behavior by police forces.</rdfs:comment>
