		<rdfs:label>article-1b541b86-8bde-466d-b01c-45669b6846ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With his political career, his business dealings and his reputation, the president has long bet that he can ride out difficulties. Now, though, he is facing an entirely unfamiliar threat.</rdfs:comment>
