	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1b7b4739-c236-4d16-8a09-840aee445204">
		<rdfs:label>article-1b7b4739-c236-4d16-8a09-840aee445204</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Michael Kuperberg was told he would no longer oversee the National Climate Assessment. The job is expected to go to a climate-change skeptic, according to people familiar with the changes.</rdfs:comment>
