		<rdfs:comment>President Trump spoke at his first coronavirus task force briefing since April, a concession to his diminished standing in his re-election effort. New filings revealed his campaign paid $4 million to Trump businesses and spent more than $2 million on his Tulsa rally, which drew few attendees.</rdfs:comment>
