		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1cebab67-4578-4c0b-b9c7-7591f885e457">
		<rdfs:label>article-1cebab67-4578-4c0b-b9c7-7591f885e457</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vice president’s allies are increasingly concerned that President Biden relied on her to win but does not need her to govern.</rdfs:comment>
