	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1ced6185-3493-40a2-a207-c7e38226c0cd">
		<rdfs:label>article-1ced6185-3493-40a2-a207-c7e38226c0cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Brian P. Kemp of Georgia — once derided by some of his fellow Republicans — has emerged in the aftermath of Tuesday’s Senate runoff as a savvy political operator.</rdfs:comment>
