	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1cf340b5-7a43-4bb9-bf25-cf16fa47f3a0">
		<rdfs:label>article-1cf340b5-7a43-4bb9-bf25-cf16fa47f3a0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: Joseph Castro will be the first Californian and the first Mexican-American to lead the nation’s biggest four-year public university system.</rdfs:comment>
