	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1cf81948-9b94-4017-aedc-0d408fa323af">
		<rdfs:label>article-1cf81948-9b94-4017-aedc-0d408fa323af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Tennessee, where the governor allows families to ignore school mask mandates, some parents are making excruciating calculations each morning about whether to send their children to school.</rdfs:comment>
