	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1cfadd0b-9230-4ed4-8dc4-9e3e0f3a3eb8">
		<rdfs:label>article-1cfadd0b-9230-4ed4-8dc4-9e3e0f3a3eb8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even some of the president’s closest allies knew his Big Lie was a lie. But it’s the Jan. 6 congressional committee bringing the truth to light.</rdfs:comment>
