		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d068eec-c783-4268-bbe1-4bd31b5d1123">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d068eec-c783-4268-bbe1-4bd31b5d1123</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The court could handcuff President Biden’s climate change agenda — and restrict federal agencies from enacting new regulations governing health, workplace safety and more.</rdfs:comment>
