		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d19ab6c-9830-4a2c-aede-ae019bf04a5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d19ab6c-9830-4a2c-aede-ae019bf04a5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In his memoir, “Disloyal,” Michael D. Cohen, President Trump’s onetime lawyer and fixer, claims that he had unique access to Mr. Trump, a man with “no true friends.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d1ae8c0-2aa1-49eb-a81a-0c0e89451ccd">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d1ae8c0-2aa1-49eb-a81a-0c0e89451ccd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Exhibits include Glenn Kaino’s new show in Los Angeles and the mainstay “Sensorio” in Paso Robles.</rdfs:comment>
