	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d3c4785-45f8-47b2-87e4-0909026bccd7">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d3c4785-45f8-47b2-87e4-0909026bccd7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The dismissal, the latest effort by President Biden to oust a Trump-appointed director of an independent executive agency, could set off a legal showdown over who rightfully holds the position.</rdfs:comment>
