	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d3fd64e-adf7-4c59-822c-34225e553995">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d3fd64e-adf7-4c59-822c-34225e553995</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump Administration, rejecting concerns over the risks to Alaska’s fishery, cleared the way on Friday for the Pebble Mine.</rdfs:comment>
