	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d43f45a-f7f9-41ef-ace7-2b8f3aa38ffc">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d43f45a-f7f9-41ef-ace7-2b8f3aa38ffc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Censured by his party and shunned by family members, Mr. Kinzinger, a six-term Illinois congressman, is pressing Republicans to leave Donald Trump behind — and risking his career doing so.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-15"/>
