	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d5e9a9f-e66a-4962-b46d-4bfdc38b2304">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d5e9a9f-e66a-4962-b46d-4bfdc38b2304</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His confirmation as transportation secretary would cap a rise from mayor of South Bend, Ind., to the first openly gay cabinet secretary to be approved by the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
