		<rdfs:label>article-1d768690-704d-4add-8a92-486005f3be7a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A surge of corporate money could soon transform carbon removal from science fiction to reality. But there are risks: The very idea could offer industry an excuse to maintain dangerous habits.</rdfs:comment>
