	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d76adc9-477f-4dcd-80a3-cd33365937a3">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d76adc9-477f-4dcd-80a3-cd33365937a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Law enforcement agencies said claims on social media that antifascist activists had set fires on the West Coast were unfounded.</rdfs:comment>
