	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1d7a797a-424c-4afe-86b8-bb6db2d252fa">
		<rdfs:label>article-1d7a797a-424c-4afe-86b8-bb6db2d252fa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump said he envisioned a show running two hours a day, according to White House officials, and would do it were it not for the risk of encroaching on Rush Limbaugh, the conservative host.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1a919c05-175d-4b8d-9183-278fc0c9195c"/>
