	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1db45dea-8698-4708-a921-9ac9b62ce27e">
		<rdfs:label>article-1db45dea-8698-4708-a921-9ac9b62ce27e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With only a week left in his term, the House impeached President Trump, but he will leave office before he stands trial in the Senate. Here’s how the process works.</rdfs:comment>
