	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1dcd80a0-fe60-49dc-88d6-725dd5b0b77f">
		<rdfs:label>article-1dcd80a0-fe60-49dc-88d6-725dd5b0b77f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration is sending vaccines to many more pharmacies, opening more federally run mass vaccinations sites and making dentists, medical students, midwives, paramedics and veterinarians eligible to give shots.</rdfs:comment>
