	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1dd2056e-ecb6-4cf6-8b3d-f8c9e7805f68">
		<rdfs:label>article-1dd2056e-ecb6-4cf6-8b3d-f8c9e7805f68</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Neither Poland nor the United States wants to make itself — or NATO — a target of Russia. And providing MIG fighters might cross over Putin’s invisible line.</rdfs:comment>
