	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1dd3da17-b595-4963-8b78-117376a1a392">
		<rdfs:label>article-1dd3da17-b595-4963-8b78-117376a1a392</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Iowa and New Hampshire, it’s Mr. Buttigieg — not Bernie Sanders — who has complicated Ms. Warren’s path, winning over college-educated white voters using a similar message of Democratic unity.</rdfs:comment>
