	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1e06e00f-e9a7-46be-aab0-804408057101">
		<rdfs:label>article-1e06e00f-e9a7-46be-aab0-804408057101</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Catherine Saenz and her family, like most of their neighbors in Houston, have had no power or water for days, as the city remains in the grip of the fiercest winter in memory. But they are fortunate: They have a fireplace.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ab0366b9-dff5-47f7-930e-f33129e54673"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ae47edf3-29dc-462d-b74b-f886ebf56402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-cd408a7d-c896-49ba-8fc7-41f93f3c906a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1e1287b3-324b-4732-8344-f699fececa5e">
		<rdfs:label>article-1e1287b3-324b-4732-8344-f699fececa5e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A look at Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson’s career as a Harvard student shows her early passion for justice, and her strong sense of identity.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b782e9c4-4c0a-4c6c-aa6e-ee0fb7623560"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1e134d9c-f380-4c7c-bcf6-865bc92481fc">
		<rdfs:label>article-1e134d9c-f380-4c7c-bcf6-865bc92481fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a rally on Thursday, President Trump did not mention the dissident Aleksei A. Navalny, or warnings that Moscow is trying to interfere with the election. When news reports mention Russia, he said, “I just turn it off.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
