		<rdfs:label>article-1e2d71b1-6e80-4f68-af94-822d3e70214f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House managers concluded their case by asserting that the Jan. 6 violence wouldn’t have happened without former President Donald Trump and that his supporters believed he had invited their help.</rdfs:comment>
