		<rdfs:label>article-1e31d727-cf5a-4c06-aebd-e731ac434700</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An Afghan family struggled for a foothold in a new home in the U.S. Now one of them is charged with killing fellow Muslims.</rdfs:comment>
