		<rdfs:label>article-1e3d8eed-d220-4a7d-a634-069d0f7a7bed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New York deaths spike as the state releases a revised count, and California explores steps toward reopening. Trump announces his “opening the country” council.</rdfs:comment>
