	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1e42ae8d-9284-46d2-8c2c-d051dc04b24e">
		<rdfs:label>article-1e42ae8d-9284-46d2-8c2c-d051dc04b24e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Donald Trump came to rely on executive action for many of his achievements. But his successor seems to understand that it is best used to repeal someone else’s legacy, not build his own.</rdfs:comment>
