		<rdfs:label>article-1e44a472-49e7-4995-9cc0-474230b57b0a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Warren’s proposal would be a part of the $3.5 trillion economic and social-policy package.</rdfs:comment>
