		<rdfs:label>article-1e4636c5-65fa-4f41-be92-26d063ee20df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph R. Biden Jr. urged Republicans on Sunday not to rush a Supreme Court nominee through the Senate in the final six weeks before the presidential election, suggesting that such a move would amount to an “abuse of power” at an already perilous moment in American political history.</rdfs:comment>
