	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1e5be7ba-d281-4f45-ae4f-7f5b6e436431">
		<rdfs:label>article-1e5be7ba-d281-4f45-ae4f-7f5b6e436431</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Online retailers, backed by Amazon, are beginning a campaign to press for billions of dollars to rescue the Postal Service. Nearly one in five children in the U.S. are not getting enough to eat.</rdfs:comment>
