		<rdfs:label>article-1e7290bd-1962-4d6c-89a1-c9aeef99ddd1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Leaders reached agreements to reduce methane gas emissions and protect the world’s forests. Now, the really hard part begins.</rdfs:comment>
