		<rdfs:label>article-1e746956-a77f-4b1c-8271-e78e27066933</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Senate majority leader, marking his own 100 days in charge, is responsible for turning sweeping Democratic plans into law. It’s a tall order.</rdfs:comment>
