		<rdfs:label>article-1e8adecf-8316-4737-b048-191cbc1aa172</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Whether he is invited or not, the former president keeps holding rallies in battleground states. It reflects an awkward dance as Republican candidates try to win over general-election voters.</rdfs:comment>
