		<rdfs:label>article-1e8b799a-da2a-4397-860c-0b3463f406c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid the ‘loss and damage’ debate at global climate talks, the study adds to evidence that less-developed countries suffer from warming that industrialized nations largely cause.</rdfs:comment>
