		<rdfs:comment>A Monmouth University poll of North Carolina brought more good news for Democrats Tuesday, with Joseph R. Biden Jr. retaining a narrow advantage over President Trump and Cal Cunningham continuing to outpoll Senator Thom Tillis.</rdfs:comment>
