		<rdfs:label>article-1ea112dd-120f-48a7-a34b-3dec833ff3a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As global warming passes certain limits, dire changes will probably become irreversible, the researchers said, including the loss of polar ice sheets and the death of coral reefs.</rdfs:comment>
