		<rdfs:label>article-1ef931e2-7bfe-4162-acd6-9ff6a1761404</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The two septuagenarian Democratic candidates were asked at Sunday’s debate what they were doing to ensure they remained healthy.</rdfs:comment>
