	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1efdae16-d50c-43e0-93c6-4cce82ca12d2">
		<rdfs:label>article-1efdae16-d50c-43e0-93c6-4cce82ca12d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Russian president has rejected requests from commanders in the field that they be allowed to retreat from Kherson, a vital city in Ukraine’s south.</rdfs:comment>
