	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f129c05-3033-42fd-b81a-fd31c2682d9c">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f129c05-3033-42fd-b81a-fd31c2682d9c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The lines at Los Angeles’s mass vaccination site are a portrait of the city. Men on motorcycles. Bangladeshi merchants. Retired record-company executives. Latina health care workers. Arnold Schwarzenegger.</rdfs:comment>
