	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f1427d5-46ea-4640-8c1d-f84cd5f84cd1">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f1427d5-46ea-4640-8c1d-f84cd5f84cd1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The potential delivery of hundreds of Iranian drones would help the Kremlin replenish a fleet that has suffered steep losses in Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
