	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f14fb35-6dd1-415e-b1a1-056a087e7460">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f14fb35-6dd1-415e-b1a1-056a087e7460</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jurors found the main organizers of the deadly far-right rally in Charlottesville, Va., in 2017 liable under state law, awarding more than $25 million in damages, but deadlocked on federal conspiracy charges.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-17d88f11-8c44-408d-8ac2-945b979b26ce"/>
