	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f226f46-1cb2-46ac-8c67-1c2d9a555eb1">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f226f46-1cb2-46ac-8c67-1c2d9a555eb1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The family of Andrew Brown Jr. watched a snippet of his final moments, but that hasn’t stopped the demands to publicly release body camera footage of the fatal shooting.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d7a0b17f-e0aa-44c5-a995-e81e028fa879"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f2384a3-d9c4-4c49-9a20-0c1a60f19148">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f2384a3-d9c4-4c49-9a20-0c1a60f19148</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ronny Jackson is one of 15 candidates in a crowded Republican primary. And the White House hasn’t gone out of its way to help.</rdfs:comment>
