	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f25b2de-4e45-4137-9fb9-f8faaa09b0cd">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f25b2de-4e45-4137-9fb9-f8faaa09b0cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democratic Party is anxiously awaiting a formal announcement from President Biden about whether he is running for re-election.</rdfs:comment>
