	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f273389-d2b7-4325-b815-dafd7debb8b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f273389-d2b7-4325-b815-dafd7debb8b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Champ and Major joined the Bidens at the White House shortly after the family relocated to Washington. Since then, the German shepherds have been allowed to roam unleashed on the White House grounds</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-09"/>
