	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f289499-563c-42ec-be24-d941876b107b">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f289499-563c-42ec-be24-d941876b107b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nick Rocco, a passionate Trump follower in the Democratic bastion of Massachusetts, slowly realized it wasn’t going his way.</rdfs:comment>
