	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f2bef59-7abc-4259-9975-34b7a14d8b15">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f2bef59-7abc-4259-9975-34b7a14d8b15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biggs and his fellow Proud Boys left an incriminating social media trail for federal investigators before and during the Capitol attack on Jan. 6.</rdfs:comment>
