	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f308897-e48a-4ee4-9d5d-f533741e50ee">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f308897-e48a-4ee4-9d5d-f533741e50ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a report from the Pentagon, Democrats questioned whether there was enough capacity to help either detainees or their guards if an outbreak occurs.</rdfs:comment>
