	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f33096a-7d45-45a0-be00-3805d81e9f15">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f33096a-7d45-45a0-be00-3805d81e9f15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Klobuchar made her decision hours before Super Tuesday. She shocked the primary field with a third-place finish in New Hampshire, but ultimately could not compete with better-funded rivals.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3488268a-8b17-411a-8185-6859abbab9a8"/>
