	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f489dd7-6f91-4b30-bee7-8bec62e455df">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f489dd7-6f91-4b30-bee7-8bec62e455df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Investigators are questioning whether the perpetrator specifically targeted the building. The explosion disrupted 911 call centers, hospitals and cell service in several states.</rdfs:comment>
