		<rdfs:label>article-1f78ee64-2800-4495-827f-20c7e8e9d8e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While Mr. Chipman’s selection came as welcome news to gun control groups, few nominees put forward by President Biden have faced steeper odds of confirmation in the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
