	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f7b4ae0-2989-414b-8280-45e8c66cc07e">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f7b4ae0-2989-414b-8280-45e8c66cc07e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president and his allies have baselessly claimed that rampant voter fraud stole victory from him. Officials contacted by The Times said that there were no irregularities that affected the outcome.</rdfs:comment>
