	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f7ebdb8-7fa7-4d13-a9bb-a5bd6050ba38">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f7ebdb8-7fa7-4d13-a9bb-a5bd6050ba38</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden faced a challenge in winning the confidence of a continent where the circumstances of its leaders vary so dramatically.</rdfs:comment>
