		<rdfs:label>article-1f7fa648-40c7-4806-b244-97d3ee4b62f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump sought to reassure the country that his government was controlling the spread of the coronavirus after his administration weathered days of criticism.</rdfs:comment>
