	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f86fbd4-d221-493d-a8df-abba91211569">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f86fbd4-d221-493d-a8df-abba91211569</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jeffrey Zients, a candidate to lead the administration’s coronavirus response team, is arousing resistance from some progressive Democrats.</rdfs:comment>
