	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f94119e-04b6-4861-9c8f-7511cdca1bf3">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f94119e-04b6-4861-9c8f-7511cdca1bf3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the coronavirus upends the economy, the Trump administration plans to make changes to the food stamp program that could lead to nearly 700,000 people losing assistance.</rdfs:comment>
