		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f949109-d626-46bf-ad3c-9564899ff6fa">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f949109-d626-46bf-ad3c-9564899ff6fa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Bernie Sanders’s campaign said it would request the more intensive step of a recount after the state party announced that it had changed results in 29 precincts but that no national delegates would be moved.</rdfs:comment>
