	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f9d55fa-ab34-40d5-9cd2-cd36bceb73a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f9d55fa-ab34-40d5-9cd2-cd36bceb73a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wendy Sherman is best known for negotiating the Iran nuclear deal. Now, as the first woman to serve as deputy secretary of state, she has a big role in confronting another adversary: China.</rdfs:comment>
