	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-1f9fb951-ff7f-4299-b543-cdf2f6321343">
		<rdfs:label>article-1f9fb951-ff7f-4299-b543-cdf2f6321343</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Requests for the first lady, who is also the president’s most popular surrogate, are piling up ahead of the midterm elections. Her visits can deliver a morale boost and a fund-raising opportunity.</rdfs:comment>
