		<rdfs:label>article-20f991d1-59cc-49ff-916e-b0f400dd4835</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans increasingly believe that elevating China’s culpability for spreading the coronavirus may be the best way to improve their difficult election chances. The president is muddying the message.</rdfs:comment>
