	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-218a0e6b-cb26-452e-aa70-32df8e8b47f4">
		<rdfs:label>article-218a0e6b-cb26-452e-aa70-32df8e8b47f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Commerce Department announced rules that threaten to inflict more pain on the company and upset an already rocky U.S.-China relationship.</rdfs:comment>
