	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-218a696c-d351-42a8-84bd-ba8bbe572fce">
		<rdfs:label>article-218a696c-d351-42a8-84bd-ba8bbe572fce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Channel Street Skatepark in San Pedro is considered one of the nation’s only “D.I.Y.” skate parks to be officially sanctioned.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-252129e5-f5aa-4881-9b46-aaca042fd5a4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-218e87ff-49f6-4f7f-b2be-ccb1bdc0e88e">
		<rdfs:label>article-218e87ff-49f6-4f7f-b2be-ccb1bdc0e88e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. secretary of agriculture, Tom Vilsack, has tested positive for the coronavirus, his department announced on Saturday, adding to a wave of cases disrupting the Biden administration days after he met with officials in Mexico.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c431cec6-53e9-48e0-a3c8-38432e75646c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f97eca41-c833-4bf2-a3f3-9cae7b120727"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2190766a-2ecc-4e42-91fd-4e7a96673e36">
		<rdfs:label>article-2190766a-2ecc-4e42-91fd-4e7a96673e36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an interview with ABC, the former vice president said he was angered that President Donald J. Trump’s tweet during the Capitol attack had endangered him and his family.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2191265d-aaff-48fc-beff-0227b8228de5">
		<rdfs:label>article-2191265d-aaff-48fc-beff-0227b8228de5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Activists and women’s rights advocates have urged Mr. Biden to address a former aide’s allegation that he sexually assaulted her in 1993. His lack of response has angered them.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-577cfa39-5806-4396-ae24-cdf4ba406715"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-21973c97-c677-47c4-9b9d-d8aadcc51ab3">
		<rdfs:label>article-21973c97-c677-47c4-9b9d-d8aadcc51ab3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a disappointing fifth-place finish in the Iowa caucuses, the Minnesota senator made a series of bets in the Granite State.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2199559d-c5bb-406b-ba33-e089a144f6e5">
		<rdfs:label>article-2199559d-c5bb-406b-ba33-e089a144f6e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With a Democratic president in the White House, Senate Republicans have a newfound zeal for austerity, foreshadowing spending fights to come.</rdfs:comment>
