	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-221d43ac-f0be-4117-959a-03779151553e">
		<rdfs:label>article-221d43ac-f0be-4117-959a-03779151553e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump returned to the White House this week after his hospitalization for coronavirus. He is eager to get back on the campaign trail as his support is falling far behind Joe Biden in national polls.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4504805-5b5f-41c7-b157-41ff04a342ad"/>
