		<rdfs:label>article-221f9511-f3c5-4fb2-b0ac-f74f8e4a73fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move, on the eve of Juneteenth, came as part of a nationwide outcry for racial justice that has included the removal of historic symbols of racism in America.</rdfs:comment>
