		<rdfs:label>article-2229f75f-513a-42af-a564-c1b065575517</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least six clinics had returned to performing the procedure, but most of the state’s roughly two dozen abortion clinics were waiting, weighing the risks under the new law.</rdfs:comment>
