		<rdfs:label>article-2231d81e-30ee-46fb-abd3-23aa649dfac8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The confirmation of the Mississippian, over Democratic opposition, fills the final appeals court vacancy and makes him the 200th judge installed by President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
