		<rdfs:label>article-2234b08b-5727-4772-b2ea-2843254f2f27</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After pledging on Twitter to end immigration during the pandemic, President Trump moved to block new green cards but stopped short of ending all work visas.</rdfs:comment>
