		<rdfs:label>article-223b4a9e-6dc2-4472-8bb7-5d7611715a4c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The federal judge in Florida also indicated that she would unseal a more detailed inventory of the materials seized in the search of the former president’s Mar-a-Lago home.</rdfs:comment>
