	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2285daf0-1cd4-46c5-8e39-7db4895733e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-2285daf0-1cd4-46c5-8e39-7db4895733e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The current civil unrest is deeply connected to the racial disparities exposed by the coronavirus crisis. “I’m just as likely to die from a cop as I am from Covid,” one organizer said.</rdfs:comment>
