		<rdfs:label>article-228de745-d176-4a17-b060-70bf10a31024</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Interest in the draft and “World War III” surged online, stalling the government website where young men are required to register. Here’s what you need to know.</rdfs:comment>
