		<rdfs:label>article-22a10b72-ecbc-46d1-8857-0d63be9b3a1c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Food insecurity is rising again as relief provided by President Biden’s $1.9 trillion stimulus package wanes.</rdfs:comment>
