	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-22a6385f-8f34-4956-aad0-c3f5533c33c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-22a6385f-8f34-4956-aad0-c3f5533c33c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The nation’s capital has been secured with checkpoints, tens of thousands of National Guard troops and miles of fencing and barricades, security at the cost of normalcy.</rdfs:comment>
