	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-22a6bd0e-528e-4c58-bee4-ba0770fe7519">
		<rdfs:label>article-22a6bd0e-528e-4c58-bee4-ba0770fe7519</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Peter Meijer, a Republican who voted to impeach Donald J. Trump, seeks “decency and humility” in Western Michigan, but has found anger, fear and misinformation.</rdfs:comment>
