	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-22ab83e3-d189-49de-bfdc-b0c2d5c68856">
		<rdfs:label>article-22ab83e3-d189-49de-bfdc-b0c2d5c68856</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Temperatures are soaring across South Asia, testing dangerous thresholds. How much is climate change to blame? It’s becoming an ‘obsolete question,’ one scientist says.</rdfs:comment>
