		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-22b763f4-4329-4301-8eac-c7561b96e6da">
		<rdfs:label>article-22b763f4-4329-4301-8eac-c7561b96e6da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Under an agreement to be voted on in May, a new “traditionalist Methodist” denomination would continue to ban same-sex marriage and gay and lesbian clergy.</rdfs:comment>
