	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-22b9fc50-e0c6-466c-aa73-da1a09caaa41">
		<rdfs:label>article-22b9fc50-e0c6-466c-aa73-da1a09caaa41</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>When the Supreme Court hears arguments this fall in a big abortion case from Mississippi, it will consider dueling accounts of international practices.</rdfs:comment>
