	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-22bb09e1-ab4e-49b7-aeef-1f21e986612d">
		<rdfs:label>article-22bb09e1-ab4e-49b7-aeef-1f21e986612d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An unusual combination of events caused the Weddell Sea to lose more sea ice than in recent years.</rdfs:comment>
