	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-23604e26-2935-40db-8a60-d40d89562fed">
		<rdfs:label>article-23604e26-2935-40db-8a60-d40d89562fed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With closing arguments set to begin in the trial of three men accused of killing Ahmaud Arbery, those closest to him have kept a prayerful vigil at the courthouse.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5f497c4d-378e-4c6b-a1e7-70ebd6812d68"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-22"/>
