	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-23614b48-5949-4ea5-b294-2e9971af79ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-23614b48-5949-4ea5-b294-2e9971af79ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus is tearing across the largest Native American reservation in the United States. Facing a spike in deaths, Navajo officials are scrambling to respond.</rdfs:comment>
