	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2364149b-0b5a-43cd-95f4-783058f858d2">
		<rdfs:label>article-2364149b-0b5a-43cd-95f4-783058f858d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Both sides have much to lose if a delicate negotiation over limiting Iran’s activities in return for a lifting of sanctions falls short.</rdfs:comment>
