	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-23743b9c-2f5a-44e6-aff6-66e395ea159a">
		<rdfs:label>article-23743b9c-2f5a-44e6-aff6-66e395ea159a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>American semiconductor giants are pressing Congress to pass legislation that would provide $52 billion for their industry, warning that they may otherwise relocate overseas.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-94d58c04-d925-44a3-9534-35b73b8dc25d"/>
