	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-23db79ef-a5a7-49a2-8e76-110b6f2b05c4">
		<rdfs:label>article-23db79ef-a5a7-49a2-8e76-110b6f2b05c4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The federal government often gives less help to Black disaster survivors than their white neighbors. That’s a challenge for President Biden, who has vowed to fight both inequality and climate change.</rdfs:comment>
