		<rdfs:label>article-248cbd7b-9fc9-47e0-9f12-94c02c7bf658</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The winter wave has been anticipated for months. Now that it’s here, health officials worry once again about strategy and supplies.</rdfs:comment>
