	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-248eee8a-977b-4de3-b1f4-163742b56bfe">
		<rdfs:label>article-248eee8a-977b-4de3-b1f4-163742b56bfe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus had entrenched itself in communities from Pensacola to Key West, killing more than 7,000 Floridians. Then came Tropical Storm Isaias.</rdfs:comment>
