		<rdfs:label>article-248f1476-7ea0-44b4-a80a-2a192d615c43</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former White House chief of staff previously provided the committee with thousands of pages of documents, including text messages he received on Jan. 6.</rdfs:comment>
