	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2493e709-1ca6-4b60-81eb-b202de2d48de">
		<rdfs:label>article-2493e709-1ca6-4b60-81eb-b202de2d48de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a coming call with King Salman, the president plans to warn him that the United States will soon make public intelligence about the Saudi crown prince’s role in the killing of Jamal Khashoggi.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-25"/>
