	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-24947143-8458-4c14-9c15-ce73e0edf0e3">
		<rdfs:label>article-24947143-8458-4c14-9c15-ce73e0edf0e3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Pentagon policy official overseeing the military’s efforts to combat the Islamic State was fired on Monday after a White House appointee told him the United States had won that war and that his office had been disbanded, according to three people briefed on the matter.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3a4b0b1a-f7a7-498e-8805-48a907d13871"/>
