	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-24983b66-9703-4d3d-9ab5-c0910e309c06">
		<rdfs:label>article-24983b66-9703-4d3d-9ab5-c0910e309c06</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For four days, the Republican National Convention constructed a false image of America beyond the pandemic, where President Trump had moved quickly and effectively to crush the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
