		<rdfs:label>article-24a4cdaa-c6ad-4c08-9522-0b4f7b67e31c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden and Jill Biden, the first lady, hosted the first Egg Roll since the beginning of the pandemic. It was the largest event held at the White House since they moved in.</rdfs:comment>
