	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-24aa6582-cf7a-4087-b329-7157decd9fd3">
		<rdfs:label>article-24aa6582-cf7a-4087-b329-7157decd9fd3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Klausutis asked Mr. Dorsey, Twitter’s chief executive, to remove President Trump’s tweets that push a debunked conspiracy theory about the death of his wife, Lori Klausutis. Twitter said it would not do so.</rdfs:comment>
