		<rdfs:label>article-24ac9bcb-5b72-4b5d-b1c6-5dbda90b0363</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Enrique Tarrio, the Florida state director of Latinos for Trump, a national grass-roots organization unaffiliated with the Trump campaign, is also the chairman of the Proud Boys, a far-right organization linked with white supremacy and acts of violence.</rdfs:comment>
