		<rdfs:label>article-24d4555e-0c99-4e20-abf9-25906ae0e78d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Eric H. Holder Jr., the former attorney general, accused President Trump on Tuesday of trying to disenfranchise millions of voters by damaging the Postal Service and its ability to handle mail-in voting in the November election.</rdfs:comment>
