		<rdfs:comment>Also this week, five climate reporters recommend books they’ve enjoyed.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8453f3b8-4b37-434c-95f9-065717bc47b6"/>
