		<rdfs:label>article-255af902-0e8c-4e34-b6cb-4e29d6d4338d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>By different metrics, all sorts of locations in the United States are deeply troubling, from Minot, N.D., to New York City.</rdfs:comment>
