		<rdfs:label>article-25631d32-2f9c-418f-81e8-0b7ce5ee2078</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The commonwealth has been battered by national disasters and human error, but Republicans have resisted sending the island more money.</rdfs:comment>
