	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2567a190-7be1-4034-8c0f-740bd11174b9">
		<rdfs:label>article-2567a190-7be1-4034-8c0f-740bd11174b9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first lady stepped on an object that became lodged in her left foot while walking on a beach in Hawaii, her spokesman said.</rdfs:comment>
