	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-256f5bb9-8591-45b7-ba3d-58ae1050e587">
		<rdfs:label>article-256f5bb9-8591-45b7-ba3d-58ae1050e587</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Voters reaffirmed their landslide support of Gov. Gavin Newsom in 2018.</rdfs:comment>
