	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-26214fc1-5a20-407a-97cd-6fd8e9114a9e">
		<rdfs:label>article-26214fc1-5a20-407a-97cd-6fd8e9114a9e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A woman who was fatally shot inside the Capitol after it was overrun by a pro-Trump mob was struck by gunfire from a Capitol Police officer, a police official said Wednesday night.</rdfs:comment>
