	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-26237747-fa4b-401e-882e-64962c78ee54">
		<rdfs:label>article-26237747-fa4b-401e-882e-64962c78ee54</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“I will not sit back and watch in silence while others lead our party down a path that abandons the rule of law,” Representative Liz Cheney said on the eve of a vote to remove her from House Republican leadership.</rdfs:comment>
