		<rdfs:label>article-26241c25-1962-43dd-9c83-7337bc1825dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Far-right activists are intercepting migrant children and collecting information about their families, based on a conspiracy theory that they are falling prey to sex-trafficking rings.</rdfs:comment>
