	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2625d7b6-f0de-4db9-8c15-a3974942fe2a">
		<rdfs:label>article-2625d7b6-f0de-4db9-8c15-a3974942fe2a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s commencement speech comes more than a month after he announced that he would pull all American troops out of Afghanistan by Sept. 11.</rdfs:comment>
