		<rdfs:label>article-26393976-41ae-4d77-aa73-a38c61422294</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers from both parties and interest groups swung into gear to influence President Biden’s choice for the first Black woman to serve on the nation’s highest court.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-27"/>
