	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-263b9d42-6111-40a3-a331-63968c5600b5">
		<rdfs:label>article-263b9d42-6111-40a3-a331-63968c5600b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An estimated 30,177 of those who served after the 9/11 terrorist attacks died by suicide, compared with 7,057 killed in war operations.</rdfs:comment>
