		<rdfs:comment>If Mr. Biden is elected president, Ms. Harris’s rise will leave an opening in January for her seat in the Senate representing California. That pick will be made by Gov. Gavin Newsom, a Democrat, and it stands to be consequential for both the sprawling state and the nation.</rdfs:comment>
