		<rdfs:label>article-26eca7fe-f133-4faf-a858-ebbb5c68aa83</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Oregon and Washington State, two of the most successful states at limiting deaths and infections during the pandemic, lifted their statewide mask mandates on Saturday, making masks optional in most settings.</rdfs:comment>
