	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2716cc33-4e89-45f2-9eae-f8e302a593e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-2716cc33-4e89-45f2-9eae-f8e302a593e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president-elect’s proposed economic rescue package is larger and more targeted to the country’s needs than the stimulus plan he helped steer into law as vice president in 2009.</rdfs:comment>
