	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-276bc2c1-27e4-4e74-b30d-710361d0aff0">
		<rdfs:label>article-276bc2c1-27e4-4e74-b30d-710361d0aff0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Minus, perhaps, the 15-hour session, it was a scene sure to be repeated many times.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-276dcecf-9329-4f6f-805f-cf8f2cb62af6">
		<rdfs:label>article-276dcecf-9329-4f6f-805f-cf8f2cb62af6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The party is promising a more traditional in-person spectacle with President Trump speaking every night. Coming into this weekend, major TV networks had only a foggy idea of what to expect.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-276ec0d0-aecb-4605-9a42-17689f960558">
		<rdfs:label>article-276ec0d0-aecb-4605-9a42-17689f960558</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The aspiring Republican House speaker disavowed the prominent white nationalist Nick Fuentes and his ideology, but declined to directly criticize former President Donald J. Trump for meeting with him.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ce324a4b-e256-4143-b6b8-1dde4bc956af"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2774c9a0-41a8-43c7-81e4-016b1bb8a37d">
		<rdfs:label>article-2774c9a0-41a8-43c7-81e4-016b1bb8a37d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A person in the Seattle area has died, officials said. Mr. Trump called more cases “likely” but added that “there’s no reason to panic at all.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-becd702f-c674-4653-9a6c-90ee51977e85"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e993acb7-fd71-489b-b569-b6b6d449dfe5"/>
