	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-277de91d-ec29-4c37-9c65-d5ca6e9cfabb">
		<rdfs:label>article-277de91d-ec29-4c37-9c65-d5ca6e9cfabb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The preliminary guidance applies to an alternative minimum tax for large corporations and a tax on stock buybacks, which helped fund President Biden’s climate and health bill.</rdfs:comment>
