		<rdfs:label>article-278b2699-938e-48e9-a67e-5f89e69f0cef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The court’s new conservative supermajority may be skeptical of admissions programs that take account of race to foster educational diversity.</rdfs:comment>
