		<rdfs:label>article-278c72ea-bd75-4ded-ac19-4da01984d75a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s personal lawyers say lower courts should not have upheld a broad subpoena by the Manhattan district attorney.</rdfs:comment>
