	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-278e4dc8-5cc8-42b6-8aac-2de533005763">
		<rdfs:label>article-278e4dc8-5cc8-42b6-8aac-2de533005763</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Times reported that many donors had unwittingly become repeat contributors to Donald J. Trump’s campaign because of  prechecked boxes in digital donation forms.</rdfs:comment>
