	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-278eddb3-e86c-429f-92bc-e674e2e35759">
		<rdfs:label>article-278eddb3-e86c-429f-92bc-e674e2e35759</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Interrupting Joe Biden nearly every time he spoke, President Trump made little attempt to reassure swing voters about his leadership. Mr. Biden hit back: “This is so unpresidential.”</rdfs:comment>
