		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2793bae0-b406-4b51-b2c8-d2aa2a54b492">
		<rdfs:label>article-2793bae0-b406-4b51-b2c8-d2aa2a54b492</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans and Democrats have long sparred over raising the debt ceiling. But this time, the odds are growing that the U.S. could default.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279528f1-3caa-42ee-8dc5-383d88fc7c1c">
		<rdfs:label>article-279528f1-3caa-42ee-8dc5-383d88fc7c1c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats at every level of the party are increasingly seeking to reclaim language about freedom and personal liberty from Republicans, as part of their midterms messaging.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279839ae-59a8-4bb3-bf40-bd49cc7a2081">
		<rdfs:label>article-279839ae-59a8-4bb3-bf40-bd49cc7a2081</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Trump’s asides in a video recorded on Jan. 7 to condemn the violence showed his frustration, and his unwillingness to acknowledge defeat.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279cfa67-2040-4928-a46b-23f67b86afda">
		<rdfs:label>article-279cfa67-2040-4928-a46b-23f67b86afda</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president, who previously commuted her sentence, said he saw her in the audience as he accepted the nomination for a second term and decided to elevate his action to a full pardon.</rdfs:comment>
