	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279cfb42-7db3-46b5-a148-80400774ee05">
		<rdfs:label>article-279cfb42-7db3-46b5-a148-80400774ee05</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The shooting death of Ahmaud Arbery has renewed criticism of the police agency that released the two suspects. They were charged by the state months later.</rdfs:comment>
