	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279e5bb2-af4f-43d5-a37e-77eed4b48e9d">
		<rdfs:label>article-279e5bb2-af4f-43d5-a37e-77eed4b48e9d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If you’re going back to work, and leaving your furry companion, we want to hear from you.</rdfs:comment>
