	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279ec5ac-7a59-4149-9d84-1a62d9aa9aaf">
		<rdfs:label>article-279ec5ac-7a59-4149-9d84-1a62d9aa9aaf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Transportation companies were altering operations, and officials were warning drivers to take extra care on the roads.</rdfs:comment>
