	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279f0e87-d6a4-4b39-bd8d-987a8083eb09">
		<rdfs:label>article-279f0e87-d6a4-4b39-bd8d-987a8083eb09</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Voters are facing a deluge of misinformation about voting by mail, some prompted by the president. Here’s a guide to those false claims.</rdfs:comment>
