	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-279fdf6e-71b2-4908-920c-3cf988d71c66">
		<rdfs:label>article-279fdf6e-71b2-4908-920c-3cf988d71c66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are strong reasons to suspect that the mass grave was for victims of the 1921 killing, given contemporary evidence.</rdfs:comment>
