	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-27a14913-7a54-41a0-8f63-82e958e5b8bb">
		<rdfs:label>article-27a14913-7a54-41a0-8f63-82e958e5b8bb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers who flipped Republican districts in 2018 worry that a democratic socialist at the top of the ticket could doom their re-election chances.</rdfs:comment>
