		<rdfs:label>article-28f0283a-708a-48c8-9cd9-8780bf929e9e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Pentagon, intelligence agencies, nuclear labs and Fortune 500 companies use software that was found to have been compromised by Russian hackers. The sweep of stolen data is still being assessed.</rdfs:comment>
