		<rdfs:label>article-29d1fb2c-eb84-436e-9a59-08ed345b0748</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus has dominated the news and is wreaking havoc on the political world. Nonetheless, the race for the Democratic nomination continues (with some modifications).</rdfs:comment>
