	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29d21a5e-45de-4e5a-8ac1-141ad249e496">
		<rdfs:label>article-29d21a5e-45de-4e5a-8ac1-141ad249e496</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ron DeSantis, Ted Cruz, Mike Pompeo, Nikki Haley and other Republicans with a potential eye on 2024 gathered in Las Vegas at a moment of deep vulnerability for Donald Trump.</rdfs:comment>
