	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29d2ccf6-8bc1-4d25-9210-fcbf7cbd9d83">
		<rdfs:label>article-29d2ccf6-8bc1-4d25-9210-fcbf7cbd9d83</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Under the proposal, the government could block a citizen or legal resident’s entry if an official “reasonably believes” the person had been exposed to or was infected with the communicable disease.</rdfs:comment>
