	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29d3a2fe-ae24-43e6-981f-3abc3489c5c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-29d3a2fe-ae24-43e6-981f-3abc3489c5c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A financial filing released on Tuesday indicated that a handful of prominent Republicans footed the bill.</rdfs:comment>
