	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29d62ac5-db7c-4ace-98c9-45b4b147326f">
		<rdfs:label>article-29d62ac5-db7c-4ace-98c9-45b4b147326f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Good morning. I’m Emily Weinstein, the Food and Cooking editor here at The New York Times, and I’ll be your host today. Are you having an excellent long weekend? Have you had pancakes yet? Are you already diving headlong into cookie-making with Gantt charts and custom holiday baking playlists?</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3f25f5ed-fbe2-4d82-8192-4b2ad0fa0088"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29d7e448-8261-450a-ac7e-0ab8933eed1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-29d7e448-8261-450a-ac7e-0ab8933eed1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ambulances in Tulsa and Oklahoma City have taken dozens of patients to hospitals with heat exhaustion or heat stroke, a significant increase over previous summers.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f7d54296-4f6d-4656-bd4e-ce98de1cb5ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29d9c351-d52b-43d4-a6f4-d4f29c1d9d90">
		<rdfs:label>article-29d9c351-d52b-43d4-a6f4-d4f29c1d9d90</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>George Floyd’s death continued to resonate far beyond Minneapolis, where he died. In Boston, Philadelphia, New York, Ferguson, Mo., Portland, Ore., Los Angeles and countless other cities, demonstrations raged.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29dea6bc-ca35-4823-96a5-f7f4cfe2fe01">
		<rdfs:label>article-29dea6bc-ca35-4823-96a5-f7f4cfe2fe01</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After this pandemic year, several superintendents across the country are leaving their jobs.</rdfs:comment>
