	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29e6c5b7-0bb9-481a-ac65-02f308d977a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-29e6c5b7-0bb9-481a-ac65-02f308d977a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Administrators face “a delicate balancing act” in a state where hospitals are crowded, workers are scarce and vaccine resistance is widespread.</rdfs:comment>
