	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29e6f001-20e0-4e07-b7cc-c14fddf8189d">
		<rdfs:label>article-29e6f001-20e0-4e07-b7cc-c14fddf8189d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Karoline Leavitt, who turned her New Hampshire primary into an argument over which candidate carried the mantle of Trumpism, is closing her campaign at a fish and game club.</rdfs:comment>
