	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-29e9f238-5ff4-4bf0-a0b2-a0aae369b3ab">
		<rdfs:label>article-29e9f238-5ff4-4bf0-a0b2-a0aae369b3ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Another Afghan helicopter was hit in January by an anti-tank guided missile in southern Afghanistan, in a swath of territory long contested by the Taliban.</rdfs:comment>
