		<rdfs:label>article-2a34f3ef-d161-4975-b25b-ba57cee9f10d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new vaccine campaign is one of the country’s last remaining strategies, as masks have fallen away and quarantines have diminished. So far, the rollout is methodical but muted.</rdfs:comment>
