		<rdfs:label>article-2a4b5ae1-6c25-4222-ae8e-ea72b9fb2c24</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Warren carved up her opponents, Bloomberg was on the defensive, and Klobuchar and Buttigieg tried to take each other down. The fiery debate signals a harsher campaign as Super Tuesday looms.</rdfs:comment>
