		<rdfs:label>article-2a50c266-3736-42c7-878b-3a96051ea8f7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A nurse at the suburban Seattle nursing home that was ravaged by the first U.S. cluster of coronavirus cases sat down beside a visiting pharmacist on Monday, pulled up her blue shirtsleeve and received the first dose of the Covid-19 vaccine administered at the facility.</rdfs:comment>
