	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2a8e8cb3-f45e-486a-b763-4e5b5e1a642a">
		<rdfs:label>article-2a8e8cb3-f45e-486a-b763-4e5b5e1a642a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pomp and circumstance, high drama and bored doodling: Here’s a look back, in photos and reporting, on the trial that ends today.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ce324a4b-e256-4143-b6b8-1dde4bc956af"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-05"/>
