	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2aaa449a-9ee4-4e2c-a307-57bc7d736a85">
		<rdfs:label>article-2aaa449a-9ee4-4e2c-a307-57bc7d736a85</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A journalist in The Times’s Washington bureau explains how some terms used by the Kremlin to deny evidence of atrocities in Ukraine originated here at home.</rdfs:comment>
