	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ab27500-80bd-401d-9d12-1615a68c0e10">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ab27500-80bd-401d-9d12-1615a68c0e10</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are six days until Election Day. Here are the daily schedules of the presidential and vice-presidential candidates for Wednesday, Oct. 28. All times are Eastern time.</rdfs:comment>
