	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ab5133e-aa36-4dbc-b67f-eb2ea946b79f">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ab5133e-aa36-4dbc-b67f-eb2ea946b79f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Elected officials are exploring changes ranging from defunding police departments to requiring more accountability.</rdfs:comment>
