	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ac43674-8e0e-4d23-a3a7-fffeea95f5bf">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ac43674-8e0e-4d23-a3a7-fffeea95f5bf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Black women have long known this. With Kamala Harris as Biden’s V.P. pick, perhaps there’s an opportunity to change the idea that aspirations are something to apologize for.</rdfs:comment>
