	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ac8f743-2375-4efb-9e93-f53d67726536">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ac8f743-2375-4efb-9e93-f53d67726536</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court on Tuesday heard arguments on an Arizona case that could further undermine the ability of the Voting Rights Act to protect access to the ballot.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
