	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2acbf86d-d5a3-47db-bb83-c0369204bb69">
		<rdfs:label>article-2acbf86d-d5a3-47db-bb83-c0369204bb69</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Just after the House impeached him for inciting an insurrection against the United States government, President Trump issued a videotaped statement on Wednesday condemning the violent siege on the Capitol last week and urging his supporters not to riot again as President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. prepares to take office.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6bc8c5a9-d09c-4f66-9308-4f0bbc37ff83"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6bcf1d-e179-43a7-9f78-6139ef8f52e0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2acc79fd-43bf-47db-9c57-c7286a4af53f">
		<rdfs:label>article-2acc79fd-43bf-47db-9c57-c7286a4af53f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Shrinking and thinning of glaciers is one of the most documented signs of global warming caused by rising levels of greenhouse gases.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e17310c8-39f3-4c91-8224-a91b0b94e409"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ad37e30-eaa0-4edd-87ba-9abbd308375e">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ad37e30-eaa0-4edd-87ba-9abbd308375e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It’s difficult to find a Republican strategist who will say the former vice president has a real chance in a 2024 matchup against his former boss. But he’s clearly laying the groundwork.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ad6adfc-731a-44d5-a149-6c72161721ab">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ad6adfc-731a-44d5-a149-6c72161721ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Omicron variant’s spread poses an unwelcome political conundrum just as election season begins. Democrats and the G.O.P. see reasons to hope, but the virus will get the deciding vote.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-89135d87-ed63-4619-a5ce-c3f23d9e6fd4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2adad920-3507-492e-acf1-a87aae46e703">
		<rdfs:label>article-2adad920-3507-492e-acf1-a87aae46e703</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Disastrous errors by medical examiners have raised questions about whether they are influenced by prejudgments and a close relationship with the police.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e2a444d6-76b3-4fc5-9655-0178ae16f402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2adc2e51-a410-4ed3-b9ba-6a57204a2228">
		<rdfs:label>article-2adc2e51-a410-4ed3-b9ba-6a57204a2228</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration has repeatedly said U.S. troops will not fight in Ukraine or rescue Americans trapped there by a Russian attack.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5a3094b1-6bc7-47d7-8f53-c56fd8ed0c59"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-02-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ade56fd-9651-4110-8594-5881d3f33d1d">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ade56fd-9651-4110-8594-5881d3f33d1d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Virginia’s governor survived a blackface scandal with the help of Black Democrats, who saw a chance for policy concessions. Both got more from the relationship than they could have imagined.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4504805-5b5f-41c7-b157-41ff04a342ad"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2ade7f63-f271-4c4e-9807-104ceca54e26">
		<rdfs:label>article-2ade7f63-f271-4c4e-9807-104ceca54e26</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 25-year-old kept the solidly conservative seat in G.O.P. hands after his race had become unexpectedly competitive when he was accused of sexual misconduct and racism.</rdfs:comment>
