	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2aee0533-fc3f-463b-acef-b4a7a1eb2f46">
		<rdfs:label>article-2aee0533-fc3f-463b-acef-b4a7a1eb2f46</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin made the case to Republican senators on Tuesday for a $1 trillion plan, including $250 billion for direct checks to Americans by the end of April.</rdfs:comment>
