		<rdfs:label>article-2aee8363-a170-4020-a5ba-047d2998d908</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In convicting Travis McMichael on that charge, the 12 jurors found that he had deliberately intended to kill Mr. Arbery.</rdfs:comment>
