	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2af10c88-e224-4f22-ac6b-c92098067a3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-2af10c88-e224-4f22-ac6b-c92098067a3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The adviser, Kash Patel, had previously declined to answer questions from prosecutors in front of a federal grand jury, citing his Fifth Amendment rights.</rdfs:comment>
