	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2af31bc6-bbf6-4ada-b35d-10b0fdf29681">
		<rdfs:label>article-2af31bc6-bbf6-4ada-b35d-10b0fdf29681</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s border wall is beginning to rise, but a thick curtain of policy changes is more responsible for suppressing the flow of immigrants into the country.</rdfs:comment>
