		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2af630c5-94e5-4ccc-a394-3ed111ab22f8">
		<rdfs:label>article-2af630c5-94e5-4ccc-a394-3ed111ab22f8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Covid-19 cases grow in the Great Plains, one official said residents need to know “how perilously close we are to the edge.”</rdfs:comment>
