	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2b060cf3-0b53-4d28-b22d-b51198085c65">
		<rdfs:label>article-2b060cf3-0b53-4d28-b22d-b51198085c65</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The two Democrats giving the official response to the State of the Union address both mentioned his impeachment, with one saying, “No one is above the law.”</rdfs:comment>
