		<rdfs:label>article-2b7b4471-e50e-4724-8170-8daaa859fa5e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Researchers said that by 2070 extreme heat could encompass a much larger part of Africa, as well as parts of India, the Middle East, South America, Southeast Asia and Australia.</rdfs:comment>
