	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2b84f6ea-1192-4b32-94f5-80f571b2a304">
		<rdfs:label>article-2b84f6ea-1192-4b32-94f5-80f571b2a304</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The department said the justices should let stand an appeals court’s decision excluding about 100 sensitive documents seized at Mar-a-Lago from a special master’s review.</rdfs:comment>
