		<rdfs:label>article-2bb15ee1-af5e-44b1-b66e-1eea0723f50d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Yvette Gentry won’t be in the job long, but her city is hoping for swift progress after a series of scandals and police shootings.</rdfs:comment>
