	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bb9fde1-d8f0-4f06-a16a-390c41be977a">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bb9fde1-d8f0-4f06-a16a-390c41be977a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>F.B.I. officials in Virginia wrote a stark warning the day before a mob attacked the Capitol last week, raising alarms about the threat of violence, according to a law enforcement official.</rdfs:comment>
