	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bba92c3-b1cc-4855-836a-91f31cb2f00f">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bba92c3-b1cc-4855-836a-91f31cb2f00f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the first election test after the U.S. Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade, voters overwhelmingly rejected an amendment that would have allowed legislators to enact abortion restrictions.</rdfs:comment>
