		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bbf8ce3-2f9f-4d1e-9aad-76827aab4de0">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bbf8ce3-2f9f-4d1e-9aad-76827aab4de0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers in both parties are eager to act after former President Donald J. Trump and his allies sought to exploit a 135-year-old law to overturn the 2020 election.</rdfs:comment>
