		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bc05ca7-9e0a-40c1-a4ac-6ae15aac3a6b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bc05ca7-9e0a-40c1-a4ac-6ae15aac3a6b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Judge Barbara Lagoa lacks some of the usual credentials of a Supreme Court justice, but her roots in the Cuban-American community could make her an attractive choice for President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bc1d444-0c38-40fa-9106-30e7bcab0e73">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bc1d444-0c38-40fa-9106-30e7bcab0e73</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wednesday: Election officials are looking into the use of unofficial ballot drop boxes installed by the state’s Republican Party. Here’s what you should know.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-14f82d09-3a15-43b0-8f6d-ebdb1405d989"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bc4a2c2-9798-4c25-901b-1edaf7bb504b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bc4a2c2-9798-4c25-901b-1edaf7bb504b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There is no grand strategy. President Trump is simply trying to survive from one news cycle to the next.</rdfs:comment>
