	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bd220e6-4dce-4c7d-8b99-cffd058bc904">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bd220e6-4dce-4c7d-8b99-cffd058bc904</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Trump became a celebrity through television, but Twitter had given him a singular outlet for expressing himself as he is, unfiltered by the norms of the presidency.</rdfs:comment>
