	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2bd3f508-c288-4f5f-981a-f67e73dc2648">
		<rdfs:label>article-2bd3f508-c288-4f5f-981a-f67e73dc2648</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>She is viewed as a gifted cross-examiner whose instincts for televised verbal combat are one of her greatest political strengths, but this is a new challenge.</rdfs:comment>
