	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c08b71c-967a-428f-887a-d9d4762db7b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c08b71c-967a-428f-887a-d9d4762db7b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former President Barack Obama, campaigning in Pittsburgh with John Fetterman as he seeks to become senator, urged supporters to vote to save democracy and abortion rights.</rdfs:comment>
