	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c73e33b-c865-4fdb-8786-4010f286a1e7">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c73e33b-c865-4fdb-8786-4010f286a1e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With President Trump ratcheting up his efforts to cling to power, the party has split over whether to back him, posing a major political test.</rdfs:comment>
