	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c7c861f-d288-4d13-9538-702b152dbca4">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c7c861f-d288-4d13-9538-702b152dbca4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Donald J. Trump and his backers say revelations about the Steele dossier show the Russia investigation was a “hoax.” That is not what the facts indicate.</rdfs:comment>
