	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c7dfdd1-ed57-4800-a970-dec9303a16c3">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c7dfdd1-ed57-4800-a970-dec9303a16c3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More retailers and states are instituting mask requirements, but tensions are mounting for people who see the rules as infringements.</rdfs:comment>
