	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c7e2b56-444b-4a01-8bdb-c4a0f2d2e4e9">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c7e2b56-444b-4a01-8bdb-c4a0f2d2e4e9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state recorded 15,300 new coronavirus cases on Sunday, easily passing the previous one-day high of 12,274 set at the height of the outbreak in New York in April.</rdfs:comment>
