		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c7ec841-2e07-4099-93c9-df7b16db542e">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c7ec841-2e07-4099-93c9-df7b16db542e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The incident raised more questions about the former president’s adherence to the Presidential Records Act, which requires preservation of White House documents.</rdfs:comment>
