	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c805a38-2fbc-460e-9539-9bd165fcd6df">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c805a38-2fbc-460e-9539-9bd165fcd6df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>To some who are steadfastly opposed to the shot, the evasiveness of the coronavirus has only reaffirmed their stance.</rdfs:comment>
