	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c8c0dc5-caf7-4810-9746-3758f949d9c4">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c8c0dc5-caf7-4810-9746-3758f949d9c4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Shifting objectives led to the expansion of a war that dragged on for almost two decades, and is ending in chaos.</rdfs:comment>
