	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c8cfb13-9786-4b66-91f2-5aab55f78dc1">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c8cfb13-9786-4b66-91f2-5aab55f78dc1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A member of the far-right Proud Boys texted his F.B.I. handler during the assault, but maintained the group had no plan in advance to enter the Capitol and disrupt the election certification.</rdfs:comment>
