	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c8dbb88-e24a-4f57-9894-2b220cd35a76">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c8dbb88-e24a-4f57-9894-2b220cd35a76</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Regan, if confirmed, will take over an agency central to achieving the new administration’s climate agenda.</rdfs:comment>
