	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c968d20-f14b-4187-8f70-97dee210612e">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c968d20-f14b-4187-8f70-97dee210612e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We’d like to hear your concerns about bearing a child during the coronavirus pandemic. Please fill out our brief form, and a reporter may respond to you.</rdfs:comment>
