	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c9ae084-3f0c-4a49-a457-8c461aefd064">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c9ae084-3f0c-4a49-a457-8c461aefd064</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The island has had to weather a hurricane, a political crisis and earthquakes, but those crises did not lead to the widespread unemployment caused by the response to the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
