		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2c9d44ac-2aab-4cf1-a1fc-b9bef6fb0b31">
		<rdfs:label>article-2c9d44ac-2aab-4cf1-a1fc-b9bef6fb0b31</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration had initially defended a plan to distribute vaccines to its senior members even as the first doses are generally being reserved for high-risk health care workers.</rdfs:comment>
