		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-12-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2cb2c74c-c573-44fe-b896-74d1719e1642">
		<rdfs:label>article-2cb2c74c-c573-44fe-b896-74d1719e1642</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state now has the United States’ lowest percentage of vaccinated residents 18 and over, despite efforts from state officials to reach the hesitant.</rdfs:comment>
