	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2d1d9a3d-301e-4334-a5ac-0544ac8d2ef3">
		<rdfs:label>article-2d1d9a3d-301e-4334-a5ac-0544ac8d2ef3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The drought is revealing for California that perhaps even more than rainfall it is money and infrastructure that dictate who has sufficient water during the state’s increasingly frequent dry spells.</rdfs:comment>
