	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2d23e3d1-5c38-4b78-a71e-2a85ddd01996">
		<rdfs:label>article-2d23e3d1-5c38-4b78-a71e-2a85ddd01996</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On Juneteenth, a holiday that honors the end of slavery in America, the vice president said that “all lives matter’’ but twice declined to say that black lives matter.</rdfs:comment>
