		<rdfs:label>article-2d25a5f6-8b4e-4ff7-a6c7-68f63499d4c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The I.O.C. awarded this year’s Winter Games to a place almost completely lacking in snow. China’s water-scarce capital had to go to enormous lengths to make it.</rdfs:comment>
