		<rdfs:label>article-2d263e27-7b2d-4341-9f69-778ad2be97e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Colorado graphic designer says she has a First Amendment right to refuse to create websites for same-sex weddings despite a state anti-discrimination law.</rdfs:comment>
