		<rdfs:comment>Standing in front of Air Force One on the tarmac of the Minneapolis airport Monday afternoon, President Trump assailed Joseph R. Biden Jr. and Kamala Harris, accusing them of wanting to bring a “left-wing war on cops” to the White House.</rdfs:comment>
