		<rdfs:label>article-2da5241f-46a7-479a-a6b8-9d2511d96f55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In May, Mr. Biden passed President Trump in fund-raising for the first time. A surge in donations has helped cut into the president’s financial advantage.</rdfs:comment>
