	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2dab5c2c-f3e5-4530-8ec1-4c29fc1023f2">
		<rdfs:label>article-2dab5c2c-f3e5-4530-8ec1-4c29fc1023f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Business groups and major companies like Apple have been pressing Congress to alter legislation cracking down on imports of goods made with forced labor from persecuted Muslim minorities in China.</rdfs:comment>
