	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2dbd5765-7a72-4564-a9a4-e186dba5a79b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2dbd5765-7a72-4564-a9a4-e186dba5a79b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are no abortion bans that attempt to prosecute women who cross state lines to seek an abortion.</rdfs:comment>
