	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2dc70224-315e-46d9-b4d8-55caaa719e86">
		<rdfs:label>article-2dc70224-315e-46d9-b4d8-55caaa719e86</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Secretary of State Antony J. Blinken will meet with Foreign Minister Sergey V. Lavrov of Russia in Geneva on Friday as the United States warns that Russia could soon attack Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
