	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2dd1a0f8-14a6-43c6-8f05-db0fd805848e">
		<rdfs:label>article-2dd1a0f8-14a6-43c6-8f05-db0fd805848e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The rule, struck down by a bipartisan majority, sought to rewrite Obama-era debt relief measures, which allow students misled by schools to request that their loan debts be forgiven.</rdfs:comment>
