		<rdfs:label>article-2dd9b8bd-a5e8-40a7-8755-175ea8a66f99</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Leaders with White House aspirations all say they’ll support the president for another term. But there is no shortage of chatter about the options if he continues to falter.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3488268a-8b17-411a-8185-6859abbab9a8"/>
