		<rdfs:label>article-2de27123-df32-408a-a5bc-9b47fa8bfa60</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has made fracking  a &quot;Hail Mary&quot; attack on Joe Biden in the industrial Midwest, but  three weeks before Election Day, it does not seem to be working.</rdfs:comment>
