	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2df2d69d-4352-4591-9698-e2c55fd4c98b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2df2d69d-4352-4591-9698-e2c55fd4c98b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A dizzying week featured Kevin McCarthy, the House Republican leader, caught lying and another lawmaker, Marjorie Taylor Greene, grilled under oath about her role in the Jan. 6 attack.</rdfs:comment>
