	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2df609ba-01e3-46dd-ba51-5fbcc80ce644">
		<rdfs:label>article-2df609ba-01e3-46dd-ba51-5fbcc80ce644</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden is planning a huge economic program that would represent a fundamental shift in the way Democrats treat the environment: Climate change would not be a side issue.</rdfs:comment>
