	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2df8b035-12d6-4d04-99cd-8bbaa1302c0b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2df8b035-12d6-4d04-99cd-8bbaa1302c0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An elite unit assigned to protect Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman is said to have carried out dozens of operations, including forcibly repatriating Saudis.</rdfs:comment>
