	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2dfa2b33-5e77-4740-b48d-9fc2465d6d7b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2dfa2b33-5e77-4740-b48d-9fc2465d6d7b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The presidential candidates worked to sell their pitches to the state’s caucusgoers on Sunday, but also ripped into the billionaire they will soon face in the Super Tuesday contests on March 3.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-864756c8-4d62-42e5-a6e4-482550bf62a9"/>
