		<rdfs:label>article-2e5bf064-6819-49eb-aa31-652aeff21ef1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The New York Times asked poets laureate from across the country what the people in their states had to be thankful for in this difficult year.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2e5f9c74-49a2-4695-8bc1-8040e3d8968a">
		<rdfs:label>article-2e5f9c74-49a2-4695-8bc1-8040e3d8968a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many officials have taken to calling the current wave, fueled by the more contagious Delta variant, a “pandemic of the unvaccinated.”</rdfs:comment>
