	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2e620dd4-82b3-4023-a869-fae222993dbb">
		<rdfs:label>article-2e620dd4-82b3-4023-a869-fae222993dbb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Warren, a senator and former law professor, staked her campaign on fighting corruption and changing the rules of the economy.</rdfs:comment>
