	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2e643aeb-d5b5-40d7-8995-70ef97203f55">
		<rdfs:label>article-2e643aeb-d5b5-40d7-8995-70ef97203f55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Proponents of the policy saw the move as an attempt to shore up the president’s sagging support among white suburban voters by stoking racial division.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-01"/>
