		<rdfs:label>article-2e714798-e44c-4283-9925-96c595b052dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former national security adviser shared his unease with the attorney general, who cited his own worries about the president’s conversations with the leaders of Turkey and China.</rdfs:comment>
