		<rdfs:label>article-2e7a23c5-ad4f-48f3-9ee3-834636d50b6b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Commission on Presidential Debates said on Wednesday that it would adjust the format of this year’s remaining matchups in the wake of Tuesday night’s melee in Cleveland, where frequent interruptions from President Trump led to a chaotic and often incoherent event.</rdfs:comment>
