	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2e7af9ad-bbdb-4f8c-be2a-bf772bc0364f">
		<rdfs:label>article-2e7af9ad-bbdb-4f8c-be2a-bf772bc0364f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Eager to offset a Democratic advantage among so-called dark money groups, wealthy pro-Trump conservatives like Peter Thiel are involved in efforts to wield greater influence outside the traditional party machinery.</rdfs:comment>
