	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2e865609-0474-47e5-b3e5-827cf20a01c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-2e865609-0474-47e5-b3e5-827cf20a01c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>State leaders on both coasts are starting to debate how and when to reopen. The closure of a major meat processing plant could affect the nation’s food supply.</rdfs:comment>
