		<rdfs:label>article-2e891b26-dabc-4739-b7a0-af113a4a281b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The shift toward cleaner cars, combined with tighter pollution rules, is pushing up demand for the precious metals in automobile antipollution gadgets. Crooks have taken note.</rdfs:comment>
