		<rdfs:label>article-2e8d3459-422a-45ef-b9e9-0145436a61d6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Group of 7 nations agreed to back a new global minimum tax rate that companies would have to pay regardless of where they are based.</rdfs:comment>
