	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2e8e5ca5-8c51-42c3-9737-d84599c8873d">
		<rdfs:label>article-2e8e5ca5-8c51-42c3-9737-d84599c8873d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States needs allies. Punishing Berlin over a Russian gas pipeline is a needless provocation.</rdfs:comment>
