		<rdfs:label>article-2e95c883-5ee9-405a-9fa5-aa45bbc43eab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Time after time for more than a decade, Democrats in Congress have proposed gun restrictions and faced unyielding Republican opposition.</rdfs:comment>
