		<rdfs:label>article-2e97e878-7fcd-44ba-82ab-e2ee0787d142</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Disappointed by down-ballot losses, Democratic interest groups are joining forces to conduct an autopsy of the election results. Republicans do not yet seem willing to reckon with the G.O.P.’s major defeats.</rdfs:comment>
