		<rdfs:label>article-2e9ac7b6-1308-4236-8ffe-883b6a2b77e2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States and the big European powers came together to declare they had serious concerns about Tehran’s failure to allow inspectors into two locations.</rdfs:comment>
