		<rdfs:label>article-2e9b539b-3a51-4332-8a44-d939fe79da5f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The less quantifiable elements of Mr. Biden’s campaign — including his association with Barack Obama, his empathy and his momentum — have outweighed his lack of organizational heft.</rdfs:comment>
