	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2eb8d901-144d-49dc-a522-e519b37a37c6">
		<rdfs:label>article-2eb8d901-144d-49dc-a522-e519b37a37c6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senators hear the second installment of President Trump’s legal defense and arguments for why he should not be removed from office.</rdfs:comment>
