		<rdfs:label>article-2f69ad44-558d-437a-bd8e-932acbc6067d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s threat to scuttle a $900 billion relief package held workers in limbo, but did little to change the bill’s outcome.</rdfs:comment>
