		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f7cb302-e82e-4c4e-b9ed-a5edd48718e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f7cb302-e82e-4c4e-b9ed-a5edd48718e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The highly contagious variant has already contributed to flight cancellations and staffing shortages.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ea9dbbc7-267d-46dd-9bad-620f876af0ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f7f6bfe-a55d-4e56-bdf6-019df7e6d7cb">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f7f6bfe-a55d-4e56-bdf6-019df7e6d7cb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Storm watches have been extended as far north as New England. Tropical Storm Isaias is on a track to reach land on Monday, with heavy rain and the potential for damaging floods.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f7f81f6-7a43-410c-ba86-b26502cc584e">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f7f81f6-7a43-410c-ba86-b26502cc584e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Eight people died at Travis Scott’s Astroworld festival, and hundreds more were injured as investigators sought to determine why and how a surging crowd turned deadly.</rdfs:comment>
