	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f8306cd-def9-45ad-a0ed-ebc8ca134b8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f8306cd-def9-45ad-a0ed-ebc8ca134b8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House “does not put any stock” in the rumor that Victoria Coates, the aide, wrote an Op-Ed essay in The Times in 2018, an administration official said.</rdfs:comment>
