	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f86d3c0-f7db-4231-87c7-751680996070">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f86d3c0-f7db-4231-87c7-751680996070</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Defeated and twice impeached, the 45th president used his farewell remarks before a sparse crowd to brag about his record and wish luck to the incoming administration.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-20"/>
