	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f873663-a99a-41b2-bc4d-d95989fda1f7">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f873663-a99a-41b2-bc4d-d95989fda1f7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The suit by Representative Eric Swalwell accuses Donald J. Trump of inciting the Jan. 6 attack and conspiring to prevent Congress from formalizing President Biden’s victory.</rdfs:comment>
