	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f8a136c-a904-42b2-8ee3-a002c510e57f">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f8a136c-a904-42b2-8ee3-a002c510e57f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an evenly divided Senate, the fate of President Biden’s domestic agenda could hinge on any one Democratic senator willing to withhold his vote.</rdfs:comment>
