	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f8a2ec2-55ad-40bf-95c6-7b75cc20a791">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f8a2ec2-55ad-40bf-95c6-7b75cc20a791</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Diplomatic correspondents said the move appeared to retaliate against NPR for an interview that pressed Mr. Pompeo on his role in the Trump administration’s shadow foreign policy in Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
