		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f9a8799-867d-4d90-bed5-47d26f12a3e2">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f9a8799-867d-4d90-bed5-47d26f12a3e2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first-term Michigan congresswoman, part of a group of liberal women of color known as “the squad,” widened her margin of victory against a Democratic opponent who first challenged her in 2018.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a2860122-d5d8-4996-a4a4-bc29b03dbcd0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-05"/>
