	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2f9b46bb-8d66-496d-bd67-6d19aa07d791">
		<rdfs:label>article-2f9b46bb-8d66-496d-bd67-6d19aa07d791</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It is the day before Election Day. Here are the schedules of the presidential and vice-presidential candidates for Monday, Nov. 2. All times are Eastern time.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fa23e54-9ba9-4b84-8ace-ebada059de6c">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fa23e54-9ba9-4b84-8ace-ebada059de6c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph R. Biden Jr. will continue promoting his economic message to “Build Back Better” in a trip to Ohio on Monday, where he will deliver remarks in Toledo before a visit to Cincinnati. It was a message he pushed over the weekend, swinging through a county in Pennsylvania that voted for Donald Trump in 2016 and Barack Obama in 2012, and making a direct pitch to union and blue-collar workers on Saturday afternoon, in a speech laden with economic populist tones.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fa2c544-e505-4075-a763-af7910d599d3">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fa2c544-e505-4075-a763-af7910d599d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Woods was condemned by a judge even though a jury failed to reach a unanimous verdict on his sentence.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc5a47b7-5e7e-4d58-8ee7-caaf2f703c6a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
