		<rdfs:label>article-2fa86ad2-9fcf-4c2a-af20-bbe0ca177b7d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Denying a permit for the Pebble Mine in Alaska is a commendable move, finally, by the Trump administration.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fa91566-122e-4dec-837d-4897aa3524d5">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fa91566-122e-4dec-837d-4897aa3524d5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A fire incident management team went into temporary isolation this week in Washington State after a member of a resupply crew tested positive for the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
