	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fafc628-9115-4299-81b7-31540c0c9dd0">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fafc628-9115-4299-81b7-31540c0c9dd0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A decision on Pennsylvania ballots has implications for the future: This is your morning tip sheet.</rdfs:comment>
