	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fb03fb0-0c78-4d55-95ed-1b170a4d2fcf">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fb03fb0-0c78-4d55-95ed-1b170a4d2fcf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The top French intelligence official, who is visiting Washington this week, said QAnon and other conspiracy theories were spreading to Europe.</rdfs:comment>
