	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fb7f9c0-98fb-4b21-8af7-c5b3e00d55bd">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fb7f9c0-98fb-4b21-8af7-c5b3e00d55bd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“In some of these local races it has come down to a handful of votes,” said Ashleigh Strange, one of the Pennsylvanians assembled, about the movement’s importance.</rdfs:comment>
