	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-2fbb6226-3460-4e94-8a1f-f622df2126ca">
		<rdfs:label>article-2fbb6226-3460-4e94-8a1f-f622df2126ca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Retirees displaced by Hurricane Ian confront a wrenching situation: At their age, remaking the lives they loved so much in Florida may not be possible.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3d0d7757-313d-444e-a4df-32876c51aaa0"/>
