	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-306d14df-82f7-47c7-b9f6-d4f2f90e834e">
		<rdfs:label>article-306d14df-82f7-47c7-b9f6-d4f2f90e834e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden is trying to confront repeated surges of migrants at the U.S. border by casting the issue as a problem for the entire region, not just the United States.</rdfs:comment>
