	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-306ecfa7-4cad-4c26-b2d0-f39fb75ddef4">
		<rdfs:label>article-306ecfa7-4cad-4c26-b2d0-f39fb75ddef4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Just hours after taking her own oath of office outside the Capitol, Vice President Kamala Harris administered oaths of office to three Democrats: Jon Ossoff and Raphael Warnock of Georgia, who won Jan. 5 runoff elections, and Alex Padilla of California, who was appointed to fill the vice president’s former seat.</rdfs:comment>
