	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-307b8080-efc1-40f6-acb6-a4ce62621555">
		<rdfs:label>article-307b8080-efc1-40f6-acb6-a4ce62621555</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A president who is at his strongest politically when he has a human target to attack has found it harder to confront a growing outbreak that has rattled the country.</rdfs:comment>
