	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-307d1c3f-14b0-41b3-9b9a-b1ae70fba832">
		<rdfs:label>article-307d1c3f-14b0-41b3-9b9a-b1ae70fba832</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration is struggling to find space for a surge of migrant children and teenagers that is almost three times the level seen early last year.</rdfs:comment>
