	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31a32c40-de56-4436-adaa-c33c19349824">
		<rdfs:label>article-31a32c40-de56-4436-adaa-c33c19349824</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ambitious timetable could slip as debate intensifies over aspects of the plan.</rdfs:comment>
