		<rdfs:label>article-31b0d511-71b5-4b6d-98b0-75c15e9083f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A deadly condo collapse in Florida has prompted a close look at other buildings.  A luxury tower in Bal Harbour was deemed safe by an inspector but is spending $4.5 million in restoration.</rdfs:comment>
