	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31b294f1-f97b-4088-86ba-52edcfd75023">
		<rdfs:label>article-31b294f1-f97b-4088-86ba-52edcfd75023</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A decision by the Florida Supreme Court means the November elections there will most likely be based on legislative maps that a lower court said illegally diluted the power of Black voters.</rdfs:comment>
