		<rdfs:label>article-31bed863-fb25-4bac-9306-d4809d98d9de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The nature of a death-penalty trial requires documenting brutal crimes in painful detail, even when the defendant’s guilt has never been in doubt.</rdfs:comment>
