	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31c3d080-50b3-4036-bb82-98ec3ba8792c">
		<rdfs:label>article-31c3d080-50b3-4036-bb82-98ec3ba8792c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After 11 years of war, Syria has become a cautionary example of what can happen in a conflict with no end in sight, like the one that began 100 days ago in Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
