	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31c82156-1120-4d6f-980e-9b5e7ecab944">
		<rdfs:label>article-31c82156-1120-4d6f-980e-9b5e7ecab944</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A return to a 2015 accord is on the table, but the next decisions are up to the new government in Tehran, the Biden administration says.</rdfs:comment>
