		<rdfs:label>article-31c89664-6736-4978-9949-99b286eff6cb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As candidates made their closing arguments on Sunday, Democrats braced for potential losses even in traditionally blue corners of the country while Republicans predicted a red wave.</rdfs:comment>
