	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31c98b7f-375f-497c-b091-8a00cd300d06">
		<rdfs:label>article-31c98b7f-375f-497c-b091-8a00cd300d06</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president dismissed the severity of the pandemic, downplaying the effect of the disease even as infections surge across the Sunbelt and rebound in California.</rdfs:comment>
