		<rdfs:label>article-31cc09f6-7b85-4932-aebf-7b575d5713fe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Once history has endorsed a social movement, people tend to simplify it and downplay the opposition it faced. But while movements are happening, historians say, they are always messy.</rdfs:comment>
