		<rdfs:label>article-31dc7861-c90f-48bf-91b5-c583edd613ca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The military justice system is in dire need of an overhaul. Two senators are standing athwart a bipartisan fix.</rdfs:comment>
