	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31ecfeff-0947-4579-8fc3-e87724326ac8">
		<rdfs:label>article-31ecfeff-0947-4579-8fc3-e87724326ac8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Without a broader diplomatic effort, the newest and toughest penalties will worsen a humanitarian crisis without forcing a leadership change, experts say.</rdfs:comment>
