		<rdfs:label>article-31f2897f-abcc-4334-8901-4ee0043e15ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>About one in 10 voters could still be considered “volatile,” half the number as at this point in 2016, but this time around, most of them have an unfavorable opinion of Donald J. Trump.</rdfs:comment>
