	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-31f5a9f1-c730-46f7-ab2d-8681c20f6fc6">
		<rdfs:label>article-31f5a9f1-c730-46f7-ab2d-8681c20f6fc6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Donald Trump’s push to overturn his 2020 loss was roundly rejected by courts. Now dozens of lawyers who argued the cases are working for Republican campaigns and groups.</rdfs:comment>
