		<rdfs:label>article-320317ee-b25a-4418-85f8-41462b91764d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The city has grown nearly 8 percent since 2010, and now has 8.8 million residents, the census showed. One reason is a more accurate count, officials said.</rdfs:comment>
