		<rdfs:label>article-3237c85b-b995-4aae-8ba4-9341f864d8a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. is confronting outbreaks of factionalism and fierce impatience within his own party, as the groups that make up the Democratic coalition see President Trump crumbling as an adversary and turn instead toward the battle to define the personnel and policies of a new administration.</rdfs:comment>
