		<rdfs:label>article-323d0217-e96b-444d-994e-04447b8914ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For more than 30 years, over three presidential runs, Mr. Biden has been waiting to notch a victory like the one in South Carolina. Now he has to face the test of Super Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
