		<rdfs:label>article-323d072b-b7ca-45e4-b690-00735d87a106</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move comes after her nomination as budget director was pulled earlier this year over her frequent caustic remarks on social media.</rdfs:comment>
