	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3251ebeb-06c8-4160-8e36-54caee481751">
		<rdfs:label>article-3251ebeb-06c8-4160-8e36-54caee481751</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Wu is the first woman and the first person of color to be elected mayor in Boston.</rdfs:comment>
