	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-325411f0-91fd-4ebb-8f47-38384f69e50a">
		<rdfs:label>article-325411f0-91fd-4ebb-8f47-38384f69e50a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Critics say the administration has targeted a human rights lawyer with economic penalties meant for warlords, dictators and authoritarian governments.</rdfs:comment>
