	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3257dee8-e66c-41ea-b215-d0fa59ac7dea">
		<rdfs:label>article-3257dee8-e66c-41ea-b215-d0fa59ac7dea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For Black families in particular, reunions allow older generations to teach younger ones about the importance of voting. But in this crucial election year, many of the gatherings have been postponed.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6383c1-cac8-4d71-9310-61837de0d0c2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-325dd5ff-c407-4b9b-be08-bc18c11dca3b">
		<rdfs:label>article-325dd5ff-c407-4b9b-be08-bc18c11dca3b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The law does not go into effect until Aug. 28, but it has already had a serious chilling effect on cooperation between local and federal authorities, agents say.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3261bc65-485f-4d9a-8293-79c8d6e2d79c">
		<rdfs:label>article-3261bc65-485f-4d9a-8293-79c8d6e2d79c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The plan, meant to rattle President Biden, fits into his strategy for addressing record numbers of border crossings. The migrants said they were grateful for the chartered bus ride.</rdfs:comment>
