		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3267e100-28b8-4d58-b891-dfc89d877390">
		<rdfs:label>article-3267e100-28b8-4d58-b891-dfc89d877390</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Krebs had overseen election cybersecurity efforts, and had joined other officials in declaring the 2020 election “the most secure in American history.”</rdfs:comment>
