	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-326f7f52-6046-4696-ad41-2a534c57fb43">
		<rdfs:label>article-326f7f52-6046-4696-ad41-2a534c57fb43</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After two decades of legal obscurity, the ruling that handed the 2000 election to George W. Bush is getting fresh attention.</rdfs:comment>
