	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-32734b48-a9ce-4d82-8f5f-befee11d4ea2">
		<rdfs:label>article-32734b48-a9ce-4d82-8f5f-befee11d4ea2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Those behind the widespread intrusion into government and corporate networks exploited seams in U.S. defenses and gave away nothing to American monitoring of their systems.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
