	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-327e4d05-0441-4b1d-b962-9fd7b1910e5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-327e4d05-0441-4b1d-b962-9fd7b1910e5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An appeals court dismissed a lawsuit brought by the House Judiciary Committee against President Trump’s former White House counsel, Donald F. McGahn II.</rdfs:comment>
