	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-328050d7-9f11-4b58-ac15-af00ba675066">
		<rdfs:label>article-328050d7-9f11-4b58-ac15-af00ba675066</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump spearheaded an administration-wide push to pry open the nation’s elementary and secondary schools, the next phase of his effort to get the economy on its feet.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
