		<rdfs:label>article-3310cbf4-32cd-4653-91b7-783d0d9845c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the dust settles from the presidential race, the eyes of the political world have already shifted to Georgia, where two runoff elections set for early January will almost certainly determine which party has control of the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
