		<rdfs:label>article-3331f1fd-cc32-465d-bc82-1a0bcbf58e30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Successful in raising small contributions online and six-figure ones from wealthy donors, the campaign now wants to tap into supporters who can “bundle” contributions from friends and business associates.</rdfs:comment>
