		<rdfs:label>article-333517b5-6cad-4cae-ab5b-89d0762b700e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Richard M. Fierro, who served for 15 years in the military, was at the nightclub in Colorado Springs with his family when the gunman opened fire. “I just knew I had to take him down,” he said.</rdfs:comment>
