		<rdfs:label>article-333b9fdf-8f7b-4713-ba1e-c3703febfc27</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The suspect’s motivations are unclear in a tragedy that left six people dead and dozens more injured during a Christmas parade in Waukesha.</rdfs:comment>
