	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-333eaf0a-04bd-432c-aba5-3e94513aa1e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-333eaf0a-04bd-432c-aba5-3e94513aa1e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The court followed the Biden administration’s guidance that Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman has immunity as a head of government in a case over the death of Jamal Khashoggi.</rdfs:comment>
