		<rdfs:label>article-3346580a-11ed-42ee-9123-f9621a9b2319</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the coronavirus prevents people from going back to work and paying their rent, evictions have begun, often targeting vulnerable people such as unauthorized immigrants.</rdfs:comment>
