	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33cb728c-6c0b-4fc9-a5f9-02a5045a18a2">
		<rdfs:label>article-33cb728c-6c0b-4fc9-a5f9-02a5045a18a2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We spoke to the Maryland congressman about losing his son just before Jan. 6 last year and his new book on American democracy.</rdfs:comment>
