	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33cc8115-6918-4a19-91a6-f91289880b17">
		<rdfs:label>article-33cc8115-6918-4a19-91a6-f91289880b17</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Anthime Joseph Gionet, a far-right media personality nicknamed “Baked Alaska” who is known for livestreaming himself participating in illegal activity, was arrested by the F.B.I. on Friday and accused of illegally storming the Capitol during the attack on the building by President Trump’s supporters last week.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e99dcff-b565-458e-b08f-ae5cce9b25f2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e993acb7-fd71-489b-b569-b6b6d449dfe5"/>
