	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33cd2a6e-e1cf-4f60-91bd-abe4881cf47b">
		<rdfs:label>article-33cd2a6e-e1cf-4f60-91bd-abe4881cf47b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are clear ways to reform the pardon process to work as the founders intended.</rdfs:comment>
