	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33cd42a7-43a0-41e1-9382-296e49694059">
		<rdfs:label>article-33cd42a7-43a0-41e1-9382-296e49694059</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president made the remark in an interview that aired on CBS’s “60 Minutes” on Sunday night. By Monday, the backlash was in full swing.</rdfs:comment>
