		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33cd78a9-299f-4458-b881-43b93b4426a0">
		<rdfs:label>article-33cd78a9-299f-4458-b881-43b93b4426a0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Pennsylvania, deaths in nursing homes account for almost two-thirds of all virus-related fatalities. Some of the people working inside those facilities say the pandemic is shaping their politics.</rdfs:comment>
