	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33d3c829-8cfb-47fc-b8d2-fee5c6684603">
		<rdfs:label>article-33d3c829-8cfb-47fc-b8d2-fee5c6684603</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state epidemiologist made the recommendation after several people who received the vaccine at one community clinic needed medical attention in the span of 24 hours.</rdfs:comment>
