		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33d49e5e-0cbd-4228-b4a2-fe839f61d029">
		<rdfs:label>article-33d49e5e-0cbd-4228-b4a2-fe839f61d029</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He would be wise to remember that Barack Obama didn’t pick him simply because they were “simpatico.”</rdfs:comment>
