		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33d6836b-41c9-4d0b-9bea-8a6fc309119c">
		<rdfs:label>article-33d6836b-41c9-4d0b-9bea-8a6fc309119c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Pennsylvania, the president’s false claims of a rigged vote may inflame the party base for years to come. One lawmaker said that refusing to back up his assertions would “get my house bombed.”</rdfs:comment>
