	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33d6d61f-e4ca-4082-bf7a-c43e1329b4c8">
		<rdfs:label>article-33d6d61f-e4ca-4082-bf7a-c43e1329b4c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Waiving standardized test requirements during the pandemic brought more hopefuls to the Ivy League and large state schools, while less-selective colleges face an alarming drop.</rdfs:comment>
