	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33d9d1a0-3e65-4920-979a-f84a4cf910a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-33d9d1a0-3e65-4920-979a-f84a4cf910a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The justices will consider whether a city may exclude a Catholic adoption agency from its foster care system because it refuses to work with gay couples.</rdfs:comment>
