	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33da7c9c-5983-4b59-ac61-4e8aa742c24d">
		<rdfs:label>article-33da7c9c-5983-4b59-ac61-4e8aa742c24d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The birthrate is falling for American women in their 20s, especially in places where the local economy is booming.</rdfs:comment>
