		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-33dafe4e-96da-48f2-8b0c-9409ba468075">
		<rdfs:label>article-33dafe4e-96da-48f2-8b0c-9409ba468075</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s speech at the U.N. was a stark contrast to President Donald J. Trump’s. But it came amid complaints that some of Mr. Biden’s policy moves echoed his predecessor’s approach.</rdfs:comment>
