	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-34cb0cfe-e0dd-4661-b141-898ca2d602c0">
		<rdfs:label>article-34cb0cfe-e0dd-4661-b141-898ca2d602c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Chris Malloy runs a small events business in New Hampshire. The week before the state’s primary election, he has handled almost every campaign event.</rdfs:comment>
