		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-34db67b0-4263-4586-b18b-f792758cd898">
		<rdfs:label>article-34db67b0-4263-4586-b18b-f792758cd898</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Enforcement could be complex and legal challenges are likely. But ultimately, experts say, success or failure will depend on steady supply and buyers’ appetite.</rdfs:comment>
