	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-34e0097a-8eb5-44df-b040-0f02cc732ffe">
		<rdfs:label>article-34e0097a-8eb5-44df-b040-0f02cc732ffe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>What is it like when a city abandons a neighborhood and the police vanish? Business owners describe a harrowing experience of calling for help and being left all alone.</rdfs:comment>
