	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-34e19b15-22d5-410c-b158-fdb93c278ac3">
		<rdfs:label>article-34e19b15-22d5-410c-b158-fdb93c278ac3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>College graduates are now a firmly Democratic bloc, and they are shaping the party’s future. Those without degrees, by contrast, have flocked to Republicans.</rdfs:comment>
