	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-34e4d606-da22-4934-b07b-b0f6093dcaa0">
		<rdfs:label>article-34e4d606-da22-4934-b07b-b0f6093dcaa0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jannie Jones is the 76-year-old woman who had to know who Representative James Clyburn was voting for in the South Carolina primary. Did her question change the Democratic presidential race?</rdfs:comment>
