	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-34e4d8cc-c0f4-4003-bf99-d1caf89b9170">
		<rdfs:label>article-34e4d8cc-c0f4-4003-bf99-d1caf89b9170</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The top Senate Republican traveled to Europe in a bid to show that isolationism hasn’t taken over his party. He has privately lobbied his colleagues to vote that way, and so far, most are.</rdfs:comment>
