		<rdfs:label>article-34eddefc-0760-4ca6-bb68-6aa04423b9af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The hacking group, Energetic Bear, is among Russia’s stealthiest. It appears to be casting a wide net to find useful targets ahead of the election, experts said.</rdfs:comment>
