		<rdfs:label>article-35020fdc-00db-4076-9acb-3c61a295ebe9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The upcoming Republican primaries are a critical test of the former president’s grip on the G.O.P. Here are the key races to watch.</rdfs:comment>
