	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3502cdf6-c438-435c-a65b-710997bf3d2e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3502cdf6-c438-435c-a65b-710997bf3d2e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A stronger-than-expected midterm showing has quieted the party’s public hand-wringing about a re-election campaign for President Biden. But it hasn’t put those worries to rest.</rdfs:comment>
