		<rdfs:label>article-350438ff-b8ba-4f10-ad2d-7647868c4388</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president emphasized a “blue collar” boom in his speech to Congress. But workers in those industries have seen a slowdown — or even losses — in jobs.</rdfs:comment>
