		<rdfs:label>article-351231fe-c5af-46ce-9a54-2f2ac44f3103</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New Mexico showed how a state can fight the coronavirus with aggressive social distancing, free testing and scientific expertise. But contagion threats are building.</rdfs:comment>
