	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-351c32ad-de1a-46eb-a927-a97a5dcd1002">
		<rdfs:label>article-351c32ad-de1a-46eb-a927-a97a5dcd1002</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The jump in benefits, the biggest in the program’s history, comes after a revision of the initiative’s nutrition standards that supporters say will reduce hunger and better reflect how Americans eat.</rdfs:comment>
