		<rdfs:label>article-352399da-7541-427b-9a86-480a7ceaebc7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Richard C. Shelby made the most of his perch on the committee that controls federal spending. Now he’s leaving Congress, where his way of doing business is a fading art.</rdfs:comment>
