	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3527a29b-8c37-4177-979f-60fa6f55f913">
		<rdfs:label>article-3527a29b-8c37-4177-979f-60fa6f55f913</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some roads were closed and parking lots inundated across Cape Cod and the state’s South Shore. Residents braced for the 9 p.m. high tide.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-18d1d621-2836-4c27-b1b4-097a961039f0"/>
