	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3528c989-68f5-4148-9e62-4edacc7fc9b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-3528c989-68f5-4148-9e62-4edacc7fc9b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The storm could bring a level of destruction that many in the densely populated Tampa Bay and Southwest Florida regions have never experienced.</rdfs:comment>
