	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-35623045-8ac9-49b5-94fb-c85a3ff34500">
		<rdfs:label>article-35623045-8ac9-49b5-94fb-c85a3ff34500</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph R. Biden Jr. and Senator Kamala Harris presented a united front in their first joint television interview, glossing over a number of significant differences they held in the primary campaign to emphasize their shared commitment to defeating President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
