		<rdfs:label>article-35669645-c651-4db3-a9cd-0f042fcd738e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Board of Regents announced that the former Republican governor is its choice to become chancellor. His selection has angered professors concerned about academic freedom.</rdfs:comment>
