		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-35690eff-50ce-4585-b097-3353ae19d87b">
		<rdfs:label>article-35690eff-50ce-4585-b097-3353ae19d87b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The approval came after months of negotiations and despite deficit concerns, reflecting an appetite in both parties for the long-awaited spending package.</rdfs:comment>
