		<rdfs:comment>Attorney General Merrick Garland told lawmakers that he sought an 11 percent budget increase for Biden administration priorities.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd522e1c-57a0-49bc-9835-fae39d9d58a6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36cd2d45-f7d3-4afb-8b08-441b1725a657">
		<rdfs:label>article-36cd2d45-f7d3-4afb-8b08-441b1725a657</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an experiment with influencers, two young progressive strategists tapped apolitical accounts to promote policy-related content, focusing on reaching young voters of color.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36cf7d47-f018-4010-b155-e8b4a1905e49">
		<rdfs:label>article-36cf7d47-f018-4010-b155-e8b4a1905e49</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“The future of the country is at stake, and there are moments when we all have to come together in order to defend the Constitution,” Representative Liz Cheney, Republican of Wyoming, said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36d1f584-0b62-4035-addf-ec5b7eb53d2e">
		<rdfs:label>article-36d1f584-0b62-4035-addf-ec5b7eb53d2e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some public health experts worry that the administration is not being aggressive enough in waging what the president calls a “wartime effort” to vaccinate the country.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36d6221d-46fe-4c2e-bbaa-236d1a525995">
		<rdfs:label>article-36d6221d-46fe-4c2e-bbaa-236d1a525995</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The days when voters put their partisan differences aside during a national security crisis appear to be over.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-89135d87-ed63-4619-a5ce-c3f23d9e6fd4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36d86803-fc2d-4e4d-bd46-c8218675cebe">
		<rdfs:label>article-36d86803-fc2d-4e4d-bd46-c8218675cebe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Departure from E.U. is a clear negative for the U.K. economy, but it could have been worse.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-db7fff94-e71b-4a8f-9a4c-e045b8ce99d6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36d93360-db6f-428e-8108-59f56ad4e927">
		<rdfs:label>article-36d93360-db6f-428e-8108-59f56ad4e927</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democratic candidate for Senate in Pennsylvania did not give a timeline for when he would return to the campaign trail.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36d96133-5a7d-4493-a7aa-e4221930dff2">
		<rdfs:label>article-36d96133-5a7d-4493-a7aa-e4221930dff2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Here is an overview of some of the broader forms of legal jeopardy — not related to impeachment — President Trump may be facing after his speech at a rally of his supporters, whom he dispatched to the Capitol shortly before they rioted last week.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36d96779-6f0e-4438-86f2-2ff04641153e">
		<rdfs:label>article-36d96779-6f0e-4438-86f2-2ff04641153e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Lisa Murkowski, a centrist Republican facing a tough re-election campaign, said she would support Representative Mary Peltola, a Democrat, to serve a full term in the House.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36da8fd1-e7f5-4f8f-a306-b8c569f1ee02">
		<rdfs:label>article-36da8fd1-e7f5-4f8f-a306-b8c569f1ee02</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As President Trump brazenly seeks to delay the certification of the election in hopes of overturning his defeat, he is also mounting a less high-profile but similarly audacious bid to keep control of the Republican National Committee even after he leaves office.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4a606035-f311-493f-9272-00230e475b23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36dc5ab0-0f1b-4bc4-af21-722ab3c10df0">
		<rdfs:label>article-36dc5ab0-0f1b-4bc4-af21-722ab3c10df0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Brian D. Sicknick, the Capitol Police officer who died from injuries sustained while clashing with the mob that stormed the Capitol, was the fifth person to lie in honor there.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-86cb289f-07a2-4230-a325-a1b201d41c50"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36e04d7c-43ab-4f47-828f-125bf4bdb73c">
		<rdfs:label>article-36e04d7c-43ab-4f47-828f-125bf4bdb73c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s $1.7 trillion proposal cuts $500 billion from his initial plan, but it does little to resolve difficult questions of how to offset the spending.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36e461d2-99c5-4edd-8dd6-251fed51631d">
		<rdfs:label>article-36e461d2-99c5-4edd-8dd6-251fed51631d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Biden is running a risk-averse campaign in states like Wisconsin, where a broad coalition of supporters is emerging. Even Republicans are noticing.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4504805-5b5f-41c7-b157-41ff04a342ad"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36e82b23-f3ec-4055-8943-57d8e1bef6c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-36e82b23-f3ec-4055-8943-57d8e1bef6c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Emails show the increasingly urgent efforts by President Trump and his allies during his last days in office to find some way to undermine, or even nullify, the election results.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd522e1c-57a0-49bc-9835-fae39d9d58a6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36ec2632-f97a-4146-8e7c-cf21650e398c">
		<rdfs:label>article-36ec2632-f97a-4146-8e7c-cf21650e398c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>John Wilson, a private equity financier, and Gamal Abdelaziz, a former casino executive, were the first people to stand trial in the federal investigation.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4f1bc425-040c-4850-aa28-f277207d36bf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36ec5ea7-c4a2-4690-8e1b-a6a95c2272d3">
		<rdfs:label>article-36ec5ea7-c4a2-4690-8e1b-a6a95c2272d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even with the awkward limitations of a virtual convention, the programming of the last three nights has built steadily and more or less smoothly toward the unveiling of Joseph R. Biden Jr. as a president-in-waiting. It now falls to him to fill the political silhouette his party has gradually sketched.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3488268a-8b17-411a-8185-6859abbab9a8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f33dc887-a9a6-4b4f-adce-fc81b6f27a0c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36f352ae-e7e1-4ed3-9d44-2ef6736e3a7b">
		<rdfs:label>article-36f352ae-e7e1-4ed3-9d44-2ef6736e3a7b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Sharp-eyed watchers of Senator Elizabeth Warren’s convention speech, which was broadcast Wednesday from a virus-shuttered child care center in Springfield, Mass., may have noticed something unusual in the background: analog Easter eggs that nodded to her policy positions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6383c1-cac8-4d71-9310-61837de0d0c2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-36f7d323-446e-498a-af0b-79248607b9c3">
		<rdfs:label>article-36f7d323-446e-498a-af0b-79248607b9c3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officers say that city and police officials were slow to release crucial details in the Breonna Taylor case. Protesters are fed up with what they consider abusive tactics. Calm seems a long way off.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-295dc04c-bd5c-4dba-9271-bfd8a89ba851"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-37f61f7f-75e2-434f-ae69-a6fd4decb9eb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-38612bef-d331-4b4e-8a11-2278ecc52a9a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3707750c-5f61-46e9-b6b8-841b756ae269">
		<rdfs:label>article-3707750c-5f61-46e9-b6b8-841b756ae269</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A look at the state of play in the tallies that could determine the presidency.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3707cbf3-2e83-43e0-bcbd-8eac36c02dc6">
		<rdfs:label>article-3707cbf3-2e83-43e0-bcbd-8eac36c02dc6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The corner market, the site of demonstrations and memorials, reopened on Monday. It has been a fixture in the neighborhood for more than three decades.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b0d8acac-ba33-4091-b922-0eb5b9ab904d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e993acb7-fd71-489b-b569-b6b6d449dfe5"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37094acd-229a-43d1-88b4-38dac1a9f66a">
		<rdfs:label>article-37094acd-229a-43d1-88b4-38dac1a9f66a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new program that targets racial inequity among homeowners will loan money to first-time buyers in exchange for a stake in their houses.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b93aedf6-30c5-4252-896d-c3bf6d863d61"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-370c0574-71a4-43e8-a07c-42f010ef68c1">
		<rdfs:label>article-370c0574-71a4-43e8-a07c-42f010ef68c1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least a temporary lapse in expanded unemployment benefits for millions of Americans is now inevitable because of President Trump’s delay in signing a $900 billion pandemic relief bill.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b06f805-a6f6-4cda-9908-3f8ddd3a0432"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-370de633-8c65-467e-b603-44ed63317f0d">
		<rdfs:label>article-370de633-8c65-467e-b603-44ed63317f0d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bill would allow most adults over 21 to carry a handgun. Gov. Greg Abbott, who said he would sign it, called it “the strongest Second Amendment legislation in Texas history.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-17d88f11-8c44-408d-8ac2-945b979b26ce"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ba1def2a-fecf-4911-9182-36727aa8deac"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37102d85-cf2a-4743-a1ad-ad1c80aa57e8">
		<rdfs:label>article-37102d85-cf2a-4743-a1ad-ad1c80aa57e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Making the digital artworks requires colossal amounts of computing power, and that means greenhouse gases.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c4d98394-1549-4853-be0d-e7afcd8ee238"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37162d5f-e1de-4712-aaf9-dbfd946c350b">
		<rdfs:label>article-37162d5f-e1de-4712-aaf9-dbfd946c350b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge in Florida refused to extend the state’s voter registration deadline despite a glitch that may have blocked thousands from signing up.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-371800e0-56c0-474d-b09f-00fa4d7e40dd">
		<rdfs:label>article-371800e0-56c0-474d-b09f-00fa4d7e40dd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A nationwide march for abortion rights on Saturday offered an early test of Democratic enthusiasm in the post-Trump era.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ae47edf3-29dc-462d-b74b-f886ebf56402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-371ba586-1203-4b92-b4d4-0dca569a9ff2">
		<rdfs:label>article-371ba586-1203-4b92-b4d4-0dca569a9ff2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If approved, the deal would avert a strike and allow some students to receive in-person instruction starting this week.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9ef20237-f390-44c5-8d52-031cdd2c86e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37211847-38bc-4fe9-8faf-418fbd584f2b">
		<rdfs:label>article-37211847-38bc-4fe9-8faf-418fbd584f2b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A doctor stricken with Covid-19 was running out of options. His family mounted a search for a donor whose plasma might help.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ea9dbbc7-267d-46dd-9bad-620f876af0ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37227cb1-a2e9-4931-832a-7dbccee8088e">
		<rdfs:label>article-37227cb1-a2e9-4931-832a-7dbccee8088e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans are shifting their focus from legal challenges to overturn election results in battleground states to efforts that would limit or undermine the future use of the vote-by-mail ballots that so infuriated President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-be4a3e54-4b34-4f4b-b446-90f3692a587d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37286836-4ce8-4bf9-bb42-34560329e925">
		<rdfs:label>article-37286836-4ce8-4bf9-bb42-34560329e925</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden wants electricity generated from wind, solar and other clean sources. The Tennessee Valley Authority plans to invest in fossil fuels instead.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b1afb246-66b2-4eea-8ebc-1b5c7f6c7900"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3732d11e-dd43-4bb8-9616-957223dcaa7e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3732d11e-dd43-4bb8-9616-957223dcaa7e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As he dropped out of the presidential race, the billionaire former mayor of New York confronted a moment he had never quite faced: a big, heaping, public loss.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f33dc887-a9a6-4b4f-adce-fc81b6f27a0c"/>
