		<rdfs:label>article-377a120f-cfd4-459f-b215-d2f5ad6aff1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New laws cleaning up the sport of horse racing can’t come soon enough.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
