	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-377e8f25-e136-4c33-85a1-7f66a7fd8adb">
		<rdfs:label>article-377e8f25-e136-4c33-85a1-7f66a7fd8adb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration’s plan to divert more military funds to building a border wall is the latest example of the long-running erosion of Congress’s power of the purse.</rdfs:comment>
