		<rdfs:label>article-377f5385-0e8a-48f5-94ca-9ece79a88129</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The testimony underscores the prosecutors’ challenge in disproving a self-defense claim. Gaige Grosskreutz, who was armed, was shot while responding to an earlier shooting.</rdfs:comment>
