	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-378f29ab-3448-4ace-a8c1-919fe0770659">
		<rdfs:label>article-378f29ab-3448-4ace-a8c1-919fe0770659</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The very future of our democracy is at stake, former President Barack Obama said Wednesday night, imploring voters to oust President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
