	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3791060e-56e5-4012-a9d9-12b57f1a939e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3791060e-56e5-4012-a9d9-12b57f1a939e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Warren’s failure to finish in the top two in any Super Tuesday state left her with microscopic chances of success. Her campaign said she was weighing her next move.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0b1c0734-81f6-4bd6-ab6e-2c3d3239bc31"/>
