		<rdfs:label>article-3796110e-9339-4ae1-ada9-5395b7f92137</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a Black executive board member described racism and classism in the leadership ranks of the College Democrats of America, the president of the organization resigned.</rdfs:comment>
