	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37964640-5bc6-4377-8530-89c74a258c55">
		<rdfs:label>article-37964640-5bc6-4377-8530-89c74a258c55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Living with a roommate has always included some drama. But these days, once petty grievances about cleanliness or visitors have morphed into arguments over safety.</rdfs:comment>
