	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3796c998-e771-4b74-8f29-de4033477b39">
		<rdfs:label>article-3796c998-e771-4b74-8f29-de4033477b39</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Tom Udall, a retiring New Mexico Democrat, used his parting speech as a call to kill the legislative filibuster, arguing that it had caused paralysis and prevented action on big issues.</rdfs:comment>
