		<rdfs:label>article-37971af3-80b3-452f-a17a-cd41297674a6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s handling of the country was the elephant in the room during Wednesday’s vice-presidential debate, but it was a fly, taking a brief break from flying, that couldn’t be ignored by viewers watching the event from home.</rdfs:comment>
