		<rdfs:label>article-37a16222-7aa4-415d-8b2b-72d2e1b7a6a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus recession has exacerbated the racial and income divides in America. Lifting restrictions too soon will make them worse and leave workers with a bleak choice.</rdfs:comment>
