		<rdfs:label>article-37a96d3c-dbf9-48b3-9ccd-305c0ef02f27</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As he runs for president, Mr. Biden has repeatedly faced questions about the overseas business dealings of his son, Hunter Biden. He has mostly kept his cool — but not always.</rdfs:comment>
