	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37b3bec8-ba7c-40e6-8475-5c1541296ea9">
		<rdfs:label>article-37b3bec8-ba7c-40e6-8475-5c1541296ea9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $1.9 trillion pandemic relief package moving through Congress advances an idea that Democrats have been nurturing for decades: establishing a guaranteed income for families with children.</rdfs:comment>
