		<rdfs:label>article-37ba65c6-a9e1-44e1-ac94-5697b4e74dda</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move almost certainly means that blacked-out passages requested by Congress will stay secret at least until after the presidential election.</rdfs:comment>
