	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37c48161-76df-4482-ad09-93f200bc89b2">
		<rdfs:label>article-37c48161-76df-4482-ad09-93f200bc89b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If voters reject him next month, this will be the chief reason: The 2020 campaign is different, and Donald Trump is not.</rdfs:comment>
