	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37c4aa3e-6369-45c3-b44e-c1bd04a038e7">
		<rdfs:label>article-37c4aa3e-6369-45c3-b44e-c1bd04a038e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>From Alaska to Maine to the Carolinas, Democratic strategists working on Senate campaigns described a spontaneous outpouring of donations the likes of which they had never seen. A Republican surge is expected as well.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0b1c0734-81f6-4bd6-ab6e-2c3d3239bc31"/>
