	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37c5b668-e78a-4b22-bef5-00ac7bdd37c8">
		<rdfs:label>article-37c5b668-e78a-4b22-bef5-00ac7bdd37c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sailor, who was a member of the crew when the fire broke out last July, faces a hearing that will determine whether there will be a court-martial.</rdfs:comment>
