	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37c83dd5-1d45-4cb5-ae57-6c28c17a2211">
		<rdfs:label>article-37c83dd5-1d45-4cb5-ae57-6c28c17a2211</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the coronavirus spreading out of control in many parts of the United States and daily case counts once again setting records, health experts have warned that it is only a matter of time before the pressure on hospitals mounts to the breaking point.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-073a2c11-e123-4e83-900b-90a962ee7e54"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37cfd6ee-bc23-4abd-9f15-e44bdd4e31a3">
		<rdfs:label>article-37cfd6ee-bc23-4abd-9f15-e44bdd4e31a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Three of President Trump’s family members will speak tonight, including his wife, Melania.</rdfs:comment>
