		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37d25a6b-d924-4b44-96b9-6d4c9aa8a9fe">
		<rdfs:label>article-37d25a6b-d924-4b44-96b9-6d4c9aa8a9fe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Those eligible for the extra shot would include adults over 65 and others at high risk — the same groups now eligible for a Pfizer-BioNTech boost</rdfs:comment>
