	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37d3d00b-8556-4b51-861d-a107cb21781b">
		<rdfs:label>article-37d3d00b-8556-4b51-861d-a107cb21781b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Since August, at least 16 Iranian students have been turned away at airports, losing their chances to study at prestigious universities, amid new tensions between the U.S. and Iran.</rdfs:comment>
