		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37d6c9c4-f5e9-41f3-bdfa-537cc87049c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-37d6c9c4-f5e9-41f3-bdfa-537cc87049c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But more cities are carefully tracking these populations — and making progress in addressing the problem.</rdfs:comment>
