	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37d78d38-f7b2-4c13-af4a-32c66e1ff4c0">
		<rdfs:label>article-37d78d38-f7b2-4c13-af4a-32c66e1ff4c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jill Biden’s speech, bipartisan nostalgia, a nomination from a security guard and an unusual roll call: Tonight the Democrats finally and officially named Joe Biden as their candidate for president.</rdfs:comment>
