	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-37dbacf6-fd97-4711-9c1e-b9f4a5196b4d">
		<rdfs:label>article-37dbacf6-fd97-4711-9c1e-b9f4a5196b4d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Patrick J. Leahy, the Senate president pro tempore, is expected to preside over former President Donald J. Trump’s impeachment trial when it formally begins on Tuesday, assuming a role filled last year by Chief Justice John G. Roberts Jr., aides and other officials said on Monday.</rdfs:comment>
