		<rdfs:label>article-37e0dc17-dc39-43b9-b1ff-99ffb6b67752</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has made a series of rosy — and sometimes false — statements on the virus and the U.S. response.</rdfs:comment>
