		<rdfs:label>article-37e3154d-7354-42fe-82d3-0695e95aa022</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The congressional committee planning January’s inauguration ceremony announced on Wednesday that it would drastically cut the number of tickets issued for President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s swearing in to guard against spread of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
