		<rdfs:label>article-37e39296-3840-4760-9209-c8f6a762fd60</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The swift and bitter pushback to President-elect Joe Biden’s choice to lead his budget office left some wondering if the incoming administration recognizes the depth of polarization it is confronting on Capitol Hill.</rdfs:comment>
