		<rdfs:label>article-380625df-0c4f-4567-87a8-5a52d7f6d07b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House event was briefly interrupted by a protester, who demanded stronger efforts from Washington to restrict guns.</rdfs:comment>
