		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-381e0cfe-ff4f-46cc-a059-31bd5a3b7df6">
		<rdfs:label>article-381e0cfe-ff4f-46cc-a059-31bd5a3b7df6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a White House where the president is billed as his own best communicator, speechwriters try to remain anonymous. But two men quietly compile it.</rdfs:comment>
