	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3820fb1f-7161-4b0d-bdcd-19affdfad27c">
		<rdfs:label>article-3820fb1f-7161-4b0d-bdcd-19affdfad27c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Efforts to bring wavering Republicans into line appeared to be working as President Trump’s lawyers argued that anything a president did to win re-election was “in the public interest.”</rdfs:comment>
