	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38320483-080e-4f96-bec9-5ac0d20983fa">
		<rdfs:label>article-38320483-080e-4f96-bec9-5ac0d20983fa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>BIRMINGHAM, Mich. — As former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. pulls ahead in Michigan, it is becoming clear that he has accomplished two goals that Democrats believed were key to regaining Midwestern battleground states.</rdfs:comment>
