	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-383631da-cac2-44c8-8d0c-64f8ebc67e7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-383631da-cac2-44c8-8d0c-64f8ebc67e7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New research confirms that emissions from China of CFC-11, a banned gas that harms Earth’s ozone layer, have fallen sharply, reversing a dangerous spike.</rdfs:comment>
