	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38389294-fedd-476d-b563-1c9df06a1740">
		<rdfs:label>article-38389294-fedd-476d-b563-1c9df06a1740</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mayor de Blasio should let the health department do its Covid-19 tracing.</rdfs:comment>
