		<rdfs:label>article-3839465c-9a40-4e32-ba21-b3c48f4426fb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On the eve of the final Senate votes in the impeachment trial, President Trump traded snubs with Speaker Nancy Pelosi and promoted a ‘Great American Comeback,’ pausing to award Rush Limbaugh the Presidential Medal of Freedom.</rdfs:comment>
