	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-383ce7c8-ce9e-4c9b-a8ca-40db823c0cc9">
		<rdfs:label>article-383ce7c8-ce9e-4c9b-a8ca-40db823c0cc9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A mortgage-related firm called Lower My Bills has spent more than $10 million on Facebook ads in recent months, invoking President Biden’s name in ostentatious pitches.</rdfs:comment>
