		<rdfs:label>article-38a2ffb1-2a8f-44ce-84fe-fc3350fee039</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Houston has been reeling from oil-market chaos on top of a coronavirus shutdown. Job losses could reach 300,000.</rdfs:comment>
