	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38aef7ac-7a78-488f-af69-3719097cc885">
		<rdfs:label>article-38aef7ac-7a78-488f-af69-3719097cc885</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Biden, who worked as a full-time professor at a community college even while she served as second lady, spoke to the challenges educators are facing during the pandemic in her prime-time speech.</rdfs:comment>
