		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38aff5a6-0033-44f4-8984-cf5a97e0c442">
		<rdfs:label>article-38aff5a6-0033-44f4-8984-cf5a97e0c442</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The river known for its vast reach and powerful currents has withered to levels not seen in decades, choking shipping lanes and endangering drinking water supplies.</rdfs:comment>
