		<rdfs:label>article-38ba90e1-c8b1-4bec-9723-cda87421342f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Cruz challenged a federal law that caps repayments of loans from candidates to their campaigns from postelection contributions.</rdfs:comment>
