		<rdfs:label>article-38bbe3fb-49f3-447d-89bc-f5cda42dcd18</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Abrams, a Democrat, bowed to Mr. Kemp, the Republican incumbent, in a rematch of their 2018 race. He had campaigned on his conservative policy wins.</rdfs:comment>
