	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38bc8287-bd25-45d4-9776-732ada226923">
		<rdfs:label>article-38bc8287-bd25-45d4-9776-732ada226923</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge in Texas found that the Affordable Care Act’s process for determining what kinds of preventive care should be covered by insurance violates the Constitution.</rdfs:comment>
