	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38c1a875-f66b-4a80-8c27-ece8f82d3149">
		<rdfs:label>article-38c1a875-f66b-4a80-8c27-ece8f82d3149</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A jury deliberated for just over 10 hours before pronouncing Mr. Chauvin guilty on all three charges: second-degree murder, third-degree murder and second-degree manslaughter.</rdfs:comment>
