		<rdfs:label>article-38c4c09d-7ce5-4b9b-b588-beda3aa03534</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Researchers used new data to calculate fire threats to homes and other properties throughout the lower 48 states. We made a map.</rdfs:comment>
