	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-38c6c012-e8a6-4894-9b84-ffc534ecd646">
		<rdfs:label>article-38c6c012-e8a6-4894-9b84-ffc534ecd646</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Commentators from around the world were quick to react to the news of former President Donald J. Trump’s acquittal in his second impeachment trial, with many saying it had shaken their faith in an already weakened American democracy.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0137c8d2-ca42-438d-b365-ccce9f61d31b"/>
