		<rdfs:label>article-38d58963-f149-4f99-9794-f5a17913c267</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One after the other, like dominoes, colleges announced that because of coronavirus fears, they were suspending classes and asking students to pack up and go.</rdfs:comment>
