		<rdfs:label>article-38e91164-1566-46e5-b118-9c2e8b449b13</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A girlfriend of the man who officials say set off a bomb in downtown Nashville had called police to his home last year, claiming that he was making bombs there, according to a police report.</rdfs:comment>
