		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39ab836d-781c-4b0e-a83c-8c96620d9199">
		<rdfs:label>article-39ab836d-781c-4b0e-a83c-8c96620d9199</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Unexpected receipts, driven in part by taxes on high earners riding a hot stock market, have prompted Republicans to push the president to spend on infrastructure instead.</rdfs:comment>
