	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39ad8f54-f122-4e70-94e5-88c6d352ca3b">
		<rdfs:label>article-39ad8f54-f122-4e70-94e5-88c6d352ca3b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump trampled on his own message again, as he campaigns this week in states that demonstrate his campaign’s defensive posture.</rdfs:comment>
