		<rdfs:label>article-39ae06d8-abf7-4d5a-8207-5f3b847d2ac4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>House passage of the measure, which invoked the World War II-era Lend-Lease Act, sent it to President Biden for his signature.</rdfs:comment>
