	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39b161cf-4e39-4200-9feb-9fede50df896">
		<rdfs:label>article-39b161cf-4e39-4200-9feb-9fede50df896</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a surprising filing, state chief justices opposed an argument pressed by Republicans — that state legislatures may set federal election rules unconstrained by state constitutions.</rdfs:comment>
