	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39b5739c-91ce-4295-8cf7-4b5597f70536">
		<rdfs:label>article-39b5739c-91ce-4295-8cf7-4b5597f70536</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Less than two weeks after enactment of a $2 trillion stimulus plan, the Trump administration is asking for a fresh infusion of funds to help businesses survive the economic damage of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
