		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39b73b02-0f76-4d23-8acf-1e0f34a6a785">
		<rdfs:label>article-39b73b02-0f76-4d23-8acf-1e0f34a6a785</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Treasury secretary’s House testimony, combined with renewed stimulus discussions among Republicans, highlighted divisions over how big an economic package should be.</rdfs:comment>
