	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39b818a8-93b3-4800-8ecf-e9e110792b06">
		<rdfs:label>article-39b818a8-93b3-4800-8ecf-e9e110792b06</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even his allies worry that President Trump has undermined his ability to appear presidential in a moment of national emergency.</rdfs:comment>
