		<rdfs:label>article-39babb90-6bc6-412f-9b61-3b70ec2cfc46</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Top Democrats and some of President Biden’s advisers are considering borrowing money to fund a sweeping infrastructure package as the nation’s fiscal situation improves more rapidly than expected.</rdfs:comment>
