		<rdfs:label>article-39be85e6-dfd1-49d2-9c86-9abbd31805fe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The resolution is unlikely to halt the sale, but it is putting more pressure on President Biden and other Democrats to take a harder line with Israel.</rdfs:comment>
