		<rdfs:label>article-39c799d8-c1d0-4900-a614-11b05b17594a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Drop-box watchers and disinformation about mail-in voting pose threats for election officials, who want to assure the public that voting is secure.</rdfs:comment>
