		<rdfs:label>article-39cb2783-b144-4e73-9bdc-adc31d9767ce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The lopsided vote was a reminder that bipartisan cooperation on public works projects is possible, but lawmakers in both parties said the spirit of compromise could be fleeting.</rdfs:comment>
