		<rdfs:label>article-39d4ee2d-bacb-4011-a3b0-7e36828779e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Additional prosecutors and agents around the country have been assigned to the investigation as officials try to manage it and stave off a backlog in the courts.</rdfs:comment>
