	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39df6c35-1a87-4bc6-b948-ddc14d272dbb">
		<rdfs:label>article-39df6c35-1a87-4bc6-b948-ddc14d272dbb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After falling since late summer, coronavirus cases in the state have begun to tick up.</rdfs:comment>
