		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39e0dbc5-7489-4945-930a-531700b017a0">
		<rdfs:label>article-39e0dbc5-7489-4945-930a-531700b017a0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But decisions come more quickly than they did in the Obama administration, when Mr. Biden, as vice president, complained about the endless meetings.</rdfs:comment>
