	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39e8be3a-83d4-44f5-aa61-c356bb2f9728">
		<rdfs:label>article-39e8be3a-83d4-44f5-aa61-c356bb2f9728</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Almost 150 people were still unaccounted for after a residential building collapsed in the beachfront community.</rdfs:comment>
