	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-39f59cd2-0928-4b7f-8c9e-ff666b3e9dc0">
		<rdfs:label>article-39f59cd2-0928-4b7f-8c9e-ff666b3e9dc0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration placed severe restrictions on trade with dozens of Chinese entities, its latest step in a campaign to curtail access to technology with military applications.</rdfs:comment>
