		<rdfs:label>article-3a02c7c4-8360-425f-b494-6e2d56ba853a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One example of how things have changed: A Latino outreach group estimated in January that it would register 21,000 new voters in the state by Labor Day. It’s at around 6,000 now.</rdfs:comment>
