		<rdfs:comment>Chicago Public Schools has announced plans to lift a mask requirement in the third-largest U.S. school district starting next week, infuriating members of the teachers’ union who stopped reporting to school buildings for a week in January to demand additional Covid-19 safeguards.</rdfs:comment>
