		<rdfs:label>article-3b50bdbc-13cc-43a4-bbb3-c48c2eb1c591</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Colby-Sawyer in New Hampshire has reduced its tuition to $17,500 a year, from about $46,000. But the cut is also a recognition that few pay the list price.</rdfs:comment>
