	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3b546dae-1714-4d4b-bd35-280bbc68c37e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3b546dae-1714-4d4b-bd35-280bbc68c37e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Families of the Sept. 11 victims have long pushed for a deeper investigation into any possible role the Saudi government had in the attacks, but the document offered no conclusive evidence.</rdfs:comment>
