	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3b578584-a440-4b1c-a9f6-4d5489d5147e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3b578584-a440-4b1c-a9f6-4d5489d5147e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democratic leaders say the Senate will vote on the $1 trillion infrastructure bill and a $3.5 trillion budget blueprint before leaving Washington for the August recess.</rdfs:comment>
