		<rdfs:label>article-3b5bd410-9943-4f86-97aa-83496ff8c90f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fifty years ago, Marty Bluewater fought to keep his home among the nesting birds of Protection Island. Now he’s fighting for the birds.</rdfs:comment>
