	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3b5d71de-aa49-4b6b-aed8-21d31827fd2f">
		<rdfs:label>article-3b5d71de-aa49-4b6b-aed8-21d31827fd2f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The demonstrations over Covid lockdowns present a challenge for President Biden, who has insisted he will call out abuses by authoritarian governments.</rdfs:comment>
