	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3b5df0fa-9071-477a-ad5b-6447c302aff6">
		<rdfs:label>article-3b5df0fa-9071-477a-ad5b-6447c302aff6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A day before the caucuses, the state party says volunteer and staff members at caucus sites are forbidden to talk to the news media.</rdfs:comment>
