	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3b61af5a-41cc-493e-9173-5b0e04a616ce">
		<rdfs:label>article-3b61af5a-41cc-493e-9173-5b0e04a616ce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Over all, the birthrate declined by 4 percent in 2020. Births were down most sharply in December, when babies conceived at the start of the health crisis would have been born.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-81f0af94-b9cf-4dcb-8ae5-91c423d251ff"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3b648a84-3799-41fd-b902-e162ba6d7699">
		<rdfs:label>article-3b648a84-3799-41fd-b902-e162ba6d7699</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The police are supposed to protect free speech, not suppress it.</rdfs:comment>
