		<rdfs:label>article-3b6ed533-5b9b-4742-912a-7745f22988e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A squalid tent camp on the border is the result of President Trump’s unprecedented limits on asylum. Some people have waited in filthy conditions for more than a year to obtain refuge in the United States.</rdfs:comment>
