		<rdfs:label>article-3b83cae2-9afa-4e6c-9614-cde39a7f6080</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even as he presses ahead, some Republicans wonder whether it would be better to hold a confirmation vote before the election or start hearings but leave the final vote until afterward.</rdfs:comment>
