	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bc81fd0-e0e1-4cd8-9b61-afd26ebebdf2">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bc81fd0-e0e1-4cd8-9b61-afd26ebebdf2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge on Thursday rejected President Trump’s latest effort to block the Manhattan district attorney from obtaining his tax returns, dismissing Mr. Trump’s arguments that the prosecutor’s grand jury subpoena was “wildly overbroad” and issued in bad faith.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f825ab9-e8df-4126-bf23-0d9bab1b54cd"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-da1afed8-865c-46f9-8917-3ac48c2b0d56"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bc8603a-4d9e-45d2-82c3-e218cbf98604">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bc8603a-4d9e-45d2-82c3-e218cbf98604</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hours after President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. declared the coronavirus a top priority, the magnitude of his task became starkly clear on Sunday as the nation surpassed 10 million cases and sank deeper into the grip of what could become the worst chapter yet of the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d0804387-7ba1-4df8-b8ae-a8a9c6bfc424"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-de093669-b27a-4345-ac65-683caba65a27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f08506e1-4ec6-45c9-9d85-46fe67848dee"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bca7fa5-49fb-4616-8a64-84c1400974e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bca7fa5-49fb-4616-8a64-84c1400974e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>No cases of the new coronavirus variant have been confirmed in the U.S., but leaders said they were using existing safeguards and watching closely.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-073a2c11-e123-4e83-900b-90a962ee7e54"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-078e57d0-5b20-48e9-b039-c2569b2acb05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bccddaa-185d-44a5-af0b-e6c839fb65f3">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bccddaa-185d-44a5-af0b-e6c839fb65f3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wednesday: Measuring the damage is critical for making better policy choices in the future, one expert says.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-738c55e5-1f96-4b93-8c70-fc8c1c8c9119"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bd121e2-2cad-4168-b495-f5d267c0c434">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bd121e2-2cad-4168-b495-f5d267c0c434</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The race to replace Gov. Gavin Newsom is in a dead heat.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e5cee4f-82a8-44a6-9cc0-9285f4da7bf4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bd6f658-bb50-4c45-8eb5-a1da921e527e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bd6f658-bb50-4c45-8eb5-a1da921e527e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new shipment continues the Pentagon’s recent trend of sending ammunition that Ukraine needs to carry out heavy fighting in the country’s south, east and northeast.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5a3094b1-6bc7-47d7-8f53-c56fd8ed0c59"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bd9930c-261c-4c0b-9d8e-09e3a4e92005">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bd9930c-261c-4c0b-9d8e-09e3a4e92005</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Barack Obama barely muscled his health law through the House. But income inequality, economic stagnation and a pandemic propelled an even more ambitious bill.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bda50e4-4045-4d62-bfb8-7bf509366617">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bda50e4-4045-4d62-bfb8-7bf509366617</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Just as the United States seems to have emerged from the worst of a surge in coronavirus cases that ravaged the country for months and peaked after Americans crowded indoors for the winter holidays, public health officials are concerned about another potential superspreader date: Super Bowl Sunday.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-25d63f99-02d5-4bf8-81d2-8d281d6dd9f7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f800cdb3-ad0c-4b7e-81cb-a52efab2aad2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bdd4d4f-6786-40f0-a06b-15e8002ef386">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bdd4d4f-6786-40f0-a06b-15e8002ef386</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president plans to quickly press for his $1.9 trillion stimulus bill, and then move on to infrastructure, immigration, climate change and other major priorities.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bdd9167-0b5b-4cda-aa50-0d9b3964e862">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bdd9167-0b5b-4cda-aa50-0d9b3964e862</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Congress moved to buy an additional week for a deal on pandemic aid and a broader agreement to fund the government, but there was little sign of progress on the stimulus plan.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3be3da67-cda9-48e1-b224-84ea147f856c">
		<rdfs:label>article-3be3da67-cda9-48e1-b224-84ea147f856c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With competitors closing, online retail giants are poised to be the only ones standing after the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8645bedc-c642-4ef0-8efb-ff731885cf27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3be3e3de-0642-4842-aa57-7632700201f2">
		<rdfs:label>article-3be3e3de-0642-4842-aa57-7632700201f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jack Arends wore a black beret, a bright blue tie and slammed his fist on the desk before him as he announced that he was casting his vote, faithfully, for President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. and Vice President-elect Kamala Harris.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9d70ec7c-4469-4070-b704-f06eb556d22a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3be9c224-26ed-4c00-ad25-a2f7c8b41346">
		<rdfs:label>article-3be9c224-26ed-4c00-ad25-a2f7c8b41346</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Scott Reed, the top political adviser at the U.S. Chamber of Commerce, said on Monday that he had resigned his post, citing what he described as a drift to the political left by the group in the wake of a string of endorsements of Democrats.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bec4498-43d7-4ee2-aca3-e75d49727952">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bec4498-43d7-4ee2-aca3-e75d49727952</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It’s a tradition to reach a captive, often bipartisan audience. YouTube isn’t quite the same.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3ae2425-3375-4f35-8d77-4a964cfba490"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bed3e23-08b7-4cb9-811f-bd97d39fc9b8">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bed3e23-08b7-4cb9-811f-bd97d39fc9b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are times when government must curtail individual freedoms to protect the public. But those measures must end once the threat passes.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bef4215-c35b-48a3-b787-5449b517d7d8">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bef4215-c35b-48a3-b787-5449b517d7d8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Three former presidents — Barack Obama, George W. Bush and Bill Clinton — have said they would be willing to get a vaccine for Covid-19 publicly to help ensure public confidence in its safety, once a vaccine is approved for use in the United States.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ab0366b9-dff5-47f7-930e-f33129e54673"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3befbf60-dbe5-4961-949b-7579e22f2ba0">
		<rdfs:label>article-3befbf60-dbe5-4961-949b-7579e22f2ba0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>About 100 Yemeni witnesses are unavailable for the trial for the 2000 terrorist attack. Now, a military judge must decide how much hearsay testimony to allow in the death-penalty case.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4bd6cfaa-ebec-415a-8c53-2870f770bfa7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3befc86d-21bf-4e48-9443-a06e7117f937">
		<rdfs:label>article-3befc86d-21bf-4e48-9443-a06e7117f937</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As voters try to make up their minds on which presidential candidate would be the better steward for the ailing economy, Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s economic proposals show how President Trump has shifted the playing field toward protectionism.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-15af15b1-0d6a-47b3-9f61-fabb93599819"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3bf6ea41-286b-459c-bb71-f0a40e1c6ee5">
		<rdfs:label>article-3bf6ea41-286b-459c-bb71-f0a40e1c6ee5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For conspiring to inflate drug prices, Apotex will pay $24 million and cooperate with the Justice Department’s investigation into the pharmaceutical industry.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd522e1c-57a0-49bc-9835-fae39d9d58a6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c028d1a-c518-4dd3-8449-297d081b9e9e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c028d1a-c518-4dd3-8449-297d081b9e9e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The specter of the divisive Democratic battles of 2016 cast a shadow over the final days of the 2020 contest for Iowa as several candidates questioned the ability of Bernie Sanders to unite the party.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-577cfa39-5806-4396-ae24-cdf4ba406715"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c05991d-5d17-4f50-9ce5-a61579ca958f">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c05991d-5d17-4f50-9ce5-a61579ca958f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A release of up to 180 million barrels in all, over 180 days, is aimed at helping ease prices at the pump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c082f7f-5710-43c6-b747-fbd7fdefaf36">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c082f7f-5710-43c6-b747-fbd7fdefaf36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>People in Florida and Alaska reported receiving menacing and deceptive emails that used false claims about public voting information to threaten voters: “Vote for Trump on Election Day or we will come after you.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1892db12-ee0d-4515-a348-5f66820836b7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-21d856ad-a6ae-406e-a9e4-9707218ad815"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4bd1aa5-c807-421e-b8ae-1b3824d70300"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c0f7ee5-6a85-44ca-8dd3-d137f2aa3ba8">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c0f7ee5-6a85-44ca-8dd3-d137f2aa3ba8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>State officials say that more than 600,000 doses of the bivalent booster have been administered so far.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d01bf002-c77d-4553-95c9-1a8ab8cd235b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c12e28a-cffe-423c-9b8e-e6be763ee220">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c12e28a-cffe-423c-9b8e-e6be763ee220</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Most of the leading Democratic presidential hopefuls took part in speeches, a march and a rally in the state capital, before heading to an Iowa forum focused on minority communities.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-21d856ad-a6ae-406e-a9e4-9707218ad815"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-01-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c218599-8f94-4c6c-9c32-bbe2f7cc1003">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c218599-8f94-4c6c-9c32-bbe2f7cc1003</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One district has gotten tough with residents who repeatedly flout the rules: Their taps have been slowed to trickle.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ec0f6572-4696-4e2e-b261-57f3ee9a323f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c2616f6-85ba-488c-a333-d3e44cdb2b7e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c2616f6-85ba-488c-a333-d3e44cdb2b7e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>By Wednesday morning, the White House sought to correct the impression that the department was putting a pause on the Mission Act.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-20ac5364-1758-414f-ab86-a88673954008"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c2823c9-2147-44e4-8823-f6c9d321286f">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c2823c9-2147-44e4-8823-f6c9d321286f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The way some Americans talk about these issues is changing. We want to hear what you think about these changes.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c341e68-82d3-4311-b936-43f01671ce2c">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c341e68-82d3-4311-b936-43f01671ce2c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Several former athletes and coaches including Lou Holtz have appeared at the R.N.C. to deliver a message that the party wants to project — that the president is not racist. Many current Black athletes do not agree.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c3c76a8-8c96-4dee-acab-0d1699082d39">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c3c76a8-8c96-4dee-acab-0d1699082d39</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Coast Guard officials said a search was still underway for 38 migrants missing after a boat capsized off Florida. The situation looked increasingly dire.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b043cde-c9ac-41fc-91ae-7eae6c420e38"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c27717ae-a4a7-43e2-a892-7d5659d97cf6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c3f24dc-722b-4c87-8553-a604f9f64e10">
		<rdfs:label>article-3c3f24dc-722b-4c87-8553-a604f9f64e10</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Driven online, like so much of life, by the pandemic, the Democratic National Convention that is getting underway Monday night will not feature the customary cheers, boos and cascading balloon drops of yore — or, its organizers hope, the dropped Zoom calls of today.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5c7e1f74-a87d-4db2-a8c4-665fc5eb3d59"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7da4dfa6-58ba-4b1b-8d80-6c39df820022"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3c400a36-d4c8-4dbb-84bb-f866ee5c7b01">
