		<rdfs:label>article-3c5cfad8-9902-4c78-8036-8019bdf2e442</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A week after Election Day, ballots are still being counted in many states. This isn’t unusual. But because so many people voted by mail this year, the process isn’t as far along as it would normally be.</rdfs:comment>
