		<rdfs:label>article-3cbaba3d-4cc0-4362-a5ed-a2f87680fff9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even as voting goes smoothly, the 2022 midterm elections have exposed the toll Donald J. Trump’s falsehoods have taken on American democracy.</rdfs:comment>
