		<rdfs:label>article-3cc046d0-6f13-4727-915b-3d4abcafb4b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nearly $470 million is set to be spent on ads for the Georgia Senate runoff races. With the airwaves already saturated, the candidates are heading across state lines to seek any possible advantage.</rdfs:comment>
