		<rdfs:label>article-3cc3739c-1ca4-4538-a3cf-c5843382dad6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Allies of the onetime presidential rivals revealed a long list of policy proposals. Most were widely acceptable to liberals, and some were broader than Mr. Biden’s plans during the primary campaign.</rdfs:comment>
