		<rdfs:label>article-3cc48158-c4d3-4855-aac6-a88a3164169d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president continued using his power to help his supporters, including his former chief strategist and one of his top 2016 fund-raisers.</rdfs:comment>
