		<rdfs:label>article-3cca5614-0d29-45e8-965a-1ca45b3dd8fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Community Reinvestment Act needs a renovation. The Trump administration instead is proposing a partial demolition.</rdfs:comment>
