	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3d318584-d67d-4b3a-bc40-d449b4c2fa67">
		<rdfs:label>article-3d318584-d67d-4b3a-bc40-d449b4c2fa67</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Higher temperatures are linked to worse test scores, but only for Black and Hispanic children. The likely culprit: a lack of air-conditioning.</rdfs:comment>
