		<rdfs:comment>The battle over the federal minimum wage — long a deferred dream for Democrats — moved to the forefront on Thursday as lawmakers waited to see if inclusion of a $15-per-hour wage in President Biden’s $1.9 trillion pandemic bill passes parliamentary muster.</rdfs:comment>
