		<rdfs:label>article-3d6664c2-cce9-4312-ba12-36208af6be98</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>PHILADELPHIA — Pennsylvania Democrats are growing increasingly confident that when all the votes are counted, Joseph R. Biden Jr. will have a significant lead of more than 100,000 votes.</rdfs:comment>
