	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3d673016-295a-4093-94fd-c7d1a76b1caf">
		<rdfs:label>article-3d673016-295a-4093-94fd-c7d1a76b1caf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two separate polls released this week found that a wide majority of Americans supported prosecuting the rioters who overtook the Capitol on Jan. 6, and wanted steps to be taken to prevent further extremist violence.</rdfs:comment>
