	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3d6c1029-4d9d-4e17-9f76-6778e6f43d1f">
		<rdfs:label>article-3d6c1029-4d9d-4e17-9f76-6778e6f43d1f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Oregon earmarked $62 million to explicitly benefit Black individuals and business owners. Now some of the money is in limbo after lawsuits alleging racial discrimination.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-295dc04c-bd5c-4dba-9271-bfd8a89ba851"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
