		<rdfs:label>article-3d6ca04d-9c41-41f2-acc9-cffdf52dabac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Newsom, a former mayor of San Francisco elected to run the nation’s biggest state in 2018, is facing a recall effort by Republicans enraged by the state’s lockdowns during the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
