		<rdfs:label>article-3d84d1ba-1b42-45e9-add9-47f1c255e1dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Kurt Kloss, whose daughter, the model Karlie Kloss, is married to Mr. Kushner’s brother, solicited suggestions from a medical Facebook group.</rdfs:comment>
