		<rdfs:label>article-3daa49bb-0d61-4bd5-a129-6c1a3942c8c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ahead of a major climate summit in Glasgow, many countries have vowed to do more to curb their emissions. But those plans still put the world on path for dangerous warming.</rdfs:comment>
