		<rdfs:label>article-3dc041af-90d1-4a77-a597-0448965e72f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president portrayed the measure, his most wide-ranging attempt yet to seal off the country from the world, as a bid to save Americans’ jobs amid the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
