	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3dc06d34-34d7-47e2-84fb-e449da47bfe2">
		<rdfs:label>article-3dc06d34-34d7-47e2-84fb-e449da47bfe2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The university is concerned about bringing hordes of people to campus amid the pandemic. New cases in the U.S. account for 20 percent of new global infections. New York City allowed offices to reopen, with limits.</rdfs:comment>
