		<rdfs:label>article-3dd7414b-8a20-46e5-b355-5a16ad8bd56b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Members of a mob, many unmasked, roamed the halls of the Capitol. Unmasked Republicans jammed into secure rooms. The outcome is worrisome to many members of Congress.</rdfs:comment>
