	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3e24ac2a-3725-41ad-b507-205678f79cb7">
		<rdfs:label>article-3e24ac2a-3725-41ad-b507-205678f79cb7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republican women delivered critical victories to their party in the election, signaling the success of the party’s efforts to recruit and elect a more diverse slate of candidates to counter Democrats’ huge advantage in adding women to their ranks in Congress.</rdfs:comment>
