		<rdfs:label>article-3e679428-e792-4e2c-9f30-8d3d0a416123</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Charles W. Herbster, who has been endorsed by Donald Trump for Nebraska governor, was accused of groping a second woman at a 2019 Republican fund-raising event. He denies both allegations.</rdfs:comment>
