	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3e7f016e-09c2-4387-9fa1-b3ee3bc42720">
		<rdfs:label>article-3e7f016e-09c2-4387-9fa1-b3ee3bc42720</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the expiration of the moratorium over the weekend, the White House called on state and local governments to protect renters and sought to speed the flow of federal aid.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d2647a35-d767-4ddd-a84d-456d7af5ed17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3e7f4b0b-09cc-4083-9e53-a0236c219382">
		<rdfs:label>article-3e7f4b0b-09cc-4083-9e53-a0236c219382</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nursing home residents and staff members account for around 40 percent of coronavirus-related deaths in the U.S. There’s no justifiable reason for that.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3e8584cc-01b7-4350-8d00-6dcdfa8bfc6e">
		<rdfs:label>article-3e8584cc-01b7-4350-8d00-6dcdfa8bfc6e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The gunman and the five people he killed were all employees of the brewery.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3e893422-55de-4f93-9886-c8c19ecd8084">
		<rdfs:label>article-3e893422-55de-4f93-9886-c8c19ecd8084</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Treasury secretary and Fed chair said economic damage could last. One prescribed rapid reopening, the other robust policy action.</rdfs:comment>
