		<rdfs:label>article-3fd4df69-924c-4912-9057-b97fbdf0886d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While some states have moved to release adults from prisons where the coronavirus poses a threat, efforts to free juveniles from detention have met resistance.</rdfs:comment>
