	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3fd7d957-9305-408d-8e3b-0820f8919022">
		<rdfs:label>article-3fd7d957-9305-408d-8e3b-0820f8919022</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The support of the centrist from West Virginia shows that Democrats are unifying behind Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson’s nomination in the face of strong Republican opposition.</rdfs:comment>
