		<rdfs:label>article-3fdf2dba-1d32-4f65-b4f5-3f087acb2c60</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>U.S. politicians from both parties have pressed for reopening, along with residents of Canada and Mexico.</rdfs:comment>
