		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-3fe12ab6-bc49-44c9-b76a-5760f2dbd400">
		<rdfs:label>article-3fe12ab6-bc49-44c9-b76a-5760f2dbd400</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The outbreak at the White House and on Capitol Hill underscored how difficult it is for a city with almost no control over the federal government it houses to sustain progress.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-20ac5364-1758-414f-ab86-a88673954008"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-06"/>
