		<rdfs:label>article-3fe8f402-e10d-4eda-88e9-39e191cadaec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The indoor mask mandate will go into effect on Wednesday and will remain until at least Jan. 15.</rdfs:comment>
