		<rdfs:label>article-3fefbadf-8bc8-4330-9bca-2ccef08ac917</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Afghanistan’s president said he had not agreed to release up to 5,000 prisoners, as a deal between the United States and the Taliban appears to require.</rdfs:comment>
