		<rdfs:label>article-4013b25f-eb92-4e15-b4f4-183d68ad6885</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The airstrikes the president ordered on Iranian-backed militias show how he has to navigate between using force and pursuing diplomacy to revive the nuclear deal.</rdfs:comment>
