	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40164e88-4c0d-4fda-b3ac-a61d0e3193df">
		<rdfs:label>article-40164e88-4c0d-4fda-b3ac-a61d0e3193df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Kayleigh McEnany, the White House press secretary, told reporters on Thursday that President Trump “will accept the results of a free and fair election,” downplaying his refusal the day before to commit to a peaceful transfer of power without categorically stating whether he would accept the results.</rdfs:comment>
