		<rdfs:label>article-4016e761-4415-4088-a0a6-eef9ce93c6eb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A nursing home where vaccinations have finished offers a glimpse at what the other side of the pandemic might look like.</rdfs:comment>
