	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40170ab5-48a5-47fb-aa57-a2113a0c552d">
		<rdfs:label>article-40170ab5-48a5-47fb-aa57-a2113a0c552d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Until Thursday, the White House had still not told its political appointees to step down, a routine request to smooth presidential transitions that usually happens within weeks of an election.</rdfs:comment>
