	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40180138-0c39-4992-942e-e647a9a64bf4">
		<rdfs:label>article-40180138-0c39-4992-942e-e647a9a64bf4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are “only” eight candidates left in the Democratic primary and we still do not know who won Iowa. Here is a recap of what you might have missed from a busy week in the Democratic primary.</rdfs:comment>
