	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-401b8f12-236d-4a77-a389-e18a2a2af4e8">
		<rdfs:label>article-401b8f12-236d-4a77-a389-e18a2a2af4e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A dramatic account of how the militia leader, Stewart Rhodes, tried to reach Donald J. Trump on Jan. 6 with a message that the group could help keep him in power was revealed in federal court.</rdfs:comment>
