		<rdfs:label>article-401dc9e2-dae0-43ec-a786-5fa1c0d13414</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Emissions rose 6 percent last year after a record 10 percent decline in 2020, fueled by a rise in coal power and truck traffic as the U.S. economy rebounded from the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
