		<rdfs:label>article-401f5cd9-ed61-4ddc-bc72-ccd735377c09</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than two days after polls closed across the United States, control of both houses of Congress is still up for grabs, with many election outcomes not yet determined.</rdfs:comment>
