	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-402eb124-3965-4ec4-8a14-38019fb78645">
		<rdfs:label>article-402eb124-3965-4ec4-8a14-38019fb78645</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The agreement, years in the making, is a milestone in the effort to reduce greenhouse gas emissions from airplanes worldwide.</rdfs:comment>
