	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40327ab5-feea-45d7-9050-4bac5c2759f2">
		<rdfs:label>article-40327ab5-feea-45d7-9050-4bac5c2759f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“When the state opened, that’s when we saw the infection rate increase dramatically,” one city health official in the region said of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
