	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-404369c6-55d4-4727-ab42-35ebd895fed7">
		<rdfs:label>article-404369c6-55d4-4727-ab42-35ebd895fed7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dozens of people in Washington on the day of the attack on the Capitol were said to be on a terrorism watch list.</rdfs:comment>
