		<rdfs:label>article-408832f2-03b3-4049-b97a-b3f20651048b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>She was in the mix to potentially replace Jerome Powell as Fed chair, but Mr. Biden’s decision to elevate her to the Fed’s No. 2 role will still place her in a powerful position.</rdfs:comment>
