	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40f17bd3-01a3-48dd-b7da-3ea19cf7b5c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-40f17bd3-01a3-48dd-b7da-3ea19cf7b5c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It may take months for federal investigators to determine what caused an aircraft carrying nine people to plummet into a Southern California hillside.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-01-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40f5e096-d711-4786-8dbc-ed5f13f6e4ea">
		<rdfs:label>article-40f5e096-d711-4786-8dbc-ed5f13f6e4ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The case will be sent back to a lower court — the U.S. Court of Appeals for the Second Circuit — which is expected to send it back to Federal District Court in New York, a legal expert said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-237da474-b217-4644-82d1-d2c32091654c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40fb800e-1cce-40d9-8362-c27603ddb96b">
		<rdfs:label>article-40fb800e-1cce-40d9-8362-c27603ddb96b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Government documents that President Donald J. Trump had accumulated were with him in roughly two dozen boxes in the White House residence. They were to go to the National Archives, but at least some ended up in Florida.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd522e1c-57a0-49bc-9835-fae39d9d58a6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40fcd073-73ab-46dc-9539-386322d0fe20">
		<rdfs:label>article-40fcd073-73ab-46dc-9539-386322d0fe20</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>By keeping the legislative day from ending, Speaker Nancy Pelosi avoided breaking a promise to moderates to hold a vote by month’s end.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-01"/>
