	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-40fe16c4-0a5a-4792-a74b-ca4a9f10edc1">
		<rdfs:label>article-40fe16c4-0a5a-4792-a74b-ca4a9f10edc1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A document outlining the case for a search warrant of former President Donald J. Trump’s Mar-a-Lago property included references to possible obstruction.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41000af3-a455-4c52-9219-90e576f4cc11">
		<rdfs:label>article-41000af3-a455-4c52-9219-90e576f4cc11</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The British and Canadian governments oppose admitting Russia into the bloc, as President Trump continues a renewed courtship of Russia’s leader.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-410feb4f-0f6a-4c4e-a982-95d2afc752ec">
		<rdfs:label>article-410feb4f-0f6a-4c4e-a982-95d2afc752ec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A sweeping statement in a 1928 opinion about property rights was revised soon after it was issued. But the error lived on.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41134efd-2917-42ee-8dee-20ad686eff8e">
		<rdfs:label>article-41134efd-2917-42ee-8dee-20ad686eff8e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even for an election cycle defined by a relentless string of crises and chaos, the amount of time it took for the Senate race in North Carolina, which could determine which party controls the Senate, to fall into utter mayhem was something of a record.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ce324a4b-e256-4143-b6b8-1dde4bc956af"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41149e16-f811-4ba9-9d11-019e8471657a">
		<rdfs:label>article-41149e16-f811-4ba9-9d11-019e8471657a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A court that does not keep the public’s trust cannot perform its critical role in American government.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4116a0e7-5990-4337-8e83-0d9e087517f7">
		<rdfs:label>article-4116a0e7-5990-4337-8e83-0d9e087517f7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lounges where customers consume cannabis on site are the next frontier of the state’s recreational marijuana industry.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e5cee4f-82a8-44a6-9cc0-9285f4da7bf4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-411b7239-ab59-4cf1-be45-4db2c1ad781d">
		<rdfs:label>article-411b7239-ab59-4cf1-be45-4db2c1ad781d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Senate on Wednesday took a step toward providing federal protections for same-sex marriage, a critical move toward passing landmark legislation in the twilight of the Democratic-held Congress that would signal a remarkable shift in American politics and culture.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-411daf81-44f4-4e49-89c8-244ff9c3075c">
		<rdfs:label>article-411daf81-44f4-4e49-89c8-244ff9c3075c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Michael Gableman, a conservative former State Supreme Court Justice, declared that the state’s partisan inquiry into the election results was not meant to overturn President Biden’s victory.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41292fa4-92a3-490c-a510-743b76fb8936">
		<rdfs:label>article-41292fa4-92a3-490c-a510-743b76fb8936</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Pentagon will provide travel funds and other support for women who seek abortions, a new directive says.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-46b2f3e2-fc43-4d1f-8134-a17365f8ec33"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-413588be-b115-4063-bf2a-6e6e748520b0">
		<rdfs:label>article-413588be-b115-4063-bf2a-6e6e748520b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bill is the latest victory for the president on overhauling the physical economy, but he has found less support for plans to help workers.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-413725f0-3780-4f6d-9f4c-50b960519620">
		<rdfs:label>article-413725f0-3780-4f6d-9f4c-50b960519620</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the pandemic took hold, more than 1 million children did not enroll in local schools. Many of them were the most vulnerable: 5-year-olds in low-income neighborhoods.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6ee28e48-631d-4ee5-ad85-e2135fc18dd9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b84d8bda-1ee4-435d-8105-15b48a6a482f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-413a0749-ef17-4d8d-af1a-34bf4b3d75a1">
		<rdfs:label>article-413a0749-ef17-4d8d-af1a-34bf4b3d75a1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An early 20th-century federal water project irrigated the prairie to create farms and towns in eastern Montana. But it needs a $200 million overhaul.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f997038e-ad5c-4458-8646-472e6c5ad2d2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-413b3569-7994-4cdf-a0de-d1cc7921a198">
		<rdfs:label>article-413b3569-7994-4cdf-a0de-d1cc7921a198</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House committee investigating the riot received hundreds of pages of documents from the former president’s White House within hours of the ruling.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4140b437-bad9-4bf9-9aea-f89cd8ca300c">
		<rdfs:label>article-4140b437-bad9-4bf9-9aea-f89cd8ca300c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>They echo misinformation that the president has spread for much of the year, as he has sought to minimize the threat of the virus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
