	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41555233-e9e4-4216-b564-ad4bc03c432f">
		<rdfs:label>article-41555233-e9e4-4216-b564-ad4bc03c432f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The officer was put on administrative leave, the authorities said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f667d37e-c785-4825-a637-b2187d022f52"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41581a9d-bb18-4254-a234-7db683f1d490">
		<rdfs:label>article-41581a9d-bb18-4254-a234-7db683f1d490</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Conventional wisdom has been that Democrats are more likely to benefit from voting by mail. But that’s not what research has shown.</rdfs:comment>
