	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-415ac021-4c0f-4716-b1ad-5bf09e7c2398">
		<rdfs:label>article-415ac021-4c0f-4716-b1ad-5bf09e7c2398</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The region has been an engine of Democratic victories, but now the party is on defense as Republicans go after swing voters with worries about schools.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-415c16fa-dafd-4d0d-9d98-8cfce1970452">
		<rdfs:label>article-415c16fa-dafd-4d0d-9d98-8cfce1970452</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The census was hobbled by the coronavirus and by a White House that tried to take undocumented immigrants out of the count to shift the balance of power.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-be4a3e54-4b34-4f4b-b446-90f3692a587d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-415ce760-fce4-4d13-a66c-9bbfe2bf50af">
		<rdfs:label>article-415ce760-fce4-4d13-a66c-9bbfe2bf50af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A North Carolina community risks washing away, and solutions don’t come cheap. It very likely offers a glimpse of things to come.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4160d8f0-7359-4612-b495-1bb3146a3aaf">
		<rdfs:label>article-4160d8f0-7359-4612-b495-1bb3146a3aaf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The calls to action underscore the stark reality that the United States has no intention of rescuing government forces.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-13"/>
