	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4162af40-6550-49ab-8b74-e18c0b9ee8b1">
		<rdfs:label>article-4162af40-6550-49ab-8b74-e18c0b9ee8b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden has said he plans to run for a second term, but his age has become an uncomfortable issue for him and his party.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4162b803-b112-41e3-ad61-4a257296ff5b">
		<rdfs:label>article-4162b803-b112-41e3-ad61-4a257296ff5b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The actions of law enforcement officials before, during and after the violent breach of the Capitol on Wednesday by a pro-Trump mob were questioned as images emerged of officers gently escorting rioters to freedom and a video showed officers pushing aside barricades used to keep the mob from entering the complex.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-17d88f11-8c44-408d-8ac2-945b979b26ce"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-295dc04c-bd5c-4dba-9271-bfd8a89ba851"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e2a444d6-76b3-4fc5-9655-0178ae16f402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-416845a4-a00c-4e38-93d0-fd1a394957c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-416845a4-a00c-4e38-93d0-fd1a394957c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. refugee program is already under pressure to absorb more than 70,000 evacuees from Afghanistan who arrived last year.</rdfs:comment>
