		<rdfs:label>article-41b0bda5-8ff8-4c35-afe2-ff7e9d97f55f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There were fears the death toll could rise as the first rescuers reached some of the mountainous villages struck by the temblors in one of Afghanistan’s most impoverished regions.</rdfs:comment>
