		<rdfs:label>article-41b4587d-cd76-45b0-b8eb-e992353c1313</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats have made giving government the power to negotiate drug prices a central campaign theme for decades. With the power to make it happen, they may fall short yet again.</rdfs:comment>
