	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41c03ffc-ecd1-45a0-945e-1d43328ec03f">
		<rdfs:label>article-41c03ffc-ecd1-45a0-945e-1d43328ec03f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the wake of George Floyd’s killing, some cities are asking if the police are being asked to do jobs they were never intended to do. Budgets are being re-evaluated.</rdfs:comment>
