		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-41c11b3e-a67a-41f2-9d70-323b536d4eeb">
		<rdfs:label>article-41c11b3e-a67a-41f2-9d70-323b536d4eeb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s final budget proposal of his term will offer a blueprint for his priorities if he wins re-election.</rdfs:comment>
