	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-420464a8-b1dd-46c2-bfac-046ed1418fce">
		<rdfs:label>article-420464a8-b1dd-46c2-bfac-046ed1418fce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“We can say unequivocally that democracy did prevail,” the president said in a statement.</rdfs:comment>
