		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4205e9be-ab06-4b72-bed8-489c0a3fca54">
		<rdfs:label>article-4205e9be-ab06-4b72-bed8-489c0a3fca54</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>California’s governor was given a boost by last year’s failed recall effort, which effectively gave him an extra year to campaign.</rdfs:comment>
