		<rdfs:label>article-4262c881-84a4-4046-8ce2-f287a4c74fa0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>WASHINGTON — Representative Mark Walker announced on Tuesday that he would run for North Carolina’s open Senate seat in 2022, kicking off what is likely to be a fierce Republican primary that could pit him against President Trump’s daughter-in-law in a key swing state.</rdfs:comment>
