		<rdfs:label>article-4265680c-db9f-4438-a0f4-3ad52b989b8e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two months before Ahmaud Arbery was killed, one of the suspects told the police he could be notified if a nearby homeowner noticed any suspicious activity.</rdfs:comment>
