		<rdfs:label>article-42a6fc95-7eac-4b03-8ee0-adc70393d15d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state of Pennsylvania certified its election results on Tuesday, as Gov. Tom Wolf signed off on the slate of 20 electors and solidified President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s victory in the state where he was born, one of the most hotly contested prizes of the election.</rdfs:comment>
