		<rdfs:label>article-42a6fd5b-25e8-48fb-8dd9-e462fc574926</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans who had blocked the bill, which would extend benefits to an estimated 3.5 million veterans, allowed it to pass after trying unsuccessfully to limit funding for the treatments.</rdfs:comment>
