		<rdfs:label>article-42b968d4-c641-4b57-81dc-14758442c44e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Does the idea of becoming an educator appeal to you? Why or why not? Has being a student during the pandemic changed the amount of empathy you have for teachers? If so, what is different now?</rdfs:comment>
