	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-42bc76ee-5df7-4782-877a-fded73e2964f">
		<rdfs:label>article-42bc76ee-5df7-4782-877a-fded73e2964f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Watching the Supreme Court nominee was a major moment, but her treatment by Republican senators felt all too familiar. “Every Black woman speaks that language,” one woman said.</rdfs:comment>
