	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-431cd6f1-a869-4760-9407-2c2e4234b40e">
		<rdfs:label>article-431cd6f1-a869-4760-9407-2c2e4234b40e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If confirmed, he would be the first Latino to serve as secretary of the Department of Health and Human Services.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-431d1833-e71d-4d41-9218-c72b2101db06">
		<rdfs:label>article-431d1833-e71d-4d41-9218-c72b2101db06</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Scott Stringer is New York City’s comptroller. He previously served as an assemblyman and the borough president of Manhattan.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-431fea5e-2307-4289-9eec-dcc780935167">
		<rdfs:label>article-431fea5e-2307-4289-9eec-dcc780935167</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In making the announcement, Mr. Newsom has taken the most drastic step of any state leader to slow the spread of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-738c55e5-1f96-4b93-8c70-fc8c1c8c9119"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9a5389b6-c0ea-4275-8951-1523cfe86f87"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-432228d8-26e2-4140-ae98-be08157bb15b">
		<rdfs:label>article-432228d8-26e2-4140-ae98-be08157bb15b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Central Intelligence Agency and the National Security Agency both recently overhauled their showcases of espionage.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4322525e-7b6c-4c8a-bc82-f3de1d3419e1">
		<rdfs:label>article-4322525e-7b6c-4c8a-bc82-f3de1d3419e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration pulled back the aid from states and counties with unspent funds and diverted it to four states pressing for more: California, New York, New Jersey and Illinois.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4323a279-3f0a-4298-8b3a-695ef82a3928">
		<rdfs:label>article-4323a279-3f0a-4298-8b3a-695ef82a3928</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The picks are a repudiation of President Trump’s isolationism, but they will have to resolve tensions between an Obama-era approach and the “fresh thinking” the president-elect says he wants.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-43248277-2126-486f-9ac1-50eb5285cf27">
		<rdfs:label>article-43248277-2126-486f-9ac1-50eb5285cf27</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The civil trial that starts Monday will examine whether the far-right organizers had plotted to foment violence. They have countered that bloodshed stemmed from self-defense.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-17d88f11-8c44-408d-8ac2-945b979b26ce"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-43289bc1-68ed-4363-a43e-a6c923613964">
		<rdfs:label>article-43289bc1-68ed-4363-a43e-a6c923613964</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s infrastructure plan tries to break from the past by shifting spending away from new roads and toward public transit. It won’t be easy.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b260801d-bdff-4eb7-8a05-483fb64c3c44"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d8148593-227b-4889-ae70-592b440737ae"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4328f498-ed6a-4bd9-bb40-e3c01fc25c30">
		<rdfs:label>article-4328f498-ed6a-4bd9-bb40-e3c01fc25c30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A 4-to-4 tie let stand a ruling from Pennsylvania’s highest court that had extended the deadline for counting some mailed ballots by three days, citing the pandemic and postal delays.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-432a1c06-fb2f-420d-a94f-9de61b4c8742">
		<rdfs:label>article-432a1c06-fb2f-420d-a94f-9de61b4c8742</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The candidates endorsed by former President Donald J. Trump have succeeded in many of their early primaries, with some notable exceptions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a5fb0ba0-4965-4f76-8b52-d16ac9dac194"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-432a5696-4a8f-48a5-8539-f53c7f9ef26c">
		<rdfs:label>article-432a5696-4a8f-48a5-8539-f53c7f9ef26c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dan Scavino, one of the president’s closest advisers, shared the cartoon by Ben Garrison, an alt-right artist who has been criticized for anti-Semitic imagery.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4331afac-a4fc-4178-a75c-709adce0c9e1">
		<rdfs:label>article-4331afac-a4fc-4178-a75c-709adce0c9e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 9/11 Commission prompted a national reckoning over the Sept. 11 attacks. But some experts fear that the chance to create an independent panel to investigate the pandemic response is slipping away.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-12-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-43335642-5cb2-4808-b566-c309fcf1e4b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-43335642-5cb2-4808-b566-c309fcf1e4b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The chief elected official in Dallas County celebrated a victory on Tuesday in his legal dispute over the governor’s ban on mask mandates, after a state appeals court upheld an earlier injunction against the ban.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f800cdb3-ad0c-4b7e-81cb-a52efab2aad2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4333e435-1efa-4c23-b618-44874ba3f948">
		<rdfs:label>article-4333e435-1efa-4c23-b618-44874ba3f948</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials warned residents to stay out of harm’s way as at least two people were killed by tornadoes, and two others from fallen trees. Millions were left without power.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f1a8aaef-4e1b-44e2-a602-d062ec8984ff"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc5a47b7-5e7e-4d58-8ee7-caaf2f703c6a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-433cee48-6379-41e4-ba84-cbef32473ea1">
		<rdfs:label>article-433cee48-6379-41e4-ba84-cbef32473ea1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The meeting let North American leaders present a united front without going into detail on deeper issues, including trade disputes or migration.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a47e8931-f51e-4343-a990-2c520552325e"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
