		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s latest proposal is funded by raising taxes on wealthier Americans, and it is likely to encounter Republican resistance for that reason.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44b32c6e-2603-4335-a78b-e7174c8393b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-44b32c6e-2603-4335-a78b-e7174c8393b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the C.D.C. updated its mask guidance for vaccinated people, President Biden urged Americans to get along as things maybe, possibly start to return to normal.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44b6fc54-1e5a-437c-89df-12b1f481ccc5">
		<rdfs:label>article-44b6fc54-1e5a-437c-89df-12b1f481ccc5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The fallout from the Capitol attack and the shadow of the 1995 Oklahoma City bombing are likely to take center stage at the confirmation hearings for President Biden’s pick for attorney general.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dcd0eb75-780a-43fe-aa5a-ac14ace05e96"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44b8e24d-3428-44ad-bd4a-f6ca8d4456ab">
		<rdfs:label>article-44b8e24d-3428-44ad-bd4a-f6ca8d4456ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new approach finds unlikely allies among some feminist scholars, who say colleges and universities were failing to sufficiently protect the rights of young men accused of sexual misconduct.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-12de0d3c-4c34-4f95-85a8-abb5edb86193"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44bd3ae6-e374-42a6-a32b-1e32703c8ee3">
		<rdfs:label>article-44bd3ae6-e374-42a6-a32b-1e32703c8ee3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus is fading but not gone. Major legislation hangs in the balance. And in 2022, his party will be looking to defy history.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-887d1269-7020-4c8e-8dfc-eae7c464f3cb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44bd4edb-91ac-4a96-a913-64544787f145">
		<rdfs:label>article-44bd4edb-91ac-4a96-a913-64544787f145</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president also sought to address the nation’s battered psyche, telling anxious Americans that “we should all be concerned about Omicron, but not panicked.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-12-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44c1a9c7-f4f0-494f-a358-acdbab1bcc37">
		<rdfs:label>article-44c1a9c7-f4f0-494f-a358-acdbab1bcc37</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court repudiation of President Trump’s desperate bid for a second term not only shredded his effort to overturn the will of voters: It was also a blunt rebuke to Republican leaders in Congress and the states who were willing to damage American democracy by embracing a partisan power grab over a free and fair election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-982bde63-8146-432c-a09a-c9cac220ddaa"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44c31121-d9de-4e7e-b6f4-685ecf17c873">
		<rdfs:label>article-44c31121-d9de-4e7e-b6f4-685ecf17c873</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration is considering how to recalibrate its policy in the region in light of the cease-fire between Israel and the Palestinians without distracting from other priorities.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44c3b153-61e3-4ec3-b095-f3957e28e50e">
		<rdfs:label>article-44c3b153-61e3-4ec3-b095-f3957e28e50e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state’s Supreme Court ruled against the governor’s last-minute effort to delay the election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44c3f32f-6356-4286-9a68-2163c3c54cbf">
		<rdfs:label>article-44c3f32f-6356-4286-9a68-2163c3c54cbf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The blazes scorching the West highlight the urgency of rethinking fire management policies, as climate change threatens to make things worse.</rdfs:comment>
