	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44c9e337-d62b-4be7-931d-f92702a9b81d">
		<rdfs:label>article-44c9e337-d62b-4be7-931d-f92702a9b81d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Most of it will go directly to K-12 schools, with a chunk dedicated to learning loss. But districts will also have much leeway in how they spend the aid.</rdfs:comment>
