	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44cfd602-1cbb-47ee-9c1d-2c02b1375225">
		<rdfs:label>article-44cfd602-1cbb-47ee-9c1d-2c02b1375225</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jonathan Pershing, a veteran diplomat, worked to reassert the U.S. role in global negotiations. He said he was optimistic that the world will avert climate catastrophe.</rdfs:comment>
