	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44d4fc43-f0ef-409f-83df-c28fe0d5a4d6">
		<rdfs:label>article-44d4fc43-f0ef-409f-83df-c28fe0d5a4d6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The court, which has for years been cutting back on harsh punishments for juvenile offenders, changed course in a 6-to-3 decision.</rdfs:comment>
