	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44dfb393-2af8-400a-9581-b3dc4152b445">
		<rdfs:label>article-44dfb393-2af8-400a-9581-b3dc4152b445</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senate Democrats discussed carving out an exception to the 60-vote requirement as they explore ways to overcome Republican opposition.</rdfs:comment>
