		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44dfb83f-d282-4939-88a5-2a87bf98d80f">
		<rdfs:label>article-44dfb83f-d282-4939-88a5-2a87bf98d80f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least five people have died in unrest over the death of Mr. Floyd. Injuries have been numerous, and millions of dollars in damage to property has occurred.</rdfs:comment>
