		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44e706eb-eff7-4903-842a-addc54efdf44">
		<rdfs:label>article-44e706eb-eff7-4903-842a-addc54efdf44</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The panel will have up to a year to recommend whether the prosecutor should pursue criminal charges against the former president and his allies.</rdfs:comment>
