	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-44f6d5c0-c25a-4c9f-abcd-f93deb00a4c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-44f6d5c0-c25a-4c9f-abcd-f93deb00a4c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Whether lawmakers love budget reconciliation or hate it depends on whether they’re in the majority. Democrats who are defending its use now protested it when they were in the minority.</rdfs:comment>
