		<rdfs:label>article-452cf8ab-2196-4017-84ff-57b086acd68b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bipartisan infrastructure bill has passed. Now it’s time for Democratic centrists to make a good-faith deal on the Build Back Better bill.</rdfs:comment>
