	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-452dd688-9856-4f01-bfd5-eb175d9d4386">
		<rdfs:label>article-452dd688-9856-4f01-bfd5-eb175d9d4386</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House directly challenges the House’s new rules. President Trump plans to resume in-person fund-raising soon. New York City, Washington and Los Angeles plan to lift some restrictions.</rdfs:comment>
