		<rdfs:label>article-45331379-47a8-41c0-8781-b965c743e9b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“A president who takes no responsibility for costing millions and millions of Americans their jobs deserves no credit when a fraction of them return,” Mr. Biden said, adding that President Trump should “step out of his own bunker.”</rdfs:comment>
