	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-45333d65-8469-47e5-926a-9d8e183f887b">
		<rdfs:label>article-45333d65-8469-47e5-926a-9d8e183f887b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>G.O.P. leadership would like to blunt President Trump’s influence over the party. Mr. Trump and his allies want to punish those who have crossed him. A series of clashes looms.</rdfs:comment>
