		<rdfs:label>article-453e2756-8764-435c-99cf-7ca756547cee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a major shift, the Democratic National Committee will eliminate the requirement that candidates to show evidence of grass-roots support.</rdfs:comment>
