		<rdfs:label>article-45598876-c81d-44d1-aeb6-1407e2284c6d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Half of American adults have received at least one shot of the coronavirus vaccine. Now comes the hard part: persuading the other half to get it.</rdfs:comment>
