	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-46d15293-48a6-4528-bc97-2516122cb9f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-46d15293-48a6-4528-bc97-2516122cb9f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president made misleading or false claims about the reaction of allies to the withdrawal, the presence of Al Qaeda and conditions for Americans traveling to the Kabul airport.</rdfs:comment>
