		<rdfs:label>article-46ddaae5-1867-4e65-af64-408da361db8c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fatalities are climbing to record levels two years into the pandemic. Authorities cite drivers’ anxiety levels, larger vehicles and fraying social norms.</rdfs:comment>
