		<rdfs:label>article-46def5ce-af7c-4e7a-ab1b-8f97001913a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A bipartisan package includes the largest-ever federal spending for electric vehicle charging stations, public transit and clean water.</rdfs:comment>
