		<rdfs:label>article-46e82f44-30b0-4ce9-87a1-f9e9e090d730</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans said they would not add a repeal demanded by President Trump of a legal shield for social media companies, and Democrats said they were prepared for a veto showdown.</rdfs:comment>
