		<rdfs:label>article-46e8a1d3-1308-4632-9537-277dcb75d83c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Secretary of State Antony Blinken heads to the region, the window of opportunity for a political resolution has slammed shut. At least for now.</rdfs:comment>
