		<rdfs:label>article-46f6673f-4626-446c-9441-4a63bad4b9c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The trial of Derek Chauvin in the death of George Floyd is being livestreamed from Minneapolis, and the public’s interest in the case may make this one of the highest-profile trials in recent memory.</rdfs:comment>
