	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-46fcea02-9641-4fff-b794-a65afd0ebf3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-46fcea02-9641-4fff-b794-a65afd0ebf3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The California senator is considered a potential running mate for Joe Biden. But unlike other possible contenders, she has avoided making a pitch for the ticket.</rdfs:comment>
