	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47000055-cab9-4a7b-8230-d1292b0a7db3">
		<rdfs:label>article-47000055-cab9-4a7b-8230-d1292b0a7db3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The nominee, Vanita Gupta, had served as the department’s top civil rights official during the Obama administration. Some Republicans have already signaled that they will oppose her.</rdfs:comment>
