	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47059ece-5e09-4443-934b-a5b093478188">
		<rdfs:label>article-47059ece-5e09-4443-934b-a5b093478188</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are numerous similarities between the Simpson and Chauvin cases, including defendants who have become household names and media outlets broadcasting the cases live into homes across America.</rdfs:comment>
