	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-470a7e32-32cf-48d6-a868-9ad81d05c8ec">
		<rdfs:label>article-470a7e32-32cf-48d6-a868-9ad81d05c8ec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fani T. Willis, the district attorney in Atlanta, is leading an investigation into election interference by Donald J. Trump. A Republican targeted by her inquiry wants her disqualified.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9943b18b-b21a-4097-affa-8e1a1ddd74f7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ac748b00-7205-45e9-ba20-53ddfa903a7f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-470c7053-8906-464c-aff3-76e664160966">
		<rdfs:label>article-470c7053-8906-464c-aff3-76e664160966</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than three years after his exit, the 44th president of the United States is back on a political battlefield he longed to leave.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1a919c05-175d-4b8d-9183-278fc0c9195c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-470eaf26-8033-469c-b246-8f63901576c3">
		<rdfs:label>article-470eaf26-8033-469c-b246-8f63901576c3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facing a primary challenge from the right in Alaska, the moderate Republican had to choose between placating restive conservatives or courting the center.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-470fd04f-d105-4cd4-9b15-cf18ce53d520">
		<rdfs:label>article-470fd04f-d105-4cd4-9b15-cf18ce53d520</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president’s defense team brings together an Alabama civil rights and criminal defense lawyer and a former Pennsylvania prosecutor best known for not charging Bill Cosby.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4714559c-7d31-4b2a-8977-2cb4f1acd16f">
		<rdfs:label>article-4714559c-7d31-4b2a-8977-2cb4f1acd16f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Experts believe that the challenge is a cautionary tale for future megafires in the West and lays bare a certain futility in trying to fully control the most aggressive wildfires.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-01e0bf39-1e3b-4b77-9cba-8bcf2fb383b2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-10ac2d2b-df6f-4f6e-81ed-6043c29aa826"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2bfc1d86-f654-490c-ae5c-efaa41acbbe5"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47158f0a-53f7-43d7-8b17-f75513dd32f8">
		<rdfs:label>article-47158f0a-53f7-43d7-8b17-f75513dd32f8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A group of Republicans and Democrats have begun an urgent set of talks aimed at reaching an elusive compromise on new gun laws. After a decade of failure, can this time be different?</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ce324a4b-e256-4143-b6b8-1dde4bc956af"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47176409-1563-4c44-8683-bb678a11a3dc">
		<rdfs:label>article-47176409-1563-4c44-8683-bb678a11a3dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Especially amid the pandemic, it’s the surest path to a more inclusive, more accurate and more secure election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-471e3dd4-bb62-4ba5-a2ca-022c2940db60">
