		<rdfs:label>article-47c0df7c-7f24-4528-a996-2b55bb67d84d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>From her first days in Congress, the future speaker was willing to confront China’s leaders. As she looked toward her legacy, the California Democrat was not about to back down this time.</rdfs:comment>
