		<rdfs:label>article-47d6ff86-979c-49a2-9884-dd60e9ee6d14</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A judge in Atlanta cited a conflict of interest on the part of Fani T. Willis. Her broader investigation into election meddling will continue.</rdfs:comment>
