	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47d962d1-e41a-4fa4-92d7-a7038b29fa22">
		<rdfs:label>article-47d962d1-e41a-4fa4-92d7-a7038b29fa22</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The late-night announcement was the latest step by the central bank to keep financial markets functioning during the coronavirus crisis.</rdfs:comment>
