	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47da8171-0a88-4fd0-9547-c60e03be6f8a">
		<rdfs:label>article-47da8171-0a88-4fd0-9547-c60e03be6f8a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>And many of them tell us they’re willing to use a brokered convention to stop Bernie Sanders.</rdfs:comment>
