	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47de8ad2-ae99-4c31-9d3d-279051a25e0f">
		<rdfs:label>article-47de8ad2-ae99-4c31-9d3d-279051a25e0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Justice Department rejected an interpretation by the retired chief prosecutor that lawyers could sometimes use statements obtained during C.I.A. interrogations.</rdfs:comment>
