		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-47f2c691-03bd-45c3-aabe-4a9616bf36f2">
		<rdfs:label>article-47f2c691-03bd-45c3-aabe-4a9616bf36f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A provision in the Senate legislation would give the I.R.S. more power to scrutinize a largely unregulated corner of finance.</rdfs:comment>
