	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4814cf9b-3790-431c-894f-1c754c428d82">
		<rdfs:label>article-4814cf9b-3790-431c-894f-1c754c428d82</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The stuck container ship became the butt of online jokes, but it was no minor crisis.</rdfs:comment>
