		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-481b37d7-eb98-4329-8d78-28d6771d975e">
		<rdfs:label>article-481b37d7-eb98-4329-8d78-28d6771d975e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Moderna accepted $2.5 billion in taxpayer money to develop its Covid-19 vaccine. But officials in the U.S. and overseas are having trouble persuading the company to license its technology.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fd0852ba-f3d3-46ae-9bd7-3df6f37d8f46"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-481b6bf1-5dff-4e58-aa30-af539d79fa7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-481b6bf1-5dff-4e58-aa30-af539d79fa7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Revelations aside, there’s only one thing that will get the company to change its ways.</rdfs:comment>
