	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4826ca61-82e4-4bfe-9a2f-10e8bc6504b0">
		<rdfs:label>article-4826ca61-82e4-4bfe-9a2f-10e8bc6504b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Unfolding in a stable presidential race and a tumultuous election year, the debate may be less likely than past ones to sway voters. But it is still an opportunity for President Trump in particular.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0b1c0734-81f6-4bd6-ab6e-2c3d3239bc31"/>
