	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4827362c-b2ba-4ff0-bade-f5f90da05d6b">
		<rdfs:label>article-4827362c-b2ba-4ff0-bade-f5f90da05d6b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House said its offshore wind plan would avoid 78 million metric tons of carbon dioxide emissions and create tens of thousands of jobs.</rdfs:comment>
