		<rdfs:label>article-48284fe7-09d5-4a78-9f4d-ee01a69f3db5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Texas has asked the Supreme Court to reverse the election results, but the case’s legal argument is flawed and its statistical assertion that Joe Biden had a minuscule chance to win is “comical,” experts said.</rdfs:comment>
