		<rdfs:label>article-482a9cb5-6b6f-4f2d-934d-2b1c180f65b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The struggle for power in Haiti after the assassination of the country’s president has spilled onto K Street, where rival Haitian politicians, business leaders and interest groups are turning to lobbyists to wage an expensive and escalating proxy battle for influence with the United States.</rdfs:comment>
