	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-482b7ee0-96bb-4194-94c0-d4a9b8817b1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-482b7ee0-96bb-4194-94c0-d4a9b8817b1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nevada voters elevated election deniers, while South Carolina split on two House members facing Trump-endorsed challengers. Here’s a rundown.</rdfs:comment>
