		<rdfs:label>article-4857eebe-d3b2-4df6-98ed-a6d726196264</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House gave final approval to the Senate-passed compromise, ending nearly three decades of congressional inaction.</rdfs:comment>
