	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4858a275-2600-4060-958f-d49780c6f916">
		<rdfs:label>article-4858a275-2600-4060-958f-d49780c6f916</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move comes as the Pentagon released a new order this week saying that National Guard members who do not get vaccinated would receive a general order of reprimand, essentially ending their careers.</rdfs:comment>
