		<rdfs:label>article-485aeec3-1c5b-46aa-8f07-2e44a8afaca1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A state judge said the approach inappropriately granted standing and denied due process. Abortion providers said they would expand services if the State Supreme Court upheld the ruling.</rdfs:comment>
