	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-486fa19e-2546-45db-9519-f3a25999966d">
		<rdfs:label>article-486fa19e-2546-45db-9519-f3a25999966d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Rising seas are bringing water into communities at record rates, the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration said Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
