		<rdfs:label>article-487dfe86-5bae-43ae-8ec4-85c8d24a439a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Texas doctor with only six hours to administer expiring doses of a Covid-19 vaccine inoculated 10 people, but the move got him fired and charged with stealing the doses.</rdfs:comment>
