		<rdfs:label>article-48beff7d-ce3f-4d4c-b245-2517a19822fe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An expert testifying for the defense said Mr. Chauvin was justified in pinning George Floyd under his knee. He contradicted numerous experts called by prosecutors, including the police chief of Minneapolis.</rdfs:comment>
