		<rdfs:label>article-48c8b20c-ce6c-41a5-b694-19e12c405fda</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Records show that some people who are paid $1,000 a head by the government to give legally protected mustangs “good homes” are sending the horses to auction once they get the money.</rdfs:comment>
