	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4965f161-b6a5-464b-8f08-d47be65194ad">
		<rdfs:label>article-4965f161-b6a5-464b-8f08-d47be65194ad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Confused about who can get a booster shot of which vaccine, and what the F.D.A.’s advisers on vaccines voted on this week? This scorecard may help.</rdfs:comment>
