	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-498270f5-d080-49e5-94ac-9b87d5428deb">
		<rdfs:label>article-498270f5-d080-49e5-94ac-9b87d5428deb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hudson Canyon, an underwater gorge off the coast of New York and New Jersey, would receive permanent federal protection.</rdfs:comment>
