	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4984ca8f-f2d1-4ad6-b10e-3370af3fce0a">
		<rdfs:label>article-4984ca8f-f2d1-4ad6-b10e-3370af3fce0a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Unlike his first senate impeachment trial, former President Donald J. Trump has no Twitter feed to use as a cannon aimed squarely at his political rivals as the proceedings unfold.</rdfs:comment>
