		<rdfs:label>article-49919c6c-2d07-4d17-a1aa-f694617b5f20</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An interim police chief has nearly finished her work, and the city is at a crossroads. Will a department handling one of the nation’s most controversial police shootings win back the city’s trust?</rdfs:comment>
