		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-49936c8b-2ce4-431c-ad00-bb3ac575aff2">
		<rdfs:label>article-49936c8b-2ce4-431c-ad00-bb3ac575aff2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president rejected the annual invitation in the latest snub between him and the House speaker since she authorized the inquiry that led to his impeachment.</rdfs:comment>
