	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4998f77c-9a73-4d1f-a273-f2066e5886ed">
		<rdfs:label>article-4998f77c-9a73-4d1f-a273-f2066e5886ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After landfall overnight with 150 m.p.h. winds, Laura ripped northward. Officials confirmed at least six deaths tied to the storm, and hundreds of thousands of people have lost power.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
