		<rdfs:label>article-499a7b92-4f12-4c30-9361-eae67c2e879a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move by the nation’s largest four-year public university system comes as many other schools insist they will find a way to bring students back to campus despite the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-204cd1d8-9d72-4785-968e-7d68ce7d17d7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-12"/>
