	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-499f6009-2d74-4a43-b65f-721c08e53adf">
		<rdfs:label>article-499f6009-2d74-4a43-b65f-721c08e53adf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This country has failed to provide one of the most fundamental protections in the Constitution: the right to life.</rdfs:comment>
