		<rdfs:label>article-49a28b9b-c4f5-4305-87d9-2ec0f0485ee5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials are scrambling to find ways to protect residents against dueling threats of extreme heat and the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
