		<rdfs:label>article-49c7b8ee-800b-497d-ab74-c4aafe6efa58</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Virginia Republicans in a tight governor’s race have been staging “Parents Matter” rallies and tapping into conservative anger over mandates and critical race theory.</rdfs:comment>
