	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-49ca4cb8-491b-4c8e-b88f-51a70fcbecd2">
		<rdfs:label>article-49ca4cb8-491b-4c8e-b88f-51a70fcbecd2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hundreds of stranded residents were rescued by aircraft and boats, Gov. Andy Beshear said. There is more rain in the forecast.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a3c9a0d0-b427-4117-88fe-c045ed32c11a"/>
