	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-49fa7e8a-c3dc-463d-9792-c6eefdc79f0f">
		<rdfs:label>article-49fa7e8a-c3dc-463d-9792-c6eefdc79f0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Educators, historians and students had their say on how differences in textbooks from California and Texas reflect deep partisan divides.</rdfs:comment>
