	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a029d4e-1cbe-47fb-9b87-d77c2d3ad979">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a029d4e-1cbe-47fb-9b87-d77c2d3ad979</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There is no question too basic, or too big. Your suggestions will be used to help guide the Times’s climate coverage.</rdfs:comment>
