	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a05ac06-7ae4-4b73-abfb-ac9347f8eb25">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a05ac06-7ae4-4b73-abfb-ac9347f8eb25</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Red Cross has issued new guidelines for its shelters, screening people for symptoms and keeping bed six feet apart. That strategy will soon be tested.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-74659e03-2c48-4140-91f4-08e5d544f77a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a06921c-23cc-4e11-9b24-ea0b9887b16a">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a06921c-23cc-4e11-9b24-ea0b9887b16a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After last-minute appeals and issues with inserting an IV line, prison officials determined there was not enough time left to execute an inmate before his death warrant expired.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e993acb7-fd71-489b-b569-b6b6d449dfe5"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a097fb0-92ff-4fce-9986-448d519e0212">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a097fb0-92ff-4fce-9986-448d519e0212</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We asked Tom Frieden, the former C.D.C. director, for some advice. It’s not all doom and gloom.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a0b9338-e70a-43d3-9443-744a79092f3e">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a0b9338-e70a-43d3-9443-744a79092f3e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The department also announced limits on federal officers’ use of widely criticized policing tactics.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd522e1c-57a0-49bc-9835-fae39d9d58a6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a0dc7fc-76f0-4122-b8f3-fb84e38af0e2">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a0dc7fc-76f0-4122-b8f3-fb84e38af0e2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Criminal justice advocates say the pandemic offers a case study for a different type of punitive system in America, one that relies far less on incarceration.</rdfs:comment>
