	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4a185c70-bf35-46c6-9577-64cef2b924a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-4a185c70-bf35-46c6-9577-64cef2b924a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Troy Carter and Karen Carter Peterson will meet in an April runoff for the seat vacated by Cedric L. Richmond.</rdfs:comment>
