		<rdfs:label>article-4ab85cbd-c631-45fd-9af7-875c5d13d047</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a battleground state just before the start of a Democratic debate, the president sided with Bernie Sanders in his clash with Elizabeth Warren.</rdfs:comment>
