	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4ad22cf5-87a4-4ee6-8526-2373becbda01">
		<rdfs:label>article-4ad22cf5-87a4-4ee6-8526-2373becbda01</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The strong job market may be about to take a turn for the worse. That could come to haunt those who made choices based on today’s conditions.</rdfs:comment>
