	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4ad4fae7-29ce-4022-a01c-89749b5a6980">
		<rdfs:label>article-4ad4fae7-29ce-4022-a01c-89749b5a6980</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump campaign is trying to make sure that Mr. Trump’s message will be almost impossible to miss even during the Democrats’ biggest week.</rdfs:comment>
