		<rdfs:label>article-4ae5bca2-f5be-46ae-877b-c13e75eb25ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The deadly flooding in the Northeast, on the heels of destruction from Louisiana to California, shows the limits of adapting to climate change. Experts say it will only get worse.</rdfs:comment>
