	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4b19771c-0456-4782-b6bf-de51f7404337">
		<rdfs:label>article-4b19771c-0456-4782-b6bf-de51f7404337</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The two leaders, who do not have a history of friendliness, spoke just a few weeks before the treaty is set to expire.</rdfs:comment>
