	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4b2199b8-ca99-4063-b389-96282b790e0e">
		<rdfs:label>article-4b2199b8-ca99-4063-b389-96282b790e0e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president’s legal team keeps invoking a 1978 law as a basis for various assertions in the dispute over the seized files he was hoarding.</rdfs:comment>
