	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4b28bd36-bbbf-4b19-850e-c28f3225ca75">
		<rdfs:label>article-4b28bd36-bbbf-4b19-850e-c28f3225ca75</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The billionaire was in the race for just over 100 days and won the support of 58 delegates.</rdfs:comment>
