	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4b2cbfde-ff6b-4afc-8f1b-31c5f4fb260e">
		<rdfs:label>article-4b2cbfde-ff6b-4afc-8f1b-31c5f4fb260e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The government has fallen into the bad habit of trying to engineer competition instead of simply enforcing antitrust laws.</rdfs:comment>
