		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4b41af83-b310-4f8e-9675-f5b6e54ea541">
		<rdfs:label>article-4b41af83-b310-4f8e-9675-f5b6e54ea541</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After an airstrike on Turkish forces by Russia or its Syrian allies, President Trump may be forced to pick between Moscow and Ankara.</rdfs:comment>
