		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4b52a893-350c-4072-9129-09d8904ee64b">
		<rdfs:label>article-4b52a893-350c-4072-9129-09d8904ee64b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some of the state’s biggest districts, including Los Angeles Unified, won’t be lifting their school mask mandates this week.</rdfs:comment>
