		<rdfs:label>article-4ba711a2-d4bb-4a03-bd94-eeb3a5d8043d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>G.O.P. threats to leverage the full faith and credit of the United States to force spending cuts have raised alarm about a debt showdown next year — and talks about how to head one off in the coming weeks.</rdfs:comment>
