	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4ba78ada-8de9-4f86-bca0-8c1453db4c70">
		<rdfs:label>article-4ba78ada-8de9-4f86-bca0-8c1453db4c70</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president falsely described scientific research around the malaria drug, falsely denied the existence of a federal warning against it and argued, with no evidence, that large numbers of health care workers were taking it.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-be4afe5b-5317-4441-a7de-57071d96016d"/>
