		<rdfs:label>article-4bb0aeed-1b5f-4388-be25-d5ca314d6450</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision will slow down the count in a hotly contested battleground state, where John Fetterman, a Democrat, and Mehmet Oz, a Republican, are in a close Senate race.</rdfs:comment>
