		<rdfs:label>article-4bbf8500-7674-4bf3-a585-ef9dcbc8a012</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But to appeal to Republicans, a bill being introduced in the House to impose checks on executive authority may be broken into pieces in the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
