	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4bc2ffbb-2e82-475d-bf4e-38410252c5c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-4bc2ffbb-2e82-475d-bf4e-38410252c5c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A small number of states in the Midwest and the South are under growing pressure to order all residents to stay at home to fight the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
