		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4bc7c00f-4cdb-431c-b567-32ee85a17efe">
		<rdfs:label>article-4bc7c00f-4cdb-431c-b567-32ee85a17efe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Candidates are not permitted to haul field organizers or canapés or record-reframing ad campaigns onstage with them. So the former mayor will stand on his own.</rdfs:comment>
