		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4bd4453b-b854-4cee-bf2a-705170cab781">
		<rdfs:label>article-4bd4453b-b854-4cee-bf2a-705170cab781</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The strategy is supposed to help the nation transition to what some are calling a “new normal,” but it will require funding from Congress.</rdfs:comment>
