		<rdfs:label>article-4bd463e8-4bd4-4903-8b88-f3e8e5fb1169</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president tried to rewrite his history with advising Americans about the coronavirus. His own words prove him wrong.</rdfs:comment>
