		<rdfs:label>article-4bd664fd-253a-4569-834b-ceeb05e95e89</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The cuts to the National Counterterrorism Center were smaller than some former officials feared. The changes will allow intelligence agencies to shift personnel to other threats.</rdfs:comment>
