		<rdfs:label>article-4bd756b7-bc0b-4620-93a0-5b3216e611f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. media is offering a different picture of Covid-19 from science journals or the international media, a study finds.</rdfs:comment>
