		<rdfs:label>article-4bd7deb4-a7a8-4ad6-93cd-dd9acc6b454c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Years ago, voters created a commission to make political maps fairer. Now the State Supreme Court is blocking maps drawn by the Republican-led commission, saying nothing has changed.</rdfs:comment>
