		<rdfs:label>article-4bdb2dde-01e7-4f85-9ba0-1af895727ba3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Much is not yet certain, but here’s what is known so far about some efforts to defund or abolish police departments.</rdfs:comment>
