	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c7ccccc-b3e4-4840-a692-3eeb3591c032">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c7ccccc-b3e4-4840-a692-3eeb3591c032</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A sprawling winter storm pummeled a large swath of the United States on Monday, delivering heavy snowfall and icy conditions as temperatures plunged well below freezing.</rdfs:comment>
