		<rdfs:label>article-4c8480c1-b5ee-46b4-af51-137d1da0dd10</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first lady is experiencing mild symptoms and is quarantining at a private home in South Carolina, her office said on Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
