		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c86b3ee-c8fd-46fc-a99d-ff8e2a163b79">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c86b3ee-c8fd-46fc-a99d-ff8e2a163b79</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump campaign wants to lure back moderates who believe that the president has lurched too far right and openly courted extremists.</rdfs:comment>
