	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c896d70-0630-492d-890f-e4982038a13e">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c896d70-0630-492d-890f-e4982038a13e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The leaders of some of history’s largest polluters are slated to speak, as are those from countries that are bearing the brunt of the effects of climate change.</rdfs:comment>
