	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c8cfde9-0402-4c4e-919f-f9e8ebf47a3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c8cfde9-0402-4c4e-919f-f9e8ebf47a3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The development comes as the United States recently began averaging more than 100,000 new confirmed cases per day again, according to a New York Times database, for the first time since February.</rdfs:comment>
