	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c95f64b-fd36-4cb9-94b4-c1ce93b9f3b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c95f64b-fd36-4cb9-94b4-c1ce93b9f3b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vote sets up a fight with the Senate, which has different recommendations for how the United States should bolster its technology industry to take on China.</rdfs:comment>
