	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c981516-dcee-4645-a0e5-41d2d9778532">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c981516-dcee-4645-a0e5-41d2d9778532</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Justice Department under the Trump administration declined to open a criminal investigation into the actions by Ms. Chao when she was transportation secretary.</rdfs:comment>
