	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4c9ed868-ea81-45ad-8391-048108759464">
		<rdfs:label>article-4c9ed868-ea81-45ad-8391-048108759464</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Democrats prepare to run on an ambitious economic agenda, Republicans are working to caricature them as liberal extremists out of touch with voters’ values.</rdfs:comment>
