	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4ca3fe03-4e30-446e-91ce-5e193644535f">
		<rdfs:label>article-4ca3fe03-4e30-446e-91ce-5e193644535f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Kern County, oil and gas generate tax revenues that keep schools open and police departments funded.</rdfs:comment>
