		<rdfs:label>article-4d8a70ce-3452-40ca-a40d-1388babec183</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ruling, which requires the government to seek consent for new projects, could put the brakes on the president’s plan to increase oil production.</rdfs:comment>
