		<rdfs:label>article-4d98852a-4b89-44cf-8f40-e0369955d0ec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Exhausted and angry as they face a series of crises, many voters nevertheless remain optimistic about the future, a poll shows, viewing this moment as a chance for progress, one they can help shape.</rdfs:comment>
