		<rdfs:label>article-4da8126c-bf6d-41da-98f7-e2fcfb461d58</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats cited the pandemic to argue for a plan that was about double the size of the one they proposed earlier this year.</rdfs:comment>
