		<rdfs:label>article-4daa2f7d-3103-421b-9020-d2290373c5df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a scathing order, a federal judge rejected the Trump campaign’s claim of widespread improprieties with mail-in ballots, removing a major legal hurdle to certifying Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s victory there.</rdfs:comment>
