		<rdfs:label>article-4dabf85e-1252-4144-8f7e-047ba4a79de6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Health officials are frustrated that available doses are going unused while the virus is killing thousands of people each day. Many vaccine appointments have been canceled.</rdfs:comment>
