	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4dc80682-6ca0-40bd-a762-52ff0be1a569">
		<rdfs:label>article-4dc80682-6ca0-40bd-a762-52ff0be1a569</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Foxconn’s failure to deliver on a Wisconsin project underscores the limits of the president’s power to make companies bend to his will.</rdfs:comment>
