	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4dc8aa6b-af9a-4ace-84b6-b447d3612deb">
		<rdfs:label>article-4dc8aa6b-af9a-4ace-84b6-b447d3612deb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president, eyeing the battleground state of Nevada, has made clear he opposes a nuclear waste site at Yucca Mountain, reversing a policy that was made in his name.</rdfs:comment>
