		<rdfs:label>article-4de724f4-a8c8-46e1-8edd-f92c63812a12</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facebook moved on Thursday to clamp down on confusion about the November election on its service, rolling out a series of changes to limit voter misinformation and prevent interference from President Trump and other politicians.</rdfs:comment>
