	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4dea457f-f47f-412f-bc33-ca5051fdbc3b">
		<rdfs:label>article-4dea457f-f47f-412f-bc33-ca5051fdbc3b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The government’s top infectious disease expert told a Senate panel that bars needed to be closed, and the Fed chairman cautioned that “a full recovery is unlikely” until safety is restored.</rdfs:comment>
