	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4deb7d09-e950-4f9e-9889-86412c323d41">
		<rdfs:label>article-4deb7d09-e950-4f9e-9889-86412c323d41</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A 24-year-old volunteer died of undiagnosed malaria on the island nation of Comoros. It was one of at least three deaths since 2009 that have been linked to mistakes by Peace Corps doctors.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
