		<rdfs:label>article-4df068ce-1b93-4584-9971-102aeeb93386</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Treasury Secretary Yellen wants India to be part of the Biden administration’s “friend-shoring” agenda, but trade tensions linger.</rdfs:comment>
