	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4df970b0-0049-4829-a684-39a41bc6cc0b">
		<rdfs:label>article-4df970b0-0049-4829-a684-39a41bc6cc0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Mike DeWine ignored a court ruling and said the state’s health director was closing the polls on Tuesday based on worries that the coronavirus placed voters and poll workers in potential danger.</rdfs:comment>
