	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4dfd82c6-1b4c-4e12-b9f3-c22249871112">
		<rdfs:label>article-4dfd82c6-1b4c-4e12-b9f3-c22249871112</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A voting rights law before Congress does not fully address the imminent threats to representative democracy in the United States.</rdfs:comment>
