		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e012614-f586-4f04-b285-93442551b340">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e012614-f586-4f04-b285-93442551b340</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats proposed a spending bill that omitted aid for farmers sought by President Trump, drawing Republican ire and leaving the fate of the bill unclear as federal funding is set to lapse.</rdfs:comment>
