		<rdfs:label>article-4e1ca573-6cff-40c9-bbfc-4f90cc605b8a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ruling affirmed a lower court decision that deemed a program protecting about 600,000 young immigrants from deportation to be illegal but allowed current recipients to renew their status.</rdfs:comment>
