		<rdfs:comment>Republicans chose Tim Michels to challenge Gov. Tony Evers in Wisconsin, and Lt. Gov. Mandela Barnes will take on Senator Ron Johnson. In Washington State, a House Republican who voted for impeachment conceded her race.</rdfs:comment>
