	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e3597d3-6e70-4200-b583-f09ff9d4a142">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e3597d3-6e70-4200-b583-f09ff9d4a142</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For nearly 50 years, the state was subject to Voting Rights Act rules meant to deter racial discrimination. Those federal guidelines are now shredded, but Virginia just recreated them on its own.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e375007-ad34-4603-b04b-054102180b9b">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e375007-ad34-4603-b04b-054102180b9b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. trade representative called for stronger worker protections in trade policy as the administration looks to curb the negative impact of globalization.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-19a7fb6b-a5ad-4f65-8d9c-b053a6ce8ab9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e400fbd-c07e-4713-8374-297bf345dfca">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e400fbd-c07e-4713-8374-297bf345dfca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The mob attack on the Capitol, and interviews with Trump voters this week, show that the president’s subversion of democratic values will have enduring influence within the Republican Party.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e4154f8-8e76-4a08-8c74-da60295759fc">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e4154f8-8e76-4a08-8c74-da60295759fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: The news can be rough. Enjoy some tiny California love stories.</rdfs:comment>
