	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e420f09-992a-4fc1-b2c9-4efec5bc3d66">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e420f09-992a-4fc1-b2c9-4efec5bc3d66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $200 cards for prescription drugs, intended for 33 million older Americans, are part of a $6.6 billion promise offered to a key constituency.</rdfs:comment>
