	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4e9d4f0c-dcf3-405f-b9a7-9f5f040e03a0">
		<rdfs:label>article-4e9d4f0c-dcf3-405f-b9a7-9f5f040e03a0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president has backed three candidates running against House Republicans who voted to impeach him, and there’s a long list of Trump-backed candidates in Arizona.</rdfs:comment>
