		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4eb185a6-5a30-41fa-a286-95bdd19e8a5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-4eb185a6-5a30-41fa-a286-95bdd19e8a5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The episode also brought to a head tensions in the U.S. attorney’s office in Washington.</rdfs:comment>
