	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4eb462f0-9c48-41f0-b1bf-fe69893064c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-4eb462f0-9c48-41f0-b1bf-fe69893064c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden is looking ahead to South Carolina to resurrect his candidacy. There are signs that it may be a bigger challenge after defeats in Iowa and New Hampshire.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-21d856ad-a6ae-406e-a9e4-9707218ad815"/>
