	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4ee56db1-1574-4ec0-bbd1-bd5322232464">
		<rdfs:label>article-4ee56db1-1574-4ec0-bbd1-bd5322232464</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Viewers saw a notably different version of President Trump on Thursday from the one at the first debate. He didn’t interrupt Joe Biden as much, and he returned to some of his central messages.</rdfs:comment>
