	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4eeefee1-0dd2-4cee-8ada-1531393372ff">
		<rdfs:label>article-4eeefee1-0dd2-4cee-8ada-1531393372ff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision is not final and the Republican National Committee must approve the choice during its summer meeting early next month.</rdfs:comment>
