	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4eef21ac-7928-4610-8461-5a8a93bca32c">
		<rdfs:label>article-4eef21ac-7928-4610-8461-5a8a93bca32c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats in Congress are under pressure to act after the Supreme Court’s decision. But with Republicans and at least one Democrat opposed in the Senate, the measures are all but certain to fail.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-11"/>
