	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4eeff887-f0af-4d11-9fa7-9d6d9c0576cd">
		<rdfs:label>article-4eeff887-f0af-4d11-9fa7-9d6d9c0576cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There was a subtext to the questions. Two Supreme Court justices have called for reconsideration of the foundational decision that made it hard for public officials to sue for libel.</rdfs:comment>
