	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4ef1e313-b277-4ec5-b228-6e46546379f4">
		<rdfs:label>article-4ef1e313-b277-4ec5-b228-6e46546379f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The officer’s combat death came as President Trump considers pulling back on American operations in the region.</rdfs:comment>
