	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4fb813aa-472f-4bc3-9536-19eb28ce62ac">
		<rdfs:label>article-4fb813aa-472f-4bc3-9536-19eb28ce62ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Researchers found ads placed by Google on sites that falsely call global warming a hoax. The revenue those sites earn from the ads can fund further misinformation.</rdfs:comment>
