	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4fbe13da-125e-4839-965c-8223fd22a88e">
		<rdfs:label>article-4fbe13da-125e-4839-965c-8223fd22a88e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Seven in 10 Americans say marriage between same-sex couples should be recognized by law.</rdfs:comment>
