	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4fc11a6b-d689-4976-af33-c9e25b76c0a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-4fc11a6b-d689-4976-af33-c9e25b76c0a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In one of the most striking moments of the second night of the Republican convention on Tuesday — both for its content and for its blatant disregard for the traditional separation between governing and politicking — President Trump held a naturalization ceremony for five immigrants.</rdfs:comment>
