		<rdfs:label>article-4fd15b13-49e9-4d4e-95d3-e55e1994fc32</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Plans for a commemoration and services have yet to be made final, but large crowds are expected to pay their respects for a justice who became a feminist icon and liberal hero.</rdfs:comment>
