	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-4fdf2463-0283-4591-899d-3bcb268da3c8">
		<rdfs:label>article-4fdf2463-0283-4591-899d-3bcb268da3c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump administration said it would lower the annual cap on refugees further into rock-bottom record territory as President Trump pursues pre-election xenophobic attacks.</rdfs:comment>
