		<rdfs:label>article-50133f7f-8d59-4cd9-847e-4d7792e3c8da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bipartisan vote was the first legislative action either chamber of Congress has taken to bolster law enforcement’s response to rising attacks on the Asian-American community.</rdfs:comment>
