		<rdfs:label>article-5015c252-6fcf-41e4-8cd4-640f3908d655</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>U.S. funding for overseas health providers that offer abortion services has vacillated with the changing of administrations for decades. Congress is debating whether to settle the policy by law.</rdfs:comment>
