		<rdfs:comment>Olivia Troye, a former top homeland security aide to Vice President Mike Pence, endorsed former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. on Thursday and accused President Trump of weak leadership and of drastically mismanaging the response to the coronavirus crisis.</rdfs:comment>
