		<rdfs:comment>For Democrats and many independents, President Trump has shattered the norms of presidential behavior with racist tweets and divisive policies; his use of federal agencies to advance his personal interests; and, perhaps most important, his detachment from managing the coronavirus pandemic, which has killed more than 175,000 Americans.</rdfs:comment>
