		<rdfs:label>article-5237f5a2-0e4e-41e3-ad6c-deb39bcf5bab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For the first time, the school district has given its version of events. In a letter to parents and staff members, it also said it will seek an outside party to conduct an investigation.</rdfs:comment>
