	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-52455e18-3cdb-4a4e-989c-087acea0b0f1">
		<rdfs:label>article-52455e18-3cdb-4a4e-989c-087acea0b0f1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Proposed changes to further limit American shipments to Huawei have been delayed amid arguments they could backfire.</rdfs:comment>
