	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-525fe3ff-a432-4da2-872e-9b74c271c304">
		<rdfs:label>article-525fe3ff-a432-4da2-872e-9b74c271c304</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The rejected request was another key breakdown in the security failure ahead of the violence at the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
