	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5260168a-c90e-4dd6-ae1c-3279744dcd1e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5260168a-c90e-4dd6-ae1c-3279744dcd1e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With hundreds of houses damaged or even washed away, a question looms in parts of the region: How many families who persevered there for generations will now leave for good?</rdfs:comment>
