	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5260cd1b-fa69-4fbe-893d-23fee96a1870">
		<rdfs:label>article-5260cd1b-fa69-4fbe-893d-23fee96a1870</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Judge Jackson, 51, is appearing before the Senate Judiciary Committee after being nominated by President Biden to replace Justice Stephen Breyer.</rdfs:comment>
