		<rdfs:label>article-52615355-e7f1-47c0-99f9-85e677e2ddea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>People with respiratory illnesses may be more vulnerable right now. Also: Are N95 masks recommended for wildfires?</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-14f82d09-3a15-43b0-8f6d-ebdb1405d989"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-21"/>
