	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5264672c-8acc-428f-b5ca-7a85f586e8c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-5264672c-8acc-428f-b5ca-7a85f586e8c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The effort could significantly reduce a backlog of asylum and deportation cases as the Biden administration anticipates a huge surge of migrants crossing the border.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dad1523a-f983-4f0f-af53-0061c7165e91"/>
