	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53be376f-e92e-498a-ac8b-26e84c33a677">
		<rdfs:label>article-53be376f-e92e-498a-ac8b-26e84c33a677</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The arrival of the new officials has prompted concerns. Their backgrounds offer insights into their policies.</rdfs:comment>
