	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53c2086b-1728-468a-9643-ef54b156c841">
		<rdfs:label>article-53c2086b-1728-468a-9643-ef54b156c841</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The document, which every new administration is required to issue, was delayed last winter as it became clear that Russia’s invasion of Ukraine was imminent.</rdfs:comment>
