	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53ccef68-d937-429f-ab91-c2d0367087e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-53ccef68-d937-429f-ab91-c2d0367087e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The cease-fire between Hamas and Israel didn’t come a second too soon.</rdfs:comment>
