		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53de2eb0-a155-4325-931e-26722126f419">
		<rdfs:label>article-53de2eb0-a155-4325-931e-26722126f419</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Perhaps no one was more surprised to learn that Joyce Jones wanted to defund the police than Joyce Jones herself.</rdfs:comment>
