	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53e527aa-ba39-4aa3-a21b-84e4afebf0f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-53e527aa-ba39-4aa3-a21b-84e4afebf0f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats’ achievements were overshadowed by legislative setbacks, fallout from the Jan. 6 attack and a sense that Congress was not rising to meet a perilous moment in history.</rdfs:comment>
