		<rdfs:label>article-53e6a434-e3a5-4645-ac35-aebc3aac3ba9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A lawsuit over voting rights in Georgia prompted a debate over multimillion-dollar legal fees and conflicts of interest.</rdfs:comment>
