	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53e7dc9d-fe41-4810-8407-48cd43d3b369">
		<rdfs:label>article-53e7dc9d-fe41-4810-8407-48cd43d3b369</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gen. Paul M. Nakasone, the head of Cyber Command, said a new cross-functional effort has been gathering intelligence to combat criminal groups targeting U.S. infrastructure.</rdfs:comment>
