	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53e926f8-2eae-4155-9617-898c08c3e584">
		<rdfs:label>article-53e926f8-2eae-4155-9617-898c08c3e584</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The campaign included planned operations against President Trump’s national security adviser at the time, H.R. McMaster, and F.B.I. employees, according to documents and interviews.</rdfs:comment>
