	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-53eab0ad-1649-43c5-aa52-e9f51a06d184">
		<rdfs:label>article-53eab0ad-1649-43c5-aa52-e9f51a06d184</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The selection of Mr. Becerra, the California attorney general, is a surprise. If confirmed, he will face a daunting challenge in leading the department at a critical moment in the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
