		<rdfs:label>article-53ec04a7-4b50-4b4c-b530-6e74832c8336</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The mob attack on Congress last week by President Trump’s supporters has spurred the most substantial challenge for the Trump Organization to date, a reckoning by businesses and institutions that are distancing themselves from the president on a grand scale.</rdfs:comment>
