	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-54e034f4-5526-4629-bc09-0d247c69351c">
		<rdfs:label>article-54e034f4-5526-4629-bc09-0d247c69351c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democratic National Committee has a roughly $75 million war chest, raising the party’s hopes of keeping power in 2022 and accelerating a Democratic shift in the Sun Belt states.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0b1c0734-81f6-4bd6-ab6e-2c3d3239bc31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-31"/>
