		<rdfs:label>article-54f1d65d-7467-4066-8ca0-7368044f8443</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Derek Chauvin is charged with second-degree murder and second-degree manslaughter in Mr. Floyd’s death.</rdfs:comment>
