		<rdfs:label>article-54f810f3-54ae-4f30-b1c8-0fc46863fab2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>TV viewership for the first night of the Republican National Convention fell short of the Democrats’ first night last week, according to Nielsen.</rdfs:comment>
