	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5501bb4c-895f-4afb-ab29-5aa6bd4ef04a">
		<rdfs:label>article-5501bb4c-895f-4afb-ab29-5aa6bd4ef04a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>E.V.s will bring down emissions, but the materials needed to build them have other environmental costs. We explain why, and talk about ways to limit the harm.</rdfs:comment>
