	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-564fdf2d-6acd-4b1c-9d35-228eea374e55">
		<rdfs:label>article-564fdf2d-6acd-4b1c-9d35-228eea374e55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Like many big state universities, it tried to open with some semblance of normalcy. Outbreaks ensued.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-204cd1d8-9d72-4785-968e-7d68ce7d17d7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56500420-1039-4dfd-8f2e-675c701179b5">
		<rdfs:label>article-56500420-1039-4dfd-8f2e-675c701179b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Crucial routes through the Cascade Mountains remained closed on Sunday as responders assessed the damage.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-073a2c11-e123-4e83-900b-90a962ee7e54"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56514950-51ab-400a-97b7-88875af2d295">
		<rdfs:label>article-56514950-51ab-400a-97b7-88875af2d295</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It didn’t take long for the fight over Judge Amy Coney Barrett to reach the airwaves, in races up and down the ballot.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5658653c-a956-4668-9708-d0cf812e3449">
		<rdfs:label>article-5658653c-a956-4668-9708-d0cf812e3449</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More homeowners are ripping out their lawns, marking the twilight of a signature symbol of Southern California homeownership.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-738c55e5-1f96-4b93-8c70-fc8c1c8c9119"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-565bbbd1-6c20-4d7a-ab3f-6e04471a4f0a">
		<rdfs:label>article-565bbbd1-6c20-4d7a-ab3f-6e04471a4f0a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even as Nancy Pelosi and Steven Mnuchin continued to narrow their differences, the president said Democrats were holding out for too much, suggesting he was preparing to blame them for the demise of a deal.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-565bea07-2d94-431d-aaac-e8e70331942a">
		<rdfs:label>article-565bea07-2d94-431d-aaac-e8e70331942a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>University outbreaks are significant contributors to the pandemic. And the campus paper might be the only one left to cover them.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f054aa66-2374-4f42-8ea3-5d2fd3c51e19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56696e1d-348f-44ee-88d3-7cbd753a09c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-56696e1d-348f-44ee-88d3-7cbd753a09c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The verdict was unlikely to be the final word for former President Donald J. Trump, his badly divided party or the festering wounds the Jan. 6 riot that prompted the impeachment left behind.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-566dd7d1-8d2d-4768-a951-6e8c12cd4f88">
		<rdfs:label>article-566dd7d1-8d2d-4768-a951-6e8c12cd4f88</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Liz Truss, Britain’s new prime minister, defended her plan in the face of stiff criticism from the International Monetary Fund and others.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5676fa43-b405-4c37-bece-3f898e4d9e6f">
		<rdfs:label>article-5676fa43-b405-4c37-bece-3f898e4d9e6f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. reported more than 41,000 new cases on Thursday, the second consecutive day with a record total, and the C.D.C. said the true national caseload was probably 10 times the official count. India plans to test all 29 million residents of its capital for the virus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-567bb5b3-c507-462d-9441-aa30a8179d92">
		<rdfs:label>article-567bb5b3-c507-462d-9441-aa30a8179d92</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state’s caucuses often come down to the wire, but this year’s contest is especially uncertain.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-887d1269-7020-4c8e-8dfc-eae7c464f3cb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-01-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-567e7438-cc1c-4b43-b906-b0aa7844f357">
		<rdfs:label>article-567e7438-cc1c-4b43-b906-b0aa7844f357</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sickout in Chandler, Ariz., reflects growing discord over whether classrooms should remain open as virus cases spike.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0cc8020e-7db7-428c-8db7-36cf2f5c4168"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56828c0e-bf32-40e8-ad05-ec65a62af4fb">
		<rdfs:label>article-56828c0e-bf32-40e8-ad05-ec65a62af4fb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>About one-third of the troops have declined to take the vaccine. Many say they worry the vaccines are unsafe or were developed too quickly. Others want a sense of independence, even in uniform.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-20ac5364-1758-414f-ab86-a88673954008"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5689c7a4-ff0a-410d-a587-2f5b0ef79c92">
		<rdfs:label>article-5689c7a4-ff0a-410d-a587-2f5b0ef79c92</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Her trip Friday will come just before former President Donald J. Trump is set to visit the border with House Republicans and the Texas governor, who has pledged to finish the wall.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-558cc815-e7e6-47a5-bd90-ac5a453042ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-568bce43-012f-40d4-b281-aa63025d03c8">
		<rdfs:label>article-568bce43-012f-40d4-b281-aa63025d03c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. search for Ayman al-Zawahri had spanned decades. His presence on a balcony at a safe house in Kabul presented an opportunity to strike.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5a3094b1-6bc7-47d7-8f53-c56fd8ed0c59"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-568e675f-2043-4b1a-91fb-0c74370408b2">
		<rdfs:label>article-568e675f-2043-4b1a-91fb-0c74370408b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden leads President Trump by about 7,000 votes as of Saturday morning.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-21d856ad-a6ae-406e-a9e4-9707218ad815"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d7a0b17f-e0aa-44c5-a995-e81e028fa879"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-568e8c67-6c50-4130-a03e-4a3e45d4a1c1">
		<rdfs:label>article-568e8c67-6c50-4130-a03e-4a3e45d4a1c1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A large majority of voters say race should not be a factor in his decision, and none of the best-known candidates has emerged as a favorite.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3488268a-8b17-411a-8185-6859abbab9a8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-569882b3-0ef7-43a1-a716-485e81bd0d9b">
		<rdfs:label>article-569882b3-0ef7-43a1-a716-485e81bd0d9b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Their fund-raising dwarfed by their Democratic rivals, Republican nominees including Blake Masters and Mehmet Oz have been in Washington gathering cash from lobbyists.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4a606035-f311-493f-9272-00230e475b23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5699e765-e915-4386-a78f-c11d376db56d">
		<rdfs:label>article-5699e765-e915-4386-a78f-c11d376db56d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Schools are looking for alternatives to the one-shot vaccine before the end of the semester.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9ef20237-f390-44c5-8d52-031cdd2c86e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f054aa66-2374-4f42-8ea3-5d2fd3c51e19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56a35c96-7e08-4143-9c22-6dd51cd3bac5">
		<rdfs:label>article-56a35c96-7e08-4143-9c22-6dd51cd3bac5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The malware was revealed as Russian troops remained massed at the Ukrainian border, and after Ukrainian government agencies had their websites defaced.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56a3e3d8-ac26-4137-ae0d-70b47a2a2cac">
		<rdfs:label>article-56a3e3d8-ac26-4137-ae0d-70b47a2a2cac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the decision by Food and Drug Administration, some institutions are seeing a green light for mandates.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-46b2f3e2-fc43-4d1f-8134-a17365f8ec33"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-cc485407-61fb-4f46-96a9-c260884f0314"/>
