		<rdfs:label>article-56d774fc-41f5-4f28-aab2-62613d8eb531</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Progressive and racial justice groups have seen a cascade of donations since George Floyd’s death and the ensuing protests. Bail funds alone have received $90 million.</rdfs:comment>
