	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56d98d59-8ecb-4033-8776-f891352b194b">
		<rdfs:label>article-56d98d59-8ecb-4033-8776-f891352b194b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even a bare-minimum majority preserves Democrats’ ability to confirm President Biden’s nominees and would allow them to stop Republican legislation in its tracks should the G.O.P. win the House.</rdfs:comment>
