	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56da7363-1b8d-4eda-a700-50958f13ed0d">
		<rdfs:label>article-56da7363-1b8d-4eda-a700-50958f13ed0d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The court seemed poised to rule that the city, which has approved many other requests to raise flags at its City Hall, violated a Christian group’s free speech rights.</rdfs:comment>
