		<rdfs:label>article-56df8f83-4c29-49c2-917d-f8847d617489</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The inquiry into the 2020 vote, derided as a badly flawed partisan exercise, has already spawned imitators in other states.</rdfs:comment>
