	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56e1fde0-fc14-45eb-85e2-7e00b9fb4ce5">
		<rdfs:label>article-56e1fde0-fc14-45eb-85e2-7e00b9fb4ce5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers from districts with low-risk areas — many of them Democrats — are complying, while members of Congress from areas where the virus is spreading rapidly — including many Republicans — have resisted.</rdfs:comment>
