	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-56ed09d5-ccc7-4321-bb31-b293dd0ec98c">
		<rdfs:label>article-56ed09d5-ccc7-4321-bb31-b293dd0ec98c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The temporary stay in lifting the pandemic rule known as Title 42 is a provisional victory for 19 states, led mostly by Republicans, that had sought to keep it in place on the border.</rdfs:comment>
