	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-571b44f5-2986-4f72-8f21-35f9ca7b76dd">
		<rdfs:label>article-571b44f5-2986-4f72-8f21-35f9ca7b76dd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The execution of Orlando Cordia Hall was the eighth since the Trump administration revived capital punishment for federal crimes and the first of three scheduled during the presidential transition.</rdfs:comment>
