	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-576c0474-67a1-40bd-b279-f2cf5723e439">
		<rdfs:label>article-576c0474-67a1-40bd-b279-f2cf5723e439</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump administration finalized plans to open land once in Utah’s Grand Staircase-Escalante National Monument to mining and oil and gas exploration.</rdfs:comment>
