		<rdfs:label>article-578e9739-cdb7-4596-968d-ddcc91c2ff19</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>They fell short of Mitch McConnell’s goal of reaching a deal in principle on a $1 trillion plan on Friday, but vowed to work through the weekend.</rdfs:comment>
