		<rdfs:label>article-579843b3-0b60-47d9-8ff9-de938f32d7fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Historically, trees and city parks in America go to wealthy, white neighborhoods. Now, a program in Colorado’s capital is trying to correct that injustice.</rdfs:comment>
