		<rdfs:label>article-579edd6a-3b5f-465e-a0cc-7b17dc75cd24</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lucy Calkins, a leading literacy expert, has rewritten her curriculum to include a fuller embrace of phonics and the science of reading. Critics may not be appeased.</rdfs:comment>
