		<rdfs:label>article-57a1bb23-517d-4731-bd61-a40e47783217</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the money race between America’s billionaires and small donors, the emerging political oligarchy is showing staying power. Both parties have megadonors, but Republicans have far more.</rdfs:comment>
