	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-598732e6-abbb-4a24-9cf7-026a204406a6">
		<rdfs:label>article-598732e6-abbb-4a24-9cf7-026a204406a6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Kamala Harris of California urged Black Americans to vote on Friday, saying it was “up to us to act” in a forceful call to action for one of the Democratic Party’s most important voting blocs.</rdfs:comment>
