	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-59888cca-31d5-4687-b954-f384b11a5c05">
		<rdfs:label>article-59888cca-31d5-4687-b954-f384b11a5c05</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Relatives of George Floyd said on Friday that Derek Chauvin’s prison sentence of 22 and a half years was not long enough, but that they were grateful he would face a measure of accountability after being convicted of murdering Mr. Floyd.</rdfs:comment>
