		<rdfs:label>article-5991fcc8-444e-49a2-84fa-c826de9d5226</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s involvement is a sign that Democratic leaders are taking down-ballot contests more seriously than in past elections.</rdfs:comment>
