		<rdfs:label>article-59a18947-3b21-44bb-9b4d-6906132bd1fe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As vice president, Joe Biden oversaw a “green jobs” stimulus package that produced notable failures. This time, with more money and more demand for clean technology, will be different, Democrats say.</rdfs:comment>
