		<rdfs:label>article-59e68a87-61fd-4bc0-b8c6-2b7fdaa304c6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Scientists say carbon removal may be needed to avert the worst effects of climate change. But it still needs to be much cheaper and more reliable.</rdfs:comment>
