		<rdfs:label>article-59e70966-26c6-48aa-a928-7c5fc5c01054</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden also said he would “have a choice” on his running mate by the first week in August. President Trump wondered aloud why his approval ratings were not as high as Dr. Anthony S. Fauci’s.</rdfs:comment>
