		<rdfs:label>article-59ef6b9c-96d4-4456-9621-64ba2b600d03</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A surprise jump in the number of people working may give Republican lawmakers less incentive to renew the very programs that have hastened the labor market’s rebound.</rdfs:comment>
