	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5a946fda-9780-4cbd-847d-d283a877715e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5a946fda-9780-4cbd-847d-d283a877715e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new analysis found 2019 was the hottest for the world’s oceans. The five hottest years have also been in the past five years. </rdfs:comment>
