		<rdfs:label>article-5a9b9fa8-3859-41a7-b762-2fcb71c23e1f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A presidential order would almost certainly face a legal challenge. But if elected, Joseph R. Biden Jr. would have other levers at his disposal to make mask wearing a cultural norm.</rdfs:comment>
