		<rdfs:label>article-5ac8c351-c03d-4b8c-8d8d-81ed66853167</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an updated indictment, the Justice Department said Thomas Barrack sought money from the United Arab Emirates for an investment fund that would boost the Trump administration’s agenda.</rdfs:comment>
