	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5b92f519-3bd4-4e5a-b3a4-3404ec79c81b">
		<rdfs:label>article-5b92f519-3bd4-4e5a-b3a4-3404ec79c81b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Treasury Department complied with a request from Senate Republicans for documents related to Hunter Biden’s ties to a Ukrainian energy company, according to a Senate Democrat.</rdfs:comment>
