	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5b930d39-8d1c-4d2d-bef4-b75feb1c7073">
		<rdfs:label>article-5b930d39-8d1c-4d2d-bef4-b75feb1c7073</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Previously, the agency said those 50 and older could opt for the additional shot, but encouraged only people over 65 or with underlying medical conditions to get it.</rdfs:comment>
