	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5b94fe57-0257-4458-adf6-f069e9bb94e8">
		<rdfs:label>article-5b94fe57-0257-4458-adf6-f069e9bb94e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The case, over a state law requiring doctors performing abortions to have admitting privileges at nearby hospitals, is the first abortion ruling since two Trump appointees joined the court.</rdfs:comment>
