	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5b95a7ce-de93-4c6a-92ff-1ae72786377e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5b95a7ce-de93-4c6a-92ff-1ae72786377e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats are outspending Republicans 57-to-1 on television ads for their secretary of state candidates. It still may not be enough.</rdfs:comment>
