	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5b9694f5-df7a-459a-a533-3c97f35cda01">
		<rdfs:label>article-5b9694f5-df7a-459a-a533-3c97f35cda01</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least 1,324 confirmed coronavirus cases are tied to prisons and jails across the United States, according to data tracked by The Times, including at least 32 deaths.</rdfs:comment>
