	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c35ee14-b111-4ed2-9237-08562cd5776a">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c35ee14-b111-4ed2-9237-08562cd5776a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Supporters of the president in several cities said they were still convinced that the election was stolen, no matter what the courts say. Some confrontations with counterprotesters turned violent.</rdfs:comment>
