	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c3a34ee-ddd4-413d-a7a9-73421cdd2fd4">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c3a34ee-ddd4-413d-a7a9-73421cdd2fd4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Kyle Rittenhouse has pleaded not guilty, but it remains to be seen how his lawyers will try to defend him from a charge of illegally possessing the gun he used.</rdfs:comment>
