	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c412fd4-b833-4839-914f-1892967c8352">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c412fd4-b833-4839-914f-1892967c8352</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The recall of San Francisco’s district attorney and the Los Angeles mayor’s race drew the most attention, but several other contests were decided, too.</rdfs:comment>
