	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c443a4d-0295-4281-a483-d2c15cf7d45d">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c443a4d-0295-4281-a483-d2c15cf7d45d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Outdoor activities have become a popular pastime during the coronavirus pandemic as adventure seekers and couch surfers alike take to hiking trails for a bit of a reprieve.</rdfs:comment>
