	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c4468b9-5a53-4550-8878-7333d96c78d2">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c4468b9-5a53-4550-8878-7333d96c78d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The question is most urgent in Arizona, where two of the former president’s loyalists may well become governor and secretary of state.</rdfs:comment>
