	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c4501aa-a4bd-4216-b39d-bf52b486fbfc">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c4501aa-a4bd-4216-b39d-bf52b486fbfc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s choice to set a firm date for a full withdrawal reflected a belief that the priorities of 2021 require moving on from policies set in 2001.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-13"/>
