		<rdfs:label>article-5c5fca32-85f2-4d07-8324-a1f17ce342f1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Intelligence assessments suggest that a Russian invasion of Ukraine would most likely be preceded by cyberattacks on Ukraine’s electric grid, its communications systems and its government.</rdfs:comment>
