		<rdfs:label>article-5c713d26-47ed-42df-812f-b637d63fd4b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ruling set up a final battle over the maps in the state Supreme Court, where Democrats hold a slim edge.</rdfs:comment>
