		<rdfs:label>article-5c8ff97a-7de2-4f66-b963-c1c6aaa52256</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A global shortage of a key component for cars and electronics has shuttered American factories and set off fierce competition to secure supplies.</rdfs:comment>
