	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c906299-c842-4f5a-9646-aa7218aeda4e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c906299-c842-4f5a-9646-aa7218aeda4e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Polls show voters liked direct payments from President Biden’s 2021 economic rescue bill. But they have become fodder for Republican inflation attacks.</rdfs:comment>
