	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c94f487-1999-40b8-81f1-c07e68a165bd">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c94f487-1999-40b8-81f1-c07e68a165bd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The two leaders were also expected to discuss the escalating humanitarian crisis in the Tigray region of Ethiopia, where fighters have been accused of atrocities against civilians.</rdfs:comment>
