	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c95cf5a-0476-46c0-bb90-986593053196">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c95cf5a-0476-46c0-bb90-986593053196</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The plan aims to inoculate Democrats in conservative-leaning states from Republican attacks on cultural issues, underscoring how successful the G.O.P. has been at weaponizing them.</rdfs:comment>
