	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c970ff8-7528-4e4e-bdf3-fcc60aeb1cb8">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c970ff8-7528-4e4e-bdf3-fcc60aeb1cb8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new advisory board, appointed by the Trump administration, recommended that the health secretary reject funding for virtually every fetal tissue research project it considered.</rdfs:comment>
