	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5c9c0ff7-3331-44d8-b8c3-bb3fce852a0b">
		<rdfs:label>article-5c9c0ff7-3331-44d8-b8c3-bb3fce852a0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Battered by the coronavirus, the American public is increasingly looking to the federal government to provide an economic lifeline, polls suggest.</rdfs:comment>
