	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5ca1b8d0-d695-4343-86e4-0cd85fd71d9e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5ca1b8d0-d695-4343-86e4-0cd85fd71d9e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The congressman and civil rights leader preached in support of nonviolent resistance, a message that some say must live on in his absence.</rdfs:comment>
