	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5ca30493-c430-4317-9f6d-23ccbf810d75">
		<rdfs:label>article-5ca30493-c430-4317-9f6d-23ccbf810d75</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vice president will preside on Wednesday when Congress convenes to ratify Joe Biden’s victory. President Trump still seems to hold out hope that his loyal No. 2 could change the outcome.</rdfs:comment>
