		<rdfs:label>article-5d6833a9-77c4-48d3-97d9-385277dcb541</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a late-night rally in Florida, President Trump suggested that he might fire Dr. Anthony S. Fauci, the nation’s top epidemiologist, “after the election.”</rdfs:comment>
