		<rdfs:label>article-5d763181-e1be-45d1-82fe-180eb17b278f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In 2019, just 17 percent of Americans said they trusted the federal government to do the right thing. The pandemic appears to be eroding their faith even more.</rdfs:comment>
