		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e1e2f28-3fda-47c4-839d-a0a82d21994c">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e1e2f28-3fda-47c4-839d-a0a82d21994c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The country is recovering from a pandemic and an economic crisis, and its former president is in legal and financial peril. But no political realignment appears to be at hand.</rdfs:comment>
