		<rdfs:label>article-5e1f7c2b-fa63-4fdf-968f-20f832fefc02</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans are awaiting results to determine a too-close-to-call race to be the party’s nominee for governor.</rdfs:comment>
