		<rdfs:label>article-5e241346-0c8d-4cf0-a22b-832cb746e7e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former President George W. Bush and a handful of other Republicans congratulated the president-elect, but most party leaders stayed quiet or urged President Trump to fight.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a2860122-d5d8-4996-a4a4-bc29b03dbcd0"/>
