	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e2c8ff3-2125-42fa-b5b4-ad6a82f68c83">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e2c8ff3-2125-42fa-b5b4-ad6a82f68c83</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The normalization of relations between Israel and two Arab states is a welcome development. There’s still a long way to go toward peace.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e2c918b-22ba-4b40-a696-5b63e911002e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e2c918b-22ba-4b40-a696-5b63e911002e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Today, works depicting the blankets of white that were once synonymous with the season evoke longing for a winter that never comes.</rdfs:comment>
