	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e2f7e4b-5c03-4bdb-9888-95d10581090a">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e2f7e4b-5c03-4bdb-9888-95d10581090a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The staggering sum — a combination of three sets of settlements with hundreds of alleged victims of Dr. George Tyndall — sets a record for collegiate sex abuse payouts.</rdfs:comment>
