	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e30075c-fdcb-4e8c-b26d-c79f7d1a129e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e30075c-fdcb-4e8c-b26d-c79f7d1a129e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration has imposed new sanctions on Tehran and expressed support for protesters, as the Iranian government aids Russia in the Ukraine war and continues nuclear enrichment.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
