	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e3320c4-b244-4d18-94f6-57db9c3728c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e3320c4-b244-4d18-94f6-57db9c3728c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Times is hosting a live chat with a pediatric infectious disease specialist and two reporters about the coronavirus vaccine and children. We’d like to hear your questions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e334e0b-c248-427a-80fe-66e92bb38955">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e334e0b-c248-427a-80fe-66e92bb38955</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The heart of both hurricane and wildfire season is yet to come.</rdfs:comment>
