	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e36b505-6f19-479a-801a-ef1a09774234">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e36b505-6f19-479a-801a-ef1a09774234</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Democrat from Connecticut, who has spent his decade in the Senate trying and failing to enact gun safety bills, says his party should make the issue the core of its 2022 midterm message.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
