	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e390e38-b3d1-4f21-b553-fd17b5434304">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e390e38-b3d1-4f21-b553-fd17b5434304</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many people who are addicted to drugs “are treated with dignity, respect and support, not brutality,” the lawyers said.</rdfs:comment>
