	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e3d3b5b-ea3e-4e14-8df7-40420caf7959">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e3d3b5b-ea3e-4e14-8df7-40420caf7959</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An unusual collection of lawmakers backed the legislation, which would give Americans some new privacy protections and extend legal authority for some F.B.I. investigative tools.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
