		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e3f41da-8240-49d6-9ae7-bc716fa45f7a">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e3f41da-8240-49d6-9ae7-bc716fa45f7a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A liberal revolt left Democrats short of votes, but leaders insisted they would bring up the measure again on Friday, giving them more time to reach a deal on a separate climate and safety net bill.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e3f865a-65e5-490a-9143-96b4c5283e95">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e3f865a-65e5-490a-9143-96b4c5283e95</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. region includes states with some of the lowest vaccination rates in the country, rivaling the South. Many factors are at work, experts say.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0cc8020e-7db7-428c-8db7-36cf2f5c4168"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e417a8f-a627-49e4-b7ed-f45c93d3160c">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e417a8f-a627-49e4-b7ed-f45c93d3160c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The debate between Vice President Mike Pence and Kamala Harris takes place on Wednesday night from 9 to 10:30 p.m. Eastern. Here are some of the many ways you can watch it:</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e45830c-c658-408e-b45e-07c3691225b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e45830c-c658-408e-b45e-07c3691225b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We’ve put together a selection of titles to take you to new worlds, conjured and remembered, fictional and real.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ec0f6572-4696-4e2e-b261-57f3ee9a323f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-12-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e52cd4a-6f0a-4ed1-be15-9a42071304ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e52cd4a-6f0a-4ed1-be15-9a42071304ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House speaker, 82, was asymptomatic, and had previously been vaccinated and boosted, a spokesman said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e53b08a-8cf3-4f38-ab29-e5cf849397da">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e53b08a-8cf3-4f38-ab29-e5cf849397da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At the same event, Representative Louie Gohmert, a Republican from Texas, repeated a widely debunked claim that right-wing extremists were not solely responsible for the Capitol riot.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e5826b7-fb8f-44e9-8ebe-aefa2366edab">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e5826b7-fb8f-44e9-8ebe-aefa2366edab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Colorado, Georgia, Oklahoma, Michigan and elsewhere, they face the same question: how and when to restart parts of their economies.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-cb5937f2-3b25-42f4-b9a4-e12264df550c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e2a444d6-76b3-4fc5-9655-0178ae16f402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e58f5a7-4434-421c-a08b-e749c363a543">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e58f5a7-4434-421c-a08b-e749c363a543</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thursday: We asked a historian about the Golden State’s role in the nominating process. Also: Coronavirus updates; and an otter rescue.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-14f82d09-3a15-43b0-8f6d-ebdb1405d989"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-738c55e5-1f96-4b93-8c70-fc8c1c8c9119"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e6183f8-9fa3-4eb5-8430-f62990fbaa1b">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e6183f8-9fa3-4eb5-8430-f62990fbaa1b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The State Department says it could take up to eight weeks to process passport applications that have piled up during consular closings caused by the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c98496c4-424c-4532-b534-6bd365299f30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f4f38f08-6492-4112-8b82-52bd8aa6b34f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e620ef0-3dec-4831-ab63-c75f95d39425">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e620ef0-3dec-4831-ab63-c75f95d39425</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a third of the 78 cities examined on the Atlantic and Gulf coasts, half or more of hospitals were at risk from a Category 2 storm, the researchers said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-da49b0de-6030-45c3-821a-423198f95c0f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e631e94-5fbd-44c8-9ff7-db855f4ddad3">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e631e94-5fbd-44c8-9ff7-db855f4ddad3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The pressure on his top administration officials to take action came as President Trump bristled at the restraints of his illness.</rdfs:comment>
