	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e71070e-b994-4ad0-a720-26e1b35f11b0">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e71070e-b994-4ad0-a720-26e1b35f11b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Support in Washington for New York’s governor, Andrew M. Cuomo, is collapsing as allegations against him pile up, with one conspicuous holdout: President Biden, who says he is deferring judgment pending the outcome of a state investigation into the governor’s behavior toward women.</rdfs:comment>
