	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e87ccc8-f648-4ccf-9c74-2f192482cbc5">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e87ccc8-f648-4ccf-9c74-2f192482cbc5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Only two presidents before him have used their first weeks in office to push for equality with the same force, according to one historian.</rdfs:comment>
