		<rdfs:label>article-5e8e5a33-03cf-410b-8eff-d00e25e9c011</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Conservative activists are working to recruit the law enforcement officers to their cause. Several sheriffs have already clashed with election officials.</rdfs:comment>
