	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e909339-c353-4a5f-b3ec-166a412ccab4">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e909339-c353-4a5f-b3ec-166a412ccab4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Every staff member and guest in contact with President Trump and Vice President Mike Pence will still have their temperatures taken, be asked their symptom histories and be tested for the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
