	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e91a828-8c05-4bc4-baaf-c853f47bf159">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e91a828-8c05-4bc4-baaf-c853f47bf159</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An upset victory by the right-wing nationalist Marine Le Pen in the presidential election on Sunday could scramble President Biden’s foreign policy.</rdfs:comment>
