		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5e95e3fc-eeea-44f2-839f-f9dd96b93545">
		<rdfs:label>article-5e95e3fc-eeea-44f2-839f-f9dd96b93545</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an unusual diplomatic moment, President Trump met with both Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu of Israel and his challenger, Benny Gantz, on the eve of releasing a Middle East peace plan.</rdfs:comment>
