		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5eba3f85-eae5-4d03-a71c-d9ce8eb11c62">
		<rdfs:label>article-5eba3f85-eae5-4d03-a71c-d9ce8eb11c62</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Katy, outside Houston, many men have taken up F3, a no-frills fitness group where members push themselves physically but also bond emotionally.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-97ea24f6-851b-466a-9f9f-381ac65ec11e"/>
