	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5ebc36f8-1da4-4977-835e-022f5d34660e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5ebc36f8-1da4-4977-835e-022f5d34660e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Our economics reporter gives a rundown on the real unemployment rate, stimulus checks and inflation.</rdfs:comment>
