		<rdfs:label>article-5f03ded7-a34f-4a45-b466-ea41bf2e2a3d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The congresswoman hasn’t attended Republican Party events in person in her state in years, amid a wave of local conservative hostility. “I’m not going to convince the crazies,” she said.</rdfs:comment>
