	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5f0fafb0-5af2-43f3-8ac8-6e9d96d55911">
		<rdfs:label>article-5f0fafb0-5af2-43f3-8ac8-6e9d96d55911</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He boarded a whites-only train with the hope of undoing racist laws. Instead, his arrest led to a Supreme Court decision that upheld the “separate but equal” doctrine used to justify segregation.</rdfs:comment>
