		<rdfs:label>article-5f149d36-a2fc-4542-a86a-7c5a8090507e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Georgia joins Louisiana as the second state to delay voting because of the coronavirus. Arizona, Florida, Illinois and Ohio are still set to vote on Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
