		<rdfs:label>article-5f192477-aff7-4bd8-9543-20523ceb27f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Allison Fluke-Ekren, a teacher from Kansas, dragged her family to Syria and forced her daughter, Leyla, to train for war on behalf of the Islamic State. Now her daughter wields final words against her.</rdfs:comment>
