		<rdfs:label>article-5f33fca7-5abd-4e29-bb0f-016a34bd5ebe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States is a week away from a Christmas that was supposed to feel far more festive than the last. Two weeks away from a new year in which it was once possible to imagine the pandemic fading into the background of mostly normal life.</rdfs:comment>
