	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5f3fb036-8c66-4554-b556-c25509b1664e">
		<rdfs:label>article-5f3fb036-8c66-4554-b556-c25509b1664e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Carolyn Zain had heard horror stories about the nation’s coronavirus vaccine rollout: long waits, clunky websites, people being turned away. So when her health department announced it was expanding appointments, she armed herself with two phones and held her breath.</rdfs:comment>
