		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-5f44391b-f5ac-47ba-8836-ef020086da71">
		<rdfs:label>article-5f44391b-f5ac-47ba-8836-ef020086da71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House and Senate sergeants-at-arms, who have resigned, now face questions about why they failed to do more to deter the Trump loyalists who swarmed the Capitol last week.</rdfs:comment>
