		<rdfs:label>article-5f49f171-dd1c-4f76-a381-ab5b7f6dca84</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a day that featured a harrowing video of the Jan. 6 assault on the Capitol, only six Republicans joined Democrats in agreeing to allow the trial to proceed, signaling there was not enough support for a conviction.</rdfs:comment>
