		<rdfs:label>article-5fc19313-0903-4944-adfe-258ba5732ffe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge said the Afghan central bank’s assets could not legally be used to pay off judgment debts owed by the Taliban to relatives of victims of the 2001 terrorist attacks.</rdfs:comment>
