		<rdfs:label>article-5fcf3c4c-47aa-4e46-a3c0-4185843d4169</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump administration is encouraging development of a domestic industry to produce critical metals now dominated by Chinese companies, but few players show clear long-term promise.</rdfs:comment>
