		<rdfs:label>article-5fd19096-01e2-43fa-a296-2c2b6ee9959f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president met at the White House with Republican senators seeking a much smaller stimulus plan, but congressional Democrats pressed forward to force through his $1.9 trillion measure, if necessary.</rdfs:comment>
