		<rdfs:label>article-5fd32445-94f0-426b-9942-29be8f3bc8b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a brief to the court, the Biden administration acknowledged that the end of Title 42 would most likely lead to an increase in border crossings.</rdfs:comment>
