		<rdfs:label>article-5fd3f096-35aa-41b5-bb9b-98ab40a9e959</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A training slide show that urged officers to “always fight to the death” is no longer used but has raised an outcry in a state that has struggled with police violence.</rdfs:comment>
