		<rdfs:label>article-5fd7a729-8679-4027-a389-f4ae90dc482a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Across the country, parents have threatened board members and vandalized their homes. One board member scans his driveway before walking to his car.</rdfs:comment>
