		<rdfs:label>article-60310351-4ad2-4cc4-8e98-818423bd3e5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The governor’s race is set, but the two-term attorney general is heading into a runoff. Some House primaries were too close to call. Here’s what we know.</rdfs:comment>
