	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-603a69f7-e1eb-4c88-95b7-2d7e7d80ec25">
		<rdfs:label>article-603a69f7-e1eb-4c88-95b7-2d7e7d80ec25</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state’s daily average of cases has risen more than 200 percent over the past 14 days and hospitalizations are surging, but an executive order ensures that masking and vaccinations remain voluntary.</rdfs:comment>
