		<rdfs:label>article-603d1e1f-af8a-4f91-a0a3-b83ed3db62dd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A father and son were arrested in connection with the Feb. 23 killing of Mr. Arbery, which had led to protests and 2.23-mile runs to show support under the hashtag #IRunWithMaud.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d0804387-7ba1-4df8-b8ae-a8a9c6bfc424"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d7a0b17f-e0aa-44c5-a995-e81e028fa879"/>
