		<rdfs:label>article-6132a4df-41d1-432f-b4b7-952de07ef820</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A century later, it’s past time to recognize the women of color who were sidelined in the fight for gender and racial equality.</rdfs:comment>
