		<rdfs:label>article-6136064f-b04a-4d09-bec6-c320d5be25d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The centrist senator is key to President Biden’s agenda in Washington. Her positions have angered some Democrats back home.</rdfs:comment>
