	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-614117bb-2118-477c-9cf2-89f68524acea">
		<rdfs:label>article-614117bb-2118-477c-9cf2-89f68524acea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Gridiron Club dinner, an annual black-tie roast between journalists and presidential administrations held over the weekend in Washington, quickly devolved from a swampy cross-pollination party into an event where a lot of boldface names appear to have caught the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-07"/>
