		<rdfs:label>article-6141e75f-9fe1-45c3-b4a4-01a3aaab577f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His placement behind his leading rivals in the caucuses on Monday dealt a damaging blow to his campaign. Some party officials say it was a long time in the works.</rdfs:comment>
