		<rdfs:label>article-614342cd-7963-4ff3-8a4e-dd736975e762</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The speaker, busy raising millions, is in no mood to contemplate a Democratic defeat in November, much less discuss her legacy.</rdfs:comment>
