		<rdfs:label>article-6149d8ab-1b06-4e0c-86e4-4c2ca1ad321e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Unexplained “inconsistencies” in results, heated conference calls and firm denials of hacking left the contest in a strange state of almost suspended animation.</rdfs:comment>
