	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-614a0a8c-fa1c-4e2f-8171-ef17f962cea3">
		<rdfs:label>article-614a0a8c-fa1c-4e2f-8171-ef17f962cea3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Mitch McConnell, Republican of Kentucky and the majority leader, challenged Amy McGrath, his Democratic opponent, to a single Lincoln-Douglas-style debate in the coming weeks as he seeks to hold off her attempt to unseat him in one of the most closely watched Senate races this fall.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
