		<rdfs:label>article-614b2d89-7973-4071-887b-e8e1855cfcb9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“To heal we must remember,” Mr. Biden said, standing in front of the Reflecting Pool, which was surrounded by 400 lights meant to mark the 400,000 people who have died from Covid-19.</rdfs:comment>
