		<rdfs:label>article-614dfee5-fded-433d-9faf-5050c7fda3e9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>White House officials, anticipating the approval of coronavirus shots for 5- to 11-year-olds within weeks, will rely on doctors, clinics and pharmacies instead of mass inoculation sites.</rdfs:comment>
