		<rdfs:label>article-614e16f0-5132-4a13-b342-ac0e31e49d4b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Mulvaney, a central figure in the president’s pressure campaign on Ukraine, defied a subpoena to testify in the House impeachment inquiry and was never called by the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
