		<rdfs:label>article-615265ee-ee52-4ef8-8438-f0582c759a27</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Across the country, plunging revenues from canceled nonemergency medical appointments have forced hospitals to furlough or cut the pay of doctors, nurses and other staff.</rdfs:comment>
