	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6165ae1c-656b-4fb0-99c0-547b5eaa1074">
		<rdfs:label>article-6165ae1c-656b-4fb0-99c0-547b5eaa1074</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A large club of Trump administration evictees have turned their bracingly bad experiences into a new genre: political revenge literature.</rdfs:comment>
