		<rdfs:label>article-625a065a-fc2b-4be5-84f0-ab43972a52e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first day of early voting in the runoffs eclipsed the one for the general election, reflecting the interest the campaigns have drawn as Republican control of the Senate hangs in the balance.</rdfs:comment>
