	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-625a4ec6-0f23-4b3c-becf-ff2436925487">
		<rdfs:label>article-625a4ec6-0f23-4b3c-becf-ff2436925487</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Top Democrats and the White House agreed on some proposals for financing their ambitious social safety net plan, but crucial decisions remained about its cost and what would be included.</rdfs:comment>
