		<rdfs:label>article-62962f54-364a-4a9d-8ed7-2f54d0de00d5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $1 trillion infrastructure bill that President Biden signed into law includes money that Amtrak hopes can fix crumbling bridges and tunnels along the Northeast Corridor.</rdfs:comment>
