		<rdfs:label>article-62967881-2cff-426b-b06a-f888fa0711cf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s choice for interior secretary faces her confirmation hearing on Tuesday. Democrats see her as embodying the hopes of the new administration; Republicans object to her activism.</rdfs:comment>
