	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-629784ff-96e2-47f4-87d3-b049aad3c557">
		<rdfs:label>article-629784ff-96e2-47f4-87d3-b049aad3c557</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Greg Abbott of Texas said on Tuesday that he was ending his statewide mask mandate, effective March 10, and that all businesses in the state could then operate with no capacity limits.</rdfs:comment>
