		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-62986926-9857-4ee6-8366-386c4a859c88">
		<rdfs:label>article-62986926-9857-4ee6-8366-386c4a859c88</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president made clear that he intends to approach crime prevention by investing in, rather than defunding, the police as he waded into an urgent national debate over policing.</rdfs:comment>
