	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-63af8c81-856c-4ad8-ab5f-5cf363218ac7">
		<rdfs:label>article-63af8c81-856c-4ad8-ab5f-5cf363218ac7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The materials included some marked as top secret and meant to be viewed only in secure government facilities, according to a copy of the warrant.</rdfs:comment>
