		<rdfs:label>article-63bbab3c-ea23-400a-9f92-22248823d04e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Governors were closing bars — again — in some states as coronavirus clusters emerged. Even federal health officials have pointed to bars as a problem.</rdfs:comment>
