	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-63bc1a9e-ba93-42d0-8a16-d051203791b7">
		<rdfs:label>article-63bc1a9e-ba93-42d0-8a16-d051203791b7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The one-vote margin of passage reflected opposition on the right and left. The measure faces long odds in the Senate, where it is likely to face a filibuster.</rdfs:comment>
