		<rdfs:label>article-63bd1f4d-2e9a-4777-8622-73a81adafa68</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans hit a significant stumbling block in their push to enact some of the strictest voting laws in the nation. But they could yet pass the measures through a special session of the Legislature.</rdfs:comment>
