		<rdfs:label>article-63c79cb5-5557-418f-b2fa-076c0818042d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court shoots down a Republican challenge in Pennsylvania as states pass a critical deadline.</rdfs:comment>
