	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-63c989c7-3242-4d3c-adef-3d3712f6913b">
		<rdfs:label>article-63c989c7-3242-4d3c-adef-3d3712f6913b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While Democrats and Republicans debate whether he should be convicted and removed from office, the president has offered up an alternative menu of events and priorities.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
