		<rdfs:label>article-63d47ec1-cbd1-4ed6-bde9-cf47ae78dc38</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state’s politics have never been as simple as the common narrative conveys. Tuesday’s vote on an abortion amendment is an example of its unpredictability.</rdfs:comment>
