		<rdfs:label>article-641cb087-fa96-4eca-946b-7e1d34af8c70</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Testimony at the seditious conspiracy trial of members of the far-right group demonstrated that they were not deterred by their failure to stop certification of the 2020 election.</rdfs:comment>
