	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-641d3c61-373d-49fe-ad86-31c7f7b2ef49">
		<rdfs:label>article-641d3c61-373d-49fe-ad86-31c7f7b2ef49</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A White House announcement was short on details, and key players have yet to be assigned policy positions in the new administration.</rdfs:comment>
