		<rdfs:label>article-641d4e3a-d16f-4ad0-bebf-293ea42bb2f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The health crisis has left people nationwide wary of physical interaction. But even this week, the Democratic presidential candidates were greeting voters normally, with a few more fist-bumps.</rdfs:comment>
