	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-641eaae0-54f4-4f80-8ab4-3dc665ad13e0">
		<rdfs:label>article-641eaae0-54f4-4f80-8ab4-3dc665ad13e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: The mundane crime of shoplifting has spun out of control in San Francisco, forcing some chain stores to close.</rdfs:comment>
