	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6426c9f7-32f7-405d-bf5d-8119b6838579">
		<rdfs:label>article-6426c9f7-32f7-405d-bf5d-8119b6838579</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and Joe Biden have taken starkly divergent approaches to protests and outbreaks of violence in American cities. Gauging whose messaging is more effective has proved challenging for pollsters.</rdfs:comment>
