	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-64271082-4e16-4b21-87ce-995c758e2cda">
		<rdfs:label>article-64271082-4e16-4b21-87ce-995c758e2cda</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid concerns about Covid, President Biden offered some humor and received his own ribbing at the White House Correspondents’ Dinner, a ritual that had gone on hiatus during the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
