		<rdfs:label>article-6427a2b9-4d18-4f07-9bb0-afef3d547a59</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>All state residents 2 and older will need to wear masks inside. Students and staff at public schools already have to wear masks.</rdfs:comment>
