		<rdfs:label>article-643c62f3-d64b-4a55-8c67-8f1d2281ce0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the deadliest school shooting in a decade, the top Senate Democrat said he would wait to force a vote on gun safety measures the G.O.P. has opposed.</rdfs:comment>
