		<rdfs:label>article-650827fa-3a13-4ac8-966b-345697087347</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Four years ago, the would-be first daughter was seen by some to have the power to persuade moderate women voters and to rein in her own father’s impulses. A lot is different now.</rdfs:comment>
