		<rdfs:label>article-650cc8ad-8533-4efd-ba9a-dc6c46a77c8f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For Black residents of Sumter County, the fight for representation echoed the civil rights era. For white residents, it reflected the anxiety, made manifest by the Trump era, of maintaining power over institutions even without the votes to do so.</rdfs:comment>
