	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-652be2bd-9e76-44cd-90fb-1637ce263ef9">
		<rdfs:label>article-652be2bd-9e76-44cd-90fb-1637ce263ef9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The inaugural of President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. is not the first to take place at a tense moment in American history.</rdfs:comment>
