	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6530e80b-7ea9-4b4a-9148-eaa4f2e3deae">
		<rdfs:label>article-6530e80b-7ea9-4b4a-9148-eaa4f2e3deae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Congressional Budget Office analysis found that the measure would have little effect on inflation this year. Democrats argue the benefits will still be felt.</rdfs:comment>
