	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6531bff3-7678-44e6-a27b-e1559b32bc55">
		<rdfs:label>article-6531bff3-7678-44e6-a27b-e1559b32bc55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even journalists inside NBC and MSNBC were taken aback at the network’s decision to air the event opposite an already scheduled ABC forum with Joe Biden, meaning Americans can’t watch both candidates live.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
