		<rdfs:label>article-6532eb34-e8ec-4fcc-b2c1-7c90e51a1241</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The election was a referendum on Trump’s America, but plenty of Latino voters liked it just fine.</rdfs:comment>
