		<rdfs:label>article-6539b48c-0294-474d-86ec-e130fdbb2e48</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: California currently has no travel restrictions in place. But as cases in the state reached a million, health officials are urging people to travel as little as possible.</rdfs:comment>
