	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-653acf8f-ea6b-4bbc-a386-d56a6a33ff11">
		<rdfs:label>article-653acf8f-ea6b-4bbc-a386-d56a6a33ff11</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican National Convention next week will kick off with an in-person roll call on Monday in Charlotte, N.C.</rdfs:comment>
