	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-65641e84-a101-4f0f-b98e-2fbb37d99d5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-65641e84-a101-4f0f-b98e-2fbb37d99d5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“There is no reason to think that in 30 years much of anything will be as it is today,” one of the editors of a new report on the Arctic climate said.</rdfs:comment>
