		<rdfs:label>article-6568f1c8-5770-4db5-b8d0-036e7ec489a6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an interview with Megyn Kelly, Ms. Reade, who has accused Joseph R. Biden Jr. of sexual assault, said he “should not be running on character.” Mr. Biden has  denied the allegation.</rdfs:comment>
