	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-65773fe1-5404-4354-ae45-2d63ab2a163a">
		<rdfs:label>article-65773fe1-5404-4354-ae45-2d63ab2a163a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Intelligence and defense agencies issued reports warning that the warming planet will increase strife between countries and spur migration.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-20ac5364-1758-414f-ab86-a88673954008"/>
