	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-657b91c9-b72a-4141-be9a-d02ec9fd2f5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-657b91c9-b72a-4141-be9a-d02ec9fd2f5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The pandemic has helped convert more and more voters into early voters, as hundreds of thousands of Virginians have made clear in recent weeks.</rdfs:comment>
