	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6580e0c2-9a37-4fe6-869c-17db6c6623c1">
		<rdfs:label>article-6580e0c2-9a37-4fe6-869c-17db6c6623c1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A top Ukrainian official criticized companies in the United States and Greece for helping Russia continue to profit from oil despite its attack on Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
