		<rdfs:label>article-67a53443-8be7-4c31-a6cc-be4d18e1b809</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A declining birthrate and pandemic deaths helped drive U.S. population growth to historic lows. But immigration appears to be back on the rise.</rdfs:comment>
