		<rdfs:label>article-67a8449e-3bfa-408e-bea3-dc2363178e3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The top White House lawyer is less resistant to President Trump’s whims and wishes than his previous counsel.</rdfs:comment>
