		<rdfs:label>article-682a368a-6f24-4379-ad6b-5f21f2756055</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the first lawsuit of its kind, two real Electoral College delegates from 2020 are seeking damages from 10 fake ones who tried to help Donald Trump overturn his defeat in the state.</rdfs:comment>
