	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6859c779-9cee-48e7-8b5b-9fc7d416dac9">
		<rdfs:label>article-6859c779-9cee-48e7-8b5b-9fc7d416dac9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As President Trump and his allies have sown doubts about Dr. Anthony Fauci, many Republicans have turned against him. But over all, nearly two-thirds of the country expressed faith in Dr. Fauci.</rdfs:comment>
