		<rdfs:label>article-68b59b1e-bb0e-4bb9-91d8-1afde3116dc6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>By a margin of 55 percent to 40 percent, participants in a new poll said they didn’t think Gov. Andrew Cuomo should resign. But by an even wider margin, most said they didn’t want him to run again, either.</rdfs:comment>
