		<rdfs:label>article-695286c8-9040-4be1-88a6-2cee23ff2248</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and his advisers had talked up how they planned to present a sunny, uplifting and optimistic vision of America at this week’s Republican National Convention, but the first day of festivities was filled with brooding warnings of a dark Democratic future.</rdfs:comment>
