		<rdfs:label>article-69638fe1-cde2-40ed-a484-fb309e3e82a6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The town of Palm Beach, Fla.,  imposed a 1 a.m. curfew, limiting New Year’s Eve festivities.</rdfs:comment>
