	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-69b92187-1c37-44cb-ad0c-ea21ff109cff">
		<rdfs:label>article-69b92187-1c37-44cb-ad0c-ea21ff109cff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Kamala Harris is the first woman of color on a major party ticket. For the women who helped get her here, the moment is joyful, and worrisome.</rdfs:comment>
