		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-69bcc58f-c15e-4701-b348-eaee0876e686">
		<rdfs:label>article-69bcc58f-c15e-4701-b348-eaee0876e686</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the midterms come to a close, the establishment politics of the two most recent Democratic presidents met the disruptive force of the last Republican one, with control of Congress at stake.</rdfs:comment>
