		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-69c58531-cdd9-4e64-be71-e2083222d349">
		<rdfs:label>article-69c58531-cdd9-4e64-be71-e2083222d349</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the deadly collapse of Champlain Towers South, local residents and volunteers mobilized to ensure that Jewish burial customs were maintained for all who wanted them.</rdfs:comment>
