	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6a83d3ec-599f-47a9-9ee6-8b1cef46cef6">
		<rdfs:label>article-6a83d3ec-599f-47a9-9ee6-8b1cef46cef6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Public transit offers a simple way for cities to lower greenhouse gas emissions, but the pandemic has pushed ridership, and revenue, off a cliff in many big systems.</rdfs:comment>
