	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6a8d1dba-c182-4979-ac18-7a5488164189">
		<rdfs:label>article-6a8d1dba-c182-4979-ac18-7a5488164189</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Opening the borders with Mexico and Canada, where crossing for nonessential travel has been barred for 19 months, will reconnect neighbors and provide a reprieve for businesses.</rdfs:comment>
