	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6a8eff66-20bb-4e34-964d-ccb51b937810">
		<rdfs:label>article-6a8eff66-20bb-4e34-964d-ccb51b937810</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Tim Scott of South Carolina delivered the Republican Party’s rebuttal to President Biden’s address to a joint session of Congress.</rdfs:comment>
