	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6a8f3975-c59c-4d53-b90b-bad8e412a5b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-6a8f3975-c59c-4d53-b90b-bad8e412a5b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Only two in five federal inmates have gotten at least one shot so far, compared with three-fifths of adults nationwide. Despite the elevated risk behind bars, mistrust and refusal rates run high.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-14927191-e041-48b1-8c30-a344ddfd6a40"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-33709db8-2f1b-4de8-b586-0d050bd917df"/>
