	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6a9629bf-a502-45a1-bb5c-3c044b1479d4">
		<rdfs:label>article-6a9629bf-a502-45a1-bb5c-3c044b1479d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the United States preparing to withdraw forces from Afghanistan, a Times reporter who has covered the naval base in Cuba reflects on those original prisoners.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4bd6cfaa-ebec-415a-8c53-2870f770bfa7"/>
