	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6a99d8df-f0b4-47d0-8a15-a9330aaedfc0">
		<rdfs:label>article-6a99d8df-f0b4-47d0-8a15-a9330aaedfc0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The trial of five men accused of plotting the attacks had been scheduled for early next year — almost 20 years after the hijackings. Now even that schedule won’t be met. Here are the reasons.</rdfs:comment>
