		<rdfs:label>article-6a9d7872-e8ca-4f1d-9de6-8980f9db4127</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“We need to be united,” said the Republican leader Kevin McCarthy, who worked behind the scenes for days on behalf of Representative Elise Stefanik of New York.</rdfs:comment>
