		<rdfs:label>article-6aa360ee-5239-43be-91e0-2597a01c3521</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Virginia Thomas, a conservative legal activist and the wife of Justice Clarence Thomas, has expressed regret over her role in discord among Justice Thomas’s former law clerks because of her support for President Donald J. Trump and the Jan. 6 rally that preceded the storming of the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
