	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6aa47eea-ac07-45db-92ce-ebb29b59b0b5">
		<rdfs:label>article-6aa47eea-ac07-45db-92ce-ebb29b59b0b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a letter to the lawyers of the women who have sued the F.B.I., the bureau said it was “interested in considering all options to reach a resolution, including settlement discussions.”</rdfs:comment>
