	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6aa6831a-3e1c-4afa-9740-8e7050e843e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-6aa6831a-3e1c-4afa-9740-8e7050e843e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The International Energy Agency said countries should encourage use of mass transit and car pooling, among other things. That could also help the climate crisis.</rdfs:comment>
