	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6aab9b41-0540-448c-b07f-543c57dbf26a">
		<rdfs:label>article-6aab9b41-0540-448c-b07f-543c57dbf26a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While legislation in Washington remains stalled, state and local governments are breathing new life into the reparations movement.</rdfs:comment>
