	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6aaba405-0398-4b49-b51c-7a9686d67170">
		<rdfs:label>article-6aaba405-0398-4b49-b51c-7a9686d67170</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president is focused on veterans who fell ill after breathing in toxic materials from burning waste in Iraq and Afghanistan, exposure that he believes contributed to the death of his elder son.</rdfs:comment>
