	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6aad6187-bda9-427b-99d9-34c3b769861f">
		<rdfs:label>article-6aad6187-bda9-427b-99d9-34c3b769861f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the pandemic stretches on, consumers and businesses could run short of some products in months to come.</rdfs:comment>
