	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6ab787a8-be7b-42c8-8127-257be2729fc5">
		<rdfs:label>article-6ab787a8-be7b-42c8-8127-257be2729fc5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden and Senator Shelley Moore Capito, the top Republican negotiator, had no breakthroughs. But they agreed to speak again on Friday.</rdfs:comment>
