		<rdfs:label>article-6ab859e1-daa8-4721-9358-6d3c13aa151c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Earlier on Monday, Bernie Sanders had denied making the remark in a private 2018 meeting with Elizabeth Warren, accusing her campaign staff of “lying about what happened.”</rdfs:comment>
