	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6ab971aa-02df-4a75-a267-ab5ed7605067">
		<rdfs:label>article-6ab971aa-02df-4a75-a267-ab5ed7605067</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The metal detectors were at the center of Tuesday’s testimony in which Trump ordered the so-called mags to be removed so that the Jan. 6 protesters could have full access at the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f871da67-29ee-4722-8987-62ac8c58b5de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-29"/>
