	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6abb1a20-de7d-48f6-9ac9-0600d9db752b">
		<rdfs:label>article-6abb1a20-de7d-48f6-9ac9-0600d9db752b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a meeting last year, industry leaders contradicted public claims that emissions of climate-warming methane are under control</rdfs:comment>
