		<rdfs:label>article-6b3ade5c-f5dd-4e74-873d-daf49831d925</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Plywood is everywhere. The National Guard is on notice. University students are told to stockpile food and supplies.</rdfs:comment>
