		<rdfs:label>article-6b6ffa10-44d2-4017-a3fb-5f4516acea46</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Education Secretary Betsy DeVos’s contentious regulations on sexual misconduct at schools will cement domestic and dating violence and stalking as forms of gender discrimination.</rdfs:comment>
