		<rdfs:label>article-6b726ef1-97a1-4c00-a1eb-b2fee0009cbb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Students and faculty are furious that the Rev. John I. Jenkins failed to wear a mask at a White House ceremony and then later tested positive for the virus.</rdfs:comment>
