	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6b74b303-36d5-4c59-ae97-1d25de2d5edc">
		<rdfs:label>article-6b74b303-36d5-4c59-ae97-1d25de2d5edc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are four key ingredients to the disastrous wildfire seasons in the West, and climate change is a key culprit.</rdfs:comment>
