	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6b759088-bee4-4495-9e27-c7bca970f3cf">
		<rdfs:label>article-6b759088-bee4-4495-9e27-c7bca970f3cf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two days after the Category 4 storm tore through the state, officials urged those who had evacuated not to return, citing interruptions in basic services like power, water and sewerage.</rdfs:comment>
