	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6b76f593-8569-40b6-947c-f3303d45ed8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-6b76f593-8569-40b6-947c-f3303d45ed8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move to exclude the institutions from state business is part of a growing effort by Republican officials to shut out companies that are backing away from fossil fuels.</rdfs:comment>
