	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6b796908-d9fe-49a8-83b9-6fdab71a9369">
		<rdfs:label>article-6b796908-d9fe-49a8-83b9-6fdab71a9369</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $1.7 trillion measure includes more money for the military and law enforcement, along with an overhaul of how Congress counts electoral votes in presidential elections.</rdfs:comment>
