		<rdfs:label>article-6b7b8725-c8ed-452b-8355-31278ceeba36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A bipartisan letter took issue with guidance about a tax credit for retaining workers during the pandemic that was part of an economic rescue package.</rdfs:comment>
