		<rdfs:label>article-6b82a4d6-3d4a-4fc9-a3fc-1e2810e04b84</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Noah Green, the knife-wielding man killed after ramming his car into a checkpoint at the U.S. Capitol on Friday, was a troubled former college athlete whose life was disintegrating in the months leading up to a violent outburst that left one officer dead and another injured.</rdfs:comment>
