		<rdfs:label>article-6b82c955-907f-4c5a-aa49-fd131c218eb8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The push comes amid new revelations about the extent of abuse of women, and the unwillingness of many prison officials to address a crisis that has long been an open secret in government.</rdfs:comment>
