		<rdfs:label>article-6b839dfa-4229-404b-8bf5-9ff73c364953</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The federal government’s system of directing medical supplies for the hardest-hit regions has left areas out of the spotlight scrambling to prepare as the outbreak spreads.</rdfs:comment>
