		<rdfs:label>article-6bd312e4-1bc2-4402-b835-c7252e1e281d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Global restrictions on sending advanced technology to Russia are hampering the country’s military capacity, U.S. officials say, though Russia has stockpiled American equipment for years.</rdfs:comment>
