		<rdfs:label>article-6c29ad6b-fe16-48ca-a75f-7f5bfcd7fa6e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Forecasters predict blizzards in the Midwest. Freezing temperatures in the South. Flooding and power outages in the Northeast. And maybe tornadoes in Florida.</rdfs:comment>
