		<rdfs:comment>A fundamental trust has been broken, according to many European diplomats, and experts believe that U.S. foreign policy is no longer bipartisan, so is no longer reliable.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-79c2c4e0-5cef-490b-bc75-d2f869534716"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-22"/>
