	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6d1a30e9-9906-44b7-8700-3d717d4086c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-6d1a30e9-9906-44b7-8700-3d717d4086c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the absence of national climate measures in the United States, how much can be done at the local level? Our reporters talk about the opportunities and barriers.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ec0f6572-4696-4e2e-b261-57f3ee9a323f"/>
