	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6d269fb3-ec10-4120-a5c7-e54cff869e79">
		<rdfs:label>article-6d269fb3-ec10-4120-a5c7-e54cff869e79</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>City Council members, the outgoing mayor, both candidates to replace him, state party officials and others have said the people heard in the recording should step down.</rdfs:comment>
