		<rdfs:label>article-6d26cc7f-53c9-4c71-8717-0177be5468e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Harris entered the administration with many new employees. Many of those officials came in with an understanding that they would stay only on a short-term basis.</rdfs:comment>
