		<rdfs:label>article-6d2ee30b-8e27-47ff-883c-15f0211efe9f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The fuel pellet industry is thriving. Supporters see it as a climate-friendly source of rural jobs. For others, it’s a polluter and destroyer of nature.</rdfs:comment>
