	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6d33f9b0-7e82-4068-80c6-d86ea2860902">
		<rdfs:label>article-6d33f9b0-7e82-4068-80c6-d86ea2860902</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Not a single Democrat running for Congress received an A in the group’s candidate ratings, which were once a powerful influence in U.S. elections.</rdfs:comment>
