		<rdfs:label>article-6daa71ed-21fe-402b-a7ca-0c6c4b7796ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A bipartisan group led by two former governors is urging President Biden to help an estimated 167,000 children who have lost parents or caregivers.</rdfs:comment>
