	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6db67fd5-e09e-45e2-92db-d7ea4da4434e">
		<rdfs:label>article-6db67fd5-e09e-45e2-92db-d7ea4da4434e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With violent crime rates rising and elections looming, progressive prosecutors are facing resistance to their plans to roll back stricter crime policies of the 1990s.</rdfs:comment>
