	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6db69052-76ec-4dd3-b0a7-ac7f8d8190b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-6db69052-76ec-4dd3-b0a7-ac7f8d8190b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The negotiations have entered that most excruciating of phases: tantalizingly close to an agreement, but with none in hand. And patience is wearing thin.</rdfs:comment>
