		<rdfs:label>article-6db8f0ce-0c29-4e1a-b39c-bfbfd0ea5b53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Texas has refused to join interstate electrical grids and railed against energy regulation. Now it’s having to answer to millions of residents who were left without power in last week’s snowstorm.</rdfs:comment>
