		<rdfs:label>article-6f125759-cd0f-456d-91dd-385b79a9fb04</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many Republicans worry that Greitens, who has a history of personal scandals, could jeopardize what is most likely a safe G.O.P. seat. Now efforts to block him are gaining steam.</rdfs:comment>
