	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6f27909c-9d4f-47ad-a118-9f0976984e34">
		<rdfs:label>article-6f27909c-9d4f-47ad-a118-9f0976984e34</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration is seeking help in urging Republicans to get inoculated. But the president said he was not sure how much value there was in enlisting his predecessor.</rdfs:comment>
