	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6f2ab534-f447-46a0-b2b4-38722ce626f3">
		<rdfs:label>article-6f2ab534-f447-46a0-b2b4-38722ce626f3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The governor’s races in Virginia and New Jersey and the New York City mayoral election are among the highlights.</rdfs:comment>
