	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6f2c3d83-6cc9-4a8b-9b95-5aeb37737f91">
		<rdfs:label>article-6f2c3d83-6cc9-4a8b-9b95-5aeb37737f91</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Twin government memos show how a gung-ho federal law enforcement response to anti-racism protests may have been driven by a shaky understanding of the demonstrations’ roots.</rdfs:comment>
