	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6f2e63df-acd1-4665-ac58-e3c84d0bfb4d">
		<rdfs:label>article-6f2e63df-acd1-4665-ac58-e3c84d0bfb4d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision will affect tens of thousands of cases moving through backlogged immigration courts.</rdfs:comment>
