		<rdfs:label>article-6f8de78d-fe39-4281-b1e0-806055a7186a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even though most people don’t name the coronavirus as their top voting issue, President Trump’s response to the outbreak, and how it’s perceived, will probably swing the election.</rdfs:comment>
