		<rdfs:label>article-6f910258-e929-402a-98e3-0c4c0ad8bdbe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Lindsey C. Thomas said Mr. Floyd died of a lack of oxygen and that there was “no evidence” he would have died that day if he had not been pressed to the ground by police officers.</rdfs:comment>
