	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6f92b452-0d15-4b9a-85cd-2043976a296b">
		<rdfs:label>article-6f92b452-0d15-4b9a-85cd-2043976a296b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the days after the Capitol riot on Jan. 6, Elizabeth MacDonough donned a hazmat suit and returned to her ransacked office on the building’s first floor, grabbing what materials she would need to continue working with her staff elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
