		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6f934665-1a5c-43c4-818f-f774f9195841">
		<rdfs:label>article-6f934665-1a5c-43c4-818f-f774f9195841</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Election results in San Francisco and Los Angeles were the latest signs of a restless Democratic electorate that remains deeply unsatisfied and concerned about public safety.</rdfs:comment>
