	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6fc56f09-f88f-42c1-b91b-8c7d599b6609">
		<rdfs:label>article-6fc56f09-f88f-42c1-b91b-8c7d599b6609</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than half of mass shootings in recent years involve a perpetrator who killed an intimate partner or family member, including the gunman who killed six people in Colorado Springs.</rdfs:comment>
