		<rdfs:label>article-6fc86574-fc63-4f37-81d9-19cf0c90e6d1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Georgia is still caught up in a political riptide, less than a week after Major League Baseball pulled its summer All-Star game out of suburban Atlanta in a rebuke to the state’s new election rules that restrict access to voting.</rdfs:comment>
