	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6fe6c15e-1b14-426e-b0f5-53ebb2589a42">
		<rdfs:label>article-6fe6c15e-1b14-426e-b0f5-53ebb2589a42</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The order was based on the imminence of runoff elections scheduled for July 13 and was not a ruling on the merits of the case.</rdfs:comment>
