		<rdfs:label>article-6fe784e5-59ea-4a1f-87c8-1abdd468455e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid concerns about a coronavirus surge in Beijing, the Biden administration announced the change in policy for those entering the United States from China, including Hong Kong and Macau.</rdfs:comment>
