		<rdfs:label>article-6fe913bb-8aed-4515-81e0-37ac864730c3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gun shops and ammunition dealers say they’ve seen a surge in purchases, particularly from first-time buyers.</rdfs:comment>
