		<rdfs:label>article-6ff18951-950e-4515-9f85-cff3b4806b26</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration will spend billions of dollars on a new plan to combat the pandemic, investing in antiviral pills, rapid tests and manufacturing.</rdfs:comment>
