	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6ff24a11-63e4-4152-b3fe-269329c4447e">
		<rdfs:label>article-6ff24a11-63e4-4152-b3fe-269329c4447e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His victory in the Georgia Senate runoff made history, and also echoed it.</rdfs:comment>
