	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6ff3591d-4bcc-4ee2-b03a-027a2099a7a5">
		<rdfs:label>article-6ff3591d-4bcc-4ee2-b03a-027a2099a7a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Michael Pack, the chief executive of the U.S. Agency for Global Media, and his aides repeatedly meddled in the editorial affairs of Voice of America, the suit says.</rdfs:comment>
