		<rdfs:label>article-6ff5539b-09b0-4030-b289-9f39c14378c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Bidens’ two German shepherds officially joined the president and first lady, ending a petless four years in the White House.</rdfs:comment>
