	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6ff6578a-bf4c-4a64-a6ab-fe639c7d522a">
		<rdfs:label>article-6ff6578a-bf4c-4a64-a6ab-fe639c7d522a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The justices return to the bench on Monday to start a term that will include major cases on affirmative action, voting and discrimination against gay couples. Several will take on questions about race.</rdfs:comment>
