	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-6ffd08b9-0354-4d5d-b9e0-cf889df06c36">
		<rdfs:label>article-6ffd08b9-0354-4d5d-b9e0-cf889df06c36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Alex Kueng is one of four former officers accused of crimes in the killing of Mr. Floyd, which happened on his third shift. His decision to join the force had frayed friendships.</rdfs:comment>
