	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7005e3eb-2d58-42af-8cfc-67af48641a4b">
		<rdfs:label>article-7005e3eb-2d58-42af-8cfc-67af48641a4b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president-elect will have to assure American national security in ways that will require pushing back on the Kremlin at times and, at others, seeking Russian cooperation.</rdfs:comment>
