	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7005eab8-a2c6-40f7-9a53-9e48a75e209d">
		<rdfs:label>article-7005eab8-a2c6-40f7-9a53-9e48a75e209d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The disputes are reminiscent of the fight surrounding the creation of the independent commission that conducted an inquiry into the Sept. 11, 2001, attacks.</rdfs:comment>
