	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7007ca27-cceb-44cb-8f68-e318abcf6e7a">
		<rdfs:label>article-7007ca27-cceb-44cb-8f68-e318abcf6e7a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the usual pomp and circumstance put on hold, Ms. Winfrey and scores of celebrities feted graduates with a virtual celebration on Facebook.</rdfs:comment>
