	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7090982f-47eb-450a-8874-0b0c55bd88fc">
		<rdfs:label>article-7090982f-47eb-450a-8874-0b0c55bd88fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Total coronavirus cases in the U.S. surpassed 10 million on Sunday. Experts say the virus is spreading out of control and could grow worse before President-elect Biden takes office.</rdfs:comment>
