		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-709a89f3-2a89-49f9-b688-eb7cf2b22f44">
		<rdfs:label>article-709a89f3-2a89-49f9-b688-eb7cf2b22f44</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The affidavit in support of the warrant explains why prosecutors believed there was probable cause that evidence of a crime could found be at the Florida estate.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-90788841-2a13-4598-abd3-3b677caff4d4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70a4b4e2-d435-4289-96c2-2d52ac8a56ad">
		<rdfs:label>article-70a4b4e2-d435-4289-96c2-2d52ac8a56ad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In closing arguments at the Varsity Blues trial, prosecutors focused on bribes, but the ways in which universities cater to rich families are also on trial.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4f1bc425-040c-4850-aa28-f277207d36bf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-06"/>
