	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70af44b7-79a3-4f06-aa80-83804a1fc350">
		<rdfs:label>article-70af44b7-79a3-4f06-aa80-83804a1fc350</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The groundwork was laid long ago for the Texas anti-abortion law that the Supreme Court allowed to go into effect.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70b405d1-697a-4100-9ed0-7b345507f454">
		<rdfs:label>article-70b405d1-697a-4100-9ed0-7b345507f454</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Health officials are studying the durability of the vaccine in different groups, he said, and “we will be prepared to give boosters” if the vaccines’ protection ebbs.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-cc485407-61fb-4f46-96a9-c260884f0314"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70bc64b7-ff3f-45c4-ad5f-d35a87452244">
		<rdfs:label>article-70bc64b7-ff3f-45c4-ad5f-d35a87452244</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move is part of a long-anticipated effort by the Biden administration to overhaul the underfunded, scandal-plagued Federal Bureau of Prisons.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
