		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70c3c7a5-2c08-4d07-9d82-2bab3116b07c">
		<rdfs:label>article-70c3c7a5-2c08-4d07-9d82-2bab3116b07c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Investigators are searching for a motive, with officials grappling with whether the bombing meets the legal definition of terrorism. A recorded message from a parked R.V. said “evacuate now.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-edd059c5-3ec4-4bec-b45e-ca6834a9e51c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f6d26132-5cee-4c7c-9a06-3bb1c14ce8ca"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70c46cc1-bb0f-4592-af34-3190f1d506e2">
		<rdfs:label>article-70c46cc1-bb0f-4592-af34-3190f1d506e2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The June 7 election will provide a window into the views of Californians on how to best tackle homelessness, crime and more.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e5cee4f-82a8-44a6-9cc0-9285f4da7bf4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70c833f3-16b3-44a8-a556-882d58647fed">
		<rdfs:label>article-70c833f3-16b3-44a8-a556-882d58647fed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrat Raphael Warnock, running for the U.S. Senate and headed to a January runoff against Republican Kelly Loeffler in Georgia, is bracing himself for an onslaught of attack ads — by preemptively releasing a video in which he eats pizza with a knife and pretends to hate puppies.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70c9a023-e9a7-4475-bae9-2ec9e4a07e9c">
		<rdfs:label>article-70c9a023-e9a7-4475-bae9-2ec9e4a07e9c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The organization, called 1st Amendment Praetorian, is not as well known as the Oath Keepers or the Proud Boys, but it worked closely with pro-Trump forces in the months after the 2020 election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-90788841-2a13-4598-abd3-3b677caff4d4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70cbb1dc-4760-4106-b0a6-1840a7cb3b71">
		<rdfs:label>article-70cbb1dc-4760-4106-b0a6-1840a7cb3b71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Candidates and political parties are struggling to plan for a fall campaign without some of the most basic building blocks of politics.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0b1c0734-81f6-4bd6-ab6e-2c3d3239bc31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70d04f33-fc09-40d9-8cd2-4245a94252ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-70d04f33-fc09-40d9-8cd2-4245a94252ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Willy Joseph Cancel Jr., 22, died in combat earlier this week, according to his uncle. He is believed to be the first American killed while fighting in Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-524922c4-c335-4218-b145-d4752931be34"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fd9f1ad4-cd49-4185-a0bb-a129097c5a29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70d1b2e2-1e00-4088-89ee-a6e63c134bb7">
		<rdfs:label>article-70d1b2e2-1e00-4088-89ee-a6e63c134bb7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The conditions seemed ripe for Republicans to make big midterm pickups. Voters had other ideas.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70d4f6fe-a1fe-409a-8c86-25674d43d91a">
		<rdfs:label>article-70d4f6fe-a1fe-409a-8c86-25674d43d91a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the C.D.C. advised masking indoors in areas with high rates of Covid-19, some locales went back under mask mandates. But there was also defiance and hostility.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70d7d917-bcaa-4b7a-a1a8-6c16ed287e0d">
		<rdfs:label>article-70d7d917-bcaa-4b7a-a1a8-6c16ed287e0d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Only about 15 million doses of the new shots have been administered so far, and many Americans appear to be unaware of or simply uninterested in them.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e4ac7a5-be1a-4937-b91e-66276e5f8dd9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70d7f5ee-0228-4939-b655-4621703a5e1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-70d7f5ee-0228-4939-b655-4621703a5e1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A holiday that once commemorated Robert E. Lee’s birthday is cited as a reason for barring early voting two Saturdays before Election Day.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a0f415ea-f8d1-4b12-b0c0-6cb1a91c315d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4bd1aa5-c807-421e-b8ae-1b3824d70300"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70d870b1-7f55-4b6f-b709-30dadef81d0a">
		<rdfs:label>article-70d870b1-7f55-4b6f-b709-30dadef81d0a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Faced with a surging pandemic, resistance from local officials in Florida and deadlines for items like hotel payments, Mr. Trump chose to cancel the convention in an effort to cast himself as putting safety first.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
