	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70dcdf20-0630-4156-9290-fa90caf18d95">
		<rdfs:label>article-70dcdf20-0630-4156-9290-fa90caf18d95</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Ken Starr’s successor, Mr. Ray ended up striking a deal that prevented Mr. Clinton from being prosecuted.</rdfs:comment>
