	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70e6a8c3-0c69-4551-8f31-9445a1ad3f80">
		<rdfs:label>article-70e6a8c3-0c69-4551-8f31-9445a1ad3f80</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Experts call it a circus. Polls say it will hurt the G.O.P. in 2022. But Republicans are on board in Arizona and elsewhere, despite warnings of lasting damage to the political system.</rdfs:comment>
