	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70e6d675-da85-4f68-9067-6800840fc07f">
		<rdfs:label>article-70e6d675-da85-4f68-9067-6800840fc07f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Sekulow, who will co-lead the president’s impeachment defense team, has stayed on as Mr. Trump’s personal lawyer while others have left their posts.</rdfs:comment>
