	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70e7feda-f721-4eeb-ade8-b4bff3afeaec">
		<rdfs:label>article-70e7feda-f721-4eeb-ade8-b4bff3afeaec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A CNN survey found recently that only 45 percent of House Republicans were willing to disclose that they had been vaccinated against the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
