	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70e98412-5b9a-44df-b377-777bc8cb96b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-70e98412-5b9a-44df-b377-777bc8cb96b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The process is expected to take weeks. Jurors will then sit through a lengthy trial to determine if the gunman should be sentenced to death or life in prison.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
