	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70f16b3d-537d-4119-9c62-fae9d0a95c08">
		<rdfs:label>article-70f16b3d-537d-4119-9c62-fae9d0a95c08</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The slugfest for the Republican nomination for Ohio’s open Senate seat has buried the brand of good-natured, country-club conservatism that was once a hallmark of the state.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
