	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-70facc24-604e-4620-93a3-13fb0bb83aa7">
		<rdfs:label>article-70facc24-604e-4620-93a3-13fb0bb83aa7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Recently leaked audio of Latino leaders exposed their ambition to gain power. But loyalties don’t always follow racial lines in the city’s most Latino district.</rdfs:comment>
