		<rdfs:label>article-70fb5167-fd6d-48cb-89e0-90b65c582778</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The incoming administration will select Gina M. Raimondo, a moderate Democrat, to guide a sprawling department critical to business and technology.</rdfs:comment>
