		<rdfs:label>article-710cc008-6719-4107-be7b-6eb723a0c757</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the nation ages, immigration emerges as a key driver of population growth. And Texas and Florida continue to gain residents, while New York and California continue to lose them.</rdfs:comment>
