		<rdfs:label>article-71121ae8-690d-4cbd-8d3e-6e2668787b94</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move brings to nine the total number of Chinese state-run news organizations that the State Department has designated with that label. China will most likely retaliate.</rdfs:comment>
