		<rdfs:label>article-7117f70b-4d2b-4cd0-8ff5-a11772c61406</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But another group opposes it. A court has not yet decided whether $3.5 billion in Afghan central bank funds can be used to pay Taliban debts.</rdfs:comment>
