		<rdfs:label>article-7118d0d9-2915-48cf-a790-2015bbdb8cd7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Federal agents are venturing blocks from the buildings they were sent to protect. Oregon officials say they are illegally taking on the role of riot police.</rdfs:comment>
