	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7217f90e-6d76-4de0-b6b2-1af938d8ac9c">
		<rdfs:label>article-7217f90e-6d76-4de0-b6b2-1af938d8ac9c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats hope meeting the nominee will persuade some Republicans senators to support her historic nomination to the Supreme Court.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0e84c75e-7bc1-4744-83f1-7496fcf4721d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7218422c-d5e5-461a-aa67-d48114c1dcb1">
		<rdfs:label>article-7218422c-d5e5-461a-aa67-d48114c1dcb1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After 147 people tested positive for the coronavirus, Notre Dame said it would shift to remote instruction for at least two weeks. Michigan State told undergraduates not to come to campus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c27717ae-a4a7-43e2-a892-7d5659d97cf6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-72186832-2576-485e-ba3b-c0be848907a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-72186832-2576-485e-ba3b-c0be848907a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden is spending less time hailing the virtues of unity and more time calling out Republicans and dangers to democracy.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-721a9086-1d92-4157-8669-0dec013728fd">
		<rdfs:label>article-721a9086-1d92-4157-8669-0dec013728fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president spoke amid his struggle to pass a bill that would give $10 billion to colleges and universities that historically serve Black, tribal and other minority students.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-12-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-721ff155-1fbf-41c8-9379-dd83b5789255">
		<rdfs:label>article-721ff155-1fbf-41c8-9379-dd83b5789255</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“While this campaign is coming to an end, our movement is not,” Mr. Sanders said in a video address on Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e99dcff-b565-458e-b08f-ae5cce9b25f2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-72232f18-33e7-4006-9389-24ed66735703">
		<rdfs:label>article-72232f18-33e7-4006-9389-24ed66735703</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Police officers and sheriff’s deputies in Graham, N.C., deployed a chemical spray and arrested eight people at a get-out-the-vote march and rally on Saturday, according to the police and participants.</rdfs:comment>
