	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-727fcc3c-cb46-498d-869d-22e81d2b20fc">
		<rdfs:label>article-727fcc3c-cb46-498d-869d-22e81d2b20fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The exit of Brian Hook, the State Department’s special envoy for Iran, most likely rules out nuclear diplomacy with Tehran before November.</rdfs:comment>
