	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-72a4221f-e3ba-4ad8-9850-4e1079ab0845">
		<rdfs:label>article-72a4221f-e3ba-4ad8-9850-4e1079ab0845</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Luke Ball had worked with Mr. Gaetz since he first began serving in the House in 2017, earning a reputation as one of the congressman’s closest aides.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-02"/>
