	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-72ba04eb-269a-4aae-95c4-940d86d4c8ea">
		<rdfs:label>article-72ba04eb-269a-4aae-95c4-940d86d4c8ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Following the president on weekends can be dull. But it’s an important assignment with interesting moments — if you are patient.</rdfs:comment>
