		<rdfs:label>article-72bd7119-b714-4869-a841-aa9db611d07b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Smith will take on the role of special counsel after leaving his current position as a specialist prosecutor based in The Hague investigating war crimes.</rdfs:comment>
