	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-72c0ccea-1dde-42f7-b62f-239e088d67f9">
		<rdfs:label>article-72c0ccea-1dde-42f7-b62f-239e088d67f9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a striking reversal, federal regulators said that they would wait for data on whether three doses of Pfizer-BioNTech’s vaccine are effective in children younger than 5.</rdfs:comment>
