		<rdfs:label>article-72cebd2a-964b-4707-a934-f5a8c0c6e4ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The secretary of state’s decision most likely ends Republicans’ hopes of securing a potentially dominant candidate for the open seat in Kansas, his home state.</rdfs:comment>
