		<rdfs:label>article-72d2ce8d-81c4-4da5-80dc-6cd9788c8cec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A mother and child were killed by a falling tree in Montgomery County, Ala. The storm system was expected to weaken as it moved into the Northeast on Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
