		<rdfs:label>article-72d309f3-7864-4558-ab31-9999ff4e1eb2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Here’s the who, what, when and where for the three matchups between President Trump and Joe Biden and the single vice-presidential debate.</rdfs:comment>
