		<rdfs:label>article-72e3e31d-cb75-4b20-b7cf-34afdf5ca253</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Greene’s victory came as six states were holding elections on Tuesday, with Ilhan Omar holding off a well-funded primary challenge in Minnesota.</rdfs:comment>
