		<rdfs:label>article-72e86d14-62ec-45c0-9e1a-ed2afcb687fe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thousands of Puerto Ricans slept outside, fearing new tremors, after the 6.4-magnitude earthquake that struck the island Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
