		<rdfs:label>article-72f8f982-0161-498e-b597-29cdfed0a4cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Earlier this week, Mr. Barrack was released on $250 million bond and ordered to wear a GPS location-monitoring bracelet at all times, according to a Justice Department spokesman.</rdfs:comment>
