		<rdfs:label>article-72f97d1c-c65a-4033-b4a9-a444c847ba00</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state education agency said in new guidance that it would immediately stop enforcing the ban on mask mandates until litigations were resolved.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9a20475f-2183-48a8-95ff-32ec3af0ee12"/>
