	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-72fd141a-5c9a-4ff2-944b-accfe987beb2">
		<rdfs:label>article-72fd141a-5c9a-4ff2-944b-accfe987beb2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His parents are charged with involuntary manslaughter in the shooting last year at a high school in Oxford, Mich., that killed four teenagers.</rdfs:comment>
