		<rdfs:label>article-732f8f56-cfd7-4c68-bbe5-5ef7a56da23a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fear of the coronavirus is speeding up efforts to allow voting from home, but some of them pose security risks and may make it easier for Vladimir V. Putin, or others, to hack the vote.</rdfs:comment>
