		<rdfs:label>article-73a0d571-1f67-4577-81bd-b32feebc36f3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Gail Newel has taken the heat as Santa Cruz went from being one of the safest coastal counties in the state to the site of a recent surge.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-06a105bb-d6dc-4509-91e2-800e07c38423"/>
