		<rdfs:label>article-73a2291c-4f3a-49d6-95e1-28b67171f475</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former Navy intelligence analyst served 30 years in prison for stealing American secrets during the Cold War.</rdfs:comment>
