	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-73a50a17-bb58-415c-849f-a18c224fa88f">
		<rdfs:label>article-73a50a17-bb58-415c-849f-a18c224fa88f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Forests absorb and store planet-warming carbon dioxide. They are also extremely vulnerable in the era of climate change. Europe is a case in point.</rdfs:comment>
