	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-73a906ca-0bac-4240-832f-366327a41e00">
		<rdfs:label>article-73a906ca-0bac-4240-832f-366327a41e00</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The support of Senator Lisa Murkowski of Alaska, a key Republican from an oil-producing state, virtually ensures Ms. Haaland’s confirmation by the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
