	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-73ab17ff-3529-44ed-968e-5fd5d033cfd3">
		<rdfs:label>article-73ab17ff-3529-44ed-968e-5fd5d033cfd3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The furious spread of the Delta variant has prompted mask mandates and fights between state and local authorities.</rdfs:comment>
