	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-73b09841-a3d0-4152-af56-4fd6ffb700df">
		<rdfs:label>article-73b09841-a3d0-4152-af56-4fd6ffb700df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s public refusal to wear a mask was the latest way he has cast doubt on their recommendations.</rdfs:comment>
