	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-73b09aeb-dbe6-4f49-b7de-492771622ab2">
		<rdfs:label>article-73b09aeb-dbe6-4f49-b7de-492771622ab2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The justices struggled to determine how the First Amendment applies to public schools’ power to punish students for social media posts and other off-campus speech.</rdfs:comment>
