		<rdfs:label>article-73f61e50-4661-4361-8036-5511af99ae49</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Worker protections are critical during the pandemic — yet the Trump administration has issued only voluntary guidance instead of enforceable rules.</rdfs:comment>
