	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7407f359-88c8-4f16-aaa0-f68c3138c6b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-7407f359-88c8-4f16-aaa0-f68c3138c6b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a single year, Covid-19 became a leading cause of death in the United States, rivaling heart disease and cancer, and has driven life expectancy down sharply.</rdfs:comment>
