		<rdfs:label>article-74090a0f-01ae-4e25-a7b9-b671c5b81db8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But the court said Gov. Greg Abbott did not have the authority to order such investigations, acknowledging they could cause “irreparable harm.”</rdfs:comment>
