	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-740ac7cf-8e47-4f69-ad3f-e7995937d7f6">
		<rdfs:label>article-740ac7cf-8e47-4f69-ad3f-e7995937d7f6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Brian Kemp of Georgia just crushed a Trump-backed challenger. Many of his counterparts are also in strong political shape. And some are openly opposing their party’s leader.</rdfs:comment>
