		<rdfs:label>article-740b79d0-3837-4424-8b94-2c9d3d7e1a53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The city is investigating the possibility that a child playing with a lighter near a Christmas tree sparked the blaze.</rdfs:comment>
