		<rdfs:label>article-74221419-dca9-4205-8c02-64e6ddc03957</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new report almost certainly underestimates the spread, depth and urgency of the crisis given that the data doesn’t yet reflect the pandemic, federal officials warned.</rdfs:comment>
