		<rdfs:label>article-7425211e-d8a6-4db8-aeb6-36f39c47a242</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If the Supreme Court is to reverse course after refusing to block the law in September, at least one conservative justice must change positions. Justice Kavanaugh is the most likely candidate.</rdfs:comment>
