	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-742df115-e785-4bb6-9385-ccf41311470f">
		<rdfs:label>article-742df115-e785-4bb6-9385-ccf41311470f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As more Republicans say they support at least some L.G.B.T.Q. protections, President Trump and party leaders continue to stand in opposition and particularly target transgender Americans.</rdfs:comment>
