		<rdfs:label>article-742f4ae9-e563-4b0a-9fec-8d4a02941888</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats’ push to quickly pass the legislation comes amid a sharp increase in reports of attacks targeting Asian-Americans.</rdfs:comment>
