		<rdfs:label>article-74320a20-5a84-40ef-b900-3f2bd68a2cfc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A deal with General Motors and Ventec Life Systems to produce tens of thousands of the critical lifesaving devices seemed imminent. Then the announcement was pulled back.</rdfs:comment>
