	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-74414caf-141c-4ab2-8728-1caa36d39959">
		<rdfs:label>article-74414caf-141c-4ab2-8728-1caa36d39959</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president warned his supporters of Democratic schemes to “cheat” their way to victory in November and said, “We’re not going to stand for it.”</rdfs:comment>
