	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-744d1325-8949-4bc5-bee2-9b15a4833ce1">
		<rdfs:label>article-744d1325-8949-4bc5-bee2-9b15a4833ce1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A key Senate committee has scheduled a vote on the long-stalled nomination of Michael Pack, an ally of Stephen K. Bannon, to run the agency in charge of the Voice of America. Employees are worried.</rdfs:comment>
