		<rdfs:label>article-7540aa95-75ac-49a2-ac51-a329fa3dae89</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As progressives balked at an emerging bipartisan deal, top Democrats said they hoped to move forward in July with a budget maneuver that would allow them to push through their own plan.</rdfs:comment>
