		<rdfs:label>article-75487965-7d17-4bb5-a048-3ccd572fe422</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In adding up the recall’s price tag, including state costs and campaign spending, a Sonoma State University professor said the total was at least $450 million.</rdfs:comment>
