	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7712383b-92bf-414c-bd2f-7c7222b0b1fc">
		<rdfs:label>article-7712383b-92bf-414c-bd2f-7c7222b0b1fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Brett Hankison is on trial over charges that he endangered Ms. Taylor’s neighbors. His bullets did not strike anyone, and he testified that he had done nothing wrong in the fatal police raid.</rdfs:comment>
