	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-777917f3-4df3-45d8-93e2-1d974ef772db">
		<rdfs:label>article-777917f3-4df3-45d8-93e2-1d974ef772db</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a wide-ranging briefing less than two months before Election Day, Joe Biden’s team said that he and Kamala Harris would be ramping up in-person activities and travel.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-05"/>
