	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-777e00ef-eb14-4f62-a123-5bb1e95d247c">
		<rdfs:label>article-777e00ef-eb14-4f62-a123-5bb1e95d247c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The injunction is another setback for the Biden administration after an appeals court suspended its vaccine mandate for large employers earlier this month.</rdfs:comment>
