	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-777e79b7-ee2f-4b55-833d-7904d5c4da00">
		<rdfs:label>article-777e79b7-ee2f-4b55-833d-7904d5c4da00</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Prosecutors declined to pursue many of the cases because they concluded the protesters were exercising their basic civil rights.</rdfs:comment>
