		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-778b7700-ab56-4bc7-abe6-471c15115dc7">
		<rdfs:label>article-778b7700-ab56-4bc7-abe6-471c15115dc7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The moves aim to strengthen protections for young immigrants, end construction of President Donald J. Trump’s border wall, end a travel ban and prioritize racial equity.</rdfs:comment>
