	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-779618c7-389d-4f5d-8908-21d339056a1c">
		<rdfs:label>article-779618c7-389d-4f5d-8908-21d339056a1c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump administration sold the luxurious estate where envoys had lived for decades when it moved the U.S. Embassy to Jerusalem.</rdfs:comment>
