		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-779a7621-5a77-4171-ba13-717dfbaa0bd2">
		<rdfs:label>article-779a7621-5a77-4171-ba13-717dfbaa0bd2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The respected Republican legislator cited gridlock and partisanship in deciding to give up his seat. His exit underscores how far the party has strayed from its former identity.</rdfs:comment>
