		<rdfs:label>article-77a7518f-9979-44d4-bdd7-966b6fb7ae5e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The scandal has forced change to admissions rules, yet some observers say the shifts weren’t sweeping enough.</rdfs:comment>
