		<rdfs:label>article-77babdc8-b1cb-4a48-ab6e-6f3eb86cec66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Justice Barrett’s lightning-fast Senate approval promised to tip the court to the right for years to come.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
