		<rdfs:label>article-77cc46bb-5bbf-45c6-b287-e4052ac10d4a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Justice Department on Thursday released details about an investigation into nine discarded mailed-in ballots in Pennsylvania, an unusual step that stoked new fears that President Trump’s political appointees were using the levers of law enforcement to sow doubt about the election.</rdfs:comment>
