	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78839f74-605d-41ca-a8ea-cbbf48e74924">
		<rdfs:label>article-78839f74-605d-41ca-a8ea-cbbf48e74924</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump told his campaign staff that Dr. Anthony S. Fauci was “a disaster” and said, “People are tired of hearing Fauci and these idiots.”</rdfs:comment>
