	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-788a76c9-a95d-46df-944d-5bfa936c721b">
		<rdfs:label>article-788a76c9-a95d-46df-944d-5bfa936c721b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>DNA tests show that Anthony Warner blew himself up along with a stretch of downtown Nashville on Christmas morning.</rdfs:comment>
