	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-788a98f0-9780-4a7e-8de1-c23ffc00859c">
		<rdfs:label>article-788a98f0-9780-4a7e-8de1-c23ffc00859c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The fun of March Madness lies in swatting away expected narratives like a lazy layup.</rdfs:comment>
