	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7894d7cc-5a62-4123-8eb7-d776f98237d9">
		<rdfs:label>article-7894d7cc-5a62-4123-8eb7-d776f98237d9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The measure would allow the government to continue borrowing to finance its obligations without further action by Congress until after the 2022 midterm elections.</rdfs:comment>
