	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78952c72-392f-4eba-a3c6-38af1cee186d">
		<rdfs:label>article-78952c72-392f-4eba-a3c6-38af1cee186d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus is likely to hit the United States’ 60 million Latinos particularly hard, and political organizers face a dual challenge of energizing them and keeping them safe.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6cc67a-b3c2-45c5-af7a-92a423ab1249"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-16"/>
