	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78c548b2-f39a-4fc9-9cfd-1ee9a1bcde14">
		<rdfs:label>article-78c548b2-f39a-4fc9-9cfd-1ee9a1bcde14</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Twenty-one years ago, President Bill Clinton was brought up on charges of high crimes and misdemeanors. But there were some big differences from what President Trump now faces.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-01-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78c9b053-c210-437f-b88b-ef364e59bdf7">
		<rdfs:label>article-78c9b053-c210-437f-b88b-ef364e59bdf7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Elizabeth Warren and Bernie Sanders are longtime allies on the left. But her pool of voters generally doesn’t look like his base.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-887d1269-7020-4c8e-8dfc-eae7c464f3cb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78d0a841-6a7e-475d-ac69-cbc993d3aa08">
		<rdfs:label>article-78d0a841-6a7e-475d-ac69-cbc993d3aa08</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Tom Reed, Republican of New York, apologized on Sunday to a woman who accused him of touching her inappropriately and said that he would not run for any political office in 2022, including governor.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-80594a63-6d61-4416-86d0-2f3845858c6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ce324a4b-e256-4143-b6b8-1dde4bc956af"/>
