	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78d76c9a-7de9-40ff-a705-7b2add6a91a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-78d76c9a-7de9-40ff-a705-7b2add6a91a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The larger-than-expected G.O.P. vote in the House in support of legislation to codify marriage equality caught both parties off guard, suggesting there could be a narrow path to enactment.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
