		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78dd998d-1070-43ea-98af-d9721aeb0d95">
		<rdfs:label>article-78dd998d-1070-43ea-98af-d9721aeb0d95</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vote was a bipartisan rejection of Republican attempts to paint her as a liberal extremist who had coddled criminals.</rdfs:comment>
