		<rdfs:label>article-78de1e53-ced8-4391-bdc0-9fb6e783d44d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Vice President Mike Pence, his wife, Karen Pence, and Kellyanne Conway will all speak during the event’s third night.</rdfs:comment>
