	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78dec38c-fd78-4da4-ac5a-0a61273b8a53">
		<rdfs:label>article-78dec38c-fd78-4da4-ac5a-0a61273b8a53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the war in Ukraine grinds on, some officials have become convinced that Iran and Russia are building a new alliance of convenience.</rdfs:comment>
