	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78e25b2d-efcf-444f-82e6-045ac62e411e">
		<rdfs:label>article-78e25b2d-efcf-444f-82e6-045ac62e411e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the president casts himself as a bulwark against “angry mobs,” there are signs that he is alienating voters in bedroom communities who view him as a deeply flawed messenger on issues of race.</rdfs:comment>
