	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78e3ce34-8430-4901-858f-f9387b96fbaa">
		<rdfs:label>article-78e3ce34-8430-4901-858f-f9387b96fbaa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An organization based in Ohio and founded by Amish and Mennonites has been swept up in the violence roiling the country.</rdfs:comment>
