		<rdfs:label>article-78e7053e-1656-436c-a02f-f2b537672c34</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. McClellan, who is favored to win in the Democratic-leaning district in February, could become the first Black woman to represent Virginia in Congress.</rdfs:comment>
