	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78e711d2-b600-4b3b-8f83-d8c64d28fb40">
		<rdfs:label>article-78e711d2-b600-4b3b-8f83-d8c64d28fb40</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Secretary of State Antony J. Blinken was among the attendees reporting coronavirus infections on Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
