	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-78e72d15-8437-4924-9458-028b174f09e5">
		<rdfs:label>article-78e72d15-8437-4924-9458-028b174f09e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We asked On Politics readers — alumni and new graduates — for guidance on navigating our politics.</rdfs:comment>
