		<rdfs:label>article-7a0200c7-4770-49f0-8e8a-6eccf90c89c3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has discussed with advisers whether to grant pre-emptive pardons to his children, to his son-in-law and to his personal lawyer Rudolph W. Giuliani, and talked with Mr. Giuliani about pardoning him as recently as last week, according to two people briefed on the matter.</rdfs:comment>
