	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7a2a5af9-cef7-46c3-8e32-d278f91e21d4">
		<rdfs:label>article-7a2a5af9-cef7-46c3-8e32-d278f91e21d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former Alaska governor, once the standard-bearer of the G.O.P.’s dog-whistling, no-apologies culture, was no match for the same forces she rode to national prominence.</rdfs:comment>
