	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7a2b6562-cead-4cd5-baba-e020ef30e840">
		<rdfs:label>article-7a2b6562-cead-4cd5-baba-e020ef30e840</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The absence of people outdoors has produced a rare positive payoff in most American cities, big and small.</rdfs:comment>
