		<rdfs:label>article-7a60843b-2279-4460-a48e-40b026ffbab8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Unlike in many Northeastern cities, a majority of families in Rhode Island’s capital have sent their children back to school.</rdfs:comment>
