		<rdfs:label>article-7b38efe8-d039-4b21-ab1a-d5105420f5ec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Ron DeSantis of Florida sent migrants to Massachusetts. He aimed to make a point about President Biden, but immigration issues are nothing new.</rdfs:comment>
