	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7b3a36ff-5b65-4e85-9a5b-3d606c2647b1">
		<rdfs:label>article-7b3a36ff-5b65-4e85-9a5b-3d606c2647b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Isaias regained strength into a Category 1 hurricane on Monday night, bringing heavy winds and rain to the East Coast. Flash flooding and tornadoes are possible.</rdfs:comment>
