		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7b4bb79e-f8b1-406b-9a13-e97ee75e03dc">
		<rdfs:label>article-7b4bb79e-f8b1-406b-9a13-e97ee75e03dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While party leaders have long worried about the discriminatory effects of such laws, many now see other restrictive voting measures pushed by Republicans as a more urgent threat.</rdfs:comment>
