	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7b4e1ded-3344-41a7-a4b3-2dad0c375cf0">
		<rdfs:label>article-7b4e1ded-3344-41a7-a4b3-2dad0c375cf0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Donald J. Trump’s hometown, New York City, has not exactly been hospitable to him as a politician. In the 2016 election, Hillary Clinton outpolled him here more than four to one.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-bd483682-8f72-4ada-ac78-c94354fc563f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e008be05-6dcb-45fe-a5d2-1657eb3a638f"/>
