		<rdfs:label>article-7b4f392b-22a6-4922-a574-d53b6f17472a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s effort to overturn the election he lost has gone beyond mere venting of grievances at the risk of damaging the very American democracy he is charged with defending.</rdfs:comment>
