		<rdfs:label>article-7b90a478-6b68-467f-8155-700d641900b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It’s a unique midterm year, with a Republican-friendly environment, an abortion ruling energizing Democrats, and increased partisanship in how people cast ballots.</rdfs:comment>
