	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bb8ab60-efbd-4460-a119-af484b13a1f6">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bb8ab60-efbd-4460-a119-af484b13a1f6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Sanders said he thought the Democratic Party was “doing rather poorly” at selling itself to working-class voters.</rdfs:comment>
