	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bb96712-4f59-415c-94f5-f1d893972801">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bb96712-4f59-415c-94f5-f1d893972801</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president has continued to downplay the severity of the coronavirus and declare before largely maskless crowds that it is vanishing. The surge in new cases across the country says: Not so.</rdfs:comment>
