	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bd52e8e-b685-45e4-952b-3427d61f93b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bd52e8e-b685-45e4-952b-3427d61f93b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Colleges are racing to reconfigure dorms, expand testing programs and establish detailed social distancing rules. And then, what to do about sex?</rdfs:comment>
