	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bd6e907-ed52-4ca4-975c-64944d777b47">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bd6e907-ed52-4ca4-975c-64944d777b47</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Huge legislation. Secret Amazon airstrips. Political shenanigans. Also a trash guessing game. Reporters and editors from The Times’s Climate Desk share pieces they particularly liked.</rdfs:comment>
