	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bdad4b9-9e38-46d8-9a04-8b010e0619f6">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bdad4b9-9e38-46d8-9a04-8b010e0619f6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Here are the daily schedules of the presidential and vice-presidential candidates for Thursday, Oct. 1. All times are Eastern time.</rdfs:comment>
