	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7be6e57e-27f0-4a73-a6de-70cde7bbccf9">
		<rdfs:label>article-7be6e57e-27f0-4a73-a6de-70cde7bbccf9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus has pushed the coal industry to once-unthinkable lows, and the consequences for climate change are big.</rdfs:comment>
