		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bf4607d-9b04-4034-8b44-c26f3ccd4f21">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bf4607d-9b04-4034-8b44-c26f3ccd4f21</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Gavin Newsom, who is campaigning to win a recall election in California, can choose to uphold or reject the recommendation, which would free Mr. Sirhan after more than five decades.</rdfs:comment>
