	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7bf5cb2f-7b4f-405f-a639-7b0af44a2225">
		<rdfs:label>article-7bf5cb2f-7b4f-405f-a639-7b0af44a2225</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mark Brown was appointed by Betsy DeVos, the former education secretary, to be the head of the Office of Federal Student Aid.</rdfs:comment>
