		<rdfs:label>article-7c05aa58-fd3e-49a4-812e-e383f20e827d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>J.D. Vance, the author of “Hillbilly Elegy,” won a G.O.P. race that saw nearly $80 million in television advertising.</rdfs:comment>
