	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7c0bb8ec-f687-477a-bcd1-72943d2e80cb">
		<rdfs:label>article-7c0bb8ec-f687-477a-bcd1-72943d2e80cb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thursday brought more coronavirus infections than in any other day of the pandemic. Around the country, the virus left its mark.</rdfs:comment>
