		<rdfs:label>article-7c0c0da7-b874-483e-8ec9-562e59d8d94a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>About half of the premature deaths caused by poor air quality are linked to pollutants that blow in from other states, a new study found.</rdfs:comment>
