		<rdfs:label>article-7c10b51e-5a61-4cf5-932d-7153966d4805</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden announced a plan that mandates vaccines for federal employees and workers and calls on schools to adopt vaccine requirements, among other things.</rdfs:comment>
