	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7c134446-3351-425d-b03e-e62dcfd16098">
		<rdfs:label>article-7c134446-3351-425d-b03e-e62dcfd16098</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the Senate voting to bar any new witness testimony, the only outstanding question is when President Trump will be acquitted.</rdfs:comment>
