	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7caa9067-a4a3-46b8-847e-99c7acab767d">
		<rdfs:label>article-7caa9067-a4a3-46b8-847e-99c7acab767d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The auctioned areas are expected to generate enough power for nearly 2 million homes once turbines are built.</rdfs:comment>
