	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7cab9298-92e0-4594-963c-be0e3b9e507f">
		<rdfs:label>article-7cab9298-92e0-4594-963c-be0e3b9e507f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former clerk told a House committee that Judge Stephen R. Reinhardt, a prominent liberal judge who died in 2018, routinely sexually harassed her and other women who worked for him.</rdfs:comment>
