		<rdfs:label>article-7cb2d011-541f-4732-8ed6-e74ebcc8673c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The jury is made up of seven women and five men. They began deliberating on Tuesday morning, and were to continue on Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
