		<rdfs:label>article-7cb38f51-b275-4ac4-b503-f9af2330c4b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The guardsman was trying to rescue migrants in the river when he was swept away, according to the Texas Military Department.</rdfs:comment>
