	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7cb6dd0c-f845-4d90-af71-ba1b2bd68716">
		<rdfs:label>article-7cb6dd0c-f845-4d90-af71-ba1b2bd68716</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Defeating President Trump can do strange things for a man’s reputation.</rdfs:comment>
