	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7cb8ba00-2c88-450e-90e7-bec9bdecd668">
		<rdfs:label>article-7cb8ba00-2c88-450e-90e7-bec9bdecd668</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and his adversaries mobilized on Sunday for an epic campaign-season showdown over the future of the Supreme Court, even as the nation prepared to honor the life of Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg in an outdoor viewing to be held according to pandemic-era guidelines.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
