		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b0bcad0a-222a-42c4-a6fd-ae0cdad8c2c4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e993acb7-fd71-489b-b569-b6b6d449dfe5"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ce22e7f-15e7-4c8b-8e80-507b3df1d33f">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ce22e7f-15e7-4c8b-8e80-507b3df1d33f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Parscale, President Trump’s former campaign manager, was angry after he was demoted last summer, and wanted out of politics. That didn’t last long. He is starting a new political data company.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-237a03ba-20f1-40ef-9959-aff960fe7278"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ce4c634-4034-41fd-a988-3dec7718641c">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ce4c634-4034-41fd-a988-3dec7718641c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court will decide whether to hear a challenge to the law, which requires that defendants in capital cases who are intellectually disabled prove it “beyond a reasonable doubt” — a phrase that was inserted in error.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ce5cc04-ad74-4ca9-964c-13a0bbac09e6">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ce5cc04-ad74-4ca9-964c-13a0bbac09e6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite a visit meant to emphasize his actions on wildfires, experts say there is little the president can do for now to reduce the damage as climate change gets worse.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-558cc815-e7e6-47a5-bd90-ac5a453042ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-74659e03-2c48-4140-91f4-08e5d544f77a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ce8f238-ba6a-447b-95ad-207c8e39d6a3">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ce8f238-ba6a-447b-95ad-207c8e39d6a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The plan detailed by the Treasury Department would make it harder for companies to avoid paying taxes on both U.S. income and profits stashed abroad.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b06f805-a6f6-4cda-9908-3f8ddd3a0432"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7cecf061-5cb9-454e-847a-935742db5839">
		<rdfs:label>article-7cecf061-5cb9-454e-847a-935742db5839</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the United States reached 1 million known deaths, there was no national, permanent memorial to the country’s loss. Some survivors have called for more to be done.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e0dfbf0e-c179-4f28-a968-4570f9209555"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7cedc362-9b4e-42a9-9d48-45acf613f617">
		<rdfs:label>article-7cedc362-9b4e-42a9-9d48-45acf613f617</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The step, which could incite retaliation from Canada, comes as the countries are preparing to ring in a new trade agreement July 1.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-94d58c04-d925-44a3-9534-35b73b8dc25d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7cee8769-892d-4ecb-b7b8-84364f7505ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-7cee8769-892d-4ecb-b7b8-84364f7505ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republican legislators abdicated their duty by refusing to seek the truth.</rdfs:comment>
