		<rdfs:label>article-7ea8c630-3e8b-43f0-b5db-dd9bfb0d99a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>GM’s decision this week to phase out gasoline vehicles is the latest in a major shift that will mean drastic new demands on electric utilities. Here are four things that will need to happen.</rdfs:comment>
