	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7eb8c3f0-879a-415d-b86e-eebc22bd0bc4">
		<rdfs:label>article-7eb8c3f0-879a-415d-b86e-eebc22bd0bc4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The military and the Department of Veterans Affairs report higher inoculation rates, as do some companies and states, but they have a long way to go.</rdfs:comment>
