	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7eb9632b-bf4d-4c72-b214-64834f5eaa1c">
		<rdfs:label>article-7eb9632b-bf4d-4c72-b214-64834f5eaa1c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Since 2016, women have been allowed to serve in every role in the military, including ground combat. Unlike men, though, they are not required to register with the Selective Service System, the government agency that maintains a database of Americans who would be eligible for the draft were it reinstated.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-22"/>
