	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ebeffcf-bc67-46d6-a9f8-3cb1c4725650">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ebeffcf-bc67-46d6-a9f8-3cb1c4725650</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Students missed homecoming, field trips and classes, while also handling anxiety and economic precarity. Now, they must leap into the future, with the school’s help.</rdfs:comment>
