		<rdfs:label>article-7ec36a26-ad40-4987-a46b-873dd9b21e3e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The actress has completed a two-month sentence for conspiring to pass her daughters off as rowers so they would be admitted to the University of Southern California.</rdfs:comment>
