		<rdfs:label>article-7ec4f0fd-6e04-4dcb-8bc7-0dc161c6cf32</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Not sure if you can vote? Can’t find your ballot? Have your ballot but don’t know where to put it? Relax. Here is a handy, last-minute guide.</rdfs:comment>
