		<rdfs:label>article-7ef14569-73c0-48ad-96fd-7c5847d8e8d1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The holiday came a day before the Senate returns to debate what is expected to be a doomed effort to pass the legislation. But advocates say they aren’t giving up.</rdfs:comment>
