	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ef4ddd1-dec2-4535-b198-63795389f8e3">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ef4ddd1-dec2-4535-b198-63795389f8e3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president failed to derail the criminal investigation into his hoarding of sensitive documents and is stuck paying for a costly process that threatens to undermine his public claims.</rdfs:comment>
