		<rdfs:label>article-7fe4fdae-23bc-4fc4-bfc6-92da4584aea6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A court found that au pairs were entitled to rights of domestic workers in Massachusetts. Families said they did not know how they would pay. Some au pairs were elated.</rdfs:comment>
