	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ff5a320-4aea-4be3-a24d-6c84b0222bcb">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ff5a320-4aea-4be3-a24d-6c84b0222bcb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s campaign has set up two election night “war rooms” in the White House complex, raising questions anew about the intermingling of the governmental and the political in the Trump administration.</rdfs:comment>
