	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ff760a0-6034-4ca7-9b86-cae0c30412db">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ff760a0-6034-4ca7-9b86-cae0c30412db</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Shortly before Jan. 6, Vice President Mike Pence’s chief counsel wrote that holding up the certification of the election results would violate federal law.</rdfs:comment>
