	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ffb88f4-1510-48cc-be3f-a09591387637">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ffb88f4-1510-48cc-be3f-a09591387637</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pescatarians take note: Farmed fish are eating more veggies and less wild fish, according to new research. That’s good news for nature.</rdfs:comment>
