	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-7ffca087-25ea-47b4-aa35-4674ed1b6451">
		<rdfs:label>article-7ffca087-25ea-47b4-aa35-4674ed1b6451</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His acquittal has reinvigorated support on the right for armed responses to racial justice protests and unrest.</rdfs:comment>
