		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-12-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-80137f9c-4414-4434-b861-6f0ae2103973">
		<rdfs:label>article-80137f9c-4414-4434-b861-6f0ae2103973</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Should news outlets contextualize false claims made by powerful people? Or ignore them completely? There is no consensus in the industry, but its thinking continues to evolve.</rdfs:comment>
