	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8014384a-b6f9-4df4-a876-d0eb4397aa32">
		<rdfs:label>article-8014384a-b6f9-4df4-a876-d0eb4397aa32</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The old guard that led the Republican Party from 1980 until 2016 has been conspicuously absent from this year’s convention, representing the final signature on the party’s bitter divorce.</rdfs:comment>
