		<rdfs:label>article-8015eafb-f12d-4f62-aa12-dc5bcbbfb3f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Judy Shelton, who has loudly echoed President Trump’s views on monetary policy, is a bad choice for a seat on the Fed’s board.</rdfs:comment>
