		<rdfs:label>article-80af27a2-2210-47be-84a8-a4b0cc5c7686</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump-era rule protected oil, construction and other industries from liability if they killed or injured birds while doing business.</rdfs:comment>
