	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-814bb353-3a41-4571-a863-c9e20299213e">
		<rdfs:label>article-814bb353-3a41-4571-a863-c9e20299213e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers from both parties are urging the Trump administration to conduct the oath remotely to make up for a pause in naturalization ceremonies during the health crisis.</rdfs:comment>
