	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-815b2710-173d-47fd-9d98-6e18d2d3c8ec">
		<rdfs:label>article-815b2710-173d-47fd-9d98-6e18d2d3c8ec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Until a new treasurer is selected, currency will continue to bear the autograph of former Treasury Secretary Steven Mnuchin.</rdfs:comment>
