		<rdfs:label>article-815d92cb-80a7-4a42-b909-e435749f91d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials are still piecing together the chain of events in the attack that killed scores of people, including 13 U.S. service members, outside the Kabul airport.</rdfs:comment>
