	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-815f5d77-6283-4e9d-bc7e-90185e49635c">
		<rdfs:label>article-815f5d77-6283-4e9d-bc7e-90185e49635c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The lawyer, Alan Tucker, declined to comment on his conversations with the suspects, citing attorney-client privilege. He later said he would not be representing them.</rdfs:comment>
