		<rdfs:label>article-815f75a2-ab3c-4e25-9624-5ef8c543f54e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mining the minerals that may be needed for a green energy revolution could devastate tribal lands. The Biden administration will be forced to choose.</rdfs:comment>
