	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8163a9c5-3704-47db-a042-7950cd4577c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-8163a9c5-3704-47db-a042-7950cd4577c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Government Accountability Office has found that the Trump administration is undervaluing the cost of climate change to boost its deregulatory efforts.</rdfs:comment>
