	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-816674ae-f29d-4f00-999e-da25713526fd">
		<rdfs:label>article-816674ae-f29d-4f00-999e-da25713526fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Negotiators from about 200 countries are entering Week 2 of climate talks trying to resolve big issues around money, transparency and timelines.</rdfs:comment>
