	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8166d488-e562-4d4c-82bc-660d80ae836b">
		<rdfs:label>article-8166d488-e562-4d4c-82bc-660d80ae836b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>J.D. Vance, the Republican author of “Hillbilly Elegy,” defeated Representative Tim Ryan. Mr. Vance was once a sharp critic of Donald J. Trump but refashioned himself.</rdfs:comment>
