	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-816837e9-6c4d-4d90-a356-e8c3ffe98d89">
		<rdfs:label>article-816837e9-6c4d-4d90-a356-e8c3ffe98d89</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite the economic downturn, government figures for 2020 show no overall rise in hunger of the sort typical in past recessions. But some groups still suffered.</rdfs:comment>
