	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8169631b-a502-4f42-a561-a543a09eb209">
		<rdfs:label>article-8169631b-a502-4f42-a561-a543a09eb209</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Overall population growth slowed substantially over the past decade, but the number of multiracial Americans more than doubled.</rdfs:comment>
