	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-817d666e-853e-4dca-a36a-765b71b78bc0">
		<rdfs:label>article-817d666e-853e-4dca-a36a-765b71b78bc0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump made his first appearance on the international stage since the House sent impeachment articles to the Senate, on the day his trial is set to begin in earnest.</rdfs:comment>
