	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-81803de4-7fd1-406d-a09b-a163a19a7995">
		<rdfs:label>article-81803de4-7fd1-406d-a09b-a163a19a7995</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For years, the United States sent mixed signals about its interests in the country. Then Vladimir V. Putin made his move.</rdfs:comment>
