	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-818438c8-3c9f-482c-ab2e-83ab22e14412">
		<rdfs:label>article-818438c8-3c9f-482c-ab2e-83ab22e14412</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While Democrats seethe, the Senate Republican leader sees the fruits of his efforts to install an aggressive conservative majority on the Supreme Court.</rdfs:comment>
