	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-81990940-57c6-4c6a-8276-161e16c79430">
		<rdfs:label>article-81990940-57c6-4c6a-8276-161e16c79430</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Last week alone, 1.7 million young children were vaccinated, about double the previous week, a White House official said.</rdfs:comment>
