	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-819f9fa6-4501-4fe8-a750-8a0def9d223b">
		<rdfs:label>article-819f9fa6-4501-4fe8-a750-8a0def9d223b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden and his party searched for a way forward on their ambitious agenda after one of their own, Joe Manchin III, closed the door on ending the filibuster.</rdfs:comment>
