		<rdfs:label>article-81ce0bb0-b050-4dd1-b4e8-1e1223594f05</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The rule reverses a Trump-era policy that barred the students from obtaining emergency aid to cover food, housing and school supplies.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-11"/>
