	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-81cf3e0e-d016-4256-8442-d798e0bc57b0">
		<rdfs:label>article-81cf3e0e-d016-4256-8442-d798e0bc57b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The orders are concentrated along Florida’s Gulf Coast. On Wednesday, some were replaced with requests to shelter in place.</rdfs:comment>
