	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-81d11d81-654a-461b-8d61-8d606cd62481">
		<rdfs:label>article-81d11d81-654a-461b-8d61-8d606cd62481</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Raphael Warnock was sworn in this week as Georgia’s first Black senator, and he arrived with a canny canine assist.</rdfs:comment>
