	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-81e06acb-2ee6-49c0-81c5-58fa46bbdab5">
		<rdfs:label>article-81e06acb-2ee6-49c0-81c5-58fa46bbdab5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The lives of the people who died on a single January day reflect an extraordinary national loss.</rdfs:comment>
