	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-81e130ed-41a0-4c24-a7d1-3810598ce862">
		<rdfs:label>article-81e130ed-41a0-4c24-a7d1-3810598ce862</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Judiciary Committee’s hearing, scheduled by Senate Democrats before the Boulder and Atlanta shootings, comes as the party had already begun advancing stricter gun control measures that face long odds.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ce324a4b-e256-4143-b6b8-1dde4bc956af"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-23"/>
