	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-82774e10-f160-4462-b116-dbf3536bd474">
		<rdfs:label>article-82774e10-f160-4462-b116-dbf3536bd474</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Confrontations have escalated in swing states, with elections officials in both parties facing threats of violence, as the president and other Republicans try to subvert the country’s voting system.</rdfs:comment>
