		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8286cc2c-4d79-4397-8cbf-699d1b8cd7a3">
		<rdfs:label>article-8286cc2c-4d79-4397-8cbf-699d1b8cd7a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>States and counties are finding it hard to keep jails and prisons open as the virus ravages both prisoners and staff members. But transferring inmates can spur new outbreaks.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0be8f28d-788c-4a10-92e6-6d5be0cf8dcc"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-62947ec2-edf3-4cca-b4a1-b070f704e56d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e0da17b5-0302-4e93-b0bf-c765cae9f535"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-828738e4-5758-40e7-930b-c0155470c63f">
		<rdfs:label>article-828738e4-5758-40e7-930b-c0155470c63f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Experts inside and outside the government identified the threat early on and sought to raise alarms even as President Trump was moving slowly. Read some of what they had to say among themselves at critical moments.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2098993a-1d86-4c6d-b5b9-c15f8e12852e"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-82899a5e-7eca-4a37-9bfa-b2f221dd17c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-82899a5e-7eca-4a37-9bfa-b2f221dd17c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A U.S. District Court judge found that the sections of the state’s election law that cover absentee ballots, voter rolls and voter applications “violate neither the constitution nor the Voting Rights Act.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a0f415ea-f8d1-4b12-b0c0-6cb1a91c315d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-01"/>
