	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-828d7009-ac50-4f65-8d0c-ef6d69cd9ce6">
		<rdfs:label>article-828d7009-ac50-4f65-8d0c-ef6d69cd9ce6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As urbanites flock to forests and rivers to escape coronavirus threats, trailheads are cramped with parked cars and fishing on the Madison River is like a Disneyland ride.</rdfs:comment>
