		<rdfs:label>article-828edd3b-59d4-4b22-bd62-844557b4934a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the coronavirus surging in Florida, officials are examining outdoor venues near the arena in Jacksonville, but it remains uncertain how many people will be allowed to attend.</rdfs:comment>
