		<rdfs:label>article-83a0ebd0-7408-4e89-a6d8-fd779bbcf218</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The conservative group was found to have violated wiretapping laws and fraudulently misrepresented itself to a Democratic consulting firm, to which it was ordered to pay $120,000.</rdfs:comment>
