	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83a92b47-024c-49f4-bf74-65631d6daa67">
		<rdfs:label>article-83a92b47-024c-49f4-bf74-65631d6daa67</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The nation, and the Democratic Party, desperately needs a replacement for the tired story that tax cuts drive economic growth.</rdfs:comment>
