	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83af8f0f-1e41-49db-b41a-00d65ead6454">
		<rdfs:label>article-83af8f0f-1e41-49db-b41a-00d65ead6454</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Groups fueled by right-wing election conspiracy theories are trying to toss tens of thousands of voters from the rolls. “They are just going to beat the system into the ground,” said one election official.</rdfs:comment>
