	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83bcacce-bf08-4d22-b34c-b18ca253801c">
		<rdfs:label>article-83bcacce-bf08-4d22-b34c-b18ca253801c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mid-August usually marks the start of wildfire season. But this year, “we’ve been going at it for a while,” one disaster specialist said.</rdfs:comment>
