	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83bfc3e8-2bfe-4b6f-85e2-c3b35caf7cfd">
		<rdfs:label>article-83bfc3e8-2bfe-4b6f-85e2-c3b35caf7cfd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many Americans watch fireworks displays on Independence Day, eat turkey on Thanksgiving and, on Election Day, head to a school gymnasium, library or senior center to cast a ballot for their favorite presidential candidate.</rdfs:comment>
