	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83c5760d-8337-4c43-bf1a-8d0ae22c5531">
		<rdfs:label>article-83c5760d-8337-4c43-bf1a-8d0ae22c5531</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers want to know why a Brazilian-owned company got payments from a program aimed to help American farmers weather President Trump’s trade war.</rdfs:comment>
