	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83c66ce7-3c70-471f-a20e-e5f7d03c8bd4">
		<rdfs:label>article-83c66ce7-3c70-471f-a20e-e5f7d03c8bd4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least two new variants of the virus — one discovered in Britain and another first detected in Denmark — are now showing up in California.</rdfs:comment>
