	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83ca0299-3c1c-4e11-8178-e14d0c79770b">
		<rdfs:label>article-83ca0299-3c1c-4e11-8178-e14d0c79770b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a rally in Johnstown, Pa., the president’s aides nudged him toward a populist script. But he also had other issues in mind.</rdfs:comment>
