	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83dca827-bbd7-48b6-a939-d652e7babf7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-83dca827-bbd7-48b6-a939-d652e7babf7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Gavin Newsom on Friday made California the first state to alter its plans for the general election in response to the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
