	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83e7144c-ad89-430e-a274-62cee04e451a">
		<rdfs:label>article-83e7144c-ad89-430e-a274-62cee04e451a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Closing the border last year was the right thing to do. But the situation has changed.</rdfs:comment>
