	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-83fa49dd-9644-42b7-b73d-129de48bbac6">
		<rdfs:label>article-83fa49dd-9644-42b7-b73d-129de48bbac6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>People got sick — and some died — after attending crowded parties and theme parks in Florida as the coronavirus spread.</rdfs:comment>
