		<rdfs:label>article-85360dc5-bbca-4a41-8cbf-7c06d9fc8d5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The country grappled with yet another bloody rampage, only weeks after back-to-back mass shootings last month in Atlanta and Boulder, Colo.</rdfs:comment>
