		<rdfs:label>article-853a7f1b-47c5-4247-94cb-20b7c64ef41c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sense of a dysfunctional, if not entirely broken, democratic system in the United States has foreign rivals crowing — and suggesting that it has no business lecturing other nations.</rdfs:comment>
