	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-854b4f42-de31-41fb-8c7c-a8ae348c85b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-854b4f42-de31-41fb-8c7c-a8ae348c85b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Calls for racial justice touched nearly every aspect of American life on a scale that historians say has not happened since the civil rights movement of the 1960s.</rdfs:comment>
