		<rdfs:label>article-85ca5f2e-eb23-44f1-abce-03a90f4c3531</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The New York Times analyzed the state’s new 98-page voting law and identified 16 key provisions that will limit ballot access, potentially confuse voters and give more power to Republican lawmakers.</rdfs:comment>
