		<rdfs:label>article-85cd9a9e-97d1-4337-8527-7d63b478c8c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Critics say the profession of forensic pathology has been slow to acknowledge how big a role bias may play in decisions such as whether to classify a death in police custody as a homicide.</rdfs:comment>
