		<rdfs:label>article-85cf1ea6-e335-425a-9b04-a96d2ec2d264</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The lawyer for Mr. Chauvin, a former Minneapolis police officer charged in the killing of George Floyd, suggested that jurors should look beyond the video.</rdfs:comment>
