		<rdfs:label>article-85d8b5ff-9dde-46b1-8871-915ff9760ca8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than 200 political scientists wrote an open letter to lawmakers proposing sweeping changes to federal elections. The overhaul would be a heavy lift.</rdfs:comment>
