	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-85df61fe-a969-489d-b641-a4f1ed8c3b1f">
		<rdfs:label>article-85df61fe-a969-489d-b641-a4f1ed8c3b1f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One in five in that age group, mostly in the South, haven’t received a single dose, increasing the risk of virus outbreaks there.</rdfs:comment>
