	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-85e2b6da-375c-4c2f-b38d-df6837675b49">
		<rdfs:label>article-85e2b6da-375c-4c2f-b38d-df6837675b49</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nobody declared victory in Pennsylvania’s Republican Senate primary, despite a Trump endorsement. Representative Madison Cawthorn of North Carolina was ousted after a series of scandals.</rdfs:comment>
