	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-85fc7336-1968-43a0-90c5-fa8d13f8fc0f">
		<rdfs:label>article-85fc7336-1968-43a0-90c5-fa8d13f8fc0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States has reached a deal with Mexico to give workers at a General Motors plant in the country the ability to vote on a collective bargaining agreement in “free and democratic conditions.”</rdfs:comment>
