		<rdfs:label>article-870fb20e-b438-46be-a652-512621a422b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Worried about inflation and dissatisfied with President Biden, many moderate women have been drifting away from Democrats. Now the party hopes the fight for abortion rights will drive them back.</rdfs:comment>
