		<rdfs:label>article-87198bc0-12b9-400a-baa7-5325c3c360b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s false accusations that voter fraud denied him re-election are causing escalating confrontations in swing states across the country, leading to threats of violence against officials in both parties and subverting even the most routine steps in the electoral process.</rdfs:comment>
