		<rdfs:label>article-872e7254-a456-4a80-b714-ada993d63842</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Donald Trump says she can’t win in November, but Kathy Barnette is pressing toward Tuesday’s voting. “They’re coming out with long knives at this point,” she said.</rdfs:comment>
