		<rdfs:label>article-873d2952-5a4c-4bda-a622-bfd96198cd30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Global emissions from fossil fuels are likely to reach record highs this year, new data shows, putting nations further off track from stopping global warming.</rdfs:comment>
