		<rdfs:label>article-87873b68-fd16-465d-a9bb-4bea151a7d6f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The dilemma sounded familiar. A prominent, ambitious red-state governor, who had staked out a firm position opposed to mask mandates and other aggressive measures to combat the spread of the virus, suddenly found himself on the defensive as cases and hospitalizations soared in his state.</rdfs:comment>
