		<rdfs:label>article-87ecf56b-f121-44dc-aa0c-707cf2b970c3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House has been asking Congress for $22.5 billion in emergency aid to continue responding to the pandemic, but Republicans have insisted on a much lower number.</rdfs:comment>
