	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87ef08e7-056c-47b2-a44c-780eaecd7a9a">
		<rdfs:label>article-87ef08e7-056c-47b2-a44c-780eaecd7a9a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The N.I.H. and Moderna are examining whether doses of Moderna’s coronavirus vaccine can be halved to double the supply, while scientists look for other ways to extend availability.</rdfs:comment>
