	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87f2a951-258a-45c9-92f0-cb86ebec182f">
		<rdfs:label>article-87f2a951-258a-45c9-92f0-cb86ebec182f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A debate over reopening classrooms pits the mayor against the Board of Education, cutting across class, party and racial lines.</rdfs:comment>
