		<rdfs:label>article-87f4cc0e-37df-49d5-a089-480297e59077</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a memo for the Trump team during the Russia investigation, the attorney general wrote that presidents who misuse their authority are subject to impeachment.</rdfs:comment>
