	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87f88dd7-10ad-4f43-beee-b7ffa630ad74">
		<rdfs:label>article-87f88dd7-10ad-4f43-beee-b7ffa630ad74</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tens of millions of Americans have the green light to seek out the extra shots.</rdfs:comment>
