	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87f9cad9-ae2d-4465-b930-fe2c53f62879">
		<rdfs:label>article-87f9cad9-ae2d-4465-b930-fe2c53f62879</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s national security adviser warned of mounting but unspecified terrorist risks to the U.S. mission to evacuate thousands of Americans and Afghan allies.</rdfs:comment>
