	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87fba1bb-c434-4f94-a181-0c102a987f9d">
		<rdfs:label>article-87fba1bb-c434-4f94-a181-0c102a987f9d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The unverified intelligence echoes a similar report, deemed credible by the C.I.A. but dismissed by the president, that Russian military agents had offered payments for attacks on Americans in Afghanistan.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87fbebfb-61a8-45b8-b2b0-1855aa2620cf">
		<rdfs:label>article-87fbebfb-61a8-45b8-b2b0-1855aa2620cf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>What&apos;s badly needed is a return to the moderate policies that fueled the blue-wave victories in 2018 and won Joe Biden the presidency in 2020.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87fc589b-7ee3-48af-927a-5034a02c1cbd">
		<rdfs:label>article-87fc589b-7ee3-48af-927a-5034a02c1cbd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Top national security aides to former President Trump also talked him out of launching military raids against drug cartels inside Mexico.</rdfs:comment>
