	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87fdbd16-32e0-4944-bad0-968952950784">
		<rdfs:label>article-87fdbd16-32e0-4944-bad0-968952950784</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The union is asking for smaller class sizes and higher wages, while the school district says its budget is shrinking because of declining enrollment. After negotiations, St. Paul averted a strike.</rdfs:comment>
