	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-87fdea2c-f738-4fcd-9049-2f28f45ac2a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-87fdea2c-f738-4fcd-9049-2f28f45ac2a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite the purge of intelligence officers, former officials cautioned that Moscow would have other ways to collect information and that the efforts would have little impact on the war in Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
