		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-881ac7d0-df4a-4017-a434-712e8f26aff3">
		<rdfs:label>article-881ac7d0-df4a-4017-a434-712e8f26aff3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The National Republican Congressional Committee released a list of the House Democrats whose seats it is targeting, including moderates like Abigail Spanberger and Conor Lamb.</rdfs:comment>
