		<rdfs:label>article-881efc4f-999a-4373-9812-2ea2910787a8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Michael R. Caputo told a Facebook audience without evidence that left-wing hit squads were being trained for insurrection and accused C.D.C. scientists of “sedition.”</rdfs:comment>
