	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-884ea8b9-5749-4a61-92d0-b246a39786c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-884ea8b9-5749-4a61-92d0-b246a39786c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>WILMINGTON, Del. — Joseph R. Biden Jr. addressed the nation for the first time as president-elect on Saturday night, delivering a message of unity and trying to soothe the extraordinary divisions that defined the last four years in American politics.</rdfs:comment>
