	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88532dd3-a64c-45ce-810f-9918ef4cd28e">
		<rdfs:label>article-88532dd3-a64c-45ce-810f-9918ef4cd28e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ties to potentially coercive labor practices could prove a problem for an industry that is heavily dependent on China, once a new law barring Xinjiang products goes into effect.</rdfs:comment>
