	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8858865e-e23d-496c-aaf0-4cabd7d24dd4">
		<rdfs:label>article-8858865e-e23d-496c-aaf0-4cabd7d24dd4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Martha McSally, Republican of Arizona, and her Democratic challenger, Mark Kelly, attempted to shed their party labels Tuesday night and reach out to independent voters in their only debate for the seat Ms. McSally was appointed to in 2018.</rdfs:comment>
