	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88d93531-6ddb-4beb-be5e-10b25ea5a430">
		<rdfs:label>article-88d93531-6ddb-4beb-be5e-10b25ea5a430</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Make the affirmative case for NATO enlargement.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4174129c-26f0-4215-a9d5-425a654777c4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88dff9d7-bde8-4bb9-965f-afafb5c0e24b">
		<rdfs:label>article-88dff9d7-bde8-4bb9-965f-afafb5c0e24b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the U.S. battling high oil prices and facing a dangerous confrontation with Russia, the Democratic Party is coalescing around a new message for the midterms.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-89135d87-ed63-4619-a5ce-c3f23d9e6fd4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-03-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88e6e525-2354-4267-96a8-35a50bb845dc">
		<rdfs:label>article-88e6e525-2354-4267-96a8-35a50bb845dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On one of the most consequential nights in recent sports history — when a player-led boycott forced the N.B.A. to postpone playoff games — the Republican National Convention offered pro-Trump testimonials from a retired Notre Dame coach and a former N.F.L. player facing insider-trading charges.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88f00449-9239-47bc-a74d-7b7927debfd7">
		<rdfs:label>article-88f00449-9239-47bc-a74d-7b7927debfd7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge ruled that top officials of Washington, D.C.’s jail had improperly delayed medical treatment for a man being held without bail in connection with the attack on the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-90788841-2a13-4598-abd3-3b677caff4d4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88f23949-41fd-4f11-bd47-9520bf5b5756">
		<rdfs:label>article-88f23949-41fd-4f11-bd47-9520bf5b5756</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are eight days until Election Day. Here are the schedules of the presidential and vice-presidential candidates for Monday, Oct. 26. All times are Eastern time.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88f31766-5949-4fdb-9d31-292bac12d7c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-88f31766-5949-4fdb-9d31-292bac12d7c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House cleared the extension, which would give companies more time to apply for pandemic relief loans, sending it to the White House for President Trump’s signature.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88f3c9b6-20e4-42bf-94ab-037ef40cc3f6">
		<rdfs:label>article-88f3c9b6-20e4-42bf-94ab-037ef40cc3f6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Ned Lamont said that he will isolate at home for the next five days and not attend any in-person events or meetings.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e2ba983e-eb48-483d-afa1-e67b02e88f99"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-04-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88f40c40-9fd4-4c90-a7b5-e4e45e18ec14">
		<rdfs:label>article-88f40c40-9fd4-4c90-a7b5-e4e45e18ec14</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state passed one of the most restrictive abortion laws in the country in 2019. But it has never been enforced, pending court decisions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-547aea49-f62b-46fc-b36a-1bb76a5d9284"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-27"/>
