		<rdfs:label>article-88f9c232-018d-4b63-a33e-d1754a143f48</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Working together, Governor Cuomo and Mayor de Blasio can help keep the coronavirus at bay.</rdfs:comment>
