		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-88fa1ecd-adb9-47af-80d0-696acaf65c71">
		<rdfs:label>article-88fa1ecd-adb9-47af-80d0-696acaf65c71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As President Biden touts an “infrastructure decade,” there is little that’s certain about the biggest infrastructure project of them all.</rdfs:comment>
