	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-89007c46-9193-4e15-9798-2e22b8160167">
		<rdfs:label>article-89007c46-9193-4e15-9798-2e22b8160167</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A runoff election in heavily Hispanic South Texas is revealing the party’s divisions on border issues.</rdfs:comment>
