	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8907bb35-115e-4dc8-93fc-533757fc3e70">
		<rdfs:label>article-8907bb35-115e-4dc8-93fc-533757fc3e70</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid mounting furor over politicization at the Justice Department, the attorney general ordered reviews of such investigations and prosecutions.</rdfs:comment>
