		<rdfs:label>article-890afec4-6da1-44f4-9da0-5a627e258ec6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After tense exchanges on the issue, Gov. Gavin Newsom said he had made an overture to the federal government.</rdfs:comment>
