	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-890cd8bc-7239-4865-93e3-12fd0be69925">
		<rdfs:label>article-890cd8bc-7239-4865-93e3-12fd0be69925</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ruling strikes down weak rules for coal-burning power plants and gives the Biden administration a freer hand to impose tighter restrictions.</rdfs:comment>
