		<rdfs:label>article-891c489d-832e-47a8-bf40-4aeb587c23dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The willpower to reduce Bitcoin’s carbon footprint is muted amid wild cryptocurrency speculation.</rdfs:comment>
