	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-891eaefb-a579-490f-97f4-4f5713331b14">
		<rdfs:label>article-891eaefb-a579-490f-97f4-4f5713331b14</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With attention focused on Georgia and its 16 electoral votes, about 200,000 ballots remain uncounted, the state’s top election official, Secretary of State Brad Raffensperger, said on Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
