	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-89213b02-43a8-45e0-806a-6b89efe9ee24">
		<rdfs:label>article-89213b02-43a8-45e0-806a-6b89efe9ee24</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The C.D.C. had imposed an eviction moratorium, saying it was needed to address the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
