	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8924f616-acf9-47fa-8be5-ae0b2ee53ffe">
		<rdfs:label>article-8924f616-acf9-47fa-8be5-ae0b2ee53ffe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>When President Trump comes to visit, world leaders face the challenge of finding ways to entertain and impress a leader who relishes spectacle.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-24"/>
