	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8a00f45c-e261-412a-abfe-71a53466a0c1">
		<rdfs:label>article-8a00f45c-e261-412a-abfe-71a53466a0c1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The case is one of several in which former President Donald J. Trump went after former aides that criticized him or his campaign.</rdfs:comment>
