	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8a03efd3-d972-4bd2-9d5b-454918c92310">
		<rdfs:label>article-8a03efd3-d972-4bd2-9d5b-454918c92310</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Federal investigations and public outcry over senators’ stock trades amid the coronavirus crisis have renewed interest in limiting what lawmakers can do with their savings.</rdfs:comment>
