	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8a105e37-c3c8-41f7-bdf6-62c56feab117">
		<rdfs:label>article-8a105e37-c3c8-41f7-bdf6-62c56feab117</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats warn Republicans to follow the precedent they set in 2016, when they refused to consider President Barack Obama’s choice for the court on the grounds that it was an election year.</rdfs:comment>
