		<rdfs:label>article-8a139e1a-188a-4edd-96b3-ef855e29a8ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The authorities are working to identify the dozens of victims, who are believed to be migrants. Four people have been charged with crimes.</rdfs:comment>
