	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8a1cc0fc-cc10-4f29-a206-4e95341a6eec">
		<rdfs:label>article-8a1cc0fc-cc10-4f29-a206-4e95341a6eec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite some turmoil, a vast majority of students have been in classrooms full-time and mostly uninterrupted this fall. Now, educators debate what’s next.</rdfs:comment>
