	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8a1e00f5-466c-43c1-b328-6fd2e15bd1c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-8a1e00f5-466c-43c1-b328-6fd2e15bd1c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The party is stepping up its attacks on the safety net measure that Democrats are shaping entirely on their own.</rdfs:comment>
