		<rdfs:label>article-8a286cc3-c917-4d5c-acfd-85b06141e2b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mayors, governors and President Trump have been the main players in disputes over how to reopen states and cities. But now state lawmakers are leaping into the fray.</rdfs:comment>
