		<rdfs:label>article-8a4a2c34-242c-429d-b6cb-45124245e6ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New York City officials plan to remove mentally ill people from streets and subways. Here’s a quick look at how other cities and countries approach the issue of support for homeless people.</rdfs:comment>
