	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8a4d484f-66f9-45d3-8170-b6a10f8d195a">
		<rdfs:label>article-8a4d484f-66f9-45d3-8170-b6a10f8d195a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Whether President Trump wins or loses on Nov. 3, the very concept of public trust in an established set of facts necessary for the operation of a democratic society has been eroded.</rdfs:comment>
