		<rdfs:label>article-8a588bb9-afe2-4271-80ca-93c8a3f78bfc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Blagojevich, a Democrat and  former governor of Illinois, was accused of trying to sell the Senate seat left open when Barack Obama went to the White House.</rdfs:comment>
