		<rdfs:label>article-8ada4383-a373-4936-9f25-e037bf1b6e28</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision brings to 11 the number who have been approved to be sent elsewhere, but the Biden administration has yet to name a point person to negotiate transfers with other governments.</rdfs:comment>
