		<rdfs:label>article-8ade6024-6fbc-437e-a219-d411a6549c99</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s son Eric on Sunday angrily dismissed a New York Times investigation showing that more than 200 companies, special-interest groups and foreign governments obtained favors from the Trump administration while patronizing Mr. Trump’s properties, earning the president millions of dollars.</rdfs:comment>
