		<rdfs:label>article-8ae42308-e699-4e31-a503-fc4b9aaefd88</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It would be a significant shift in approach by President Biden that reflects the government’s growing concern about the spread of the highly contagious Delta variant.</rdfs:comment>
