		<rdfs:label>article-8aec9390-6b1e-4735-a962-42c3e9954c20</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facebook said on Wednesday that it planned to lift its ban on political advertising across its network, resuming a form of digital promotion that has been criticized for spreading misinformation, falsehoods and inflaming voters.</rdfs:comment>
