		<rdfs:label>article-8af0a135-1b23-4d6e-b31b-b0f33543b24e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move was the latest blow to President Trump’s attempts to subvert the election results. But battles over the process of voting in Georgia are likely to continue.</rdfs:comment>
