	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8af10fa4-eeb3-4fb4-947e-1ffcafe961c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-8af10fa4-eeb3-4fb4-947e-1ffcafe961c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The transfer, a response to a request from Ukraine’s president, will mark the first time the Biden administration has helped send tanks in the five-week-old war.</rdfs:comment>
