		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8affc9a5-c088-4850-9ec2-fbeb8d0bd5b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-8affc9a5-c088-4850-9ec2-fbeb8d0bd5b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While Maricopa County, which includes Phoenix, had long lines and glitches with election tabulators, there has been no evidence that the problems influenced Arizona’s race for governor.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-12a1ee3f-e3b3-4840-894b-85dff25a659a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-982bde63-8146-432c-a09a-c9cac220ddaa"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b02c260-e4af-4ce8-8dd1-d20e6d7b2514">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b02c260-e4af-4ce8-8dd1-d20e6d7b2514</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An early estimate points to a huge die-off along the Pacific Coast, and scientists say rivers farther inland are warming to levels that could be lethal for some kinds of salmon.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2afe2750-7a7d-460f-b9fb-4feddaf4f58b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b0382ca-0fb2-4cb4-91e0-37689e301794">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b0382ca-0fb2-4cb4-91e0-37689e301794</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden’s organization remained weak. Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren focused on cities and college towns. Mr. Buttigieg, however, went everywhere.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b04985a-b0fc-4c68-85e8-512ea766441d">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b04985a-b0fc-4c68-85e8-512ea766441d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In March, talk of victory was in the air. Now, maintaining unity against President Vladimir V. Putin is looking harder, with President Biden heading to Germany and Spain to rally Europe.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b06ae39-6584-42c0-954b-ddb3def01e42">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b06ae39-6584-42c0-954b-ddb3def01e42</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden and other Democrats were already talking about health care before the coronavirus, but the outbreak gives new urgency to a central issue for the party.</rdfs:comment>
