		<rdfs:label>article-8b1dd6fc-a672-472a-a495-6a61888fdbb0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With testimony concluded in the trial of three former officers for their role in George Floyd’s death, the jury is set to hear closing arguments.</rdfs:comment>
