	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b224412-ffd9-4b9d-b6dd-c4c01fa5acfd">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b224412-ffd9-4b9d-b6dd-c4c01fa5acfd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The selection of Col. Stephen Keane eliminates one crucial roadblock to restarting pretrial hearings in the long-running case of the five men accused of helping plot the attack.</rdfs:comment>
