	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b226f80-3fb3-48b2-8dc8-779fa85cd911">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b226f80-3fb3-48b2-8dc8-779fa85cd911</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Can he even do that? His administration isn’t sure. This is your morning tip sheet.</rdfs:comment>
