		<rdfs:label>article-8b227186-4555-4941-8fce-b673b334240e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least 28 states have begun vaccinating older people. Amid a shifting rollout, here is a look at what every state is doing.</rdfs:comment>
