	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8b2b7c12-bf66-4f06-8189-3ed85c6207f2">
		<rdfs:label>article-8b2b7c12-bf66-4f06-8189-3ed85c6207f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president intends to use the Afghan central bank’s assets to fund needs in Afghanistan amid a humanitarian disaster, and compensate victims of the Sept. 11, 2001, attacks.</rdfs:comment>
