		<rdfs:label>article-8b2c9ed5-9cff-44f3-85b3-e6e343d6ecc1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>White House officials characterized the call, which lasted two hours and 17 minutes, as a relationship-tending mission.</rdfs:comment>
