	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c1ca1c9-fe5b-4741-aea0-bae73c3598c6">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c1ca1c9-fe5b-4741-aea0-bae73c3598c6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After battling for years against the Trump administration’s plan to seize some of their family’s land in South Texas to build a border wall, the Cavazos siblings believed the inauguration of President Biden would bring a successful end to their fight.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-558cc815-e7e6-47a5-bd90-ac5a453042ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-16"/>
