		<rdfs:label>article-8c277f21-dbcd-435d-97f1-26c87e9ff276</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An inquiry into years-old disclosures of classified information is highly unusual and leaves law enforcement officials open to accusations of politicizing their work.</rdfs:comment>
