	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c2b959e-1d84-4558-8590-e5297827bb78">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c2b959e-1d84-4558-8590-e5297827bb78</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>She is the third person in proximity of President Trump known to have contracted the virus.</rdfs:comment>
