	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c3017cc-5dec-4ccb-a8ce-b5f5e798a3a1">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c3017cc-5dec-4ccb-a8ce-b5f5e798a3a1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republican leaders think a moderate nominee for governor could beat Gov. J.B. Pritzker. But the party’s base seems to prefer a far-right state senator — and he is getting help from Mr. Pritzker.</rdfs:comment>
