		<rdfs:label>article-8c3506cb-ecf9-41c4-a547-3bc3f7294a6d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As a handful of authors compete to recount President Donald J. Trump’s last year in office, Twitter is strewn with vividly reported snapshots of a monumental year in American history.</rdfs:comment>
