		<rdfs:label>article-8c37c9db-7681-4ae5-84e3-3c650c0b8310</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The primary race is entering a critical nine-day stretch that could effectively determine the nomination as candidates face a debate, the South Carolina primary and Super Tuesday contests.</rdfs:comment>
