		<rdfs:label>article-8c3f0d7e-138e-4bdd-b376-e8ff32a8ac16</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Mayra Flores is one of three Republican Latinas vying to transform South Texas politics by shunning moderates and often embracing the extreme.</rdfs:comment>
