		<rdfs:label>article-8c4293a8-366f-4bce-841e-1252b5335962</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Women competed in 65 state legislative races, and had already won or were leading in 44 of them as of Wednesday night.</rdfs:comment>
