		<rdfs:label>article-8c434b9f-9315-41c4-b56b-80decb063750</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s campaign has ratcheted up its appeals for cash, but the first 75 percent of every contribution is going to a new political action committee that could fund his next political move.</rdfs:comment>
