	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c43519d-d676-4b23-980a-75007b85b81e">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c43519d-d676-4b23-980a-75007b85b81e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the term so far, including two major decisions on Thursday, the court’s expanded conservative majority is fractured and its liberals are often on the winning side.</rdfs:comment>
