	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c45f657-ef4e-4da4-b688-314a139f0ecf">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c45f657-ef4e-4da4-b688-314a139f0ecf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The company said the vaccine produced a strong immune response in children younger than 6, but proved only about 40 percent effective in preventing symptomatic Covid-19.</rdfs:comment>
