	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c484e83-f6a3-417b-9434-8d5add15fc6a">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c484e83-f6a3-417b-9434-8d5add15fc6a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president invoked the Defense Production Act to boost supply and directed federal agencies to use Defense Department planes to speed shipments of formula from overseas.</rdfs:comment>
