	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c4b8175-5b7e-4d6f-9e77-a7a84b5044a6">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c4b8175-5b7e-4d6f-9e77-a7a84b5044a6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden is set to seize the spotlight this week after weeks of attention on former President Donald J. Trump’s impeachment trial. Mr. Biden is beginning a more public sales pitch for his domestic agenda, with his first set of work trips outside Washington.</rdfs:comment>
