	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c4c6f7e-9875-4780-8419-8e6396c50cd3">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c4c6f7e-9875-4780-8419-8e6396c50cd3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jurors are considering seven charges of rape and sexual assault against the former film producer, who was convicted of similar charges in New York in 2020.</rdfs:comment>
