		<rdfs:label>article-8c4d2fb1-2cfe-499d-acf6-6e862e2f87a0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a rally that was supposed to bolster the fortunes of two Republican runoff candidates, the president instead turned the event into a lecture filled with conspiracy theories and personal attacks.</rdfs:comment>
