	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c503d14-ea95-4c55-88f0-b5426138acca">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c503d14-ea95-4c55-88f0-b5426138acca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As it resurges across the United States, the coronavirus is forcing universities large and small to make deep and possibly lasting cuts to close widening budget shortfalls.</rdfs:comment>
