		<rdfs:label>article-8c605564-e852-4af1-9fb4-fee2908dc1b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In 2009, the Obama administration’s environmental team called a group of climate activists to the White House to deliver a message: Climate change doesn’t sell and only provokes economic attacks from the right that are too difficult to counter.</rdfs:comment>
