		<rdfs:label>article-8c79030a-53d8-4b84-bff6-61a74bed1572</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fighting headwinds from the pandemic, the tight labor market and demographic shifts, the armed forces may fall further short of enlistment quotas this year than they have in decades.</rdfs:comment>
