		<rdfs:label>article-8c7d2c53-30c8-469a-9b85-cf28549f5ce4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“The darkness seems pretty dark at the moment,” said one minister, who will preach about hope in the face of fear.</rdfs:comment>
