	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c803b42-bfa1-4bc3-ba70-7b150d2ffaa5">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c803b42-bfa1-4bc3-ba70-7b150d2ffaa5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s plan to counter Russia faces obstacles in an interconnected world. Russia also has a new, if not very enthusiastic, partner in standing up to the West: China.</rdfs:comment>
