		<rdfs:label>article-8c83ce6f-2d92-4c89-b09b-dddc70a0d7e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mayors are considering waiving fares for bus service as a way to fight inequality and lower carbon emissions. Critics wonder who will pay for it.</rdfs:comment>
