	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8c8a6333-6882-418a-9ca9-207bff7505e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-8c8a6333-6882-418a-9ca9-207bff7505e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The release of former President Donald J. Trump’s private tax documents by the House Ways and Means Committee shows heavy losses from his own ventures as he continued to cash in on inherited assets.</rdfs:comment>
