	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d2fba8b-56e4-48ef-8388-e7bfac9e4bd1">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d2fba8b-56e4-48ef-8388-e7bfac9e4bd1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A proposed package includes $600 checks for individuals, but some facing overdue rent and stacks of bills say the money would make only a small dent.</rdfs:comment>
