	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d32fbad-2597-40e5-8038-e28dd486f79e">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d32fbad-2597-40e5-8038-e28dd486f79e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Commerce Department is impeding findings into whether it coerced the top NOAA official to support President Trump’s inaccurate claim that Dorian would hit Alabama, the department’s inspector general said.</rdfs:comment>
