	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d34becb-d312-408d-8480-2660d94f5bf9">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d34becb-d312-408d-8480-2660d94f5bf9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The prominent promoter of 2020 election conspiracy theories said the F.B.I. had seized his cellphone and asked him about his ties to an indicted county clerk.</rdfs:comment>
