	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d363238-97d2-4834-9496-1a8b19ef4015">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d363238-97d2-4834-9496-1a8b19ef4015</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Conciliatory messages at the Republican convention were an acknowledgment by the president’s campaign that appealing to his right-wing base will not be enough to win re-election.</rdfs:comment>
