	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d3f4d7d-f5a0-4ca6-90eb-2538937146b5">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d3f4d7d-f5a0-4ca6-90eb-2538937146b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former New York mayor is “a victim of the climate debate moving much faster than the positive realities he helped shape,” one analyst said.</rdfs:comment>
