	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d63c046-9909-4a5d-8585-8417df1b0770">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d63c046-9909-4a5d-8585-8417df1b0770</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Russia has massed more than 100,000 troops at Ukraine’s borders, officials said, publicly confirming what intelligence analysts have described for weeks.</rdfs:comment>
