	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d6af1a7-0f80-418d-8c6d-c58fbbf90371">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d6af1a7-0f80-418d-8c6d-c58fbbf90371</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Texas is having its second-hottest summer on record, yet most state prisons and jails have little air-conditioning.</rdfs:comment>
