	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d6cc85d-52de-4775-a9b7-601596465570">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d6cc85d-52de-4775-a9b7-601596465570</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph R. Biden Jr. has piled up endorsements from officials who would likely have backed almost any Republican not named Donald Trump, but one name leaps from the lengthy list of 489 national security experts who announced their support for Mr. Biden on Thursday: Gen. Paul J. Selva.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d6deb08-1df4-4cc6-95c5-6ddf73993f63">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d6deb08-1df4-4cc6-95c5-6ddf73993f63</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Amy Klobuchar is pressing for legislation after a Times investigation showed that the use of prechecked boxes for recurring donations by former President Donald Trump’s campaign led to a surge of refunds.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0b1c0734-81f6-4bd6-ab6e-2c3d3239bc31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d700e84-7809-4b41-948c-df0c3765535b">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d700e84-7809-4b41-948c-df0c3765535b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Emotions were already raw over the toll of a pandemic that has killed more than 100,000 people across the country and cost millions of jobs.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-25bd1b00-90b4-453a-8e46-dfb93ba723f0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b0d8acac-ba33-4091-b922-0eb5b9ab904d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d7348e3-caba-4cea-8ca7-fff61ecfae66">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d7348e3-caba-4cea-8ca7-fff61ecfae66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Adolescents could soon be eligible for Covid-19 vaccines, making full, in-person school even more likely.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9ef20237-f390-44c5-8d52-031cdd2c86e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f054aa66-2374-4f42-8ea3-5d2fd3c51e19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d73773c-24e3-47e8-945c-39ae66b36676">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d73773c-24e3-47e8-945c-39ae66b36676</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The rapid withdrawal of U.S. troops has left the agency seeking ways to maintain its intelligence-gathering, war-fighting and counterterrorism operations in the country.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-92d6a2c3-4676-4b0a-b692-bac80f669045"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8d74abdd-8e44-497c-9fbe-9c76795b34c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-8d74abdd-8e44-497c-9fbe-9c76795b34c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It took four days in July to extinguish the fire on the Bonhomme Richard, which rendered the ship inoperative.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-524922c4-c335-4218-b145-d4752931be34"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5a3094b1-6bc7-47d7-8f53-c56fd8ed0c59"/>
