		<rdfs:label>article-8df982a7-334b-4e92-b5ae-9c1c24580a09</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Rood told Congress that Ukraine had made necessary changes to justify sending the country aid, undermining an argument made by President Trump’s defenders in the impeachment battle.</rdfs:comment>
