	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8dfb273f-2e12-44c3-8707-b4ee8caaeb55">
		<rdfs:label>article-8dfb273f-2e12-44c3-8707-b4ee8caaeb55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the memory of last summer’s protests still fresh, some states have already ordered troops to be on standby in anticipation of large protests if there is an acquittal.</rdfs:comment>
