		<rdfs:comment>Within hours of becoming the first president to be impeached twice, President Trump posted a  five-minute video on a White House Twitter account on Wednesday evening condemning the storming of the Capitol complex by his supporters last week and urged his followers to avoid a repeat in “the coming days both here in Washington and across the country.”</rdfs:comment>
