		<rdfs:label>article-8e25dbc1-9b7e-45bb-a681-64e87e4d1650</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Communities across the country are starting to roll out at-home saliva test kits. Health officials say they could be a game-changer in detecting and slowing the spread of the virus.</rdfs:comment>
