		<rdfs:label>article-8e27008f-785b-47a4-9105-593006044aff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The statements offer an answer to the question of when Republicans might begin to repudiate the president after years of embracing him: the moment they believed he threatened their own political survival.</rdfs:comment>
