		<rdfs:label>article-8e280cd5-2d33-4f2b-80de-462838863dc4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Bowing to moderates who said the jobless aid was too generous, Democrats dropped their bid to raise a weekly federal unemployment benefit to $400 from $300.</rdfs:comment>
