		<rdfs:label>article-8e40de70-f81f-4d40-9369-909087e3a69e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But for the sake of the Democratic Party and the nation, it’s time to step aside and join forces with Joe Biden.</rdfs:comment>
