	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8e5dbce7-a070-4a67-9f3b-79aeab3f5f32">
		<rdfs:label>article-8e5dbce7-a070-4a67-9f3b-79aeab3f5f32</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president returned briefly from vacation to sign a bill that passed the House and Senate on party lines after more than a year of fraught negotiations.</rdfs:comment>
