		<rdfs:comment>Friday: A guide to Golden State athletes in Tokyo and upcoming competitions to keep an eye on.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e5cee4f-82a8-44a6-9cc0-9285f4da7bf4"/>
