	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8e668c30-730f-44ba-8902-606d80bd960d">
		<rdfs:label>article-8e668c30-730f-44ba-8902-606d80bd960d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The indication of a potential cooperation deal came as investigators were also examining a trip by Mr. Gaetz to the Bahamas and whether he discussed running a so-called ghost candidate in a local race.</rdfs:comment>
