	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8e6b747a-650a-49cf-99f5-ffcb316b54b8">
		<rdfs:label>article-8e6b747a-650a-49cf-99f5-ffcb316b54b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>House Democrats branded the former president a clear and present danger to democracy who could sow new violence.</rdfs:comment>
