		<rdfs:label>article-8eb7008b-8540-4291-bb5c-7e279b6f369a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the first national survey asking voters about the allegations, Joe Biden widened his lead over President Trump in a head-to-head matchup that has continued to grow in the last couple of months.</rdfs:comment>
