		<rdfs:label>article-8ec4a97a-e658-42c2-a8ec-b933ff705b6e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facing a climate crisis, environmental groups and industry agree to work together to bolster hydropower while reducing harm from dams.</rdfs:comment>
