	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8eca20eb-6a56-4b9c-aecd-582507cf6d7f">
		<rdfs:label>article-8eca20eb-6a56-4b9c-aecd-582507cf6d7f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers are essential workers. They should start acting like it and protect themselves and the other people who work for Congress.</rdfs:comment>
