		<rdfs:label>article-8ed3225e-6c46-42b8-8b09-234f0c39c0da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The storm that brought flooding and devastation to parts of Europe is the latest example of an extreme weather event. More are expected.</rdfs:comment>
