	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8ed77edf-9518-48c0-a11a-4f0096787a3a">
		<rdfs:label>article-8ed77edf-9518-48c0-a11a-4f0096787a3a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Schools are closed. Events are canceled. If the virus keeps spreading, governments have even more disruptive options in mind.</rdfs:comment>
