	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8edbbe34-1f59-4183-a10e-4dcc9a2a37bd">
		<rdfs:label>article-8edbbe34-1f59-4183-a10e-4dcc9a2a37bd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The New York Times asked poets laureate from across the country what the people in their states had to be thankful for in this difficult year.</rdfs:comment>
