		<rdfs:label>article-8ee654c8-4f0d-4aed-9aa0-463df8c0ebb5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump will visit California on Monday to be briefed about blazes that have burned more than three million acres. Tens of thousands of people have evacuated in Oregon.</rdfs:comment>
