		<rdfs:label>article-8ee96d00-202a-42c5-9f64-8290fba7cd1e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gordon Sondland’s memoir is a textured look at the trick of wrangling a man who refuses to be wrangled.</rdfs:comment>
