	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8eee3b2f-7e20-45ec-9921-b4f8e290995d">
		<rdfs:label>article-8eee3b2f-7e20-45ec-9921-b4f8e290995d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Sally Kornbluth, a cell biologist, is the second woman to lead the university. The provost, chancellor, dean of science and chair of corporation are also all women.</rdfs:comment>
