		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8ef09d52-b336-4923-bcb0-8a892bc80b4e">
		<rdfs:label>article-8ef09d52-b336-4923-bcb0-8a892bc80b4e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The three major presidential candidates have quickly pivoted to try to shape a new political discourse, as they face a real-time test of leadership in a national crisis.</rdfs:comment>
