	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8efc17bf-2340-43c5-bd6b-1a1cb88681c0">
		<rdfs:label>article-8efc17bf-2340-43c5-bd6b-1a1cb88681c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More vaccine shots will be given to Americans beginning Friday with the start of a federal program that delivers doses directly to drugstores and grocery store pharmacies.</rdfs:comment>
