	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8f0018d8-5776-4484-9a00-803c35935c6a">
		<rdfs:label>article-8f0018d8-5776-4484-9a00-803c35935c6a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thank geography, size, climate — and a big dose of luck — for this distinction.</rdfs:comment>
