	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8fc5ddac-314a-4247-b8ae-a8ffa2894893">
		<rdfs:label>article-8fc5ddac-314a-4247-b8ae-a8ffa2894893</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A party congress appears set to give Xi Jinping five more years in power. He has big goals for cutting greenhouse gas emissions, and big challenges.</rdfs:comment>
