		<rdfs:label>article-8fc9716c-10a0-4681-b317-ceb1c5b4ddc7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state was the first to issue a stay-at-home order, helping to control an early outbreak. It has now surpassed New York for the most known cases of the virus.</rdfs:comment>
