	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8fd544a9-b65d-4bd5-9f43-a17fea63ab90">
		<rdfs:label>article-8fd544a9-b65d-4bd5-9f43-a17fea63ab90</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and Joseph R. Biden Jr. remain locked in a tight race in Georgia, according to a Monmouth University poll released Wednesday morning.</rdfs:comment>
