		<rdfs:label>article-8fd73a5d-f20c-4da3-8d84-3cc7016ee97d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. spoke with three more foreign leaders on Wednesday, in the latest show of international support for his election victory. He committed to an early meeting with one: President Moon Jae-in of South Korea.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-abb722a9-a361-472f-8815-47ba860e769f"/>
