		<rdfs:label>article-8fdd6f0c-97a9-4780-8b7a-ec4a844f2261</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This was the session that pushed Texas further to the right, at a time when it seemed least likely to do so — as the state becomes younger, less white and less Republican.</rdfs:comment>
