		<rdfs:label>article-8fe3aefe-a0a3-4e4c-9a06-8d3ad3303fd4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An intense heat wave is set to torment the Pacific Northwest. Many who have always done without air-conditioners are scrambling to get them now.</rdfs:comment>
