		<rdfs:label>article-8fe4d0e1-7d27-48d2-a389-ad4d73709d3b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The speaker of the Republican-controlled Arizona House — who supported Donald J. Trump in 2020 — just torpedoed a bill that would have let lawmakers reject the results of an election.</rdfs:comment>
