	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8fe7e1bc-4a81-4f2d-b2f8-742d421b031e">
		<rdfs:label>article-8fe7e1bc-4a81-4f2d-b2f8-742d421b031e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Inexperienced adventurers have flooded remote areas like Wyoming’s Sublette County during the pandemic. When they call for help, the task is left to an overwhelmed network of volunteers.</rdfs:comment>
