	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8feeae19-fa8b-4484-a5b2-f00b46c46adf">
		<rdfs:label>article-8feeae19-fa8b-4484-a5b2-f00b46c46adf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“Our community is exhausted,” said the mayor of the Ohio capital, which is still reeling from the fatal shooting of Casey Goodson Jr.</rdfs:comment>
