	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-8ffd0487-387c-4651-89c1-7be86194454a">
		<rdfs:label>article-8ffd0487-387c-4651-89c1-7be86194454a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president said passage of a China competition bill was needed “for the sake of our economic competitiveness and our national security.”</rdfs:comment>
