	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-90033596-0a94-4e1e-a5d6-5f6cd831819c">
		<rdfs:label>article-90033596-0a94-4e1e-a5d6-5f6cd831819c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Among black leaders close to Joe Biden, a commitment to selecting a woman is not enough. They have publicly and privately pushed him to select a black woman to fuel black voter enthusiasm.</rdfs:comment>
