		<rdfs:label>article-9004a747-9ccb-4d34-b6a4-3d426dc0e49d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A top Democrat in Congress described the move as “an outrageous act,” and said that the inspector general, Steve Linick, had opened an investigation into Secretary of State Mike Pompeo.</rdfs:comment>
