	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-900d8b8b-3561-48b7-bdd6-8b110adfdd26">
		<rdfs:label>article-900d8b8b-3561-48b7-bdd6-8b110adfdd26</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ruling followed a similar one in a case from New York and provided more evidence of a change in the court’s direction after the death of Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg.</rdfs:comment>
