		<rdfs:label>article-90228749-9b33-4d0a-820b-e5cc92096045</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fueled by concerns about burglaries and hate crimes, San Francisco’s liberal district attorney, Chesa Boudin, faces a divisive recall in a famously progressive city.</rdfs:comment>
