		<rdfs:label>article-90234a71-47e2-464d-85d0-5565c2eaa1de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Breaking his silence, the former special counsel rebutted President Trump’s attacks on the Russia investigation and said Mr. Stone had been prosecuted “because he committed federal crimes.”</rdfs:comment>
