		<rdfs:label>article-902cb550-3dfc-46db-96db-019a2506ee4f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court repudiation of President Trump was also a blunt rebuke to Republican leaders who had put their interests ahead of the country’s.</rdfs:comment>
