		<rdfs:label>article-902ed89d-9bb9-4e1e-af4c-19405884467e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision was an acknowledgment that the current shots may no longer be as protective for at least some Americans by the time a possible fall or winter surge arrives.</rdfs:comment>
