		<rdfs:label>article-904247d0-6d5c-460a-b2e3-94b25741405d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With neither the 60 votes needed to break a filibuster of legislation to protect abortion rights nor the 50 votes to pass it, Senate Democrats said they would try anyway.</rdfs:comment>
