		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-90db3976-a3f4-44be-b58c-2152d01f6d30">
		<rdfs:label>article-90db3976-a3f4-44be-b58c-2152d01f6d30</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While the Senate verdict on impeachment could come soon, the public judgment will not be rendered until November.</rdfs:comment>
