		<rdfs:label>article-90f62eba-31cc-43f9-a273-6c006fd99729</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“What we’re trying to do is get to a point where Covid deaths are largely preventable, and I think we’re pretty close to there,” the White House Covid-19 response coordinator said.</rdfs:comment>
