		<rdfs:label>article-90f8b5b0-1bf3-4c07-87c9-f23c00eaac4d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A tense battle may soon resume over the stalled $10 billion pandemic aid package that senators failed to pass earlier this month.</rdfs:comment>
