	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-90fae6bf-4791-4b01-97fb-e9805d268140">
		<rdfs:label>article-90fae6bf-4791-4b01-97fb-e9805d268140</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The father of a 23-year-old man killed by Minneapolis police officers learned of his son’s death only after police officers searched his home in the middle of the night.</rdfs:comment>
