	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-910aef5b-1c12-46f2-9dd8-56215ba04256">
		<rdfs:label>article-910aef5b-1c12-46f2-9dd8-56215ba04256</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>States have already ordered millions of doses; if the agency authorizes them in the coming days, babies, toddlers and preschoolers could start receiving shots next week.</rdfs:comment>
