		<rdfs:label>article-91ad0c54-6398-434b-bf33-5d126c73d64d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“Seattle is freaking out,” one man said as he passed a Starbucks in downtown Seattle that was closed after an employee tested positive for the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
