	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91b4c36f-f6ab-4fcc-ad46-2d6b44370404">
		<rdfs:label>article-91b4c36f-f6ab-4fcc-ad46-2d6b44370404</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Texas and five other states began providing coronavirus vaccines to everyone 16 and older regardless of health conditions on Monday, with other states scheduled to do the same this week.</rdfs:comment>
