	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91bb4a85-35ee-41a8-a2ac-723b8d9fbf04">
		<rdfs:label>article-91bb4a85-35ee-41a8-a2ac-723b8d9fbf04</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Vladimir V. Putin is making gains in his war on Ukraine while the United States and its allies struggle with soaring energy prices and inflation.</rdfs:comment>
