	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91c190c0-b33d-483e-b7b6-bd5ed0f7d425">
		<rdfs:label>article-91c190c0-b33d-483e-b7b6-bd5ed0f7d425</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden also visited a vaccination site in Washington, D.C. ahead of his remarks.</rdfs:comment>
