	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91c6b081-50a6-4736-8ce2-2324706bf96d">
		<rdfs:label>article-91c6b081-50a6-4736-8ce2-2324706bf96d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On the first day of a new legislative session, Senate leaders indicated they had made no progress in resolving their logjam over how to proceed.</rdfs:comment>
