	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91c7194c-f59d-4394-8ebc-de752f68e09b">
		<rdfs:label>article-91c7194c-f59d-4394-8ebc-de752f68e09b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden will go down in history, fairly or unfairly, as the president who presided over a humiliating final act in the American experiment in Afghanistan.</rdfs:comment>
