	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91c85166-51a8-4f7a-8ffd-633c85b8235b">
		<rdfs:label>article-91c85166-51a8-4f7a-8ffd-633c85b8235b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>During Día de Muertos, or Day of the Dead, we remember those who have been lost.</rdfs:comment>
