	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-91cafc1c-b97e-4f77-89ed-4dde86e3dbe7">
		<rdfs:label>article-91cafc1c-b97e-4f77-89ed-4dde86e3dbe7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Alabama, Louisiana and Mississippi have the lowest vaccination rates in the country, increasing the risk of virus surges there.</rdfs:comment>
