	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9207a697-85d5-45cf-bb0b-c87bfbc50c52">
		<rdfs:label>article-9207a697-85d5-45cf-bb0b-c87bfbc50c52</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and his party pushed Justice Barrett’s confirmation through in record time. But they could find that satisfied voters, who no longer fear the specter of a liberal court, are also complacent.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ef6cc7eb-b6e8-4dba-84e0-6b42579e91d0"/>
