		<rdfs:label>article-9207ade3-9580-4631-b9d3-ae55e9a3c3e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The top Senate Republican has been working to tamp down on the anti-interventionist strain in his party, his latest proxy battle against President Donald J. Trump’s America First policy.</rdfs:comment>
