		<rdfs:label>article-920bad6a-cf68-4617-a340-be2f2db60414</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Black state leaders and voters said the results were a sign that the party could not rely on minority voters to cover its cratering totals in white areas of the state.</rdfs:comment>
