		<rdfs:label>article-9213c241-552a-44c6-a446-88541c0c48ce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The country, courted by President Trump, is selling coal and sand to Chinese companies to raise millions for its nuclear program, analysts say. It is also importing luxury goods for the ruling elite.</rdfs:comment>
