	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-922a11d2-c425-4180-bf6b-232baed440c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-922a11d2-c425-4180-bf6b-232baed440c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican effort to invalidate the votes from Harris County, which includes Houston and is largely Democratic, now hinges on an effort at the federal level, where a hearing is set for Monday.</rdfs:comment>
