		<rdfs:label>article-922ba309-9ead-4f0f-9c67-aa1f681e2305</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump is planning to form a so-called leadership political action committee, a federal fund-raising vehicle that will potentially let him retain his hold on the Republican Party even when he is out of office, officials said Monday.</rdfs:comment>
