		<rdfs:label>article-92406da1-3169-4949-ac34-67c4802111e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The speech was originally going to center primarily on the president’s domestic agenda. But the war in Europe has forced the White House to change gears.</rdfs:comment>
