	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9245ea09-e29e-42ab-baec-901ef27914d2">
		<rdfs:label>article-9245ea09-e29e-42ab-baec-901ef27914d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Electoral College was nearing completion Monday afternoon of the process that will officially designate Joseph R. Biden Jr. as the president-elect, as electors in battleground states President Trump had contested — Pennsylvania, Michigan, Wisconsin, Georgia and Arizona — voted with no surprises or defections.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-982bde63-8146-432c-a09a-c9cac220ddaa"/>
