		<rdfs:label>article-92c5de36-85d7-4f7a-97a3-883159194c90</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president endorsed roughly 300 candidates in the midterm elections. With votes still being counted, those in competitive races appeared to have mixed results.</rdfs:comment>
