		<rdfs:label>article-92e994c8-c5f3-4930-a769-71c35729b3b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jason Ravnsborg, who killed a man with his car in 2020, was removed from office after the State Senate voted to convict him. He was impeached by the House in April.</rdfs:comment>
