	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-936a8b0f-7bc6-44f1-a226-90e63d3e9d94">
		<rdfs:label>article-936a8b0f-7bc6-44f1-a226-90e63d3e9d94</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The representative-elect’s long list of fabrications has raised questions about whether he will even be allowed to take his seat next week. But House Republicans have shown little appetite for punishing him.</rdfs:comment>
