	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-93753221-2d64-44bb-ab4e-093f72c58ddb">
		<rdfs:label>article-93753221-2d64-44bb-ab4e-093f72c58ddb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans said their counterproposal amounted to $928 billion, but most of the funding would come from existing programs.</rdfs:comment>
