	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-93d26b87-9e7b-4493-81a9-7a138ad23241">
		<rdfs:label>article-93d26b87-9e7b-4493-81a9-7a138ad23241</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Lindsey Graham, a South Carolina Republican who went from being one of President Trump’s fiercest critics to one of his biggest boosters, faces a much tougher challenge than he expected as he seeks re-election. The nonpartisan Cook Political Report announced Wednesday that it now considers his race against the Democrat Jaime Harrison a toss-up.</rdfs:comment>
