		<rdfs:label>article-9449f392-c2ae-4d5b-9d16-fb07e589e0d1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move is the biggest disruption to the political calendar so far because of the coronavirus, but could give Joe Biden, the likely presidential nominee, a lift heading into the fall.</rdfs:comment>
