		<rdfs:label>article-94557136-bd84-42a2-b9c7-1f99de49faec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The hard-right Republicans’ entry to the races for open Senate seats heralded fiercely contested G.O.P. primaries in the two deeply conservative states.</rdfs:comment>
