		<rdfs:label>article-945dec7f-d300-4442-9816-88e493b2696f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The justices seemed inclined to find a narrow way to reject the argument that the censure of an elected official in Houston ran afoul of the First Amendment.</rdfs:comment>
