		<rdfs:label>article-94669270-01a4-4625-a918-15ae0f5ed3b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House Republican leader made a number of false or misleading claims about the social spending bill, President Biden, immigration policy and Teslas.</rdfs:comment>
