		<rdfs:label>article-9467b92a-a852-4a43-a4cd-8d8cfbee4023</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Representative Mary Peltola, a Democrat, campaigns for the chance to serve a full term, she debated her rivals on how to utilize the state’s resources and improve bipartisanship.</rdfs:comment>
