	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-94693020-2edd-4e6a-8cdb-cedf6dff31c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-94693020-2edd-4e6a-8cdb-cedf6dff31c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The slow evacuation may be part propaganda, part preparation for a conflict or part feint, Ukrainian and U.S. officials say. It could be all three.</rdfs:comment>
