	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-94701c5e-02dd-4dcc-8813-74cc0680dc37">
		<rdfs:label>article-94701c5e-02dd-4dcc-8813-74cc0680dc37</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Appearing newly emboldened, the Democratic nominee also said he thought he would win Michigan, Wisconsin and Minnesota, three critical battleground states.</rdfs:comment>
