	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9470e788-a2c3-4ed2-857b-67a8381651a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-9470e788-a2c3-4ed2-857b-67a8381651a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Environmental groups seek to block the $8 billion pipeline, which would deliver natural gas from West Virginia to North Carolina, crossing the famed hiking trail.</rdfs:comment>
