	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9471166e-84d6-4efc-8786-95a88d8865f9">
		<rdfs:label>article-9471166e-84d6-4efc-8786-95a88d8865f9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many of the state’s hospitals have maintained lower numbers of beds in part to limit the length of patient stays and lower costs. But that approach is now being tested.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2bfc1d86-f654-490c-ae5c-efaa41acbbe5"/>
