	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-947176e8-ecd5-47a2-9624-cea6e1ed9fc8">
		<rdfs:label>article-947176e8-ecd5-47a2-9624-cea6e1ed9fc8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bill would ensure that victims have the option of suing in federal, state or tribal court, depriving perpetrators of a secretive process that can weigh heavily in their favor.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
