	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-947cc371-5bb1-4013-9212-8de9493598f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-947cc371-5bb1-4013-9212-8de9493598f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>His victory, which came after nearly two weeks of vote-counting, made the congressman one of just two House Republicans who supported impeaching the former president to remain in Congress.</rdfs:comment>
