		<rdfs:label>article-947d3ca2-8eb3-4d8e-b569-ce4f89fc3fc2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>State legislative races will be absent from Tuesday’s ballot after the Ohio Supreme Court rejected Republican-drawn political maps four times.</rdfs:comment>
