	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-94807224-8251-492a-a35e-eede5042a5a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-94807224-8251-492a-a35e-eede5042a5a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Businesses ranging from national chain stores to neighborhood pizza shops have been damaged in the wake of George Floyd’s death. Stunned store owners were still assessing their losses.</rdfs:comment>
