	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-948358d9-1987-4682-b5bd-6cd098e53796">
		<rdfs:label>article-948358d9-1987-4682-b5bd-6cd098e53796</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With its expanded subsidies for health plans under the Affordable Care Act, the coronavirus relief bill makes insurance more affordable, and puts health care on the ballot in 2022.</rdfs:comment>
