	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-94ba1aba-00d0-4c72-ae45-c8395a10fa1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-94ba1aba-00d0-4c72-ae45-c8395a10fa1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The measure, which would include money to address climate change, expand Medicare and fulfill other Democratic priorities, is intended to deliver on President Biden’s economic proposal.</rdfs:comment>
