		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-94be608a-1bed-42cd-ac84-dc560aa12b1d">
		<rdfs:label>article-94be608a-1bed-42cd-ac84-dc560aa12b1d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Eight counties in Northern California have ordered residents to “shelter in place.” In the Sacramento area, residents were also being asked to stay home as much as possible.</rdfs:comment>
