		<rdfs:label>article-970cbd94-0682-4afa-8b42-a83349bacf3e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s allies have promoted claims of corruption aimed at the former vice president’s son in an effort to damage the Biden campaign.</rdfs:comment>
