		<rdfs:label>article-971c2623-eb48-4b8f-8782-0df64d3da582</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Administration officials blame the Delta variant for a prolonged stretch of consumer spending on goods, rather than services, pushing up prices and creating a conundrum for the Fed.</rdfs:comment>
