	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-971da09a-f6c3-4542-924c-970bdd361631">
		<rdfs:label>article-971da09a-f6c3-4542-924c-970bdd361631</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the president took forceful new steps to pressure Americans to get inoculated, he argued that they were urgently needed health measures. In his allies’ view, they were also good politics.</rdfs:comment>
