	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-971de76c-76f1-4504-bf8b-0283b50ad7e0">
		<rdfs:label>article-971de76c-76f1-4504-bf8b-0283b50ad7e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than 1,600 clergy members, religious scholars and other faith-focused officials and activists are endorsing Joseph R. Biden Jr., the largest group of faith leaders to back a Democratic presidential candidate in modern times, organizers of the initiative said.</rdfs:comment>
