		<rdfs:label>article-9724410e-d02f-4eba-ac15-f4a1a88d17d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Central to the decision is Justice Alito’s belief that the Constitution does not include a right to abortion.</rdfs:comment>
