	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-972a2717-58d8-41c0-888e-0952ceeb9799">
		<rdfs:label>article-972a2717-58d8-41c0-888e-0952ceeb9799</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 6-to-3 decision held that a state requirement infringed on the First Amendment. The court’s liberal members suggested it could erode disclosure laws for political campaigns.</rdfs:comment>
