		<rdfs:label>article-97415bc6-b88a-46d1-85f9-723451b41bcf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden tested negative for the coronavirus and planned to go ahead with campaign events. But President Trump’s hospitalization injected new volatility into the race a month before Election Day.</rdfs:comment>
