		<rdfs:label>article-975b8ae7-510a-4974-a9d6-92c5a0024f8e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president will mark the nearly 100 days he has spent in the Oval Office by describing his efforts to vaccinate Americans and revive the economy.</rdfs:comment>
