	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9778f21e-9977-4feb-b8a2-8e9f91fdae78">
		<rdfs:label>article-9778f21e-9977-4feb-b8a2-8e9f91fdae78</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Ngozi Okonjo-Iweala, the first woman and the first African to serve in the post, said she would make global economic recovery from the pandemic a priority.</rdfs:comment>
