		<rdfs:label>article-9871217b-d753-4dd1-810b-84c0b426809e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge in Atlanta on Tuesday denied a last-minute effort by President Trump to decertify Georgia’s election results, handing the president yet another courtroom loss just one day before Congress is scheduled to bring the presidential race to an official end.</rdfs:comment>
