		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-987b4bfb-87df-4dcc-aa5a-26fc31188a0e">
		<rdfs:label>article-987b4bfb-87df-4dcc-aa5a-26fc31188a0e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move would be the first significant sign that the Biden administration is taking more control of a vaccine distribution effort that states are struggling to manage.</rdfs:comment>
