	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-987c04ba-c8e4-4f9b-9d14-d65dc2f1eac8">
		<rdfs:label>article-987c04ba-c8e4-4f9b-9d14-d65dc2f1eac8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In South Dakota and other states, lawmakers are considering bills that would restrict access to hormone treatment and surgeries for young transgender people.</rdfs:comment>
