	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-987c0cd6-0f34-49a5-96ba-95a0a0fd6686">
		<rdfs:label>article-987c0cd6-0f34-49a5-96ba-95a0a0fd6686</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At big universities with powerful fraternity cultures — like UMass, Northwestern, Nebraska and Iowa — many students are demanding an end to Greek life.</rdfs:comment>
