		<rdfs:label>article-98a40c87-8b10-4822-a8e6-b81e1647ad10</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The storm, Florida’s deadliest since 1935, has been linked to the deaths of at least 119 people in the state, many of them older residents who lived near the coast.</rdfs:comment>
