		<rdfs:label>article-98afd359-bf30-45e4-9f05-55367cfddaf1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s personal lawyer has become caught up in Sacha Baron Cohen’s new “Borat” satire after he was shown with an actress in an edited scene.</rdfs:comment>
