	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-98b00885-7096-451e-9cc4-adf690da1664">
		<rdfs:label>article-98b00885-7096-451e-9cc4-adf690da1664</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new study said that limiting warming to 1.5 degrees Celsius could reduce sea level rise from melting ice sheets from about 10 inches to about five by 2100.</rdfs:comment>
