		<rdfs:label>article-98b0a222-1346-45fe-8f87-86b7bf99502e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In its last six months, the Trump administration put more than three times as many prisoners to death as the federal government had in the previous six decades.</rdfs:comment>
