		<rdfs:label>article-98b3a2bb-8d0e-443f-9358-c01688ae8f71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Prosecutors want to speak with the former vice president as a witness to former President Donald Trump’s efforts to remain in power, and he is said to be considering how to respond.</rdfs:comment>
