		<rdfs:label>article-98ce0599-952d-4cfc-b477-3bae0950269d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president, who once described Mr. Lewis’s district as “crime infested,” expressed his condolences on Twitter a day after the congressman’s death.</rdfs:comment>
