		<rdfs:label>article-98d1497d-6207-48ff-ba87-8127bc282367</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the coronavirus spreading out of control in many parts of the United States and daily case counts setting records, health experts say it is only a matter of time before hospitals start to reach the breaking point.</rdfs:comment>
