		<rdfs:label>article-98d5c080-b563-49fc-9c31-9c6c4289256b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Board of the Office of Congressional Ethics said there was “substantial reason to believe that Rep. Palazzo converted funds to personal use to pay expenses that were not legitimate.”</rdfs:comment>
