		<rdfs:label>article-98e6eb51-96de-43cd-a897-57b2a42e29c4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>European countries are paying to preserve jobs during the coronavirus crisis. Sadly for American workers, the United States is charting its own path.</rdfs:comment>
