	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-98e90d05-0d89-4cee-b413-7625ec83ecfe">
		<rdfs:label>article-98e90d05-0d89-4cee-b413-7625ec83ecfe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A February conference by the drug company Biogen was initially thought to have infected 99 people. By the end of October, it was feared that the number had grown as high as 300,000.</rdfs:comment>
