		<rdfs:label>article-98ed9114-c780-497c-b51e-d604cd564249</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The California governor has taken full advantage of the state’s loose financing rules for recall elections, overpowering Republican challengers for whom the cavalry never arrived.</rdfs:comment>
