		<rdfs:label>article-98f60002-1a45-463f-990c-a88df9ded002</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the primary in Michigan looms, a return to Bay County finds residents wrestling to make ends meet. Many plant jobs are gone. Getting by can be a juggling act.</rdfs:comment>
