	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-98fdba94-a6a7-4a98-bedc-7a285edf9223">
		<rdfs:label>article-98fdba94-a6a7-4a98-bedc-7a285edf9223</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>During a visit to the C.D.C., the president sought to play down the risk from the virus and said he would not be inclined to cancel events and travel except to infected areas.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
