	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-99096282-f31c-4044-b192-86406869b7d0">
		<rdfs:label>article-99096282-f31c-4044-b192-86406869b7d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The aid, part of a $40 billion assistance package approved by Congress in May, is a sign of the administration’s determination to assist in the fight against Russia’s invasion.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
