		<rdfs:label>article-992e7715-bbd2-4c52-8183-acac107a73b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As part of their attempt to interfere with the 2020 election, Russians are grabbing screenshots of President Trump’s tweets, or quoting his own misleading statements, analysts and officials say.</rdfs:comment>
