	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9968e879-1fab-49e6-b641-3a58bde04433">
		<rdfs:label>article-9968e879-1fab-49e6-b641-3a58bde04433</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With an eye toward parents’ anxiety, Republicans have put forward a wave of laws on classroom instruction, youth sports and health care. Some of the young people at the center feel isolated.</rdfs:comment>
