	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9969e04c-fce4-4a5a-b312-b4876a61d191">
		<rdfs:label>article-9969e04c-fce4-4a5a-b312-b4876a61d191</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This year’s outlook from NOAA forecasters predicts between 14 to 21 named storms, with between six and 10 expected to reach hurricane strength.</rdfs:comment>
