	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9974ec1e-c08a-40f2-b951-d4bf0214ddd5">
		<rdfs:label>article-9974ec1e-c08a-40f2-b951-d4bf0214ddd5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>W. McCall Calhoun Jr., who ran for office in Georgia as a Democrat, is a walking embodiment of his state’s political contradictions.</rdfs:comment>
