	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9975af74-af2a-4ebc-bac8-415f44a5e03e">
		<rdfs:label>article-9975af74-af2a-4ebc-bac8-415f44a5e03e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The unity message won. Now it will face a test.</rdfs:comment>
