	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-99763476-30ea-4197-b3d9-4d01b1202dcf">
		<rdfs:label>article-99763476-30ea-4197-b3d9-4d01b1202dcf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Families and volunteers seek out and restore abandoned cemeteries as a way of recovering their own personal stories.</rdfs:comment>
