	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9b39cf5f-09fd-43a3-a217-972be4d378c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-9b39cf5f-09fd-43a3-a217-972be4d378c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>John Lujan, a 59-year-old retired firefighter, won the seat, a blow for Democrats in the Texas city.</rdfs:comment>
