		<rdfs:label>article-9b4ff142-2ca0-4dc4-92b1-2f8544dacce8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Rebates and tax credits can lower the cost of solar panels, energy-efficient appliances and electric vehicles.</rdfs:comment>
