	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9b5866f2-1c60-4fc7-8bc6-e8bcd44d1151">
		<rdfs:label>article-9b5866f2-1c60-4fc7-8bc6-e8bcd44d1151</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Much about the shooting death of Casey Goodson Jr. by a sheriff’s deputy has been disputed — what led to it, why it happened and where exactly on his body Mr. Goodson was shot.</rdfs:comment>
