	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9b9d179b-75c7-4aa7-a7bb-c738b3da1fd1">
		<rdfs:label>article-9b9d179b-75c7-4aa7-a7bb-c738b3da1fd1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump campaign has started using an advertising firm linked to MyPillow, a company whose chief executive is a donor to and ally of the president, to buy some of its television airtime.</rdfs:comment>
