		<rdfs:label>article-9bb98916-df3d-4040-9463-3ab448ae0cc2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Missouri, Cori Bush, a progressive activist, upset the 10-term incumbent William Lacy Clay Jr., marking another major step forward for the progressive movement in its bid to threaten centrist officials.</rdfs:comment>
