		<rdfs:label>article-9c2824ee-e5e4-4641-9541-225bd9ef3fed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Firmly linking teen suicides to school closings is difficult, but rising mental health emergencies and suicide rates point to the toll the pandemic lockdown is taking.</rdfs:comment>
