	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9c458fa2-5abc-4689-9927-c72cbfdf5f81">
		<rdfs:label>article-9c458fa2-5abc-4689-9927-c72cbfdf5f81</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s bipartisan infrastructure agreement contains all of the contradictions and promises of the Biden brand. It is a deal that dramatically curbs Democrats’ policy goals in the pursuit of bipartisanship, but also opens a portal to what could be the most ambitious expansion of government into the economy in decades.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
