		<rdfs:label>article-9c62817c-bf9e-4e7d-8f2c-5f19a2574b38</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 95-year-old monarch gave her address by video, after doctors advised her to rest and not go to the summit. Prince Charles attended and delivered a similar message.</rdfs:comment>
