		<rdfs:label>article-9c767ee5-135e-4976-a22f-4c59fcc91959</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democratic donors gave more money online in the 9 p.m. hour Friday after Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg’s death was announced — $6.2 million — than in any other single hour since ActBlue, the donation-processing site, was started 16 years ago.</rdfs:comment>
