		<rdfs:label>article-9c77702e-e9ce-48ce-8fc2-c6624bc7def6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The announcement came just a week after Mr. Perdue, a former senator and a Republican, said he had filed paperwork for a possible campaign, and just days after a meeting with Donald Trump.</rdfs:comment>
