		<rdfs:label>article-9c7bd6f8-ee80-4de7-a2a0-1e53f9aa1105</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Supply shortages, financial barriers and misinformation are still stopping some Americans from getting a test.</rdfs:comment>
