	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9c8219a7-e402-48d0-8995-3dc957945c7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-9c8219a7-e402-48d0-8995-3dc957945c7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration’s actions suggest either a botched case or a shrewd play for time as it gives up on the mask order but hopes to erase an adverse ruling, legal experts said.</rdfs:comment>
