	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9c8c8ade-b1c8-43a1-b0d1-9749adf016d0">
		<rdfs:label>article-9c8c8ade-b1c8-43a1-b0d1-9749adf016d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The department that protects Congress is damaged and depleted following the Jan. 6 assault, with funding, staffing and operational problems plaguing a deeply demoralized force.</rdfs:comment>
