	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9ca8a24f-71d8-4686-a459-b5da8fb5e9c6">
		<rdfs:label>article-9ca8a24f-71d8-4686-a459-b5da8fb5e9c6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Party leaders think that tying President Biden’s handling of the war to his domestic woes could be a potent argument with voters in the fall.</rdfs:comment>
