	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9cad1611-14ee-484f-ba81-a731041f47a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-9cad1611-14ee-484f-ba81-a731041f47a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state plans to hold its elections on Tuesday, thrusting thousands of clerks and poll workers, many of them older or with health conditions, onto the pandemic’s front lines.</rdfs:comment>
