		<rdfs:label>article-9cbeec61-e8c3-4a60-b594-150c029f7f42</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fueled by a debate over when the justice system should consider young people adults, the legislation would apply to those under 25 when they committed a crime who have served at least 15 years.</rdfs:comment>
