		<rdfs:label>article-9cc4517b-910e-49fc-9792-e268adfe4ed9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An issue that has always been on the sidelines in presidential campaigns may be coming to the forefront as Joseph Biden seeks to cast climate change, not violence, as the real and immediate threat to the suburbs.</rdfs:comment>
