	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d321a83-39f9-4c39-876b-3f6e2925af28">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d321a83-39f9-4c39-876b-3f6e2925af28</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid increasing anxiety over the coronavirus, the president said he expected to pardon Michael T. Flynn, his former national security adviser who had pleaded guilty to lying to the F.B.I.</rdfs:comment>
