	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d3717b6-66af-4983-b2d9-c7156e22e3bb">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d3717b6-66af-4983-b2d9-c7156e22e3bb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After working in oil fields, Oscar Carrillo eyed the stability of law enforcement or funeral work. As a border sheriff, he is doing both.</rdfs:comment>
