	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d37c9fd-0ce5-43b5-9117-5660a231fe36">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d37c9fd-0ce5-43b5-9117-5660a231fe36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Prosecutors described Mr. Rittenhouse as an out-of-town visitor who was armed illegally during tense protests over policing in Kenosha, Wis. His defense team said he was defending himself.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3d0d7757-313d-444e-a4df-32876c51aaa0"/>
