	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d390e98-f62e-4322-9664-42dc12d8755c">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d390e98-f62e-4322-9664-42dc12d8755c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As millions of Americans lack enough to eat, the administration is rapidly increasing aid — with an eye toward a permanent safety net expansion.</rdfs:comment>
