		<rdfs:label>article-9d3915f0-d2e3-4d1a-b6fc-b096ff515682</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Armed conflict could exacerbate supply chain disruptions and drive food, gas and other prices higher.</rdfs:comment>
