	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d489db1-b818-4833-89be-24a9477dedd5">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d489db1-b818-4833-89be-24a9477dedd5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thursday: The University of California’s president talks about her tenure and the pandemic. Also: A shooting rattles Paso Robles; and reopening updates.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-204cd1d8-9d72-4785-968e-7d68ce7d17d7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-738c55e5-1f96-4b93-8c70-fc8c1c8c9119"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d4a6f5a-4eee-42a4-86d3-bde6c44174bd">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d4a6f5a-4eee-42a4-86d3-bde6c44174bd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new organization helping progressive groups highlights a dynamic of the Biden era: Many of the most influential voices in Democratic politics are also the least experienced.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d4afbb0-56be-4d4e-8d86-801fc1eb55b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d4afbb0-56be-4d4e-8d86-801fc1eb55b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It’s a familiar line in Texas political circles: The last time Democrats carried the state in a presidential race was when Jimmy Carter won in 1976. Now, at 96, the man who accomplished that feat is lending his name to a fund-raising appeal to help his party possibly flip as many as 10 congressional seats in the Lone Star State.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fd2d6ec4-4aa3-452f-8e17-99a953af7b67"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d4b4675-6094-4612-aafc-358608f0f239">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d4b4675-6094-4612-aafc-358608f0f239</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>China announced plans for live-fire military drills soon after Ms. Pelosi flew into Taiwan. Analysts said Beijing’s move seemed designed to project strength rather than serve as a precursor to an invasion.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2cc386a2-c929-4cd1-bdfe-c8aecebabdcf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7f681a8f-df31-44e7-bbae-c9ce9244a46a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d51e895-81ba-492d-b34c-e11f7792b654">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d51e895-81ba-492d-b34c-e11f7792b654</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>People of all ages flocked on Saturday to the building in Washington, leaving flowers, posters and messages scrawled in chalk.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9d70ec7c-4469-4070-b704-f06eb556d22a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
