	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d532896-99ad-492f-92a3-5aa9b6a6e9c0">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d532896-99ad-492f-92a3-5aa9b6a6e9c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Pennsylvania’s lieutenant governor, John Fetterman has pushed for second chances for certain convicts. But crime has become a focal point for Republicans nationwide in the 2022 elections.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d536441-1bf1-4390-9216-33e3e257e9f5">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d536441-1bf1-4390-9216-33e3e257e9f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Top federal health officials said in interviews this week that the number of rare blood clotting disorders in recipients of the Johnson &amp; Johnson vaccine has remained small.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3263b980-a580-440f-bdd2-6d7fa7bb3fab"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e4ac7a5-be1a-4937-b91e-66276e5f8dd9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d5d765e-d770-44a3-b189-50dce267bf7a">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d5d765e-d770-44a3-b189-50dce267bf7a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Did Democrats take the Hispanic vote for granted in 2020? Some in the party think they did, and can’t afford the same mistakes going forward.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6cc67a-b3c2-45c5-af7a-92a423ab1249"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d5ee076-511a-46fa-a754-3d70779be8b5">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d5ee076-511a-46fa-a754-3d70779be8b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The PAC can accept donations from an unlimited number of people and spend to benefit other candidates, allowing the president to retain influence in a party remade largely in his image.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d610546-79af-4c08-b9b4-0e0152d3bceb">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d610546-79af-4c08-b9b4-0e0152d3bceb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Their relationship has been a constant through wins and losses, reinvention and raising a family. At 96 and 93, they have come to rely on their bond more now than ever.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc5a47b7-5e7e-4d58-8ee7-caaf2f703c6a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d629a71-2ee2-4a64-af7a-6a8a22f3f50e">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d629a71-2ee2-4a64-af7a-6a8a22f3f50e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wyoming said anyone 16 or over would now be able to get a shot. New Mexico and South Dakota said they would do the same on Monday.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b234823e-9687-443c-921d-17ad590417a4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dad1523a-f983-4f0f-af53-0061c7165e91"/>
