	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d6b12b4-0b22-4d0d-9359-544a1c73c422">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d6b12b4-0b22-4d0d-9359-544a1c73c422</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A state board had previously said the issue could not appear on the ballot because of word spacing problems on the petitions.</rdfs:comment>
