	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9d6eeeba-b8ad-4af3-bceb-a86c2b8aa61a">
		<rdfs:label>article-9d6eeeba-b8ad-4af3-bceb-a86c2b8aa61a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Campaign reporting has changed enormously since the days of Theodore White, Timothy Crouse and Richard Ben Cramer. Today, a chat with two Times reporters who live in the brave new world of American politics.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-14"/>
