	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9e2e268c-eba4-4f13-a8fa-2ba14f1a0768">
		<rdfs:label>article-9e2e268c-eba4-4f13-a8fa-2ba14f1a0768</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>San Francisco has endured mask mandates, vaccination requirements and lockdowns. Now with the first U.S. case of the Omicron variant, no one’s sure what comes next.</rdfs:comment>
