		<rdfs:label>article-9e8fb9af-c413-49aa-a2da-92517cd17087</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thursday: A report analyzes which workers are most vulnerable and what that says about California’s economy. Also: An update from the U.S.N.S. Mercy.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-524922c4-c335-4218-b145-d4752931be34"/>
