	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9e91c09e-eed8-4a6e-bf61-052167f16b3e">
		<rdfs:label>article-9e91c09e-eed8-4a6e-bf61-052167f16b3e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>U.S. officials say they do not believe that Russia has decided to detonate a tactical device, but concerns are rising.</rdfs:comment>
