		<rdfs:label>article-9e91da46-cbc0-4468-af64-0fc8820a3815</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Food and Drug Administration official said the best time for an additional shot may be fall, when the spread of the coronavirus is expected to pick up again</rdfs:comment>
