	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9e93d2c0-869c-4fbe-b693-6a1b24e8f90a">
		<rdfs:label>article-9e93d2c0-869c-4fbe-b693-6a1b24e8f90a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a brief bit of political theater, the House majority leader opened the chamber for business to ask for unanimous consent to accede to President Trump’s request for larger checks.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
