	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f137394-27db-4425-813f-90eb25fc5242">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f137394-27db-4425-813f-90eb25fc5242</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The district in the border city of Brownsville has sent Democrats to Congress for years.</rdfs:comment>
