	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f53bc87-bb06-4b34-aed1-6d4e00565157">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f53bc87-bb06-4b34-aed1-6d4e00565157</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tuesday’s runoff election for Senate may finally settle Jeff Sessions’s yearslong standoff with President Trump, as Republicans referee between a native son and a president they admire.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1a919c05-175d-4b8d-9183-278fc0c9195c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-12"/>
