		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f58b669-02ed-4f2e-a021-354ea6776401">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f58b669-02ed-4f2e-a021-354ea6776401</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With President Biden planning to withdraw troops from Afghanistan by September, a bipartisan coalition in Congress is rushing to bring Afghans facing retribution to the United States.</rdfs:comment>
