		<rdfs:label>article-9f59a20b-9ea8-4618-bf2f-78708f0fe0a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Bill Cario was one of the first to enter the elementary school after the shooting on Dec. 14, 2012, but he stresses that he was not alone in helping, or in healing the community.</rdfs:comment>
