		<rdfs:label>article-9f66619a-02ca-4518-aeef-e0f96e870d07</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A whipsaw week of charged decisions by the Justice Department, some favored by the president and others not, has bewildered much of Washington.</rdfs:comment>
