	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f6a9f0a-63e0-471b-9036-0e2c814e323d">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f6a9f0a-63e0-471b-9036-0e2c814e323d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>John Fetterman flipped a key Senate seat in part by attracting white working-class votes, including in the reddest parts of his state.</rdfs:comment>
