	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f7993f7-0321-4011-b627-8101b5f5c31c">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f7993f7-0321-4011-b627-8101b5f5c31c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In places where social distancing is impossible and medical care strained, bars won’t stop the infection’s spread.</rdfs:comment>
