	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f7b5601-ff58-4404-b538-a4f04297996b">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f7b5601-ff58-4404-b538-a4f04297996b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president who emerged from last year’s impeachment trial feeling emboldened emerges from this one secluded behind closed doors in Florida and facing an uncertain political and legal future.</rdfs:comment>
