	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f807786-7099-417e-afc2-31355bbde405">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f807786-7099-417e-afc2-31355bbde405</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The clash at Sunday’s debate over Joe Biden’s record was the first in a litany of criticisms Bernie Sanders leveled at his former Senate colleague’s voting history.</rdfs:comment>
