	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f80fe3d-d0aa-4473-b8ce-c8005ba575ea">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f80fe3d-d0aa-4473-b8ce-c8005ba575ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president spent Sunday out of sight, berating opponents on Twitter, even as some of his campaign advisers were recommending that he deliver a televised address to an anxious nation.</rdfs:comment>
