		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f893a41-a805-418f-9256-09bc72da4f60">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f893a41-a805-418f-9256-09bc72da4f60</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With far less money than anticipated, campaign officials are scrambling to address a severe financial disadvantage against Joseph R. Biden Jr., producing something of an internal blame game.</rdfs:comment>
