		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f8f2402-e6bb-40fb-9bd2-325dc3ae0042">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f8f2402-e6bb-40fb-9bd2-325dc3ae0042</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move signals a shift for the Biden administration as the United States and NATO allies brace for possible Russian military action.</rdfs:comment>
