	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9f9d0966-4b4b-4149-a25e-abc4578ac3a3">
		<rdfs:label>article-9f9d0966-4b4b-4149-a25e-abc4578ac3a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Congress had been set to receive the first batch of Trump White House files from the National Archives on Friday, a move that the former president had fought.</rdfs:comment>
