	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fa772cf-f990-4157-951b-c943bb3c90f7">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fa772cf-f990-4157-951b-c943bb3c90f7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Borrowing $7 billion without smart spending cuts will leave the city in a yearslong fiscal bind.</rdfs:comment>
