	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fb4f5f0-0e21-4373-a122-599e2292daf0">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fb4f5f0-0e21-4373-a122-599e2292daf0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The police officer who shot and killed Mr. Wright during a traffic stop faces two felony counts; both are for manslaughter, not murder.</rdfs:comment>
