	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fb95400-e5f4-4dca-8c63-8e010ed9c7cd">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fb95400-e5f4-4dca-8c63-8e010ed9c7cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a visit to Pennsylvania hours before Joe Biden’s nomination speech, President Trump sought to undermine the former vice president’s Scranton roots, saying he had “abandoned” the state.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fbbabab-42d9-4b9d-b5a5-93a121ee4043">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fbbabab-42d9-4b9d-b5a5-93a121ee4043</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Congress tries to throw itself a lifeline, while Biden chooses a Harvard scientist to head the C.D.C.: This is your politics tip sheet.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-887d1269-7020-4c8e-8dfc-eae7c464f3cb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fbde523-5cfe-4253-8984-74e04bf0b218">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fbde523-5cfe-4253-8984-74e04bf0b218</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Several municipalities have halted new projects to study their impact on pollution and congestion.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c0050320-e88b-421a-a172-e29ecc7ed018"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-17"/>
