	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fbf5f8a-1400-43e8-9cb5-a4cd8e94b6ed">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fbf5f8a-1400-43e8-9cb5-a4cd8e94b6ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Trailed by the Capitol riot fallout and 2024 speculation, the two erstwhile allies gave competing speeches that revealed the Republican Party’s enduring challenges and divisions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d8482953-a125-4fa7-a4ef-dc645e3472e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-26"/>
