	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fbfa1b0-de48-473e-b26a-fa7ae6f1e39c">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fbfa1b0-de48-473e-b26a-fa7ae6f1e39c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The United States has walked to the edge of direct conflict with Russia in an operation that is reminiscent of the Berlin airlift of 1948-49, but far more complex.</rdfs:comment>
