	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fdc4457-b633-437a-aafd-61d8d5763b7f">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fdc4457-b633-437a-aafd-61d8d5763b7f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>All across the country, small groups of military veterans are hungry for what they see as a righteous fight to defend freedom against an autocratic aggressor.</rdfs:comment>
