	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-9fdefc54-2671-4d28-a88b-2df829e88ba0">
		<rdfs:label>article-9fdefc54-2671-4d28-a88b-2df829e88ba0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The judge has postponed hearings in the case. A proposed agreement would avert a death-penalty trial for the five defendants.</rdfs:comment>
