		<rdfs:label>article-a0464664-a853-437e-b1fc-346210eb77e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The political fights around a malaria drug that President Trump says he takes daily have impeded studies into whether it works to prevent coronavirus infection or treat Covid-19 early.</rdfs:comment>
