	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a04d7634-4449-4137-8418-b44495d62f7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-a04d7634-4449-4137-8418-b44495d62f7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One inquiry appears to focus on materials taken from the White House at the end of the Trump presidency; the other is centered on a plan to create slates of false electors to change the outcome of the 2020 election.</rdfs:comment>
