	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a0583dac-90cd-473e-ae2c-35e56d05731a">
		<rdfs:label>article-a0583dac-90cd-473e-ae2c-35e56d05731a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new law allowing people to carry handguns without a license has led to more spontaneous shootings, many in law enforcement say.</rdfs:comment>
