		<rdfs:label>article-a09aefa9-3722-4f2f-9762-981eac9703ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facebook announced on Monday that it plans to remove content centered around the “Stop the Steal” movement across its platform, as the social network prepares for a potentially quarrelsome presidential inauguration on January 20.</rdfs:comment>
