		<rdfs:label>article-a0dc6224-a2f4-489c-97c1-ec585855c5d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A major United Nations report will declare that slashing emissions of methane, the main component of natural gas, is far more vital than previously thought.</rdfs:comment>
