		<rdfs:label>article-a0f696ad-b9da-460a-b16b-f915c3dcef3d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A surprise decision by a top Senate official gives Democrats multiple chances to skirt Republican opposition, but it could sap momentum for weakening the filibuster.</rdfs:comment>
