	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a0f80b6f-0543-4e01-8ae6-a6fe9f16dc71">
		<rdfs:label>article-a0f80b6f-0543-4e01-8ae6-a6fe9f16dc71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump may not think he lost the election, but he’s acting like a man on his way out, doling out plum spots on premier boards and commissions to his friends and supporters.</rdfs:comment>
