		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a100e48e-5802-4468-87d0-e12c3078ed03">
		<rdfs:label>article-a100e48e-5802-4468-87d0-e12c3078ed03</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Progressives balked at sending military aid to a country they accuse of human rights abuses, angering centrists and Jewish lawmakers who said the United States must support a crucial ally.</rdfs:comment>
