	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a1076cdf-0bde-4f31-a757-1c4ef4829902">
		<rdfs:label>article-a1076cdf-0bde-4f31-a757-1c4ef4829902</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Black man was fatally wounded while the authorities were executing warrants. Law enforcement officials are under mounting public pressure.</rdfs:comment>
