	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a107efd0-4c66-4443-8d0c-0188f8562962">
		<rdfs:label>article-a107efd0-4c66-4443-8d0c-0188f8562962</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 12 jurors in Kyle Rittenhouse’s homicide trial are to consider only the evidence presented in court as they work toward verdicts on five criminal counts that must each be decided unanimously.</rdfs:comment>
