	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a10a517f-71f4-408d-ae52-a0800183f115">
		<rdfs:label>article-a10a517f-71f4-408d-ae52-a0800183f115</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Leaders must balance the safety of members and the public with a desire to keep the legislative branch operating.</rdfs:comment>
