	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a10b676b-fe12-4659-a7a2-3490a425a46b">
		<rdfs:label>article-a10b676b-fe12-4659-a7a2-3490a425a46b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There will be a distinctly Northern California touch to the office of the vice president. Hanging on the wall, per a promise from Vice President-elect Kamala Harris, will be a jersey from the Golden State Warriors, number 49.  On the back: “Madame V.P.”</rdfs:comment>
