	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a1febfeb-ab54-4e1e-8644-4260962975bc">
		<rdfs:label>article-a1febfeb-ab54-4e1e-8644-4260962975bc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Trump pint glasses. Trump T-shirts. Trump memberships. Six months after the former president left office, his party’s fund-raising success depends heavily on his vaunted name.</rdfs:comment>
