		<rdfs:label>article-a216b9d3-3eca-4cc6-aee3-02f15ddcb2e2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Regardless of the Senate’s verdict, the impeachment inquiry, President Trump’s own words and other revelations yield a narrative establishing his involvement in the pressure campaign.</rdfs:comment>
