	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a30a7946-ed68-42e5-a132-a985f3fa3607">
		<rdfs:label>article-a30a7946-ed68-42e5-a132-a985f3fa3607</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump continued his assault on election integrity, baselessly claiming the presidential results and the Senate runoffs in Georgia were both invalid — which could complicate G.O.P. efforts to motivate voters.</rdfs:comment>
