		<rdfs:label>article-a30ab0de-e998-41e2-b941-72900395e6fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The three officers at the scene — two of whom held Mr. Floyd down and one who kept bystanders away — are charged with violating his civil rights as Derek Chauvin knelt on his neck.</rdfs:comment>
