		<rdfs:label>article-a30abaa7-fe0d-4861-8244-50087cd04e7f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden and leading congressional Democrats have made the far-reaching bill a top priority, but some proponents believe it needs major changes.</rdfs:comment>
