	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3118fa8-c9b0-40c9-b2aa-48022c239498">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3118fa8-c9b0-40c9-b2aa-48022c239498</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The end of a pandemic-related federal policy is expected to lead to a surge in immigration. Gov. Greg Abbott said he would send migrants who volunteered to the steps of the U.S. Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
