	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3186dc3-88c2-44df-9ff4-e3bd4dc71ba7">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3186dc3-88c2-44df-9ff4-e3bd4dc71ba7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Her opponent, Sara Gideon, is running on her record in the state — but does it matter in a year when all politics is national?</rdfs:comment>
