		<rdfs:label>article-a31c054c-c4f7-41bc-8280-e88cc288b224</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The acting U.S. attorney in Washington said that focusing on militia members and other extremists would be a top priority.</rdfs:comment>
