	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a388c66d-cc44-4048-90a1-949640341558">
		<rdfs:label>article-a388c66d-cc44-4048-90a1-949640341558</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vote reflected the waning likelihood that Congress would be able to reach an election-year compromise on legislation to address racial bias in policing.</rdfs:comment>
