		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3902c53-7689-4cef-9147-d3411adbcc37">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3902c53-7689-4cef-9147-d3411adbcc37</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Before the November election, Mr. Walker had help from Republicans far and wide. Now, he’s relying heavily on Gov. Brian Kemp of Georgia to pull him ahead of Senator Raphael Warnock, the Democratic incumbent.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d8482953-a125-4fa7-a4ef-dc645e3472e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-12-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3a1ce90-aee3-46cf-90a1-2a31650bb8aa">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3a1ce90-aee3-46cf-90a1-2a31650bb8aa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Older Americans are pivotal to the success of the vaccination campaign rolling out across the United States. They are the most likely to be hospitalized and to die from Covid-19, and the least likely to muster a strong immune response to the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5c43faa4-2a00-49c8-abf7-1bb010d19618"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3a29404-d0bf-47c4-99d0-fab2d5fec438">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3a29404-d0bf-47c4-99d0-fab2d5fec438</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hotel owners, who spent years loading up on a cheap type of debt, are now faced with the potential for default as the pandemic saps revenues.</rdfs:comment>
