		<rdfs:label>article-a3b490df-ed59-4fd7-b9e7-7760f29ec402</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After weeks of escalation and threatening language, the Defense Department is sending mixed messages as the anniversary of the death of an Iranian general nears.</rdfs:comment>
