	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3b50787-7910-4969-b402-280a03dc06d0">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3b50787-7910-4969-b402-280a03dc06d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump Organization will license its name for a planned golf course in Oman, renewing questions about the former president’s mixing of politics and business as he appears poised for another run.</rdfs:comment>
