		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3b6923e-7839-4dcb-a67d-d82626335b80">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3b6923e-7839-4dcb-a67d-d82626335b80</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The increased spread of the virus has prompted the G.O.P. to change its tone and confront the reluctance among its constituents to take the Covid-19 vaccine.</rdfs:comment>
