		<rdfs:label>article-a3b7c3bf-391f-41c7-ad14-d785755e73ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The announcement is the latest effort by Senate Republicans to press forward with an election-year bid to discredit the Trump-Russia investigation.</rdfs:comment>
