	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3d881ac-c506-4457-8673-28d36f3381a5">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3d881ac-c506-4457-8673-28d36f3381a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Party leaders want to capitalize on Donald Trump’s appeal to the white working class. But in recent weeks, they’ve offered very little to advance working people’s economic interests.</rdfs:comment>
