		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3db7c63-5129-4c5c-8da6-fc9b7c407b8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3db7c63-5129-4c5c-8da6-fc9b7c407b8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House on Tuesday announced new steps to expand access to Paxlovid, the Covid-19 antiviral pill. But experts say that efforts to reach at-risk Americans remain complex and inefficient.</rdfs:comment>
