	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3e28c9a-8979-498b-b58a-7aa18d7baae7">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3e28c9a-8979-498b-b58a-7aa18d7baae7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The idea, recalling a plan by President Franklin D. Roosevelt, is increasingly popular among progressives, but faces roadblocks among members of both parties.</rdfs:comment>
