	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3e4c8d2-e863-4155-8f81-2240f9f12203">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3e4c8d2-e863-4155-8f81-2240f9f12203</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After having low rates of child vaccination more than a decade ago, the wealthy Bay Area county has one of the nation’s highest Covid-19 vaccination rates.</rdfs:comment>
