	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3ea1b48-e7c5-42ee-8034-aa741e2f40f9">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3ea1b48-e7c5-42ee-8034-aa741e2f40f9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: The governor took an extraordinary step to try to slow the spread of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
