	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3ed11d9-2957-4ced-9ccb-82402c9ae2b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3ed11d9-2957-4ced-9ccb-82402c9ae2b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tribal governments in the lower 48 states had sued to challenge the allocation of $450 million in federal virus aid to Alaska Native corporations.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3f051dd-d0d0-4ea1-beb5-fac9a4a0ce53">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3f051dd-d0d0-4ea1-beb5-fac9a4a0ce53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With just over a week until Election Day, candidates are still meeting for debates. Here’s what has taken place so far and how to watch the upcoming debates.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4d1965e-83d5-427c-92cb-8140b08c5176"/>
