	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3fd09d2-8b58-452e-ab88-d271a2274518">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3fd09d2-8b58-452e-ab88-d271a2274518</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After months of an already hyperpartisan political environment, the attorney general appears to be acknowledging that his approach has to be recalibrated.</rdfs:comment>
