	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a3fe36af-ae75-41e3-a901-ef76bba42032">
		<rdfs:label>article-a3fe36af-ae75-41e3-a901-ef76bba42032</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On a night largely overshadowed by the global pandemic, Bernie Sanders pressed Joe Biden on his past Senate voting record as Mr. Biden sought to woo the left.</rdfs:comment>
