	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a40d568a-4a62-47c3-a87f-6654e0e05089">
		<rdfs:label>article-a40d568a-4a62-47c3-a87f-6654e0e05089</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Seizing on premature news of potential $450,000 payments, conservatives have added new complications to an effort to compensate migrant families separated by the Trump administration.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b043cde-c9ac-41fc-91ae-7eae6c420e38"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ef6cc7eb-b6e8-4dba-84e0-6b42579e91d0"/>
