	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a48dec1d-aed5-43b2-8b09-eccf81fa35df">
		<rdfs:label>article-a48dec1d-aed5-43b2-8b09-eccf81fa35df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the final weeks of the election, ads will air across the country attacking President Trump, Joseph R. Biden Jr., incumbent senators and representatives, their challengers — even sheriffs won’t be spared.</rdfs:comment>
