	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a49260ed-bc8c-47d6-9ab3-7566f20fdd5c">
		<rdfs:label>article-a49260ed-bc8c-47d6-9ab3-7566f20fdd5c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The senator discussed police mistreatment of black Americans in a Q. and A. with The Times. “You can’t be comfortable with this,” he said. “And it’s our comfort with it that has allowed it to fester.”</rdfs:comment>
