	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a496a32b-d98b-4600-ae86-393fe6672ef0">
		<rdfs:label>article-a496a32b-d98b-4600-ae86-393fe6672ef0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A coalition of abortion providers and their supporters filed a federal lawsuit on Tuesday to challenge a new Texas law that would allow individuals to sue abortion clinics, doctors and anyone helping a woman get an abortion in the state.</rdfs:comment>
