		<rdfs:label>article-a49bcd6e-9c9e-485a-acfa-6fe5c6cb8925</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Kelly J. Baker is a writer and scholar of the Ku Klux Klan in the 1920s. She sees frightening similarities between that culture and the violence at the Capitol on Jan. 6.</rdfs:comment>
