	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4a46083-6105-4187-8d35-4e1d80fc0bcf">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4a46083-6105-4187-8d35-4e1d80fc0bcf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Russian invasion deeply affects Ukrainians in the United States, but it also resonates with a 100-year-old Holocaust survivor in Texas and a Taiwanese American family in Georgia.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1f4003c3-78bb-4191-901d-febdb359732e"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-230979e1-dcaa-4b07-b5cb-f66d97d8a25f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b043cde-c9ac-41fc-91ae-7eae6c420e38"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c9e39358-a975-42ba-a74a-ab413e845336"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-02-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4a4f5ed-2b29-4e98-8314-6fb701542721">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4a4f5ed-2b29-4e98-8314-6fb701542721</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For Democrats, who rely on Black voters to power their electoral advantages in America’s urban centers, the difference between good and great Black voter turnout is often dependent on how many Black men go to the polls.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4504805-5b5f-41c7-b157-41ff04a342ad"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4a4fd8d-169c-47eb-aa04-e5f2640b0516">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4a4fd8d-169c-47eb-aa04-e5f2640b0516</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Iran and Russia have both obtained American voter registration data, top national security officials have said. It’s the first concrete evidence that the two countries are trying to influence the presidential election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4a68f8a-516b-400e-9cba-431794b3c6cb">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4a68f8a-516b-400e-9cba-431794b3c6cb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Texas governor hasn’t defied President Trump, like some of his fellow Republican governors have. He also hasn’t ignored public health recommendations. He’s aiming for crisis management that doesn’t rock the boat.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1a919c05-175d-4b8d-9183-278fc0c9195c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4ab9168-d53f-487d-a772-ee8c6e8a439f">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4ab9168-d53f-487d-a772-ee8c6e8a439f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new order includes firms engaged in making and deploying the surveillance technology used against Muslim minorities and dissidents around the globe.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0396e814-250c-495b-a564-127dd78e6106"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
