	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4adad9c-b0a9-4736-8bc3-e99db0e834e5">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4adad9c-b0a9-4736-8bc3-e99db0e834e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Bernie Sanders has been campaigning in Texas, a Super Tuesday state. This is your morning tip sheet.</rdfs:comment>
