	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4b087c8-b093-4726-b767-3252e799ebff">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4b087c8-b093-4726-b767-3252e799ebff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Cori Bush, an activist backed by the progressive group Justice Democrats, is trying to unseat 10-term Representative William Lacy Clay in a bid to turn protest-movement fervor into hard political power.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
