	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4b18a29-58c6-4832-8594-9489ed757512">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4b18a29-58c6-4832-8594-9489ed757512</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden spoke with President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia in a high-stakes diplomatic effort on Tuesday morning to de-escalate a crisis over Ukraine as tens of thousands of Russian troops amass along the Ukrainian border, raising fears of an invasion.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3736c242-e9c8-48de-a3ec-df1ab3191621"/>
