		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4b19137-c912-4f2b-96dc-02c68f1534c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4b19137-c912-4f2b-96dc-02c68f1534c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A 15-year-old accused of killing four of his classmates and wounding seven other people had described wanting to attack the school in cellphone videos and a journal, the authorities said.</rdfs:comment>
