	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4b46723-367d-4967-8c3d-e51c165c906a">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4b46723-367d-4967-8c3d-e51c165c906a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Voters in Alaska will use ranked-choice voting for a general election for the first time and will take part in a new open-primary system.</rdfs:comment>
