	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4ba34ce-e4e4-41fa-9597-26de771a913d">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4ba34ce-e4e4-41fa-9597-26de771a913d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Kyrsten Sinema’s refusal to raise rates on high earners and major corporations has led Democrats to consider proposals once championed only by the party’s most liberal flank.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-22"/>
