		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4c4e316-831f-4f52-99b5-7e1fdcdd69ae">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4c4e316-831f-4f52-99b5-7e1fdcdd69ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Leading lawmakers and strategists are openly doubting the party’s kitchen-sink approach, saying Democrats have failed to unite around one central message.</rdfs:comment>
