	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4c782e0-e8aa-4371-8d25-9fd6135edadc">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4c782e0-e8aa-4371-8d25-9fd6135edadc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Working at the White House has traditionally been a ticket to a lucrative future. But that hasn’t been the case so far for Trump alumni.</rdfs:comment>
