	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4c9a98a-acf3-40db-9a85-c5627c606760">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4c9a98a-acf3-40db-9a85-c5627c606760</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Staying within a moderate lane focused on jobs, manufacturing and China, the congressman beat a progressive lawyer who had criticized his record and campaign donations.</rdfs:comment>
