	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4ccc025-de4b-41d7-8097-fadd619dc6b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4ccc025-de4b-41d7-8097-fadd619dc6b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The complex dynamics among veterans’ groups reflect general exhaustion with war among American voters and shifting domestic politics.</rdfs:comment>
