	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4e649dc-e293-4ef5-8fb6-ba489871e73b">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4e649dc-e293-4ef5-8fb6-ba489871e73b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The archives said in a letter to the House Oversight Committee that it was seeking electronic messages from unnamed White House officials sent through personal accounts.</rdfs:comment>
