	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a4ef689a-b67f-47e9-8de8-cd84ec985106">
		<rdfs:label>article-a4ef689a-b67f-47e9-8de8-cd84ec985106</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Sweetening federal stimulus and AmeriCorps funds with state and local money, the state is cranking out tens of thousands of Youth Service jobs.</rdfs:comment>
