		<rdfs:comment>Senator Tim Kaine of Virginia, a leading Democrat and the 2016 vice-presidential nominee, urged the Biden campaign to continue campaigning while following “good safety rules,” cautioning that despite the news that President Trump had tested positive for the coronavirus, this was no time to let up.</rdfs:comment>
