	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5abc7e0-91a4-4762-b7d5-98e61eb7f303">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5abc7e0-91a4-4762-b7d5-98e61eb7f303</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Nashville’s popularity has grown, so has the “transportainment” business — a motley assortment including old buses, farm tractors and a truck with a hot tub. Many think it has gotten out of hand.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d93c0283-06f7-42c1-8f98-ddd025bdc631"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc5a47b7-5e7e-4d58-8ee7-caaf2f703c6a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5ae48b3-045f-41be-90da-f66e091bbd89">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5ae48b3-045f-41be-90da-f66e091bbd89</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Both representatives said they took note of their roles as among the few Black lawmakers who played a role in the historic proceeding.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-15"/>
