		<rdfs:label>article-a5ba8768-26e0-47dd-857e-7b62faa51484</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Educators unions sue Ron DeSantis, and Congress debates virus aid: This is your morning tip sheet.</rdfs:comment>
