	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5be6bbf-f0bb-42f6-9bb0-a0e8882e2169">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5be6bbf-f0bb-42f6-9bb0-a0e8882e2169</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>State Senator Stephen A. Huffman, a Republican and a doctor, speculated publicly about why “the colored population” has been disproportionately affected by the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
