	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5c0f4a5-838e-4510-9adc-2322e3d7ff98">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5c0f4a5-838e-4510-9adc-2322e3d7ff98</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The creeping not-so-casual misogyny is indicative of the dark path down which former President Donald Trump continues to lead the G.O.P.</rdfs:comment>
