	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5c78671-e3ca-454d-819b-9fe211f0b8ac">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5c78671-e3ca-454d-819b-9fe211f0b8ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Mr. Biden campaigned in the state, residents appeared unmoved: “I don’t think much about anything Joni Ernst says.”</rdfs:comment>
