		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5ce0e8c-12b1-4cc6-be85-bbbf5c7e34bb">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5ce0e8c-12b1-4cc6-be85-bbbf5c7e34bb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s approval rating now stands at 51 percent nationwide, with 42 percent of the country disapproving, according to a Monmouth University poll.</rdfs:comment>
