	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5ce4def-9d6d-44f6-bb19-e3b32016fd06">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5ce4def-9d6d-44f6-bb19-e3b32016fd06</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Because the disaster happened in the middle of the night, many parents, children, grandparents and siblings were killed together.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ea9dbbc7-267d-46dd-9bad-620f876af0ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a5dbffac-69f2-4dd9-844d-2dd0c36ffadc">
		<rdfs:label>article-a5dbffac-69f2-4dd9-844d-2dd0c36ffadc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The attorney general echoed many of the president’s inaccurate claims on nationwide protests, police shootings and the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
