		<rdfs:label>article-a63ed8ad-760c-4144-994b-417d520f0e4e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a role that seldom allows for error, Ms. Harris is trying to shape her vice presidency by tackling unwieldy policy issues.</rdfs:comment>
