	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a63f9750-69e0-4e83-ace9-98cf9bea449b">
		<rdfs:label>article-a63f9750-69e0-4e83-ace9-98cf9bea449b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The case had examined whether Donald Trump violated election law with a $130,000 payment shortly before the 2016 election to a pornographic-film actress by his personal lawyer, Michael Cohen.</rdfs:comment>
