	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a642a7f9-fda5-4f19-991d-fb6f6b9b71a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-a642a7f9-fda5-4f19-991d-fb6f6b9b71a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s crackdown on peaceful protesters drew condemnations from a handful of Republican lawmakers, but Democrats planned to push them to back up their words with legislative measures.</rdfs:comment>
