	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a6a987ee-53e4-4219-84de-3d91ec0d963c">
		<rdfs:label>article-a6a987ee-53e4-4219-84de-3d91ec0d963c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Exhaustion and impatience are creating new risks as cases soar in parts of the world. “They have had enough,” one U.S. mayor said of her residents.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3d0d7757-313d-444e-a4df-32876c51aaa0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d0804387-7ba1-4df8-b8ae-a8a9c6bfc424"/>
