	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a6b29ac5-29ac-4b2a-8c0c-229cbc34a318">
		<rdfs:label>article-a6b29ac5-29ac-4b2a-8c0c-229cbc34a318</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In Enid, Okla., pandemic politics prompted a fundamental question: What does it mean to be an American? Whose version of the country will prevail?</rdfs:comment>
