	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a6b543e9-9546-4ff2-8261-764cd44153b0">
		<rdfs:label>article-a6b543e9-9546-4ff2-8261-764cd44153b0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Several of President Trump’s top aides are advising him to work with China on the coronavirus pandemic, but national security officials are skeptical the truce will hold.</rdfs:comment>
