		<rdfs:label>article-a6d7b66c-d5ef-4571-be0c-e0e749bb2f1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An F.B.I. statement said the man emerged from his vehicle, was wounded and was taken to a hospital.</rdfs:comment>
