	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a6dbd7d1-68f4-44fa-9595-3b6a4d02ba98">
		<rdfs:label>article-a6dbd7d1-68f4-44fa-9595-3b6a4d02ba98</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Vaccinated Americans may be looking forward to crowded beaches and packed backyard barbecues, getting back to what Dr. Rochelle Walensky described as “something closer to normal.”</rdfs:comment>
