	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-a74c207b-2369-46cf-b5cf-5e95cfa8d376">
		<rdfs:label>article-a74c207b-2369-46cf-b5cf-5e95cfa8d376</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 8-to-1 ruling said courts may hear suits seeking only nominal damages. Chief Justice John G. Roberts Jr., dissenting, said the majority had turned judges into advice columnists.</rdfs:comment>
