	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aa15685f-e2ed-4a2c-9b38-1cb054fd92e7">
		<rdfs:label>article-aa15685f-e2ed-4a2c-9b38-1cb054fd92e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Blake Masters appears to be struggling among independent voters, who make up about a third of the state’s electorate. In interviews, more than one called him a “flip-flopper.”</rdfs:comment>
