	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aa15a158-e39f-4b1a-b7fd-b6323aa72a59">
		<rdfs:label>article-aa15a158-e39f-4b1a-b7fd-b6323aa72a59</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $2 trillion coronavirus law could give the education secretary the power to waive special education rules as school districts struggle to teach all their students online.</rdfs:comment>
