	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aab80f5f-24f5-4a1b-9f30-a6653d46ec20">
		<rdfs:label>article-aab80f5f-24f5-4a1b-9f30-a6653d46ec20</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former Louisiana congressman is expected to step down next month. He will be one of the first White House senior advisers to leave as Democrats brace for a difficult midterm election.</rdfs:comment>
