	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aabf9f6f-1ebf-4703-9143-729281022b77">
		<rdfs:label>article-aabf9f6f-1ebf-4703-9143-729281022b77</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Washington’s elite has long bemoaned the “shattered norms” of the Trump presidency. But it has felt beside the point — like privilege talking — in the angry crowds of the last few nights.</rdfs:comment>
