	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aac1a0ba-bb76-4903-87b3-fdb8702afdf4">
		<rdfs:label>article-aac1a0ba-bb76-4903-87b3-fdb8702afdf4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump is 73. His leading rival is 77. And many of their strongest supporters — vulnerable to the coronavirus but enormously influential politically — are eligible for Social Security.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-81f0af94-b9cf-4dcb-8ae5-91c423d251ff"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aac2bd77-1061-4af5-a0c3-1586e3d503eb">
		<rdfs:label>article-aac2bd77-1061-4af5-a0c3-1586e3d503eb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>American life expectancy fell by one year, to 77.8 years, in the first half of 2020. It may rebound as the pandemic’s end approaches.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6ffe97dc-d137-44d2-a45a-7a007b5451ab"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-81f0af94-b9cf-4dcb-8ae5-91c423d251ff"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aac46688-a564-4b5c-b838-e5b161b869fd">
		<rdfs:label>article-aac46688-a564-4b5c-b838-e5b161b869fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump won Kansas by more than 20 points, but he leads Joe Biden by only seven in a Times/Siena College poll. The Republican Senate candidate leads his Democratic rival by an even smaller amount, 46 percent to 42.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e99dcff-b565-458e-b08f-ae5cce9b25f2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aac5686c-94b9-42b2-a2aa-e0501c4d69d7">
		<rdfs:label>article-aac5686c-94b9-42b2-a2aa-e0501c4d69d7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Led by a firebrand loyalist, the state party has lurched to the right under President Trump. That has turned off some Republicans, and Arizona suddenly appears in play for Democrats.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1a919c05-175d-4b8d-9183-278fc0c9195c"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aac7fe81-ef02-4d3a-a89c-4f17f9585da0">
		<rdfs:label>article-aac7fe81-ef02-4d3a-a89c-4f17f9585da0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Vehicles flying Trump flags tried to force a Biden-Harris campaign bus off a highway in Texas. Trump chuckled about it at a rally later that evening.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fd2d6ec4-4aa3-452f-8e17-99a953af7b67"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aad36da1-ada4-4e0b-809f-39c7445f93a2">
		<rdfs:label>article-aad36da1-ada4-4e0b-809f-39c7445f93a2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After Biden&apos;s inauguration, right-wing media outlets are pushing false voter-fraud conspiracy theories and predicting more political conflict  ahead.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ef6cc7eb-b6e8-4dba-84e0-6b42579e91d0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aad3b632-35ac-4762-ad65-2fda6201e9ad">
		<rdfs:label>article-aad3b632-35ac-4762-ad65-2fda6201e9ad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With parts of the country seeing record-setting chilly temperatures — including in places where coats and gloves are rarely needed — power operators and the National Weather Service have been offering tips for how people can conserve energy and stay warm at home, with or without power.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-74fe9339-5cba-4d49-b38d-2ccc7bfafd17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-02-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aad40f4f-c9d3-4781-a5e9-f3e052530862">
		<rdfs:label>article-aad40f4f-c9d3-4781-a5e9-f3e052530862</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Steele dossier’s main source explained where its most notorious claim came from — and called Republicans’ accusations that he is a Russian agent “slander.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3a4b0b1a-f7a7-498e-8805-48a907d13871"/>
