		<rdfs:label>article-aad57f7a-8467-4512-adec-69d8cb698b31</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mitt Romney indicated that he believed the charge against former President Donald J. Trump was impeachable, while Marco Rubio called a trial “stupid.”</rdfs:comment>
