		<rdfs:comment>A day after former President Barack Obama portrayed him as an existential threat to American democracy, President Trump returned the favor, accusing Joseph R. Biden Jr., who will accept the Democratic nomination on Thursday night, of trying to “destroy the American way of life.”</rdfs:comment>
