		<rdfs:label>article-aaee9195-e28e-4ea5-b7ef-0a18937384cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The commitment memo changed no laws in their states, which have been legislating for months to protect abortion rights in anticipation of the ruling.</rdfs:comment>
