	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ab5aa497-1bd5-4f34-a02d-63cf3014636c">
		<rdfs:label>article-ab5aa497-1bd5-4f34-a02d-63cf3014636c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Electric heat pumps are a way to cool and heat homes at a much lower carbon cost than traditional air-conditioners and furnaces.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d8148593-227b-4889-ae70-592b440737ae"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ab5c0f36-d6f5-4509-9bfc-95e469ba581d">
		<rdfs:label>article-ab5c0f36-d6f5-4509-9bfc-95e469ba581d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers are increasingly pushing for a 9/11-style panel that would examine failures and make recommendations. It could also be a final chance for Congress to hold Donald J. Trump to account.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
