		<rdfs:label>article-ab60481f-1ecf-4b06-bf7b-4aed6c9938b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Minneapolis police chief recently described George Floyd’s death as murder. Lawyers for the four officers charged in the case say that may have biased potential jurors.</rdfs:comment>
