		<rdfs:label>article-ab6e1749-0a88-4f02-a4ad-52fb7cfeca9b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>What if returns in key swing states on Nov. 3 show President Trump ahead, and he declares victory before heavily Democratic mail-in ballots, which he has falsely linked with fraud, are fully counted?</rdfs:comment>
