	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-acaa213c-73b4-4838-bff0-81bcc2795ddc">
		<rdfs:label>article-acaa213c-73b4-4838-bff0-81bcc2795ddc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden has spent most of his life struggling with his words.</rdfs:comment>
