		<rdfs:label>article-acdfdc1a-66f3-4025-9f50-b1164d9cc4cf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans sought to put their imprint on an emerging economic stabilization package of $1 trillion, unveiling a bill that includes tax cuts and loans to businesses and would curtail paid leave.</rdfs:comment>
