		<rdfs:label>article-acf63093-0f8a-4208-8041-e633be5e77f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Envelopes with ricin were intercepted last week on their way to the White House, a sheriff’s office and a detention facility in Texas.</rdfs:comment>
