	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-acf6427c-68fb-4cb0-b000-61185dadd322">
		<rdfs:label>article-acf6427c-68fb-4cb0-b000-61185dadd322</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House’s use of emergency powers to enact widespread debt relief could be ripe for challenges.</rdfs:comment>
