		<rdfs:comment>President Trump confirmed Monday that he will deliver his own nomination acceptance speech next week at the White House, telling a small crowd in Wisconsin that he will “have plenty to say” as he formally becomes the Republican candidate for his re-election.</rdfs:comment>
