	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ad9bdbcd-f9ed-4a8f-8810-52b6fd5d015e">
		<rdfs:label>article-ad9bdbcd-f9ed-4a8f-8810-52b6fd5d015e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Shock and outrage over the fall of Roe v. Wade has faded as confusion has spread, deflating Democrats’ hopes that the issue could carry them to victory.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1f4003c3-78bb-4191-901d-febdb359732e"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ad9d7971-3cda-4be6-aa24-6e895938efde">
		<rdfs:label>article-ad9d7971-3cda-4be6-aa24-6e895938efde</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Experts in virus transmission called the plexiglass barriers being used at tonight’s vice-presidential debate pretty much useless.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5c43faa4-2a00-49c8-abf7-1bb010d19618"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ad9ef7e7-7116-4611-8eaf-7bfb34601cba">
		<rdfs:label>article-ad9ef7e7-7116-4611-8eaf-7bfb34601cba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the days after the Nov. 3 election, Georgia was one of several states where the vote count seemed to progress agonizingly slowly. But for several reasons, it’s unlikely that it will take as long to count the votes in today’s two runoff elections, which will determine control of the Senate. It’s even possible — but certainly not guaranteed — that we’ll know who won  very early Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ad9faed7-19fe-4a92-885d-735b3fff47f2">
		<rdfs:label>article-ad9faed7-19fe-4a92-885d-735b3fff47f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The question of timing has become an unsettled new frontier of policymaking as the use of police body cameras is more the rule rather than the exception.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d7a0b17f-e0aa-44c5-a995-e81e028fa879"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f08506e1-4ec6-45c9-9d85-46fe67848dee"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ada0f236-4520-482b-a75b-25aafdc84b94">
		<rdfs:label>article-ada0f236-4520-482b-a75b-25aafdc84b94</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president exhibited a pattern of dissembling about the material he took from the White House, creating legal risk not just for himself but also some of his lawyers.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2c183a13-1898-4deb-ad56-cc02fd034eaf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ada25f4a-3db3-4daa-b9da-480bd5ff4677">
		<rdfs:label>article-ada25f4a-3db3-4daa-b9da-480bd5ff4677</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facing pressure from parents, conflicting messages from experts and initial silence from the federal government, superintendents began making their own decisions to close.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b782e9c4-4c0a-4c6c-aa6e-ee0fb7623560"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ada39753-f19d-4dac-9c14-35d75e0839c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-ada39753-f19d-4dac-9c14-35d75e0839c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Terry McAuliffe, the Democrat, will try to tie his opponent, Glenn Youngkin, to former President Donald Trump, while Mr. Youngkin will try to sidestep Mr. Trump but not reject him.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4a606035-f311-493f-9272-00230e475b23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ada3e34d-e56d-420b-9f11-55b4c419594d">
		<rdfs:label>article-ada3e34d-e56d-420b-9f11-55b4c419594d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The unofficial Labor Day start to the fall presidential campaign centered around Wisconsin on Monday, as Vice President Mike Pence tried to poach Democrats in La Crosse and Senator Kamala Harris sought to rally the Democratic base in Milwaukee.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3488268a-8b17-411a-8185-6859abbab9a8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4a606035-f311-493f-9272-00230e475b23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adab0d88-737f-485b-ac11-9e3ff1948b1f">
		<rdfs:label>article-adab0d88-737f-485b-ac11-9e3ff1948b1f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>To understand how union members in Las Vegas are thinking about Bernie Sanders, it helps to remember a picket line in the 1990s.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6cc67a-b3c2-45c5-af7a-92a423ab1249"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-02-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adace781-8af1-4961-9ecb-a95337b2b9a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-adace781-8af1-4961-9ecb-a95337b2b9a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On a trip to North Carolina where she is expected to speak about Judge Amy Coney Barrett, Senator Kamala Harris will take a rare turn in the campaign spotlight today.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3488268a-8b17-411a-8185-6859abbab9a8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adaf14ce-f36a-425d-b4d3-6906e57cee66">
		<rdfs:label>article-adaf14ce-f36a-425d-b4d3-6906e57cee66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new campaign came only months after President Biden imposed sanctions on Moscow in response to a series of spy operations it had conducted around the world.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adb07cf4-e472-4c38-9e7f-2e24a886674b">
		<rdfs:label>article-adb07cf4-e472-4c38-9e7f-2e24a886674b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two years after Ms. Rapinoe publicly feuded with former President Donald J. Trump over whether she would visit the White House, she accepted the invitation from the Bidens.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-24"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adb2ed97-d957-4c18-a170-c8b6decbfd21">
		<rdfs:label>article-adb2ed97-d957-4c18-a170-c8b6decbfd21</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The legislation now heads to the president’s desk, just days before some businesses will run out of time to spend the loan money.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-06-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adb45fd9-bebd-439b-9b1b-c3252e959042">
		<rdfs:label>article-adb45fd9-bebd-439b-9b1b-c3252e959042</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The account by a former National Security Council official also implied that the Justice Department may have told a court that the book contains classified information and opened a criminal investigation based on false pretenses.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2c183a13-1898-4deb-ad56-cc02fd034eaf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adb9159e-c3f3-4990-a0e5-c3a722153596">
		<rdfs:label>article-adb9159e-c3f3-4990-a0e5-c3a722153596</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As discussions resumed over how to whittle down the plan, Senator Joe Manchin, a key holdout, said any talks would be starting with “a clean sheet of paper.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-adba1d76-f2ec-46e2-ab62-133e70817efa">
		<rdfs:label>article-adba1d76-f2ec-46e2-ab62-133e70817efa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Los Angeles County, which has been averaging more than 2,000 new cases each day, surpassed 100,000 total cases on Monday.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-204cd1d8-9d72-4785-968e-7d68ce7d17d7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2bfc1d86-f654-490c-ae5c-efaa41acbbe5"/>
