	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ae5a6b39-f9f1-4bf0-9de2-9a01752d883f">
		<rdfs:label>article-ae5a6b39-f9f1-4bf0-9de2-9a01752d883f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden campaigned on restoring an accord limiting Iran’s nuclear program. It remains unclear if Tehran, which is demanding that sanctions be lifted first, will accept the offer to talk.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-54142ed4-763a-40da-ba02-8da2f1d32a60"/>
