	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ae5dd4a0-27f9-43f7-ad4f-87580af0164f">
		<rdfs:label>article-ae5dd4a0-27f9-43f7-ad4f-87580af0164f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden plans to talk on Friday with Xi Jinping, who has a close partnership with Vladimir V. Putin and supports him in the Ukraine war.</rdfs:comment>
