		<rdfs:label>article-ae619247-f0b0-47a3-9f9d-d7b0fcd3bd25</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One year ago today, health officials told Americans about a traveler who had just come home from Wuhan, China, sought treatment at an urgent-care clinic north of Seattle after falling ill — and set off alarm bells.</rdfs:comment>
