	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ae6fc7f2-5eb0-4c20-9971-6bcd54cb4d48">
		<rdfs:label>article-ae6fc7f2-5eb0-4c20-9971-6bcd54cb4d48</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Britt, now the state’s Republican nominee for Senate, made her way to the top with an “Alabama First” message and skillful navigation of a rival’s fleeting Trump endorsement.</rdfs:comment>
