	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ae71a359-3434-4ecf-aee7-75f834bc18b8">
		<rdfs:label>article-ae71a359-3434-4ecf-aee7-75f834bc18b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ben Casselman, an economics correspondent for The New York Times, unpacks the numbers.</rdfs:comment>
