	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aecad3bf-4e50-42f8-b17d-b98d458a95e0">
		<rdfs:label>article-aecad3bf-4e50-42f8-b17d-b98d458a95e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Just days earlier, the U.N. Security Council had failed to agree to continue humanitarian assistance to four million Syrians in Idlib Province, after Russia vetoed plans to extend it for one year.</rdfs:comment>
