	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aed28840-06e5-441d-b419-827aee135361">
		<rdfs:label>article-aed28840-06e5-441d-b419-827aee135361</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ukrainian officials have asked for a weapon that can strike targets 190 miles away. But the Pentagon — wary of widening the war — says the ones it has provided are powerful enough.</rdfs:comment>
