	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aed5d3ed-1704-42c9-be9c-bb20d6708e52">
		<rdfs:label>article-aed5d3ed-1704-42c9-be9c-bb20d6708e52</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tribal government in the lower 48 states had sued to challenge the federal government’s allocation of about $500 million in virus aid to Alaska Native corporations, arguing that the corporations do not meet the definition of “Indian tribes.”</rdfs:comment>
