	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aed8fe0b-40bf-431c-a343-e0f1d5542644">
		<rdfs:label>article-aed8fe0b-40bf-431c-a343-e0f1d5542644</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With no nationwide plan for distributing coronavirus vaccines, people are scrambling to other states. Some health officials, saying greater immunity is the goal, aren’t standing in the way.</rdfs:comment>
