		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aedb77aa-8d01-4770-afac-1cf5365bd79a">
		<rdfs:label>article-aedb77aa-8d01-4770-afac-1cf5365bd79a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>WILMINGTON, Del. — Just before midnight on Monday, workers darted in and out a side door of the grand old Hotel du Pont, pausing for brief cigarette breaks or a chat, then getting back to setting up for an unspecified event. The effort had been underway for hours, at least.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7da4dfa6-58ba-4b1b-8d80-6c39df820022"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aee2193c-e1ae-4763-9f6a-f5cb0dc71ed0">
		<rdfs:label>article-aee2193c-e1ae-4763-9f6a-f5cb0dc71ed0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On the way out the door, the Trump administration is trying its utmost to make things difficult for Joe Biden.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aee8a40b-c292-4432-a219-557abd37c4ba">
		<rdfs:label>article-aee8a40b-c292-4432-a219-557abd37c4ba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The number of daily global cases also broke a record, with the United States as the biggest source of new infections. The U.S. death toll is also on the rise.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aeee194b-7aad-443d-95db-618d956cf07b">
		<rdfs:label>article-aeee194b-7aad-443d-95db-618d956cf07b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After a deal was seemingly struck in March, Congress has not agreed on where the money will come from or who will move next.</rdfs:comment>
