		<rdfs:label>article-aeee47a9-c38c-4062-b783-5014cc9f9f79</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sudden breach between the two leading liberals in the Democratic primary race has disheartened those who fear it could provide an advantage to the party’s moderate candidates.</rdfs:comment>
