	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-aeef211d-04de-4695-9959-54e0436b5921">
		<rdfs:label>article-aeef211d-04de-4695-9959-54e0436b5921</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tens of thousands of motorcyclists roared into the western South Dakota community on Friday, lining Main Street from end to end, for the start of the annual Sturgis Motorcycle Rally.</rdfs:comment>
