		<rdfs:label>article-aef172c9-7a14-46ee-81a7-11d55e9812da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The attorney general had weighed whether to step down by the end of the year, potentially avoiding a contentious transition.</rdfs:comment>
