		<rdfs:label>article-aef2135e-75ef-4ecf-a182-cea5852ddfd5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The settlement still needs federal court approval, but Flint residents were being cautiously optimistic after the drawn-out crisis: “I just want it to be over.”</rdfs:comment>
