		<rdfs:label>article-aef5aee7-e752-46b9-8fa3-49673e5ea448</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One 10-year-old became the focus of debate, but more than 1,000 girls under 15 seek abortions each year. “How are we going to help the pregnant kids?”</rdfs:comment>
