	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-af3d7b0c-4491-435e-b807-116897addb6e">
		<rdfs:label>article-af3d7b0c-4491-435e-b807-116897addb6e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The year-to-year increase in homicides from 2019 was the largest since national record-keeping began in 1960. But overall, major crimes declined last year.</rdfs:comment>
