		<rdfs:label>article-af3da54c-c622-4346-8a3e-b5a2e5de4ac8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president confused the American war in Iraq with the Russian war in Ukraine and then misstated how his son Beau died.</rdfs:comment>
