	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-af3f33b9-900c-49d1-9cff-01475fe91eaa">
		<rdfs:label>article-af3f33b9-900c-49d1-9cff-01475fe91eaa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Mitch McConnell, the Republican leader, said on Tuesday that the mob that stormed the Capitol on Jan. 6 had been “provoked by the president and other powerful people,” stating publicly for the first time that he holds President Trump at least partly responsible for the assault.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-19"/>
