		<rdfs:label>article-af402328-1561-43de-b779-fdccf94b8d91</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump resumed meeting with foreign leaders after months, and his first guest at the White House is in a close race that will be decided on Sunday.</rdfs:comment>
