		<rdfs:label>article-af40eb84-e40e-447f-8a80-5578a7364496</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House is poised to deliver to the Senate on Monday its article of impeachment charging former President Donald J. Trump with “incitement of insurrection,” formally advancing the process even as the trial itself has been delayed.</rdfs:comment>
