		<rdfs:label>article-af48d985-4f45-44f2-b1bf-be6d932ab37a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The shift comes as the Biden administration pressures Native tribes in Oklahoma to desegregate their constitutions to comply with treaty obligations.</rdfs:comment>
