		<rdfs:label>article-af4982a7-93c8-416c-9e39-c8676b450aa6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president is sounding notes of bravado and exasperation at the end of a divisive campaign. But he may have severed himself from the political realities of a country in crisis.</rdfs:comment>
