		<rdfs:label>article-af4a505a-4479-45aa-a8af-5426a83aa2ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden spent $1.6 million on Facebook last Thursday as his campaign capitalized on energy surrounding mass protests. That’s far more than President Trump has spent on the platform on a single day.</rdfs:comment>
