		<rdfs:label>article-af4c7fec-a332-4565-8aaa-a0a60467af3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Fifteen months after they tried and failed to overturn the 2020 election, the same group of lawyers and associates is continuing efforts to “decertify” the vote, feeding a false narrative.</rdfs:comment>
