		<rdfs:label>article-afaf3485-d115-4128-8d29-18f966bf71bf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Ralph Northam of Virginia was discussed as a possible target by members of an anti-government group charged with plotting to kidnap the Michigan governor, the F.B.I. said.</rdfs:comment>
