	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-afbbe549-b484-4d2a-82b6-8c8723583fff">
		<rdfs:label>article-afbbe549-b484-4d2a-82b6-8c8723583fff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With a possible winter surge on the horizon, the president tried to draw attention to the retooled shots, which Americans have been slow to receive so far.</rdfs:comment>
