	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-afc35bf6-40ec-4f27-ad78-64966cb6d117">
		<rdfs:label>article-afc35bf6-40ec-4f27-ad78-64966cb6d117</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“Remaining silent and ignoring the lie emboldens the liar,” Ms. Cheney said.</rdfs:comment>
