	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-afeb0a5e-5d8e-4a0d-b2fb-3727e3a07fa5">
		<rdfs:label>article-afeb0a5e-5d8e-4a0d-b2fb-3727e3a07fa5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Rudolph W. Giuliani, the president’s personal lawyer, was standing in the parking lot of Four Seasons Total Landscaping in far northeast Philadelphia, as close to a Trump enclave as a decidedly Democratic city gets, highlighting alleged examples of voter fraud when the networks called the presidential race for Joseph R. Biden Jr.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
