	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-afef2c17-6eb6-4c18-bd18-b247933473a2">
		<rdfs:label>article-afef2c17-6eb6-4c18-bd18-b247933473a2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An opinion and ruling by the Foreign Intelligence Surveillance Court also accepts a series of reforms the F.B.I. said it would make following a damning inspector general report.</rdfs:comment>
