	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b0270625-513d-4066-95f1-fc5d3dad8840">
		<rdfs:label>article-b0270625-513d-4066-95f1-fc5d3dad8840</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Palestinian Authority announced on Tuesday that it was resuming its cooperation with Israel, ending six months of financial hardship for tens of thousands of West Bank residents and signaling relief over the election of Joseph R. Biden Jr.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4ba1c7ec-56dd-4804-9436-b85ef07cc18e"/>
