	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b0354eec-a5fe-4ed3-b9ef-f717dde53a3d">
		<rdfs:label>article-b0354eec-a5fe-4ed3-b9ef-f717dde53a3d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The jurors in Derek Chauvin’s trial came from the Minneapolis area, which is more racially mixed and more liberal than other areas of Minnesota.</rdfs:comment>
