		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b0487291-d216-4abd-aec3-22806c42f8a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-b0487291-d216-4abd-aec3-22806c42f8a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Monday’s Supreme Court arguments involved many hypothetical scenarios. A few riffs provoked snickers in the generally serious chamber.</rdfs:comment>
