		<rdfs:label>article-b04a47e6-7910-4e3e-93b2-0bee97ceee5b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As schools in the South and the Midwest reopen this week, officials must decide what steps to take as staff members and students test positive.</rdfs:comment>
