	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b0592cd9-2f1e-42e7-b940-98c871a8984f">
		<rdfs:label>article-b0592cd9-2f1e-42e7-b940-98c871a8984f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Lombardo, the sheriff of the Las Vegas area, will face Gov. Steve Sisolak, a Democrat, in what is expected to be one of the most competitive governor’s races in the country.</rdfs:comment>
