	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b17bcaf6-2c13-4481-acdd-3b4f32ca8259">
		<rdfs:label>article-b17bcaf6-2c13-4481-acdd-3b4f32ca8259</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump will cap off the 2020 presidential campaign with a two-day, seven-state, 10-rally mad dash that embodies his total saturation approach to politics and his faith in overcoming obstacles through perpetual motion, force of will and a torrent of talk.</rdfs:comment>
