		<rdfs:label>article-b1b3d918-d114-4f20-b530-edbcbae889b9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>YouTube said on Tuesday that it had suspended President Trump’s channel over concern about “ongoing potential for violence,” in the latest move by one of the large tech companies to limit the president online.</rdfs:comment>
