	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b1ddfd8d-af62-46d9-9511-671ccf217f87">
		<rdfs:label>article-b1ddfd8d-af62-46d9-9511-671ccf217f87</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Environmentalists say now is the time to choke off Russia’s oil and gas profits. But the White House has difficult choices to make.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
