	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b1f1b137-1f80-470d-8e00-f79a9102e5b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-b1f1b137-1f80-470d-8e00-f79a9102e5b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even before Mr. Jones erupted in a rant in the final hour, the day’s proceedings in a Connecticut courtroom had been contentious.</rdfs:comment>
