		<rdfs:label>article-b1f5675d-6d0a-4139-bcd1-0ad2ea8dc881</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The survey would bring heavy trucks looking for signs of oil reserves into one of the most remote and pristine parts of the United States.</rdfs:comment>
