	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b1fa47a5-4384-4641-876d-5254e2f3ff1f">
		<rdfs:label>article-b1fa47a5-4384-4641-876d-5254e2f3ff1f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A day after President Trump suggested he was open to cutting entitlement programs in a second term, he insisted he would protect Social Security.</rdfs:comment>
