	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b1fd659c-693d-47d2-8da9-409282909f8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b1fd659c-693d-47d2-8da9-409282909f8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The fast-moving impeachment trial of former President Donald J. Trump will turn on Friday to his defense, with his legal team seeking to persuade senators that he should be acquitted of inciting an insurrection.</rdfs:comment>
