	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b2019b7b-8447-4589-adff-f7ea2ed9ef2e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b2019b7b-8447-4589-adff-f7ea2ed9ef2e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Running for office used to mean relegating personal style to the background. Not anymore.</rdfs:comment>
