	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b206a244-6a86-4789-8d12-936da255298f">
		<rdfs:label>article-b206a244-6a86-4789-8d12-936da255298f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president, responding to videotaped testimony played at the Jan. 6 hearing, said Ivanka Trump had been “checked out” and was not involved in studying the election results.</rdfs:comment>
