	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b2103542-b1b1-4758-ab42-6ec3b78e4572">
		<rdfs:label>article-b2103542-b1b1-4758-ab42-6ec3b78e4572</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The release of the highly anticipated survey was canceled after Pete Buttigieg’s campaign raised concerns that he was not included in at least one phone call.</rdfs:comment>
