		<rdfs:label>article-b213a9fa-5b94-41cc-89b8-4be20a833474</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A charismatic pastor helped build a megachurch favored by star athletes and entertainers — until some temptations became too much to resist.</rdfs:comment>
