	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b21b9d49-cf50-4f4b-9894-bfe55dac2358">
		<rdfs:label>article-b21b9d49-cf50-4f4b-9894-bfe55dac2358</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thursday: The Golden State was well represented on Inauguration Day. Here’s what it meant.</rdfs:comment>
