		<rdfs:label>article-b2ee969d-de2b-4e28-859f-1f2ebe21f359</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Supreme Court ruling, combined with an energy crunch and intraparty politics, makes it nearly impossible for President Biden to achieve his climate goals.</rdfs:comment>
