		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b2f5360f-0e78-4130-90b2-eb427fe71ecf">
		<rdfs:label>article-b2f5360f-0e78-4130-90b2-eb427fe71ecf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>She interrupted a campaign speech. Jill Biden wanted to keep her.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b2f8dc20-7415-4be5-9128-d132278941e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-b2f8dc20-7415-4be5-9128-d132278941e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president is eying a comeback in 2024 aimed at making him the only person other than Cleveland to win another term after losing the White House.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-12-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b2ffabde-bb7f-49d5-a092-87fe35a57a74">
		<rdfs:label>article-b2ffabde-bb7f-49d5-a092-87fe35a57a74</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While a winter storm disrupts air travel around the country, there was some measure of relief at one of the country’s busiest airports.</rdfs:comment>
