		<rdfs:label>article-b3767240-81de-4003-b1cc-e44b020c2c7e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Federal officials are hoping that encouraging new findings will spur more Americans to get an updated booster before a feared surge in coronavirus cases this winter.</rdfs:comment>
