	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b37dfa86-59f6-458d-aafd-0a410f863293">
		<rdfs:label>article-b37dfa86-59f6-458d-aafd-0a410f863293</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>How have you been coping with the extraordinary challenges that 2020 has presented? What strategies have you used to “stay steady in the turmoil” of this year?</rdfs:comment>
