		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b386c54b-49d7-4283-9984-609e86beac8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b386c54b-49d7-4283-9984-609e86beac8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president has discussed potential pardons that could test the boundaries of his constitutional power to nullify criminal liability.</rdfs:comment>
