		<rdfs:label>article-b395ff4a-ef31-47dd-8eca-8af7f9949a15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Human rights observers warn the document could be a tool to advance Mr. Pompeo’s religious beliefs and political aspirations, and not women’s and L.G.B.T.Q. rights.</rdfs:comment>
