		<rdfs:label>article-b3a6f12c-9e48-445c-b34e-1c304cb03592</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision-making theatrics of Amazon, Facebook and other tech companies underscore the need for government to play a larger role.</rdfs:comment>
