	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b432fddd-c8c1-47bf-85b4-184e6f53284d">
		<rdfs:label>article-b432fddd-c8c1-47bf-85b4-184e6f53284d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>No state was walloped harder by the economic impact of the pandemic, and voters may take out their anger on Democrats.</rdfs:comment>
