		<rdfs:label>article-b43acc09-aab1-4fcc-b35c-f6aae76fb84f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump will campaign in Michigan, Minnesota and Wisconsin on Friday, while Joseph R. Biden Jr. heads for Minnesota, Wisconsin and Iowa.</rdfs:comment>
