	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b46cbf5d-3479-4a53-b391-c9f0b45b0fb3">
		<rdfs:label>article-b46cbf5d-3479-4a53-b391-c9f0b45b0fb3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Georgia Republican’s racist and antisemitic conspiracy theories put her on the party’s fringes, but she is likely to play a more central role in the next Congress.</rdfs:comment>
