		<rdfs:label>article-b4aa0743-0062-4579-9648-e2efe2a02bf2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Florida coast was spared severe damage on Sunday, but much of the Eastern Seaboard is threatened with flooding rains.</rdfs:comment>
