		<rdfs:label>article-b4b45552-8914-4202-9a34-dfccd777edc6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The certification by the secretary of state paves the way for Jon Ossoff and the Rev. Raphael Warnock to be sworn in as senators.</rdfs:comment>
