	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4b48446-4564-4a0c-86fa-73d48aba7d79">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4b48446-4564-4a0c-86fa-73d48aba7d79</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The four-term Maine senator, who crossed party lines to vote against President Clinton’s impeachment, must now decide whether to break with President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
