	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4b4d4ac-1960-4fbc-af7d-80389c917d5e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4b4d4ac-1960-4fbc-af7d-80389c917d5e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Worsening heat and dryness could lead to a 50 percent rise in off-the-charts fires, according to a United Nations report.</rdfs:comment>
