	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4b8ed7f-3015-48df-9a71-695b110925df">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4b8ed7f-3015-48df-9a71-695b110925df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Speaking to reporters at the White House, the president shared a story about precautions he had taken to avoid illness: “I said, ‘Excuse me,’ and started washing my hands. You have to do this.”</rdfs:comment>
