	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4b96ccb-e7bb-497e-bb97-061a53a2c5f1">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4b96ccb-e7bb-497e-bb97-061a53a2c5f1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Continent-spanning storms triggered blackouts in Oklahoma and Mississippi, halted one-third of U.S. oil production and disrupted vaccinations in 20 states.</rdfs:comment>
