	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4bc7fd7-3cd5-46c7-8130-07184eb359e1">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4bc7fd7-3cd5-46c7-8130-07184eb359e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Mitch McConnell on Monday dropped his demand that the new Democratic Senate majority promise to preserve the filibuster — which Republicans could use to obstruct President Biden’s agenda — ending an impasse that had prevented Democrats from assuming full power even after their election wins.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0e84c75e-7bc1-4744-83f1-7496fcf4721d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4be7474-c471-43cf-a1d1-82ed8c98d131">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4be7474-c471-43cf-a1d1-82ed8c98d131</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A handful of parents from Mexico and Central America who were deported under the Trump administration’s family separation policy are the first of up to 1,000 who will eventually be reunited.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b043cde-c9ac-41fc-91ae-7eae6c420e38"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b4be8013-01dd-46ba-b618-123fe3fce884">
		<rdfs:label>article-b4be8013-01dd-46ba-b618-123fe3fce884</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Undocumented women are risking their health by postponing prenatal care and giving birth at home in response to the Trump administration’s immigration enforcement policies.</rdfs:comment>
