		<rdfs:label>article-b4d7abff-0a94-4988-b4d6-f2cf19989ecd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Donald Trump uttered the first inaccurate claim about two minutes in and a few minutes later, ticked off at least four hyperbolic claims about his own accomplishments.</rdfs:comment>
