	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b55ed3a8-4b3d-4244-acd0-a517def505c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-b55ed3a8-4b3d-4244-acd0-a517def505c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We often focus on the battleground states that decided the last election and seem likeliest to decide the next one. But on Tuesday, we got high-quality polls from two states that Donald J. Trump won handily in 2016, and they’re an important reminder of the wide range of possibilities in this election.</rdfs:comment>
