		<rdfs:label>article-b55f1424-1c12-411c-bed6-3593b8412230</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden reversed his predecessor’s ban on transgender troops serving in the military, administration officials announced Monday, moving swiftly into a social issue that has tangled the Pentagon over the past five years.</rdfs:comment>
