		<rdfs:label>article-b56a7189-e4bd-4ecd-a981-b344f959fd53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Their persistence forced Speaker Nancy Pelosi to delay a planned vote on the $1 trillion infrastructure bill. In the end, President Biden sided with their position.</rdfs:comment>
