		<rdfs:label>article-b5d53fc5-7548-46cf-807f-27448874e8a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president said the measure,  announced Tuesday, would lift the economy, but outside analysts said the administration&apos;s rosy numbers did not represent an accurate accounting of its costs.</rdfs:comment>
