		<rdfs:label>article-b5eaea4d-44d3-494b-a785-580f08611c5b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The intelligence agency alerted Microsoft to a vulnerability in Windows. Typically, it would keep quiet and exploit the flaw.</rdfs:comment>
