		<rdfs:label>article-b5f367c3-bedc-4a9f-88ac-f37e0f9514ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first known U.S. death from the illness came in early February in California. Trump says he ‘strongly’ disagrees with Georgia’s governor on reopening some businesses.</rdfs:comment>
