		<rdfs:label>article-b5f3b586-02be-4c5f-9591-87edecf94112</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Beneficiaries of two American oil fortunes are supporting groups trying to block fossil fuel projects. One donor said he felt a “moral obligation.”</rdfs:comment>
