		<rdfs:label>article-b5f7580d-7131-44e7-bd9a-d3a5638e0e14</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s comments come as a May 1 deadline negotiated by the Trump administration is fast approaching.</rdfs:comment>
