	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b5fbe016-3149-49f8-9fc5-2f1c3b008709">
		<rdfs:label>article-b5fbe016-3149-49f8-9fc5-2f1c3b008709</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bill, which Gov. Ron DeSantis is expected to sign, is the latest Republican effort to restrict voting after the 2020 election. It will make Florida the first major swing state won by Donald Trump to pass such a law.</rdfs:comment>
