	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b5fd7d78-03c3-4b22-98fb-bbc9b32fc14d">
		<rdfs:label>article-b5fd7d78-03c3-4b22-98fb-bbc9b32fc14d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“I believe this is the most important thing I’ve ever done professionally,” she said, “and maybe the most important thing I ever do.”</rdfs:comment>
