		<rdfs:label>article-b604cfb1-27ce-4462-8edd-47701dc398e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Supervisors denied civil-rights prosecutors’ request to use a grand jury for their investigation into the 2014 shooting of a Black boy by a Cleveland police officer, but did not tell his family.</rdfs:comment>
