		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6061b50-5399-44cb-99c6-f3d4708b98bb">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6061b50-5399-44cb-99c6-f3d4708b98bb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The economic downturn is shaping up to be particularly devastating for renters, who are more likely to be lower-income and work hourly jobs cut during the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
