		<rdfs:label>article-b60a8629-89a5-4b1d-8256-0ee538b6e7b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The party has largely moved beyond denying the existence of climate change but continues to oppose dramatic action to halt it, worried about the short-term economic consequences.</rdfs:comment>
