		<rdfs:label>article-b60b97bd-fba9-4449-b635-95b45bd4452c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House is facing new questions about whether it acted quickly enough after the leading baby formula plant shut down in February.</rdfs:comment>
