	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6332584-ed49-4299-af93-6dc42ac8af8d">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6332584-ed49-4299-af93-6dc42ac8af8d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A gunman pleaded guilty to the premeditated murder of 17 people and the attempted murder of 17 others. Jurors will decide whether he can be sentenced to death.</rdfs:comment>
