	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b63d4fa6-760e-471a-b0a1-77010025db9c">
		<rdfs:label>article-b63d4fa6-760e-471a-b0a1-77010025db9c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vote made official Joe Biden’s victory, despite President Trump’s attempt to subvert the nation’s democratic process, and it put pressure on Republicans to acknowledge the outcome.</rdfs:comment>
