	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b64321a3-b0f4-4869-8427-195e1c61717e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b64321a3-b0f4-4869-8427-195e1c61717e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Shifts in polls of Republicans, disagreements on endorsements and jeers over vaccines hint at daylight between the former president and the right-wing movement he spawned.</rdfs:comment>
