		<rdfs:label>article-b6474f27-a0fc-4f76-a492-99b234e9f64d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president woke up on Thursday morning and immediately assailed Senator Chuck Schumer and Speaker Nancy Pelosi, just hours after he implored the nation’s political leaders to “stop the partisanship.”</rdfs:comment>
