	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b664eaea-e597-4028-8886-da4d49933051">
		<rdfs:label>article-b664eaea-e597-4028-8886-da4d49933051</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Disaffected conservatives broke with their party to oust a sitting president. Some still hope to have a say in the G.O.P.’s future.</rdfs:comment>
