	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b66ad032-a6b6-4fda-acf8-0d59470c6551">
		<rdfs:label>article-b66ad032-a6b6-4fda-acf8-0d59470c6551</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The dueling moves by Judge Aileen M. Cannon and a special master she appointed reflected a larger struggle over who should control the rules of the review — and whom those rules would favor.</rdfs:comment>
