	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6880deb-5363-445b-bcb6-51eeb66c77de">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6880deb-5363-445b-bcb6-51eeb66c77de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Gillum said he was depressed and abusing alcohol since losing the 2018 election to Ron DeSantis.</rdfs:comment>
