		<rdfs:label>article-b68a64d3-0ebf-4963-964e-d726cb2aaec2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump on Wednesday released a direct-to-camera video address to the nation in which he called getting the coronavirus “a blessing from God,” calling the unapproved drug a “cure” and saying he would provide hundreds of thousands of doses of unapproved drugs to Americans free of charge.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4030cfe1-123b-49ce-ab64-a8c3b8a9ff83"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b68b619a-53a7-4070-ae96-589508df9a5d">
		<rdfs:label>article-b68b619a-53a7-4070-ae96-589508df9a5d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tulsa’s top health official said the Trump rally last month may have contributed to a local surge in cases. A study in England provided more evidence of crucial risk factors for Covid-19 deaths.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b698c3d5-9a56-4a5e-b18a-cd9070e80df4">
		<rdfs:label>article-b698c3d5-9a56-4a5e-b18a-cd9070e80df4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Trump administration policies that discourage immigrants from coming forward could hamper efforts to contain the epidemic.</rdfs:comment>
