		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b69f82be-5771-4277-b5b4-ba7edfefc1f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-b69f82be-5771-4277-b5b4-ba7edfefc1f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The right-wing group’s deceptive call to the president’s daughter a month before Election Day is among the new details that show how the organization worked to expose personal information about the Biden family.</rdfs:comment>
