	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6a00b59-46ee-4b5c-9c6d-a4e456abd541">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6a00b59-46ee-4b5c-9c6d-a4e456abd541</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nearly half of the last 39 detainees have now been approved for transfer, and the challenge for U.S. officials is to find countries to receive them.</rdfs:comment>
