	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6a09fc9-46b2-4cfc-9110-cd80c0aaef0b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6a09fc9-46b2-4cfc-9110-cd80c0aaef0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The directives came in response to the flawed monitoring of a former Trump adviser that the president has falsely held up as proof of spying on his campaign.</rdfs:comment>
