	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6a221c9-7bd9-4001-9903-87f9a2918f4e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6a221c9-7bd9-4001-9903-87f9a2918f4e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Durst, the eccentric millionaire who has been the subject of books and documentaries, is accused of killing a close confidante in Beverly Hills, Calif., in 2000.</rdfs:comment>
