	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6a39f13-3aab-43d5-b16b-15eae2c6685c">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6a39f13-3aab-43d5-b16b-15eae2c6685c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s taxes reveal details about his business dealings in China, including a previously unknown bank account.</rdfs:comment>
