	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6a3e26d-a441-4228-b7a8-2e9bf50c8fa4">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6a3e26d-a441-4228-b7a8-2e9bf50c8fa4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s message to his die-hard fans is increasingly at odds with how most Americans feel.</rdfs:comment>
