	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6f0598a-1602-41bc-8fc3-c10883961eec">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6f0598a-1602-41bc-8fc3-c10883961eec</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There are two big questions tonight as this long campaign comes to an end. The first, obviously, is whether President Trump survives a challenge from Joseph R. Biden Jr. and wins a second term in the White House.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ebf4f94d-a728-4327-b424-d347782b7b17"/>
