		<rdfs:label>article-b6f1086b-2d19-465a-8c59-15c28cfe1d65</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ruling is the latest twist in the lead-up to a campaign rally that has become a flash point, as the country grapples with the coronavirus crisis and intensifying calls for racial justice.</rdfs:comment>
