	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b6fc86d5-00ce-49bd-b096-48dcf9886025">
		<rdfs:label>article-b6fc86d5-00ce-49bd-b096-48dcf9886025</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph R. Biden Jr. raised more money in August than any past presidential candidate had in a single month: $364.5 million. Now he has done it again.</rdfs:comment>
