	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b7724f5f-f47f-43fb-b231-69d08afc57f9">
		<rdfs:label>article-b7724f5f-f47f-43fb-b231-69d08afc57f9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After going dark on the TV airwaves last week, the Trump campaign has returned, targeting early voting states.</rdfs:comment>
