	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b772688d-40a0-4d36-8565-f11a1ec4f8d6">
		<rdfs:label>article-b772688d-40a0-4d36-8565-f11a1ec4f8d6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Senate’s passage of a trillion-dollar infrastructure plan was vindication of President Biden’s commitment to bipartisanship, but for his larger agenda, he will need Democrats in lock step.</rdfs:comment>
