		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b7745e21-a366-446b-9b32-be58f17c4457">
		<rdfs:label>article-b7745e21-a366-446b-9b32-be58f17c4457</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration extended tariffs on imported solar products but made changes to exempt many more products from the levies, a decision that angered some domestic producers.</rdfs:comment>
