	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b785d647-7a5e-490f-8217-6a743e344e7e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b785d647-7a5e-490f-8217-6a743e344e7e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Glenn Youngkin, a first-time candidate with vast wealth, will deliver a pro-business message intended to win over suburban voters. Democrats plan to portray him as a Trump devotee.</rdfs:comment>
