	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b786923f-ae62-48b5-96dc-e53a77f6a223">
		<rdfs:label>article-b786923f-ae62-48b5-96dc-e53a77f6a223</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Legislation across the country would restrict voting methods and accommodations that people with disabilities are disproportionately likely to rely on.</rdfs:comment>
