	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b7a391d1-805c-48f3-a9ac-f3950f04868d">
		<rdfs:label>article-b7a391d1-805c-48f3-a9ac-f3950f04868d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 116th Congress has lurched through a government shutdown, the impeachment and trial of a president, and the deadliest pandemic in a century.</rdfs:comment>
