		<rdfs:label>article-b833c952-2a65-455f-8f9a-da3fcc767a8a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than 45,000 new cases in the United States were reported on Friday, the third consecutive day with a record total. India’s caseload surged past 500,000, as global infections approached 10 million.</rdfs:comment>
