		<rdfs:label>article-b8395ab0-20da-41d1-bb52-e7bf55f16b01</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Anita Dunn, who is returning to her Democratic consulting company next month, has long faced questions about how her influence in the White House intersects with her company’s corporate work.</rdfs:comment>
