		<rdfs:label>article-b84952c3-5177-4818-a675-ded6d6524d3c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Chris Stirewalt was part of a pivotal decision to declare Joe Biden the winner of Arizona in 2020. Now he’s speaking out about a network he says incites “black-helicopter-level paranoia and hatred.”</rdfs:comment>
