		<rdfs:label>article-b84988ff-1074-4125-b50e-8bb079834d3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump issued national guidelines that included closing schools and avoiding bars, restaurants and groups of more than 10 as he prepared for months of upheaval.</rdfs:comment>
