		<rdfs:label>article-b849a766-9db6-4eda-9779-0b6d04fb80ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In their second attempt to pass a sweeping elections overhaul, Republican lawmakers followed the broad outlines of the first, including a wide range of measures to limit voting access.</rdfs:comment>
