	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b856f5fd-0ed4-4f2a-8ce6-c932ff6225c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-b856f5fd-0ed4-4f2a-8ce6-c932ff6225c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Parts of the country are starting to reopen even though the government is projecting a much higher death toll. Given this reality, who can think much about the future?</rdfs:comment>
