		<rdfs:label>article-b87f0904-3fef-417c-b49d-2e9e316b9c0b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Troubling resurgences have hit places around the world that were seen as models in the virus fight. In the U.S., known cases surpassed four million.</rdfs:comment>
