	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8953f81-591c-411b-9c73-c7ef1753a2af">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8953f81-591c-411b-9c73-c7ef1753a2af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Since a report in The Daily Beast said Mr. Walker, the Republican Senate candidate in Georgia, paid for an abortion in 2009, Mr. Kemp has offered no specific support nor condemnation.</rdfs:comment>
