		<rdfs:label>article-b8991d35-fc46-418f-bcf6-2f0eac2272a8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Using office software, satellite maps and messaging apps, volunteers are acting like digital guide services to helping American citizens and Afghan allies flee the country.</rdfs:comment>
