	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b89cd335-34a0-4739-9e0b-4b0e107533e6">
		<rdfs:label>article-b89cd335-34a0-4739-9e0b-4b0e107533e6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Restrictions in several states on mail-in voting are sending more people with disabilities to the polls. What they find isn’t always easy to navigate.</rdfs:comment>
