	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8a4e4a8-bbe6-4344-a668-3b39f0de87b4">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8a4e4a8-bbe6-4344-a668-3b39f0de87b4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Years before he won a murder conviction for the death of George Floyd, Mr. Ellison, the Minnesota attorney general, was a young civil rights lawyer taking on police misconduct.</rdfs:comment>
