	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8afe7e4-5951-43d3-aba7-7baa8088bb13">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8afe7e4-5951-43d3-aba7-7baa8088bb13</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>To the chagrin of Republicans, the democratic socialist senator will play a central role in shepherding Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s agenda through Congress.</rdfs:comment>
