	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8b005fc-b14e-41f5-8d1e-4169076eee2e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8b005fc-b14e-41f5-8d1e-4169076eee2e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s much-anticipated stimulus bill is on the verge of becoming law. Here is what’s actually in it.</rdfs:comment>
