		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8b54b58-a2df-41f9-8761-05ae48aa6b70">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8b54b58-a2df-41f9-8761-05ae48aa6b70</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Waiting eight weeks or more between doses may boost immunity. But as Omicron slams the United States, waiting also comes with risks.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-163813f5-35bf-46dc-ba93-a0055350c200"/>
