		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8be84a6-ae72-4d0c-9f82-9b58968704ab">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8be84a6-ae72-4d0c-9f82-9b58968704ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A report showing that the richest Americans, including Jeff Bezos, Elon Musk and Warren Buffett, pay almost no taxes has refocused attention on the tax code.</rdfs:comment>
