	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8da38bc-4220-49fc-ac25-a88fccd9d9ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8da38bc-4220-49fc-ac25-a88fccd9d9ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For nearly a century, advocates have tried to add a provision to the Constitution guaranteeing equal rights to men and women. The effort, stalled for decades, has come back to life.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2da392b5-3975-4712-902a-5672c1f67a38"/>
