	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8df0d02-1a99-492a-b272-79fd582e718c">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8df0d02-1a99-492a-b272-79fd582e718c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It remains unclear if the effort to enlist companies like General Motors, Apple and Hanes constitutes an effective strategy.</rdfs:comment>
