	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b8e63c46-c433-4e71-a536-2403a3c63d15">
		<rdfs:label>article-b8e63c46-c433-4e71-a536-2403a3c63d15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“He’s literally the talk of the hospital because he’s so chunky and so cute,” said George’s mother, Amanda.</rdfs:comment>
