	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b901daca-1884-4e1d-8a5d-a9e01216c239">
		<rdfs:label>article-b901daca-1884-4e1d-8a5d-a9e01216c239</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The two clashed over bankruptcy policy more than a decade ago. But Joseph R. Biden Jr. now supports Elizabeth Warren’s plan that allows student debt to be relieved in bankruptcy.</rdfs:comment>
