	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b904f3e8-4cb4-4925-ac1b-f54caa811404">
		<rdfs:label>article-b904f3e8-4cb4-4925-ac1b-f54caa811404</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Here’s a last-minute guide to voting in the state’s primary elections.</rdfs:comment>
