	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b90c91cb-6ec8-4002-9355-1275ae9f2aa4">
		<rdfs:label>article-b90c91cb-6ec8-4002-9355-1275ae9f2aa4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>So far, there is scant evidence that these punishments have limited the cyberattacks and other bad behavior from America’s two greatest rivals for influence and power around the world.</rdfs:comment>
