	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b90fa56b-fee4-4c12-898a-2486469fabad">
		<rdfs:label>article-b90fa56b-fee4-4c12-898a-2486469fabad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Here are facts about heaters (for outside and inside) and climate change.</rdfs:comment>
