	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b911a605-f7d2-497f-9b2f-b3bd73cd915e">
		<rdfs:label>article-b911a605-f7d2-497f-9b2f-b3bd73cd915e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the vice president landed in El Paso, she responded to criticism that she should have traveled to the U.S.-Mexico border earlier as part of her work addressing migration.</rdfs:comment>
