	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b912e57a-433b-400a-afea-f4bfb46d8f24">
		<rdfs:label>article-b912e57a-433b-400a-afea-f4bfb46d8f24</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Stepien, a former aide to Chris Christie who has been shadowed by the Bridgegate scandal, brings a data-centric style to the president’s lagging re-election effort.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-21d856ad-a6ae-406e-a9e4-9707218ad815"/>
