		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b914a586-b48a-4883-896c-0c0c0924f6ae">
		<rdfs:label>article-b914a586-b48a-4883-896c-0c0c0924f6ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s visceral reaction to the horrifying images coming out of Ukraine also reflects a broader effort to isolate the Russian leader.</rdfs:comment>
