		<rdfs:label>article-b914cb8b-bbbc-45bf-b2b5-662641f63e90</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This year’s congressional map, despite continued gerrymandering, is poised to have a nearly equal number of districts that lean Democratic and Republican.</rdfs:comment>
