		<rdfs:label>article-b914f563-5af2-4de0-ab4d-c5aa6f1d406f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Biden will hold a drive-in rally in Georgia on Thursday and plans to visit the couple after they were unable to attend his inauguration in January because of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
