	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b91c56a0-64f2-40b4-931f-a20db4fa5f35">
		<rdfs:label>article-b91c56a0-64f2-40b4-931f-a20db4fa5f35</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a case with major implications, the justices wrestled with a high-tech dispute over computer code using low-tech analogies.</rdfs:comment>
