	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b91e8bfe-49bc-40bd-9cbd-893c8d016683">
		<rdfs:label>article-b91e8bfe-49bc-40bd-9cbd-893c8d016683</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A campaign whose fund-raising, events and messaging have all been driven by President Trump says it will stay the course while he’s off the campaign trail.</rdfs:comment>
