		<rdfs:label>article-b9203f50-28e4-4b62-8e28-71def2f1c8fa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Russia has struggled to see military gains from its cyberattacks in the world’s first sustained cyberspace battle between two sophisticated militaries.</rdfs:comment>
