	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b9278b6a-790d-413c-91f2-7bcfbadbcd3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-b9278b6a-790d-413c-91f2-7bcfbadbcd3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even in states that protect abortion rights, colleges are proceeding with caution.</rdfs:comment>
