		<rdfs:label>article-b928c006-279d-4d38-b17d-183a2822b834</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Silicon Valley firm Andreessen Horowitz, whose founders played big roles in the development of the internet, aims to own a huge part of the digital currency world — and set the rules for it, too.</rdfs:comment>
