	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b9301658-3ea8-4fa1-8264-5d8566d88a10">
		<rdfs:label>article-b9301658-3ea8-4fa1-8264-5d8566d88a10</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a virtual roll call showcasing its diversity, the party rewarded Joe Biden with the nomination he has pursued intermittently since 1988. The long-awaited victory is a triumph of personal and political endurance.</rdfs:comment>
