		<rdfs:label>article-b93a91ac-7dca-416b-a691-4443280116dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The address comes as the coronavirus spreads — and during a breakdown in relations between the president and the nation’s top military leaders.</rdfs:comment>
