		<rdfs:label>article-b93c74fb-84c1-4ec2-8b9e-4334ff426475</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A prosecutor in Atlanta is investigating interference in the 2020 presidential election, an inquiry that has engulfed Donald J. Trump and many of his allies.</rdfs:comment>
