	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b93f06e5-8c60-4c4d-adc1-538380e35e7b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b93f06e5-8c60-4c4d-adc1-538380e35e7b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans from Georgia to Washington traded blame for their bruising defeats in the Senate races. Much of it landed on Donald Trump.</rdfs:comment>
