		<rdfs:label>article-b9401e02-4e4c-41f3-8101-74881276462a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Moore, a celebrity author and former nonprofit executive, will aim to take back the office for Democrats after eight years under Gov. Larry Hogan, a Republican who is term-limited.</rdfs:comment>
