	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b949861d-db7a-4b4b-aaf9-70a40a89f82b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b949861d-db7a-4b4b-aaf9-70a40a89f82b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The conservative nonprofit said it had paid for staff to accompany its founder, James O’Keefe, when he starred in a 2021 production of “Oklahoma!”</rdfs:comment>
