		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-09-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b954f9b6-0aa9-4bee-8df0-8b43d4fb995c">
		<rdfs:label>article-b954f9b6-0aa9-4bee-8df0-8b43d4fb995c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The outcry over a photograph of Ivanka Trump with a can of Goya beans reveals how the president and his aides continue to disregard traditional boundaries between the official and the political.</rdfs:comment>
