		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b95609d6-0f20-402f-a11b-f25caa331e8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b95609d6-0f20-402f-a11b-f25caa331e8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump administration’s response to the attack, incited by the president, has lacked broad reassurances to a country on edge.</rdfs:comment>
