	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b9567be1-6354-44e9-b9cc-0e49d666426b">
		<rdfs:label>article-b9567be1-6354-44e9-b9cc-0e49d666426b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s pledge to nominate a Black woman to the Supreme Court has drawn conservatives’ criticism. But they may just have a short memory.</rdfs:comment>
