		<rdfs:label>article-b95dd156-aa5a-4f2f-8c34-428bbd1fd8c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state’s Republican governor, who recently vetoed an anti-transgender bill only to be overridden by the legislature, spoke to The Times about why his party has “got to show greater compassion.”</rdfs:comment>
