	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b9632a8d-4014-4bb4-a777-44abbef428a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-b9632a8d-4014-4bb4-a777-44abbef428a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Susan Collins, Republican of Maine, emerged victorious on Wednesday in her bid to secure a fifth term, beating back an avalanche of Democratic money and liberal anger in the most difficult race of her career to defeat Sara Gideon, a Democrat, and strengthen her party’s hold on the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
