		<rdfs:label>article-b9d439d7-907c-4a05-b6fc-fd8eb1ddc4e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As allegations against Gov. Andrew Cuomo put a new spotlight on sexual misconduct in New York’s capital, numerous women there described an enduring predatory and misogynistic environment.</rdfs:comment>
