	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b9ddc88d-1771-4f21-b8b6-62c1295c80ac">
		<rdfs:label>article-b9ddc88d-1771-4f21-b8b6-62c1295c80ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The appointment of the Nigerian economist Ngozi Okonjo-Iweala to lead the World Trade Organization removes one obstacle, but the group’s future remains uncertain.</rdfs:comment>
