		<rdfs:label>article-b9e34b96-2053-430b-8915-c48dc35b1c57</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As an L.A.P.D. officer, William Jones Jr. said he wanted the public “not to be scared of us.” He is now under investigation for a shooting that killed Valentina Orellana Peralta and an unarmed assault suspect.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-078e57d0-5b20-48e9-b039-c2569b2acb05"/>
