	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-b9e641ab-63f4-40c3-8ad3-e67990951fd4">
		<rdfs:label>article-b9e641ab-63f4-40c3-8ad3-e67990951fd4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>During the Delta surge, British schools emphasized other safety measures: quarantining and regular testing for the virus.</rdfs:comment>
