		<rdfs:label>article-b9fc7d2c-a18e-4387-b43b-64aebeccbc28</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A presentation obtained by The New York Times shows that the Department of Health and Human Services’ emergency response office is monitoring public sentiment around the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
