		<rdfs:label>article-b9fc97b5-511c-4fe7-b351-94d46d6ba347</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The National Security Council confirmed that Ellen Knight, who told of improper pressure from Trump administration officials, was returning to help manage classified information.</rdfs:comment>
