		<rdfs:label>article-b9fe579f-7ab8-473e-b55f-4c4e82eeec13</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden said the United States would pursue “a measure to disrupt their ability to operate” against Darkside, the group behind the hack.</rdfs:comment>
