	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ba00e91c-4098-4808-8c40-ac3b6e523004">
		<rdfs:label>article-ba00e91c-4098-4808-8c40-ac3b6e523004</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Tuberville, the Republicans’ new Senate nominee, will most likely repeat the same pro-Trump strategy he used to beat Jeff Sessions in the primary.</rdfs:comment>
