	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ba01c836-feda-4cf7-8583-fc0433c5509f">
		<rdfs:label>article-ba01c836-feda-4cf7-8583-fc0433c5509f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mike Pence deflected criticism of the Trump administration’s pandemic response, something Kamala Harris said “clearly” hadn’t worked.</rdfs:comment>
