	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ba058312-05ad-4c4a-82ab-362745084286">
		<rdfs:label>article-ba058312-05ad-4c4a-82ab-362745084286</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden also announced the allocation of 1,000 medical personnel to six states would carry out a pledge the president made last month on quashing Omicron.</rdfs:comment>
