	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ba0b4439-4598-4547-969b-31d1d6d72f3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-ba0b4439-4598-4547-969b-31d1d6d72f3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mayor Lori Lightfoot called for calm before the body camera footage was made public. The victim, Adam Toledo, was one of the youngest people killed by the police in Illinois in years.</rdfs:comment>
