	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ba0cbb8a-7e05-4794-984a-bdb2c732f229">
		<rdfs:label>article-ba0cbb8a-7e05-4794-984a-bdb2c732f229</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The most daunting challenge for Mr. Biden in the weeks ahead will be balancing his stated desire for bipartisanship with his sense of urgency.</rdfs:comment>
