	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ba0f2287-dd1d-42e4-a1f7-40236f175f1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-ba0f2287-dd1d-42e4-a1f7-40236f175f1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the first presidential envoy for climate, he wants to persuade world leaders to “do what the science tells us.” With global climate talks less than two months away, he faces a tough path.</rdfs:comment>
