	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-baba6fdd-c5f8-44a2-9e82-07e8da90527c">
		<rdfs:label>article-baba6fdd-c5f8-44a2-9e82-07e8da90527c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>WASHINGTON — President Trump abruptly signed a measure on Sunday providing $900 billion in pandemic aid and funding the government through September, ending last-minute turmoil over a possible government shutdown and an economic lifeline for millions of Americans.</rdfs:comment>
