	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-badeac5b-2dff-4905-976f-109429049a01">
		<rdfs:label>article-badeac5b-2dff-4905-976f-109429049a01</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As an encapsulation of the president’s worldview, some former associates say, there is perhaps no beating the text of a campaign waiver: “guests voluntarily assume all risks.”</rdfs:comment>
