	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-badecd6b-5f39-4bc4-83c4-b04608034196">
		<rdfs:label>article-badecd6b-5f39-4bc4-83c4-b04608034196</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden picked up votes in Pennsylvania, Nevada and Georgia and urged patience with the slow-moving vote count. President Trump appeared in the evening to break his silence, lying about “illegal” votes.</rdfs:comment>
