	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bae240c6-485b-4dcd-83a1-18a5e2a6de59">
		<rdfs:label>article-bae240c6-485b-4dcd-83a1-18a5e2a6de59</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In his latest con, the former president dons his trusty cloak of victimhood to gin up antigovernment anxiety.</rdfs:comment>
