		<rdfs:label>article-baedb499-85ea-4751-9912-4592eb991e25</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Mitch McConnell’s call to delay former President Donald J. Trump’s trial left the timetable uncertain as party leaders wrangled over the basics of a functioning Senate.</rdfs:comment>
