		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bb05b1b6-d252-4497-8a4d-3c115ef4acc4">
		<rdfs:label>article-bb05b1b6-d252-4497-8a4d-3c115ef4acc4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As states report less frequently, changes in the trajectory of the virus are slower to reveal themselves.</rdfs:comment>
