	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bb15d9aa-ec68-4fe4-b4de-7b6c5834029f">
		<rdfs:label>article-bb15d9aa-ec68-4fe4-b4de-7b6c5834029f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House and bipartisan lawmakers have agreed on a package that would provide funding for roads, bridges and other physical infrastructure.</rdfs:comment>
