	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bc82463b-1096-426f-859c-e63066fe5dc3">
		<rdfs:label>article-bc82463b-1096-426f-859c-e63066fe5dc3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Swimming in polluted beaches increases the chance of skin rashes and infections.</rdfs:comment>
