		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd0599c2-b56a-4681-9140-61babe7bf1fd">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd0599c2-b56a-4681-9140-61babe7bf1fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The White House has been slow to recognize the political potency of rising prices. But Republicans had a plan, and they think the issue can help realign the American electorate.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e9c4025-7dbe-4808-a3d4-b9d25fa14354"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-89135d87-ed63-4619-a5ce-c3f23d9e6fd4"/>
