	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd13d93f-2c3a-4c95-8d77-2d74023b648f">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd13d93f-2c3a-4c95-8d77-2d74023b648f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a video, we retraced Kobe Bryant’s route before the crash that killed him and eight others to try to understand what might have happened.</rdfs:comment>
