	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd178926-4a7c-4579-a0de-a3e4cc746d9d">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd178926-4a7c-4579-a0de-a3e4cc746d9d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The families of 10 victims have waited years to hold the Infowars conspiracist and the political environment that enabled him to account.</rdfs:comment>
