	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd2112d6-1f7f-4f8f-923c-363b217088bc">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd2112d6-1f7f-4f8f-923c-363b217088bc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The storm was especially hard on Volusia County, northeast of Orlando, where officials said that inspectors had deemed 24 hotels and condominiums unsafe.</rdfs:comment>
