	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd259610-bb30-4b4e-993b-7e5bbd513773">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd259610-bb30-4b4e-993b-7e5bbd513773</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president went to Phoenix to speak to a group of student supporters.</rdfs:comment>
