		<rdfs:label>article-bd28b444-4845-4960-b2e1-53e81c82f5d5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The elite force’s selection course is so punishing that few make it through, and many of those who do resort to illicit tactics.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fd9f1ad4-cd49-4185-a0bb-a129097c5a29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-30"/>
