	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd298169-824e-46fb-b9cb-d48a83e1bf8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd298169-824e-46fb-b9cb-d48a83e1bf8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Minnesota’s Department of Human Rights found instances of shockingly racist and misogynistic language, as well as patterns of discrimination in arrests and use of force.</rdfs:comment>
