		<rdfs:label>article-bd39b9d5-2731-473b-b122-59439b739c42</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pete Buttigieg would be the first openly gay cabinet secretary, one of the firsts that President-elect Joe Biden cited in introducing him as his transportation secretary.</rdfs:comment>
