	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bd3bb66e-15c9-4996-88a6-55a768d62e66">
		<rdfs:label>article-bd3bb66e-15c9-4996-88a6-55a768d62e66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Pfizer-BioNTech coronavirus vaccine is expected to be approved next week for children 12 to 15, and the federal government says more than half of K-8 schools are open full-time for in-person learning.</rdfs:comment>
