		<rdfs:label>article-bd3bd183-75ea-4471-b1c3-df66c478e96a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Kamala Harris has had a galvanizing effect on Indian-American voters — but she’s not the only reason they support the Democratic ticket.</rdfs:comment>
