		<rdfs:label>article-be93155a-a060-4171-b01a-d0be9296526c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The moneyed summer resort became an unlikely arena in the fight over illegal immigration. Republican states have bused thousands of migrants to New York and Washington.</rdfs:comment>
