		<rdfs:label>article-be935a7c-7b09-4c23-b565-a5e7a1ed7a73</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Kirsten Gillibrand of New York has spent years building support for a measure to remove commanders from decisions about prosecuting sex crimes, but some colleagues now worry it goes too far.</rdfs:comment>
