		<rdfs:label>article-bf3716b0-4258-4f1a-8bf1-5a6f377613e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Kyrsten Sinema, a first-term Arizona senator, was rebuked by fellow Democrats in her state after her vote on the filibuster helped sink the party’s voting-rights legislation.</rdfs:comment>
