	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bf390130-31b8-4f55-8ae4-3e31b54b7124">
		<rdfs:label>article-bf390130-31b8-4f55-8ae4-3e31b54b7124</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the rural hills of Georgia, a state he is seeking to win, Joseph R. Biden Jr. called for “healing” and “restoration,” and a commitment to a common purpose to meet the challenges of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
