	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bf3a69da-6c8d-4fe9-a84f-e90bd0879a6c">
		<rdfs:label>article-bf3a69da-6c8d-4fe9-a84f-e90bd0879a6c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Kevin McCarthy, the Republican leader, has pledged to take his fight for the speakership to the House floor. It could turn into a debacle not seen in the chamber for a century.</rdfs:comment>
