	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bf731319-a040-447c-9861-187e2c1b4764">
		<rdfs:label>article-bf731319-a040-447c-9861-187e2c1b4764</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The election that thrust Arnold Schwarzenegger into power in 2003 was the first time that many Americans heard of a recall. But they have a long history in the U.S.</rdfs:comment>
