	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bf83e274-efef-4e8a-a5a6-64c1206135e9">
		<rdfs:label>article-bf83e274-efef-4e8a-a5a6-64c1206135e9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A lawyer for Mr. Chauvin argued that the former officer had acted reasonably when he knelt on George Floyd for more than nine minutes, imploring jurors to also consider the moments before officers took Mr. Floyd to the ground.</rdfs:comment>
