	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bf83fb92-6e4b-4287-8a72-4c201922fbb7">
		<rdfs:label>article-bf83fb92-6e4b-4287-8a72-4c201922fbb7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph Biden and other Democrats are wary of criticism of Judge Amy Coney Barrett that could be perceived as personal. They will focus on the real-world impact she might have as a Supreme Court justice on health care and access to abortion.</rdfs:comment>
