		<rdfs:label>article-bf88371a-e20a-44f0-a9c4-589a76adfec2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For the second year in a row, concentrations of the potent planet-warming gas jumped by the largest amount since measurements began four decades ago.</rdfs:comment>
