		<rdfs:label>article-bf9215d3-c172-4079-a485-5cfb978b7c53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But even as President Trump acknowledged that the coronavirus has been deadlier than he had previously predicted, he pressed to reopen the country.</rdfs:comment>
