	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bf9f206d-bc13-4337-98a5-e9374860d87b">
		<rdfs:label>article-bf9f206d-bc13-4337-98a5-e9374860d87b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While the number of forces — about 700 — is small, it is a continuation of President Trump’s efforts to withdraw the United States from what he has described as endless wars.</rdfs:comment>
