	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bfae1996-d17f-4f01-b6df-6a78b9822601">
		<rdfs:label>article-bfae1996-d17f-4f01-b6df-6a78b9822601</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The travails of a Chicago fishing company’s advent calendar highlight the supply chain hurdles for businesses trying to deliver items in time for the holidays.</rdfs:comment>
