	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bfb04882-6deb-4a27-a021-e4261a62ba88">
		<rdfs:label>article-bfb04882-6deb-4a27-a021-e4261a62ba88</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A short-handed Supreme Court — driven from its courtroom by the pandemic, grieving over the loss of a colleague and awaiting the outcome of a divisive confirmation battle — returns to the virtual bench today to start a term that presents Chief Justice John G. Roberts Jr. with a daunting test.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
