	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-bfb12b59-7a85-4126-9489-7ea649ae0f45">
		<rdfs:label>article-bfb12b59-7a85-4126-9489-7ea649ae0f45</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He joked to a crowd in Denver that he would rather be at his house in Vail, and told people he was excited for “Super Bowl Tuesday.” But Mr. Bloomberg is getting a little bit better at this.</rdfs:comment>
