	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c0a2b7f5-e9cf-490d-9dd8-e3ddad72f050">
		<rdfs:label>article-c0a2b7f5-e9cf-490d-9dd8-e3ddad72f050</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>All eyes were on mail-in ballots when general election results were tallied in November. And now, with control of the Senate hinging on two runoff elections in Georgia, it is no surprise that mail-in ballots are getting attention again. Here is what we know about when they will be counted:</rdfs:comment>
