		<rdfs:label>article-c0ae75c7-1445-42d6-aa62-eb0a57e9e670</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move represents a fundamental change in America’s response to a drug that has been at the center of a clash between culture and policing for more than a half-century.</rdfs:comment>
