		<rdfs:label>article-c0c3e50d-a557-47b1-8e17-9e504be5561e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Connecticut judge rejected the Infowars conspiracy theorist’s claim that he was too ill to sit for a deposition, and set a schedule of hefty fines.</rdfs:comment>
