	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c0cd60ae-f24f-4118-877f-2cc630a4bfca">
		<rdfs:label>article-c0cd60ae-f24f-4118-877f-2cc630a4bfca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Friday: Immigration lawyers and groups have been visiting emergency shelters to help educate children who crossed the border without a parent.</rdfs:comment>
