		<rdfs:label>article-c0d0d9d1-2e80-4952-8535-7dca5fcbfd11</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Homeless shelters would have the right to turn away transgender people from single-sex facilities that correspond to their gender identity.</rdfs:comment>
