	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c0db0135-6cc8-4b9f-ba5b-b579d31ce495">
		<rdfs:label>article-c0db0135-6cc8-4b9f-ba5b-b579d31ce495</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Grading on a curve, political experts said President Trump did not hurt himself. But they said neither did Joe Biden, and that may be all that matters so late in the game.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e99dcff-b565-458e-b08f-ae5cce9b25f2"/>
