	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c0e2f6c6-fc17-4ff0-998b-d13b1c672ddc">
		<rdfs:label>article-c0e2f6c6-fc17-4ff0-998b-d13b1c672ddc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Polls have shown that Americans think war with Iran is more likely than it was before President Trump took office.</rdfs:comment>
