	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c1421f14-9747-4360-a158-102c96ef4e2e">
		<rdfs:label>article-c1421f14-9747-4360-a158-102c96ef4e2e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first full week of the Biden presidency has unfolded with a certain rhythm, with each day putting a spotlight on a new policy theme. President Biden has addressed American manufacturing, racial equity and climate change since Monday.</rdfs:comment>
