		<rdfs:label>article-c144c877-678b-464c-90e9-b4c2f7fe67bc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The new polling showed that Joe Biden maintains a steady but not overpowering lead, particularly in the critical battleground of Pennsylvania.</rdfs:comment>
