		<rdfs:label>article-c14b40d1-6afa-43ca-bb3d-ad7ed79d2be7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Speaking at an online summit on the fifth anniversary of the Paris climate agreement, Xi Jinping said that China would reduce its carbon intensity by over 65 percent by 2030.</rdfs:comment>
