	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c150fe25-6654-4c55-9383-9ca540ea6c6e">
		<rdfs:label>article-c150fe25-6654-4c55-9383-9ca540ea6c6e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The report, which describes vacant key posts and a culture of disrespect and political retaliation, came days before Secretary of State Mike Pompeo will give long-awaited testimony on Capitol Hill.</rdfs:comment>
