		<rdfs:label>article-c154e430-f189-40d2-83d1-6a0780d43f16</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A stronger-than-expected performance by Democrats that preserved their control of the Senate and left the House up for grabs has reshuffled the congressional agenda for the rest of the year.</rdfs:comment>
