	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c16c1924-a807-465d-adb2-ef37261afbb0">
		<rdfs:label>article-c16c1924-a807-465d-adb2-ef37261afbb0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Among those attending the inauguration were the relatives of Black victims of police violence. Jacob Blake, whose son, Jacob Blake Jr., was shot and gravely wounded by a police officer in Kenosha, Wis., Justin Blake, the uncle of the younger Jacob, and Bianca Austin, the aunt of Breonna Taylor, who was fatally shot in a botched raid by the Louisville police, attended together.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-295dc04c-bd5c-4dba-9271-bfd8a89ba851"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-20"/>
