	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c16d1038-f25f-4073-8832-6045b471966c">
		<rdfs:label>article-c16d1038-f25f-4073-8832-6045b471966c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The right-wing firebrand is counting on Republican primary voters to look past his bad press. Opponents are counting on them to lose patience with him.</rdfs:comment>
