	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c2251471-111f-4b1d-bf05-22799c105e31">
		<rdfs:label>article-c2251471-111f-4b1d-bf05-22799c105e31</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We want to see how educators are preparing school buildings to keep themselves and their students safe if they open amid the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
