		<rdfs:label>article-c23cef58-190c-4a9a-81e0-252679d8804b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first Trump vs. Biden debate starts soon. We’ll have a livestream with real-time fact-checking and analysis from New York Times reporters.</rdfs:comment>
