		<rdfs:label>article-c23f97d2-6d3b-4816-94e3-d49583ecd3f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Justice Department has told four carmakers that they violated no laws when they negotiated a fuel economy standard with California that is more stringent than Washington’s.</rdfs:comment>
