		<rdfs:label>article-c244f356-1fd1-422b-bc03-b617784e2473</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Fudge, a House member from Ohio, would be the second African-American Biden cabinet member chosen in two days. Mr. Vilsack would reprise his role from the Obama administration.</rdfs:comment>
