		<rdfs:label>article-c245c577-d3e2-4c5e-81c0-1f10e05d0e33</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $1.85 trillion social policy bill would provide free private health insurance for more than two million adults locked out of coverage, but only for four years.</rdfs:comment>
