		<rdfs:label>article-c24ae442-29f6-4313-a22f-6dafe8221795</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a rally in Des Moines, Representatives Marjorie Taylor Greene and Matt Gaetz showed that many Republicans do not plan to move on from the Trump era.</rdfs:comment>
