		<rdfs:label>article-c24d6ee0-8a5c-4cdc-b8f2-baad0ffebce2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The legislation, which would create a panel to consider reparations for slavery, is being considered as President Biden works to address racial inequity.</rdfs:comment>
