		<rdfs:label>article-c2516210-31fc-4b89-98bb-0f61bc075402</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But Donald Trump faces no further investigation or penalties related to the 2016 payment to a former Playboy model by the publisher of The National Enquirer.</rdfs:comment>
