		<rdfs:label>article-c252d8bc-8df1-4e18-858c-88dbe91773eb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Immigrant field workers have been told to keep working despite stay-at-home directives, and given letters attesting to their “critical” role in feeding the country.</rdfs:comment>
