		<rdfs:label>article-c258ca7d-d740-472a-aa49-91a1e1c3cbdf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Admiral Rachel Levine is the first female four-star admiral in the history of the he U.S. Public Health Service Commissioned Corps, which she already leads in her role as assistant secretary.</rdfs:comment>
