	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c264a303-5729-4e78-a021-54558128a60d">
		<rdfs:label>article-c264a303-5729-4e78-a021-54558128a60d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pushing false theories on the virus, the vaccine and the Jan. 6 attack on the Capitol, Mr. Johnson, the Republican senator from Wisconsin, has absorbed his party’s transformation under Donald Trump.</rdfs:comment>
