		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c267cb5d-040d-4ee2-85c9-3b4498e7d4ab">
		<rdfs:label>article-c267cb5d-040d-4ee2-85c9-3b4498e7d4ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Documents obtained through a public records request showed the degree to which XPO Logistics, Postmaster General Louis DeJoy’s former employer, is intertwined with the agency he now oversees.</rdfs:comment>
