	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c26830cd-c8c9-4cef-aae4-0e08b24ee48e">
		<rdfs:label>article-c26830cd-c8c9-4cef-aae4-0e08b24ee48e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After ascending to the top Senate job during the assault on the Capitol, Mr. Schumer faces a different kind of challenge: steering President Biden’s agenda with no margin for error.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a2860122-d5d8-4996-a4a4-bc29b03dbcd0"/>
