	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c26ad97e-0b39-4edb-beb5-9f75e5c06aaa">
		<rdfs:label>article-c26ad97e-0b39-4edb-beb5-9f75e5c06aaa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>While the Asian giant hornet massacres honeybees in their hives, some bees have developed a remarkable defense: cooking the hornets alive.</rdfs:comment>
