		<rdfs:label>article-c26c28ba-a55e-4b09-ab0f-899564dad2ca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two young conservatives are battling for the mantle of Trumpism in a congressional primary in a competitive district in New Hampshire that could help decide the House majority.</rdfs:comment>
