	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c272cbde-07ff-4432-8e9f-bde42302c668">
		<rdfs:label>article-c272cbde-07ff-4432-8e9f-bde42302c668</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president said U.S. troops should not be fighting a war Afghan forces are not willing to fight. Afghanistan’s leaders and military had been given every chance to determine their future, he said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-16"/>
