	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c27385a4-7ac3-4086-833f-d54f606accc3">
		<rdfs:label>article-c27385a4-7ac3-4086-833f-d54f606accc3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican National Committee voted to censure Representatives Liz Cheney and Adam Kinzinger for participating in the inquiry into the deadly riot at the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-02-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c273af8a-c7b0-4aff-b371-989f50002742">
		<rdfs:label>article-c273af8a-c7b0-4aff-b371-989f50002742</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The arrested passengers face charges including assault and battery, conspiracy and violating health and safety codes after an altercation in San Francisco that was captured on video.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f08506e1-4ec6-45c9-9d85-46fe67848dee"/>
