	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c275c9a3-cebc-44c9-85fc-aa60d70e3f40">
		<rdfs:label>article-c275c9a3-cebc-44c9-85fc-aa60d70e3f40</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s younger brother Robert S. Trump died Saturday night at age 71. The White House did not say what the cause was, but he had been in poor health for some time.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
