		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c278b987-8372-4f8a-9478-68977872555c">
		<rdfs:label>article-c278b987-8372-4f8a-9478-68977872555c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A grand jury in St. Louis returned an indictment on Tuesday against a white couple who brandished guns at Black protesters as they marched past their home in June in a menacing display caught on video that earned them a spotlight at the Republican National Convention and the admiration of President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4bd1aa5-c807-421e-b8ae-1b3824d70300"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-06"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c2796e4a-94bd-40f7-8234-d9c53cec65a0">
		<rdfs:label>article-c2796e4a-94bd-40f7-8234-d9c53cec65a0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The pandemic has made education a top issue for many voters. But you wouldn’t know that from the candidates’ stump speeches.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6ffe97dc-d137-44d2-a45a-7a007b5451ab"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c27a6c9a-2b88-473d-a8ec-626be9c1a2be">
		<rdfs:label>article-c27a6c9a-2b88-473d-a8ec-626be9c1a2be</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>And the most populous county in the United States, Los Angeles, will also require proof of vaccination, beginning in the fall.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-cc485407-61fb-4f46-96a9-c260884f0314"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e2ba983e-eb48-483d-afa1-e67b02e88f99"/>
