		<rdfs:label>article-c27e14a5-2c17-498f-8871-0f791b1b333c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The contest between Senator Raphael Warnock, the Democrat, and Herschel Walker, the Republican, is seen as key to which party controls the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
