		<rdfs:label>article-c27e2801-6b7e-447c-b853-438c4d037bdd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Ugandan activist’s speech on Thursday was one of the most powerful so far at the United Nations climate conference in Glasgow.</rdfs:comment>
