	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c27efac3-58fd-4b1c-9da3-c6ab019d75df">
		<rdfs:label>article-c27efac3-58fd-4b1c-9da3-c6ab019d75df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid a muted tenure at the S.E.C., the corporate lawyer is now the Trump administration’s intended nominee to be the top prosecutor for the Southern District of New York.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6438df9c-a081-44bb-a03e-8fc36ee83051"/>
