	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c2918042-c1dc-4f96-99af-b36dab6b33cd">
		<rdfs:label>article-c2918042-c1dc-4f96-99af-b36dab6b33cd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Descendants of Robert E. Lee and others whose statues are coming down are confronting this moment’s reassessment of history in a very personal way.</rdfs:comment>
