	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c29a5566-72a6-4a77-9b2c-821ce84b6429">
		<rdfs:label>article-c29a5566-72a6-4a77-9b2c-821ce84b6429</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>According to a state audit, Mississippi allowed tens of millions of dollars in federal anti-poverty funds to be used in ways that did little or nothing to help the poor.</rdfs:comment>
