	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c29bcb72-e1e5-4e7d-b980-89a8b2f181a2">
		<rdfs:label>article-c29bcb72-e1e5-4e7d-b980-89a8b2f181a2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president has not explicitly endorsed calls to expand the court, but he just ordered a study exploring possible reforms.</rdfs:comment>
