		<rdfs:label>article-c2ec315c-a071-48c9-8fbb-eee21aeae0b9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s trial will feature bitter debates and intense legal wrangling. Much of it is likely to unfold behind closed doors.</rdfs:comment>
