		<rdfs:label>article-c39bbc07-88a2-4528-94e1-dc128a0fe0f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The gunman, a maintenance worker at a transit agency in Silicon Valley, killed nine of his colleagues years after federal officials uncovered a notebook with his complaints.</rdfs:comment>
