		<rdfs:label>article-c39f4a0d-7e28-4820-b9ee-8924d9d5f8e2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The commander at the scene arrived without a police radio, and decided in the first minutes on an approach that would delay a confrontation.</rdfs:comment>
