	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3a23896-2d2f-4497-87e3-eede46279155">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3a23896-2d2f-4497-87e3-eede46279155</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Millions of dollars in stock trades by the freshman senator have drawn intense scrutiny for potential insider trading, and it could reshape a contested Senate race in Georgia.</rdfs:comment>
