		<rdfs:label>article-c3a3ccda-0768-4c1f-8d94-beec3a12e67e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Maurice Lester Hall, who fled Minneapolis after witnessing George Floyd’s death, was arrested Monday in Houston and interviewed by a Minnesota investigator.</rdfs:comment>
