	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3a5513f-2380-4f70-967e-143277625ca8">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3a5513f-2380-4f70-967e-143277625ca8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The top Democrat had signaled for weeks that she would take matters into her own hands after Republicans blocked an independent bipartisan commission to scrutinize the storming of the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
