		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3b27a71-c723-4777-819f-f00b17ac52d8">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3b27a71-c723-4777-819f-f00b17ac52d8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As bigots blame them for the coronavirus and President Trump labels it the “Chinese virus,” many Chinese-Americans say they are terrified of what could come next.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-48e200fd-02da-4ffc-8666-066f9561a258"/>
