	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3b68d3a-4571-4021-89f8-ae4f6c5695b8">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3b68d3a-4571-4021-89f8-ae4f6c5695b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration must balance maintaining pressure and letting humanitarian aid flow.</rdfs:comment>
