	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3b902ff-44d7-4ded-b7ef-ff975d67b721">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3b902ff-44d7-4ded-b7ef-ff975d67b721</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New revelations have left people wondering about ailments early this year. Doctors are thinking back to unexplained cases. Medical examiners are looking for possible misdiagnosed deaths.</rdfs:comment>
