	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3c71414-214e-4892-a827-b0b9745f0112">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3c71414-214e-4892-a827-b0b9745f0112</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Elections supervisors say the hard-earned lessons of the 2000 presidential recount and other messes have taught them well. But the challenges are already apparent.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c27717ae-a4a7-43e2-a892-7d5659d97cf6"/>
