	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3d3fa06-b9c5-4b47-a326-e650d1ce615a">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3d3fa06-b9c5-4b47-a326-e650d1ce615a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joseph R. Biden Jr. has spent his career devoted to institutions and relationships. And those are the tools he will rely on to govern a fractured nation.</rdfs:comment>
