		<rdfs:label>article-c3dcf608-a688-46e5-ac8b-e14f0ea5c15f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hotter and drier weather is likely to continue, with La Niña conditions forecast for the winter.</rdfs:comment>
