		<rdfs:label>article-c3e1639b-a23d-45d4-b3bf-30a0dcfc76a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Times investigation found that dozens of women and children were killed in the bombing, which the military sought to conceal.</rdfs:comment>
