	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3e1dc2f-489a-4c02-ba02-761401b5bc2c">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3e1dc2f-489a-4c02-ba02-761401b5bc2c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 2020 election is happening now. Millions have voted in person or by mail in the weeks leading up to Election Day.</rdfs:comment>
