	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c3e56e79-0911-4d97-9950-29e7949d452d">
		<rdfs:label>article-c3e56e79-0911-4d97-9950-29e7949d452d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some of the dust has settled, and a clearer picture is emerging of Tuesday’s surprising, sometimes nuanced results.</rdfs:comment>
