	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c43b6ce8-eb57-4dda-9624-94aea17f322d">
		<rdfs:label>article-c43b6ce8-eb57-4dda-9624-94aea17f322d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Central to the job is a willingness to say yes to the president no matter what he asks. Now, that means subjecting an agent’s health to the whims of a contagious president.</rdfs:comment>
