	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c43c7da1-3bbc-4b90-8b67-257471c3e991">
		<rdfs:label>article-c43c7da1-3bbc-4b90-8b67-257471c3e991</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If you missed the deadline to register to vote in the recall election, don’t worry. You can still register on Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
