	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c43cd123-6bd2-4e34-a78f-2ed6fca12fc4">
		<rdfs:label>article-c43cd123-6bd2-4e34-a78f-2ed6fca12fc4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The powerful and highly mobile weapons systems, which can fire guided rockets with a range of 40 miles, are desperately needed in the battle for eastern Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-524922c4-c335-4218-b145-d4752931be34"/>
