	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c452e93c-a4c2-4c6d-9757-9e9189f001a8">
		<rdfs:label>article-c452e93c-a4c2-4c6d-9757-9e9189f001a8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Monday: Catch up on news of the wildfires burning across California.</rdfs:comment>
