		<rdfs:label>article-c46ebef1-ed11-486d-9d33-3d082acf6966</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The five-year plan for America’s coastal waters, required by law, risks angering both the fossil fuel industry and environmentalists.</rdfs:comment>
