		<rdfs:label>article-c4722425-99a1-4ccb-8b77-18705c1e3ac6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A court in Texas issued a 14-day nationwide temporary restraining order sought by the state’s attorney general that would prevent carrying out the policy, which was issued within hours of the president’s inauguration.</rdfs:comment>
