		<rdfs:label>article-c48240ea-e8d5-466c-aaee-01ea00d4e1e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The toll on health care workers, many of whom are giving up their holiday to treat dangerously ill Covid patients, is severe.</rdfs:comment>
