		<rdfs:comment>Working through the outer bands of a tropical storm, rescue workers recovered the bodies of 10 more victims from the rubble of a crumpled condominium in Surfside, Fla., late Tuesday and early Wednesday, the most they have found in a 12-hour period since the building collapsed nearly two weeks ago.</rdfs:comment>
