		<rdfs:label>article-c49a638d-5951-4c68-aad8-8cad05fb73be</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The world’s largest economies will stop financing coal plants abroad, though that falls far short of what’s needed to fight climate change, raising fears of half-steps at this week’s U.N. summit.</rdfs:comment>
