	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c4b8a7c4-df78-4e22-9a95-09428dfaff98">
		<rdfs:label>article-c4b8a7c4-df78-4e22-9a95-09428dfaff98</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Honoring Pride Month at the White House on Friday, President Biden signed a law to designate the site of Pulse, a gay nightclub in Florida where a gunman killed 49 people and wounded dozens in 2016, as the National Pulse Memorial.</rdfs:comment>
