	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c4bbc700-cf1e-46da-b899-8eb0cb0b3b9a">
		<rdfs:label>article-c4bbc700-cf1e-46da-b899-8eb0cb0b3b9a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid the most unusual presidential election in decades, the Trump campaign is turning to a very familiar Republican line of attack in two new ads: that Joseph R. Biden Jr. will raise your taxes. One of the ads focuses on the story of a small business owner named Juliette.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-17"/>
