	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c4c73f42-81ae-45a9-b473-17f2f10b45a5">
		<rdfs:label>article-c4c73f42-81ae-45a9-b473-17f2f10b45a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He started one Saturday as the pandemic was raging. Then he just kept going, never mind Chicago’s winter.</rdfs:comment>
