	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c4c8975c-8f6b-400e-b807-44adad788099">
		<rdfs:label>article-c4c8975c-8f6b-400e-b807-44adad788099</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As they craft their disability rights plans, the 2020 candidates are consulting the people they would affect. “This is how policy should be made,” one advocate said.</rdfs:comment>
