	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c4c9dcf0-cd69-4782-adde-363d1603ad44">
		<rdfs:label>article-c4c9dcf0-cd69-4782-adde-363d1603ad44</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The competition for senior offices has strained valuable political alliances, vexing some of Joe Biden’s key supporters from the Democratic primary contest.</rdfs:comment>
