	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c4caa745-d7b7-49be-804c-db6aa2b898e4">
		<rdfs:label>article-c4caa745-d7b7-49be-804c-db6aa2b898e4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The filibuster of a sprawling bill on voter rights, corruption and campaign finance caps its journey from a Democratic statement to a larger struggle over the nation’s direction.</rdfs:comment>
