	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5272160-a0fe-4571-9d4c-f42f9521dcae">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5272160-a0fe-4571-9d4c-f42f9521dcae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>When Dr. Sean P. Conley delivered a briefing at Walter Reed National Military Medical Center on Saturday, it seemed intended less to inform the American public than to satisfy the public relations demands of a famous and famously demanding patient — President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
