		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5383d1b-9e57-411f-bcf6-e2bf56d7bdf8">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5383d1b-9e57-411f-bcf6-e2bf56d7bdf8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus has overwhelmed scores of volunteer emergency response units, many of which are the sole responders across America.</rdfs:comment>
