		<rdfs:label>article-c538d423-e4b6-4242-8a30-e19e04b6e439</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>They are also calling for Mr. Gonzalez to resign for being one of 10 Republican House members who voted to impeach Donald J. Trump after the Jan. 6 riot.</rdfs:comment>
