		<rdfs:label>article-c5c7ad96-01ef-4557-a65a-4b2515213ce5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s comments on Mr. Floyd, who died after a police officer knelt on his neck for nearly nine minutes, were immediately criticized by Joseph R. Biden Jr., his Democratic opponent.</rdfs:comment>
