	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5c7b5f8-4fc4-44f5-a3d5-2b9339a5c6ac">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5c7b5f8-4fc4-44f5-a3d5-2b9339a5c6ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Financial institutions have made big climate pledges. But they’ve also found reasons and ways to pass the buck, continuing to funnel money toward fossil fuels. Here’s why.</rdfs:comment>
