		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5c98673-cabd-41b2-9335-46011e5a93d7">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5c98673-cabd-41b2-9335-46011e5a93d7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In large cities and rural towns, the Omicron variant has workers calling in sick with Covid-19. But in the small towns, it is often hard to find a Plan B.</rdfs:comment>
