	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5cdb824-5099-4ac5-8af0-2bd8c4030607">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5cdb824-5099-4ac5-8af0-2bd8c4030607</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Residents of Russell, the town in Kansas where Mr. Dole grew up, spoke longingly of a bygone era of bipartisanship.</rdfs:comment>
