	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5d2c343-c481-4f74-a564-d6a4a1a80159">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5d2c343-c481-4f74-a564-d6a4a1a80159</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the waning minutes of his term, former President Donald J. Trump granted a pardon to Al Pirro, the ex-husband of Jeanine Pirro, his favorite Fox News host, an administration official said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2098993a-1d86-4c6d-b5b9-c15f8e12852e"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2c183a13-1898-4deb-ad56-cc02fd034eaf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9fcaaf17-51fe-4de9-aec7-f53a415e4396"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5d2ddf4-730f-4144-8c8c-5f3c2d660475">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5d2ddf4-730f-4144-8c8c-5f3c2d660475</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite the president’s opposition, states are increasingly reducing barriers to what many see as the safest way to vote amid the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
