	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c5d9e4c2-76d4-44be-ac93-9973c2f252c0">
		<rdfs:label>article-c5d9e4c2-76d4-44be-ac93-9973c2f252c0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration set efficiency standards that will phase out sales of incandescent bulbs in favor of LEDs, reducing Americans’ electrical bills over time.</rdfs:comment>
