		<rdfs:label>article-c7152f5f-709e-442b-a09d-dabb929541ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The announcement by the Saudi-led OPEC Plus energy cartel that it would slash oil production was widely seen in Washington as a stab in the back of President Biden.</rdfs:comment>
