	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c7179f31-fcf9-4bdb-817c-a5f47f0a89d0">
		<rdfs:label>article-c7179f31-fcf9-4bdb-817c-a5f47f0a89d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The war had to end. But it didn’t have to end in such chaos.</rdfs:comment>
