	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c718d42d-a87f-4538-8844-f4dd080204a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-c718d42d-a87f-4538-8844-f4dd080204a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hospitals across California have continued to fill rapidly to dangerous levels as state and local officials try to dampen the explosive spread of the coronavirus in the state, Gov. Gavin Newsom said on Monday.</rdfs:comment>
