		<rdfs:label>article-c719ff60-6f09-4f20-8f74-cef92b219176</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tuesday: “Let’s get rid of the notion of the sleeping giant.” Also: An update on California’s vaccine planning.</rdfs:comment>
