	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c71e10ac-6732-4f17-b582-080b4e5223d4">
		<rdfs:label>article-c71e10ac-6732-4f17-b582-080b4e5223d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many school cafeterias are now operating more like community soup kitchens, even though the federal school meals program won’t reimburse districts for meals served to struggling adults.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6367e10-71fa-497b-a76c-07166686c06a"/>
