		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c721588f-ca73-4621-85df-4839c91235c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-c721588f-ca73-4621-85df-4839c91235c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A ban on single-use plastic and paper bags in grocery stores had an unintended effect: Delivery services switched to heavy, reusable sacks — lots of them.</rdfs:comment>
