	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c72688f4-a312-4b24-9aef-3e0c90b912dc">
		<rdfs:label>article-c72688f4-a312-4b24-9aef-3e0c90b912dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With the Republican National Convention at the midway point, the biggest contrast with the Democrats has been in how little attention the Republicans have given to the coronavirus pandemic that has upended life across America and led to over 178,000 deaths.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5c7e1f74-a87d-4db2-a8c4-665fc5eb3d59"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-26"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c72ee7e9-ea81-4ffe-b9f6-c151cb49ff40">
		<rdfs:label>article-c72ee7e9-ea81-4ffe-b9f6-c151cb49ff40</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pinellas County sheriff’s office said it would station deputies at five early voting sites after two armed men dressed as security guards were seen outside a polling station.</rdfs:comment>
