		<rdfs:label>article-c7e45b76-ab7b-4dab-bb12-5c28dd9c44cb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House passed a budget blueprint to allow the president’s $1.9 trillion plan to speed through Congress without Republican backing. But President Biden said he was open to negotiating the details.</rdfs:comment>
