		<rdfs:comment>The meeting was the first since the basketball star’s appeal on a drug conviction in Russia was rejected.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5050e5dd-6640-49fd-84d4-ada7204d3f85"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b32f6625-044c-4b5c-a23c-681cb2a901f9"/>
