	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-c7f8bf55-cf62-4118-8c71-3af1d2e90119">
		<rdfs:label>article-c7f8bf55-cf62-4118-8c71-3af1d2e90119</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“I feel lighter,” said a woman in Chicago. For many in an exhausted, divided nation, the inauguration was a sea change, not just a transition.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6d7b9cf0-ac61-4722-8016-c030fa3458b0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-21"/>
