	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ca77c28d-418a-49c4-9737-ba77c0d85e5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-ca77c28d-418a-49c4-9737-ba77c0d85e5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Bobby White was celebrated as the “Basketball Cop” after millions saw a video of him shooting hoops with local teenagers. A recording from two years earlier shows him throwing a young Black man on the hood of his car during an arrest.</rdfs:comment>
