	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ca789f3f-7528-4b72-b14d-a317e74aeb0f">
		<rdfs:label>article-ca789f3f-7528-4b72-b14d-a317e74aeb0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In conversations over the past two weeks, allies say they have new concerns about the United States.</rdfs:comment>
