	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cac32246-05bc-45af-a8e6-0dede5d4ee8c">
		<rdfs:label>article-cac32246-05bc-45af-a8e6-0dede5d4ee8c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Both candidates are under heavy scrutiny — and without a Republican challenger, whoever prevails will take over the office.</rdfs:comment>
