		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cac70b87-da84-4870-9c9b-a9a425cc0baa">
		<rdfs:label>article-cac70b87-da84-4870-9c9b-a9a425cc0baa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With governors and mayors pressing for more federal help to deal with the effects of the pandemic, a divide among Republicans is being driven by the political bent of the states that stand to benefit.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-11"/>
