		<rdfs:label>article-cac82006-c8ff-4377-9868-7d0f9d18b96c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At events in Washington, Chicago, Boston and other cities on Sunday, demonstrators expressed their love for the country, anger at Vladimir Putin and hope for peace.</rdfs:comment>
