		<rdfs:label>article-cad06b72-db67-457f-a721-5ea2a1244351</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gillespie County, which President Donald J. Trump won by 59 percentage points in 2020, was left without an election staff. The state planned to help.</rdfs:comment>
