		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cb35cfc9-12af-40ef-aa6c-3af5f413559d">
		<rdfs:label>article-cb35cfc9-12af-40ef-aa6c-3af5f413559d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Right-wing extremist violence in the U.S. is part of a global phenomenon. It should be treated that way.</rdfs:comment>
