		<rdfs:label>article-cb35e585-2488-49d1-b35d-65e23303f3aa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s grants of clemency to convicted liars, corrupt congressmen and child-killing war criminals are a way to lash out at a system that he believes has treated him and his friends unfairly.</rdfs:comment>
