	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cb56bf18-b77c-4983-8896-225d7f8789b3">
		<rdfs:label>article-cb56bf18-b77c-4983-8896-225d7f8789b3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia declared on Tuesday that his nation had approved the world’s first coronavirus vaccine without extensive clinical trials, public health experts worried that President Trump would feel the need to compete.</rdfs:comment>
