	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cb5e48e0-b256-491e-8490-e5c20624cdbc">
		<rdfs:label>article-cb5e48e0-b256-491e-8490-e5c20624cdbc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The guidelines released by the president effectively mean that any restoration of American society will take place on a patchwork basis.</rdfs:comment>
