		<rdfs:label>article-cb93ea5c-c9e3-4053-ac64-a5c115103bd9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Eating at buffets, which now seems unthinkable because of the coronavirus, was more formative for me than any bourgeois sit-down restaurant could offer.</rdfs:comment>
