		<rdfs:label>article-cb99a8bd-efe1-49d4-abd3-58ab3726e99b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Rush Limbaugh told millions of radio listeners to set aside any suggestion that climate change was the culprit for the frightening spate of wildfires ravaging California and the Pacific Northwest.</rdfs:comment>
