		<rdfs:label>article-cb9aa6d4-db82-4e62-abbc-7a5d294cde2d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The document’s existence, once kept secret, was revealed just days ago, sending shock waves through the denomination.</rdfs:comment>
