	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cb9e39c1-3374-4ee8-9832-c700641b0a2f">
		<rdfs:label>article-cb9e39c1-3374-4ee8-9832-c700641b0a2f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Ketanji Brown Jackson became the president’s first appellate judge, Senator Mitch McConnell suggested he would block a Biden Supreme Court pick in 2024 if Republicans gained the majority.</rdfs:comment>
