		<rdfs:label>article-cba1dcb6-386d-4486-b7bc-f583a349065e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Christian Walker, the estranged son of Herschel Walker, had harsh words for his father and the Republican Party as Georgia’s Senate race was called.</rdfs:comment>
