		<rdfs:label>article-cbaac85c-40fa-4c63-bd67-ccd5c67d0212</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>American Crossroads is wading deeper into Republicans’ fight to keep the Senate with North Carolina ads, renewing partisanship questions at the Postal Service, where a PAC leader has a powerful post.</rdfs:comment>
