		<rdfs:label>article-cbad1ce9-01a2-4c51-88b2-e0dd47ceefc2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The force reeled as hundreds of officers were infected or quarantined, and an initial drop in crime suddenly reversed with a spate of shootings.</rdfs:comment>
