		<rdfs:label>article-cbafbc94-1b85-4617-8162-1c83ae604459</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Legislation that passed unanimously would end the practice of setting clocks back one hour in the fall. Its prospects were uncertain in the House.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a2860122-d5d8-4996-a4a4-bc29b03dbcd0"/>
