		<rdfs:label>article-cc2ff13d-2871-4dbb-9263-f2dc474810a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The change is expected to accelerate the momentum of American colleges away from the tests, amid concern that they are unfair to poor, black and Hispanic students.</rdfs:comment>
