		<rdfs:label>article-ccd141dd-488d-4129-a6ae-79c6783081d9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Glenn Youngkin, the Republican nominee for governor, is encouraging early voting despite catering to the Trump base that believes the former president’s election conspiracies.</rdfs:comment>
