		<rdfs:label>article-ccd1ac59-b4ef-48ba-ab04-70e5bda6aef0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Harrowing video of the chaos, recorded by the Afghan news media, has circulated around the world. The Air Force said the episode was under investigation.</rdfs:comment>
