	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cd0581be-7454-4e22-8c0c-e5e8d1f5c79e">
		<rdfs:label>article-cd0581be-7454-4e22-8c0c-e5e8d1f5c79e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president once asked his chief of staff why his military leadership couldn’t be more like the German generals who had reported to Adolf Hitler, according to an excerpt.</rdfs:comment>
