		<rdfs:label>article-cd46ef07-8c3a-42f2-a527-632496de032d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Air Force One landed at Palm Beach International Airport shortly before 11 a.m., bringing President Trump to his adopted home state for one last time as president. The tarmac was silent as the plane rolled down the runway, other than the occasional clicking of a camera and the roar of the engine.</rdfs:comment>
