		<rdfs:label>article-cdae4184-836e-4374-9a69-c598bc31986b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Covid-19 makes social distancing a matter of life and death, a growing number of lawmakers are pushing the idea of remote voting.</rdfs:comment>
