		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cdb0c234-e5d5-4c6c-9b1c-e6036dd3ed16">
		<rdfs:label>article-cdb0c234-e5d5-4c6c-9b1c-e6036dd3ed16</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With no vaccine or cure, the president, governors, mayors and county executives will have to decide how many deaths would be acceptable to restore a shattered economy.</rdfs:comment>
