		<rdfs:label>article-cdb6a01d-eb92-401b-82f1-43e4e2005f4c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Kentucky libertarian’s tactics failed, but not before forcing lawmakers back to the Capitol for passage of the $2 trillion coronavirus stimulus package, infuriating them and President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
