		<rdfs:label>article-cdc3b189-f2f1-41c3-8ed1-3213115e4dc5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Iran released a photograph showing evidence of what appeared to be a major explosion at the site. Early evidence suggests it was most likely an act of sabotage.</rdfs:comment>
