	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cdc9a2c7-18d3-403b-841d-ff8c01b8bb7e">
		<rdfs:label>article-cdc9a2c7-18d3-403b-841d-ff8c01b8bb7e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Brad Parscale, the former Trump campaign manager who was demoted in July, claimed in a Fox News interview on Tuesday night that President Trump would have handily won the election if he had expressed more empathy about the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c67a9047-7b94-4e45-aaa9-c820c2b967de"/>
