	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cdca88bf-dfa7-493c-8ad3-09afb38defb8">
		<rdfs:label>article-cdca88bf-dfa7-493c-8ad3-09afb38defb8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Filled with hate, the screed describes a mass shooting at a grocery store and connects it with a belief shared by gunmen in previous massacres.</rdfs:comment>
