	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ce66e02c-2cf1-4647-9d21-0811e8a113f4">
		<rdfs:label>article-ce66e02c-2cf1-4647-9d21-0811e8a113f4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and Joseph R. Biden Jr. will not be the only ones in the spotlight at their first debate on Tuesday night. Chris Wallace, the Fox News anchor who is moderating, will face intense scrutiny on how he handles the evening, particularly given Mr. Trump’s tendency to hurl false and baseless claims at his opponents.</rdfs:comment>
