		<rdfs:label>article-cee0ce5c-06d4-4af2-81d1-4d8f546f3914</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With Republicans poised to block Democrats’ top priorities, the party-line vote on the $1.9 trillion pandemic aid package showed the gulf between the parties was too wide to be bridged.</rdfs:comment>
