		<rdfs:label>article-cee146e2-2cf8-4849-90d3-f5bcd59e21f8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Arizona, Texas and Florida are reporting their highest case numbers yet. As of Saturday, coronavirus cases were climbing in 22 states amid reopenings.</rdfs:comment>
