		<rdfs:label>article-ceec436f-66bd-4a2c-ad00-c47b7f58e23e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A Black superintendent’s email to parents after the killing of George Floyd engulfed a small, predominantly white Maryland community in a yearlong firestorm.</rdfs:comment>
