	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ceec969d-4eca-436a-ae62-895facf9dc71">
		<rdfs:label>article-ceec969d-4eca-436a-ae62-895facf9dc71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Interviews show Dr. Mehmet Oz struggling in the G.O.P. Senate primary, despite a Trump endorsement. Voters remain devoted to Donald Trump but seem less swayed by his guidance.</rdfs:comment>
