		<rdfs:label>article-ceecffde-4d8f-4276-8659-ac03c57d252d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Chuck Schumer, the majority leader, is among 100 Democrats seeking a review of how Black migrants are treated by the immigration enforcement system.</rdfs:comment>
