	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cef02fc1-fba1-41d4-a059-c04546cbf773">
		<rdfs:label>article-cef02fc1-fba1-41d4-a059-c04546cbf773</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Not long after Senator Mitch McConnell warned his Republican colleagues that their efforts to overturn an election would send democracy into a “death spiral,” fear surged through the Senate chamber.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
