	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cef48f5f-edba-4c2e-bb68-5275ea5153c2">
		<rdfs:label>article-cef48f5f-edba-4c2e-bb68-5275ea5153c2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The incoming Biden administration has yet to lay out plans for the Guantánamo Bay military prison on the U.S. Navy base where leftover fragments of the Bush administration’s most disputed responses to the Sept. 11, 2001, attacks remain unresolved three presidencies later.</rdfs:comment>
