		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-cef54747-8592-4d87-8bdd-43df0bd66587">
		<rdfs:label>article-cef54747-8592-4d87-8bdd-43df0bd66587</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Bottoms, who was mentioned briefly as a potential running mate for President Biden, is the latest mayor to move on after a year of pandemic challenges and racial justice protests.</rdfs:comment>
