		<rdfs:label>article-cef5bdd4-dea4-4fef-8ad9-e9804b8fdefe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The vice president discussed a $20 billion investment the administration is proposing to convert the country’s entire fleet of gasoline and diesel-powered school buses to electric vehicles.</rdfs:comment>
