		<rdfs:label>article-cf0006ae-220e-4e76-a58a-624c62c6c238</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Michael Bloomberg has sworn off taking money from other people for his presidential campaign. But in private, he is courting rich Democrats, potentially posing a challenge for his moderate rivals.</rdfs:comment>
