		<rdfs:label>article-cf00f347-267f-4e76-a5f0-070cfcc6d08f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former Army colonel, who worked on the National Security Council, said in a lawsuit that Donald Trump Jr. and others carried out a campaign of intimidation against him.</rdfs:comment>
