		<rdfs:label>article-cf0a8c98-f670-467d-bb71-deffaeab423b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Prosecutors said Joly Germine directed the kidnapping operations of the 400 Mawozo gang, including the negotiations for the release of volunteers with Christian Aid Ministries.</rdfs:comment>
