	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d13da821-667e-437c-81c8-f5e8f603ab0d">
		<rdfs:label>article-d13da821-667e-437c-81c8-f5e8f603ab0d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The relationship between President Trump’s words and their consequences has always been fairly straightforward: He says what he wants, and nothing particularly durable tends to happen to him.</rdfs:comment>
