	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d13db8a6-dddc-47be-b5c1-7f3be2fa053d">
		<rdfs:label>article-d13db8a6-dddc-47be-b5c1-7f3be2fa053d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Liberal and moderate wings of the House Democratic caucus remain at odds over whether that measure should pass without work finished on the sweeping, $3.5 trillion economic package.</rdfs:comment>
