		<rdfs:label>article-d1404bad-fb50-4176-b812-b02ad95393a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s executive order granting local officials veto power over refugee resettlement has divided communities and left immigrants feeling unwanted.</rdfs:comment>
