		<rdfs:label>article-d1580129-cd2c-4db5-bb1b-025cdb705127</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Infowars broadcaster has been ordered by courts to pay about $1.5 billion in damages to Sandy Hook families hurt by his promotion of conspiracy theories.</rdfs:comment>
