	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d163ecee-5b59-4354-9e42-f6de1b9df3af">
		<rdfs:label>article-d163ecee-5b59-4354-9e42-f6de1b9df3af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Protesters have been in the streets for more than 50 consecutive days. Federal agents deployed to Portland have hardened their resolve to stay there.</rdfs:comment>
