		<rdfs:label>article-d176ea65-2e6a-4d44-9996-9343b96baf36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The attorney general, speaking at a religious broadcasters convention, said Christian news organizations were a vital check on a mainstream press that had become too powerful.</rdfs:comment>
