		<rdfs:label>article-d17f4f2e-b1af-41ea-9175-c03807ec8f5e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Migrant children are crossing the southwestern border by the thousands each week. They are often rejoining parents who immigrated to the United States years ago.</rdfs:comment>
