	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d19f036d-7ab5-4d0e-ac9b-9130374e182e">
		<rdfs:label>article-d19f036d-7ab5-4d0e-ac9b-9130374e182e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Political campaigns were reluctant to focus too heavily on the coronavirus outbreak. What changed?</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d19fc622-bcd2-474a-8d72-88d05f290627">
		<rdfs:label>article-d19fc622-bcd2-474a-8d72-88d05f290627</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The risks of reopening the country too soon will be a focus of government hearings on Tuesday. The White House’s new mask requirement won’t apply to President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d1a548e9-784f-48bd-8a82-964bd15ea167">
		<rdfs:label>article-d1a548e9-784f-48bd-8a82-964bd15ea167</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The city’s 91-year succession of Irish American and Italian American mayors has ended, with Michelle Wu and Annissa Essaibi George facing off in November.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-91caa243-6ff4-4c6d-affc-51bd8da8617d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d1b04500-49f9-4475-8a7e-45c867f1cbc1">
		<rdfs:label>article-d1b04500-49f9-4475-8a7e-45c867f1cbc1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He says that they are a security threat. If so, it is time to show the world the evidence.</rdfs:comment>
