	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d1b0655c-2029-4135-90cc-a8c98eb66043">
		<rdfs:label>article-d1b0655c-2029-4135-90cc-a8c98eb66043</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson’s replacement of Justice Stephen G. Breyer substitutes a liberal for a liberal and would not shift the basic dynamic of the court.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-947ed571-ad87-49fb-b59a-9372d166d3c7"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-02-25"/>
