		<rdfs:label>article-d202633c-d59c-4afb-86bc-f96beefaffb8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>From the campaign trail in Georgia to Capitol Hill, President Trump’s demand for changes to the $900 billion pandemic relief plan upended political and economic calculations.</rdfs:comment>
