		<rdfs:label>article-d2040e06-3374-45dd-b210-e1717638c7ba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some die-hard Democratic delegates long for an in-person event. “It feels so lonesome when you don’t have all the crowds,” said an 89-year-old convention veteran.</rdfs:comment>
