	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2079911-196e-4bc5-b1a4-86235e2df539">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2079911-196e-4bc5-b1a4-86235e2df539</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>No fatalities were reported in the city of Andover, near Wichita, but up to 1,000 structures may have been affected, officials said.</rdfs:comment>
