	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d22f4fe7-6931-4693-8cc8-8a9d51018ebf">
		<rdfs:label>article-d22f4fe7-6931-4693-8cc8-8a9d51018ebf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Texas Board of Pardons and Paroles said it had made “procedural errors” when it issued a recommendation that Mr. Floyd be posthumously pardoned for a 2004 drug conviction.</rdfs:comment>
