	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d22f87b0-f916-4198-a622-c8db6c01773f">
		<rdfs:label>article-d22f87b0-f916-4198-a622-c8db6c01773f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New accounts show that the former president was more directly involved than previously known in plans developed by outside advisers to use national security agencies to seek evidence of fraud.</rdfs:comment>
