	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d23431c0-dcdd-435d-8086-1448dcd05bba">
		<rdfs:label>article-d23431c0-dcdd-435d-8086-1448dcd05bba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court justice’s suggestion that ballots arriving after Election Day could “flip the results” left voting rights activists concerned about how the court might rule in postelection fights.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-982bde63-8146-432c-a09a-c9cac220ddaa"/>
