	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2751da3-5eec-4d8c-a2e0-f33c21a32c39">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2751da3-5eec-4d8c-a2e0-f33c21a32c39</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>So far, many financial institutions have avoided decisive measures. But the pressure from activist shareholders isn’t going away.</rdfs:comment>
