	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d27685f6-8dbf-4ffa-90b2-c5735a778044">
		<rdfs:label>article-d27685f6-8dbf-4ffa-90b2-c5735a778044</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The trial starts in earnest with a contentious debate over its rules. Oral arguments commence later this week.</rdfs:comment>
