	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2780bd4-bf0e-408d-a5f3-98975615b2a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2780bd4-bf0e-408d-a5f3-98975615b2a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A video from Senator Johnson, who has amplified unfounded claims of voter fraud, instructs poll workers in how to spot “disqualifying issues” with absentee ballots.</rdfs:comment>
