	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2794aac-f9b6-48eb-b041-16340dd89e5c">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2794aac-f9b6-48eb-b041-16340dd89e5c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A right-wing Senate candidate accompanies a squad of heavily armed men as they storm a home looking for ‘Republicans in name only.’</rdfs:comment>
