	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2d3b621-e51f-4be8-8227-9348dcb46b2c">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2d3b621-e51f-4be8-8227-9348dcb46b2c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The prisoner, Adree Edmo, said Idaho’s failure to provide the procedure violated the Eighth Amendment’s ban on cruel and unusual punishment.</rdfs:comment>
