	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2da6e21-9f98-4731-bb9d-30b4a96e9a05">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2da6e21-9f98-4731-bb9d-30b4a96e9a05</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The $375 million sale of a Washington hotel that served as an influence and access bazaar for lawmakers, administration officials and other Trump allies is slated to be finalized this month.</rdfs:comment>
