	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2db0dbd-4c0e-4ada-8df3-a81b6e860786">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2db0dbd-4c0e-4ada-8df3-a81b6e860786</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tony Gonzales, a former Navy cryptologist, beat back a second attempt by Gina Ortiz Jones to flip the last remaining Republican district on the southern border.</rdfs:comment>
