	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2db5c50-04be-4d10-a7ca-9948d6eeead9">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2db5c50-04be-4d10-a7ca-9948d6eeead9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the Interior Department awaits its new secretary, the agency is already moving to lock in key parts of President Biden’s environmental agenda, particularly on oil and gas restrictions, laying the groundwork to fulfill some of the administration’s most consequential promises to address climate change.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b1afb246-66b2-4eea-8ebc-1b5c7f6c7900"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2dc8ca0-03b5-4d88-a52d-4998310294b6">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2dc8ca0-03b5-4d88-a52d-4998310294b6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a late Friday ruling, the state’s highest court said that a ban could begin at the end of the month while legal challenges are reviewed.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1e99dcff-b565-458e-b08f-ae5cce9b25f2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-13"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d2de267b-c68c-494f-b181-cdbedc6e5a66">
		<rdfs:label>article-d2de267b-c68c-494f-b181-cdbedc6e5a66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Because of staff shortages, some school districts are canceling classes. Others are lowering their hiring standards. The result can be a chaotic classroom.</rdfs:comment>
