	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3b476b2-2d0b-4713-b588-bcd868e7e116">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3b476b2-2d0b-4713-b588-bcd868e7e116</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Florida, the perennially competitive state where President Trump is campaigning Friday, is one of the states hardest hit by the coronavirus. The Villages, the sprawling retirement community in Central Florida where he held his first rally,  was not spared.</rdfs:comment>
