		<rdfs:label>article-d3bb704d-7b0f-42b9-afa7-9133c1231d37</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Around the world, lawmakers and entrepreneurs are taking steps to tackle two of humanity’s most pressing problems: hunger and climate change.</rdfs:comment>
