	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3c972f8-0ab9-4f43-8a30-d77a13872e9c">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3c972f8-0ab9-4f43-8a30-d77a13872e9c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The deluge of rain has shut down a park entrance that is a lifeline for neighboring tourist communities. “Seventy-five percent of my business has been cut off at the knees,” one shop owner said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f997038e-ad5c-4458-8646-472e6c5ad2d2"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-16"/>
