	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3c9970f-0216-46a0-b972-76542f49eb85">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3c9970f-0216-46a0-b972-76542f49eb85</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The nation’s schools need thousands of more teachers, full-time and substitute, to keep classrooms open during coronavirus outbreaks.</rdfs:comment>
