		<rdfs:label>article-d3ce47ef-5a4f-4949-bbc3-7e730befee7e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One man will be eligible for parole after 30 years. The three face a federal trial on hate crime charges next month.</rdfs:comment>
