	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3d22a0e-5e0f-496b-aae4-4b5c1beda039">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3d22a0e-5e0f-496b-aae4-4b5c1beda039</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The high-stakes Senate contests come after months of tumult and activism in a city often seen as both resolutely Southern and somehow distinct from the rest of the region.</rdfs:comment>
