	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3d6e53a-1030-469f-be6d-299352e82a2b">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3d6e53a-1030-469f-be6d-299352e82a2b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump and his party are using a playbook that aims to alarm people about crime in their backyards. It didn’t work in 2018, but both parties think it could resonate more this year.</rdfs:comment>
