		<rdfs:label>article-d3e81cd9-ffb3-4ae9-94aa-733c7d178a3e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Biden said Justice Department prosecutors in Delaware had said they were examining his “tax affairs.”</rdfs:comment>
