		<rdfs:label>article-d3ee047c-7442-4a73-96e6-ada7102bb3c8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The State Legislature, controlled by Democrats, voted to put a constitutional amendment on the November ballot that would let an independent commission draw district maps.</rdfs:comment>
