	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3f519d5-fdbe-4583-8edd-5e2f31ede111">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3f519d5-fdbe-4583-8edd-5e2f31ede111</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a race in which neither candidate seems to want voters to know whether they are the Republican or the Democrat, polls show a tighter contest than liberals had expected.</rdfs:comment>
