	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3f84dfd-b91a-4de9-87d7-466857eafcaa">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3f84dfd-b91a-4de9-87d7-466857eafcaa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Comrades repeatedly told the Army that Capt. Paris Davis, one of the first Black officers in the Special Forces, deserved the Medal of Honor. The Army kept losing the paperwork.</rdfs:comment>
