	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3f8b144-29ad-460b-b9bc-2e3231d5d582">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3f8b144-29ad-460b-b9bc-2e3231d5d582</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Polls show Senator Marco Rubio of Florida with a lead in his race against Representative Val Demings, who has raised more money than the incumbent.</rdfs:comment>
