	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d3fb7d5b-c56e-48f7-97b0-c2c140dcbe35">
		<rdfs:label>article-d3fb7d5b-c56e-48f7-97b0-c2c140dcbe35</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The suggestion that states need to do more seemed to startle state and local officials, who said in interviews that they are generally satisfied with the federal government’s response.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e4ac7a5-be1a-4937-b91e-66276e5f8dd9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
