	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d401522f-8575-462c-aa96-c40331850f47">
		<rdfs:label>article-d401522f-8575-462c-aa96-c40331850f47</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The memorial in Washington, D.C., pays tribute to the general who led the Allies to victory in Europe during World War II and the president who sought peace after it was over.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-922ad7b9-e6de-456a-9bc2-69207748d175"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-13"/>
