	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d4016c3a-1979-46f8-83dc-b79c14a3409b">
		<rdfs:label>article-d4016c3a-1979-46f8-83dc-b79c14a3409b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge barred the Trump administration on Friday from ending the 2020 census a month early, the latest twist in years of political and legal warfare over perhaps the most contested population count in a century.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-be4a3e54-4b34-4f4b-b446-90f3692a587d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d4066385-23cd-4368-8a8f-16812b31dad3">
		<rdfs:label>article-d4066385-23cd-4368-8a8f-16812b31dad3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The combination of the war in Ukraine and concern about longer-term threats from Russia and China is driving a bipartisan push to increase U.S. capacity to produce weapons.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-12-18"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d40dc880-2721-4e11-a877-c4012bc92133">
		<rdfs:label>article-d40dc880-2721-4e11-a877-c4012bc92133</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than a dozen states have implemented legislation that would outlaw or severely restrict abortions, on the assumption that the Supreme Court will overturn Roe v. Wade this summer.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ccf12c09-bb92-47bc-afe9-b31ea5914e31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-04"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d40e29b0-ef45-4dad-9ff8-d6e5add80bf7">
		<rdfs:label>article-d40e29b0-ef45-4dad-9ff8-d6e5add80bf7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump on Tuesday night falsely claimed that “we were short on ventilators because the cupboards were bare when we took it over.” The Strategic National Stockpile, the government’s repository of medicines and medicinal products, contained more than $7 billion worth of supplies when Mr. Trump took office, including more than 16,000 ventilators.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-be4afe5b-5317-4441-a7de-57071d96016d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d40e60f3-4184-4d48-9eb6-5a84785c62ac">
		<rdfs:label>article-d40e60f3-4184-4d48-9eb6-5a84785c62ac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bay, home to a key sockeye salmon fishery, sits atop a massive gold and copper deposit, pitting environmentalists against mining companies.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b1afb246-66b2-4eea-8ebc-1b5c7f6c7900"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d40ff47a-2486-4308-a1f1-367e3a875dbf">
		<rdfs:label>article-d40ff47a-2486-4308-a1f1-367e3a875dbf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nearly 22 percent of children in the United States had an unemployed parent in April, the highest rate on record, according to Zachary Parolin, a researcher at Columbia University.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9e94ebbb-365e-41ef-9a76-b300ca95c3d1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-01"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d415274a-42d7-416e-b9ca-46b377724e77">
		<rdfs:label>article-d415274a-42d7-416e-b9ca-46b377724e77</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawyers for Bijan Kian argue that prosecutors should drop their appeal of his acquittal because it was intertwined with the case of the former national security adviser.</rdfs:comment>
