	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d485d45e-87f9-4c40-b780-dacff3e0c671">
		<rdfs:label>article-d485d45e-87f9-4c40-b780-dacff3e0c671</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Engineers say most dams in the United States, designed decades ago, are unsuited to a warmer world and stronger storms.</rdfs:comment>
