	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d4e3ae12-ffad-4744-8cfe-bbd1e3921550">
		<rdfs:label>article-d4e3ae12-ffad-4744-8cfe-bbd1e3921550</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mayor Eric Garcetti could vacate his post months before the election to pick his replacement. Who would lead the city in the interim?</rdfs:comment>
