		<rdfs:label>article-d5163e18-8783-4739-bf21-c8969e093295</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In nonbinding elections, parts of eastern Oregon said they wanted to join Idaho. The conservative region has long felt alienated from the liberal politics of Oregon’s population centers.</rdfs:comment>
