		<rdfs:label>article-d5253b22-c425-4c4f-a221-2f94ff79394b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Defense Department inspector general will examine whether elite U.S. commando forces are doing enough to comply with the laws of armed conflict and hold violators accountable.</rdfs:comment>
