	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d52708fe-cf68-4565-830d-bf0de3f82cd3">
		<rdfs:label>article-d52708fe-cf68-4565-830d-bf0de3f82cd3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has doled out pardons to friends and fellow Republicans. Thousands of others without connections have largely been left out.</rdfs:comment>
