		<rdfs:label>article-d52a6124-dfe5-4aba-acd5-ca26b73a9a24</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The plaintiffs never cited any specific evidence that the results from voting machines used in Antrim County had been hacked or were fraudulent.</rdfs:comment>
