	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d52de8ac-3a76-4778-8435-0c6da9bc1276">
		<rdfs:label>article-d52de8ac-3a76-4778-8435-0c6da9bc1276</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The pastor at the Ebenezer Baptist Church in Atlanta, where Martin Luther King Jr. once preached, is betting that Georgia is ready to send a religious progressive to Washington.</rdfs:comment>
