	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d5309523-f366-4682-81f5-281ed7d158d3">
		<rdfs:label>article-d5309523-f366-4682-81f5-281ed7d158d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Daily briefings during the crisis in New York have given Gov. Andrew Cuomo a captive audience, and a growing fan base. But he has made it clear that he’s not going anywhere.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f33dc887-a9a6-4b4f-adce-fc81b6f27a0c"/>
