		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d538f842-19da-45a1-9aa6-b9711292aa0a">
		<rdfs:label>article-d538f842-19da-45a1-9aa6-b9711292aa0a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For Democrats, who rely on Black voters to power their electoral advantages in America’s urban centers, the difference between good and great Black voter turnout is often a question of Black men.</rdfs:comment>
