	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d53b9c46-c785-4f14-920f-2cdfebb02175">
		<rdfs:label>article-d53b9c46-c785-4f14-920f-2cdfebb02175</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the rearview mirror, the victories of a trailblazing feminist. On the road ahead, the threat of an entrenched and powerful minority.</rdfs:comment>
