		<rdfs:label>article-d53f70bd-1b88-40ff-8618-251b1c69c56c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After months of pandemic-related disruptions to President Biden’s diplomatic calendar, the White House is set to welcome the French president in December.</rdfs:comment>
