		<rdfs:label>article-d5468d2b-7367-48e9-b939-f6a53132cab1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Senate majority leader has encouraged judges thinking about stepping down to do so soon to ensure that Republicans confirm their replacements this year.</rdfs:comment>
