	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d54741e0-f7a4-478b-bfb1-101663e1d98b">
		<rdfs:label>article-d54741e0-f7a4-478b-bfb1-101663e1d98b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. government needs a coordinated response to the coronavirus on par with its response to the 2008 financial crisis.</rdfs:comment>
