	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d5478043-baf7-4cd9-a076-ecc81aefdb31">
		<rdfs:label>article-d5478043-baf7-4cd9-a076-ecc81aefdb31</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans are battling to hold off losses by warning of the risks of unified Democratic power in Washington, but they concede their majority is in peril.</rdfs:comment>
