	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d5a3d855-40db-4449-894f-feef05e89969">
		<rdfs:label>article-d5a3d855-40db-4449-894f-feef05e89969</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Federal law enforcement officials’ use of a warrant does not indicate guilt, but it does indicate a sense of prosecutorial urgency.</rdfs:comment>
