	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d5a58613-913d-4467-b773-12361b2c4375">
		<rdfs:label>article-d5a58613-913d-4467-b773-12361b2c4375</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Her chief of staff will be Tina Flournoy, who had the same job with President Bill Clinton after he left office.</rdfs:comment>
