		<rdfs:label>article-d627dc1a-e69c-433a-97a1-441b0935b380</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The strict new controls on events in the Northwest are an attempt to slow the spread of a virus that already has taken 24 lives in Washington State.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-becd702f-c674-4653-9a6c-90ee51977e85"/>
