		<rdfs:label>article-d6299d79-583e-4151-960a-668c41075144</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>DNA-based techniques that have successfully tracked down elusive serial killers may soon be used to help identify thousands of American service members “known but to God.”</rdfs:comment>
