	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d62a78ae-f7d3-42f3-ad01-78d758e44538">
		<rdfs:label>article-d62a78ae-f7d3-42f3-ad01-78d758e44538</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The appointment of an independent investigator is meant to address the perception of conflict of interest. But the system no longer seems adequate in this polarized political moment.</rdfs:comment>
