	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d62c946c-db8f-4a47-aae7-7ef4e0d18210">
		<rdfs:label>article-d62c946c-db8f-4a47-aae7-7ef4e0d18210</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the Trump White House’s undisguised hostility toward reporters, President Biden’s press secretary promised to “share the truth, even when it’s hard to hear.”</rdfs:comment>
