		<rdfs:label>article-d630b64d-9e07-4af7-87e2-240e29ddad11</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Need a little assistance? Eric Kim has seven recipes and an invaluable guide to get you through the meal.</rdfs:comment>
