		<rdfs:label>article-d633bbfa-5a39-4c10-8c81-391e921c5516</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Zalmay Khalilzad, who stepped down as the envoy for Afghanistan after the U.S. exit, has defended the deal he negotiated with the Taliban during the Trump administration.</rdfs:comment>
