	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d633f3c5-0dd0-43a4-8479-f37f014afad2">
		<rdfs:label>article-d633f3c5-0dd0-43a4-8479-f37f014afad2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Lincoln Heights community endured for decades, despite segregation, economic hardship and a pandemic. Then came the Mill fire.</rdfs:comment>
