	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d6360f75-ecf0-494c-ab4b-1cea833b603d">
		<rdfs:label>article-d6360f75-ecf0-494c-ab4b-1cea833b603d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He read off dozens of prominent names from Wall Street, Silicon Valley and the sports world. At least one person on the list was surprised to be on it.</rdfs:comment>
