		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d63e2e64-bace-4dd1-bf81-42708a6474ed">
		<rdfs:label>article-d63e2e64-bace-4dd1-bf81-42708a6474ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Booker’s endorsement of Mr. Biden came one day after Kamala Harris’s, and a day before primary elections in Michigan, Washington State and elsewhere.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d640095a-22dd-40db-9332-f663f24e2510">
		<rdfs:label>article-d640095a-22dd-40db-9332-f663f24e2510</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Reopening requires cash, safety renovations and parental confidence — all of which are in short supply.</rdfs:comment>
