	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d6401ca6-2c58-453a-a6d6-ed5f47229a57">
		<rdfs:label>article-d6401ca6-2c58-453a-a6d6-ed5f47229a57</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Authorities charged 13 men, some of whom were accused of plotting to storm the State Capitol building and planning to start a civil war.</rdfs:comment>
