	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d64844f5-d29a-40ab-a7ba-e299b55a6bba">
		<rdfs:label>article-d64844f5-d29a-40ab-a7ba-e299b55a6bba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The police said officers shot and killed Breonna Taylor, 26, in a March raid after her boyfriend shot an officer in the leg.</rdfs:comment>
