	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d64f4e60-7eac-4cf8-845b-e3d9d77cf70f">
		<rdfs:label>article-d64f4e60-7eac-4cf8-845b-e3d9d77cf70f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Researchers in Antarctica found unusually warm water beneath a massive glacier that is already melting and contributing to sea level rise. </rdfs:comment>
