		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-01-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d654f9d3-0818-4964-be12-98ea380b0949">
		<rdfs:label>article-d654f9d3-0818-4964-be12-98ea380b0949</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Number One Observatory Circle is finally ready for its newest resident. After months spent living in temporary quarters at Blair House, Vice President Kamala Harris moved into her 33-room official residence on Tuesday evening following the completion of renovations, an administration official said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dd42dd7e-7a0d-4a74-908e-252de023edfb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d6559966-febd-407c-8c6e-135f776f3f0f">
		<rdfs:label>article-d6559966-febd-407c-8c6e-135f776f3f0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For the past three weeks, the Trump campaign has been spending tens of millions of dollars on ads depicting a protest movement out of control, both to stoke fear among his base and rationalize his deployment decisions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-93d154d3-6d3d-4599-ac55-e63a146d8d6f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-21"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d65886c0-deb4-400d-b750-ce5b00b7360e">
		<rdfs:label>article-d65886c0-deb4-400d-b750-ce5b00b7360e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“The way we’ve been able to MacGyver a career as a woman is completely under attack by a global pandemic.”</rdfs:comment>
