		<rdfs:label>article-d6911801-93ac-48c1-addf-2d749800f2fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Speaker Nancy Pelosi is on track to keep her post, but with a slim majority that leaves little room for defections, party divisions could prove disastrous. Republicans can’t wait to exploit them.</rdfs:comment>
