		<rdfs:label>article-d6a1d6d3-dbcb-4d39-a38c-e72610e7093b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Pak has said he resigned rather than be fired by Trump for failing to find evidence of fraud.</rdfs:comment>
