		<rdfs:label>article-d6a3c395-ca6a-4d5a-ae83-6f91ca5dd8af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Climate change, a central part of Biden’s agenda, was barely mentioned in the State of the Union. And Europe is confronting its heavy reliance on Russian gas.</rdfs:comment>
