		<rdfs:label>article-d6afc89a-ffd1-4b25-a9b6-c5bb79b14298</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former President Donald J. Trump’s son-in-law is trying to raise capital for his investment firm and is turning to a region that he dealt with extensively while in the White House.</rdfs:comment>
