	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d6fc3318-0cf6-4588-82eb-ffb715542a1b">
		<rdfs:label>article-d6fc3318-0cf6-4588-82eb-ffb715542a1b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House voted on Tuesday night to formally call on Vice President Mike Pence to use the 25th Amendment to strip President Trump of his powers after he incited a mob that attacked the Capitol, as lawmakers warned they would impeach the president on Wednesday if Mr. Pence did not comply.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-12"/>
