	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d70042d3-d864-4792-816a-d9a55b7a2351">
		<rdfs:label>article-d70042d3-d864-4792-816a-d9a55b7a2351</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a reversal, a court said Floridians who had completed sentences for felonies must pay fines and fees before voting. The State Constitution was amended in 2018 to restore their rights.</rdfs:comment>
