	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d712ee8d-7d93-447e-b67f-54d14fc5065d">
		<rdfs:label>article-d712ee8d-7d93-447e-b67f-54d14fc5065d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A bill being drafted in the Senate would allow U.S. courts to try war crimes cases even if neither the perpetrators nor the victims are American.</rdfs:comment>
