		<rdfs:label>article-d7141636-780f-4d38-9586-a343dc231959</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The trade negotiator Robert E. Lighthizer defended the aggressive use of tariffs and said Europe could face levies if it did not agree to better trade terms.</rdfs:comment>
