	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d71d0c9f-0c40-4483-90e2-b50ac5f35c63">
		<rdfs:label>article-d71d0c9f-0c40-4483-90e2-b50ac5f35c63</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Her comments about Michael Bloomberg, who has faced criticism over a statement he made 12 years ago about a discriminatory housing practice, came as she tries to reignite enthusiasm for her campaign.</rdfs:comment>
