	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d72c513f-195c-467f-ac0b-76e8a266b402">
		<rdfs:label>article-d72c513f-195c-467f-ac0b-76e8a266b402</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The law has drawn criticism from the White House, Disney employees and Hollywood. The governor has dismissed opponents as “woke.”</rdfs:comment>
