	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d72d200b-67d3-4dc0-af5f-90ce703b6e82">
		<rdfs:label>article-d72d200b-67d3-4dc0-af5f-90ce703b6e82</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Judiciary Committee is poised to consider the nomination of a McConnell protégé to an influential appeals court, while Democrats say the focus should be on the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
