		<rdfs:label>article-d752f72e-4300-4a12-b45f-b06a3b9aa4a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the Idaho resort area of Sun Valley, there are so few housing options that many workers are resorting to garages, campers and tents.</rdfs:comment>
