	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d756cda0-e65d-4369-8249-fcaaa02ce1e8">
		<rdfs:label>article-d756cda0-e65d-4369-8249-fcaaa02ce1e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For many mothers newly burdened by Covid-19, resentment lingers that the government hasn’t helped more, and sooner. Both political parties are now trying to court them.</rdfs:comment>
