		<rdfs:label>article-d7572e71-e1e8-4bc7-aaef-ffd4fa7d2f73</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The suit, filed directly in the Supreme Court, sought to bar Georgia, Michigan, Pennsylvania and Wisconsin from casting their electoral votes for Joseph R. Biden Jr.</rdfs:comment>
