		<rdfs:label>article-d760041d-b8e5-43e9-933d-bc97690f36d5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The gulf between what Democrats in Washington are pointing to as the stakes of this year’s election and what candidates are actually doing with their money is particularly striking.</rdfs:comment>
