		<rdfs:label>article-d7627dda-259e-4c3a-bb3c-0762fea7da82</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>They are untraceable, assembled from parts and can be ordered by gang members, felons and even children. They are increasingly the lethal weapon of easy access around the U.S., but especially California.</rdfs:comment>
