	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d78547ab-a692-46b0-a287-080f8b516707">
		<rdfs:label>article-d78547ab-a692-46b0-a287-080f8b516707</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Despite immense interest in November’s elections, new-voter registrations have plummeted this year, thanks to a pandemic that has shut down motor-vehicle licensing offices and get-out-the-vote drives by advocacy groups at places like malls and street festivals.</rdfs:comment>
