		<rdfs:label>article-d7857b43-834b-4a7d-b806-5097071772a3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amid a pandemic and a recall, Mr. Schwarzenegger has been in demand at his Los Angeles mansion, embracing his unlikely role as California’s “elderly statesman.”</rdfs:comment>
