		<rdfs:comment>BATON ROUGE, La. — After a powerful storm blows through Baton Rouge, the emergency room at Our Lady of the Lake Regional Medical Center generally fills with patients suffering from burns and injuries from falls and power tool accidents.</rdfs:comment>
