		<rdfs:label>article-d7c09b86-9459-4561-9759-136d784447c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Dodd-Frank financial law succeeded at making banks safer, but empowered shadowy corners of finance that nearly wrecked the system in March.</rdfs:comment>
