	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d7c24b75-a2f2-4c87-a129-b8d9eeeeb6bf">
		<rdfs:label>article-d7c24b75-a2f2-4c87-a129-b8d9eeeeb6bf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The C.D.C. now recommends that all adults get a booster. But only one in six Americans has received that shot, worrying health officials.</rdfs:comment>
