	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d7c31635-0b01-49d1-a392-144b0a530ddd">
		<rdfs:label>article-d7c31635-0b01-49d1-a392-144b0a530ddd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Battered by a health crisis and boiling over with fury about racial injustice, many voters are mourning the past, worried about the present and fearful of what comes next.</rdfs:comment>
