		<rdfs:label>article-d7d6efa7-a075-49c1-b18f-0e8ed355dd73</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a city that is used to being disparaged, President Trump’s attempt to overturn an election that he lost seems both extraordinary and business as usual.</rdfs:comment>
