	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d86f3f51-d40b-4ec1-a9be-2039bdb8a45e">
		<rdfs:label>article-d86f3f51-d40b-4ec1-a9be-2039bdb8a45e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Luke Mogelson and Andy Campbell have followed groups like the Proud Boys for years. They are terrified at what they see as a growing threat.</rdfs:comment>
