	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d88ed38e-b2ac-40f1-94f0-14c312cee1c4">
		<rdfs:label>article-d88ed38e-b2ac-40f1-94f0-14c312cee1c4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After Roe fell, a sleepy college town in Southern Illinois found itself to be a crucial destination for abortion access. Not all of its residents are happy about it.</rdfs:comment>
