		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d89dbc71-54ea-4bd3-9ab1-cad612add15f">
		<rdfs:label>article-d89dbc71-54ea-4bd3-9ab1-cad612add15f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>New regulations in China are delaying its shipments of medical supplies around the world. And some American officials worry accepting donated gear helps China’s propaganda efforts.</rdfs:comment>
