		<rdfs:label>article-d8a9d306-8246-48da-98e1-597faf94bef2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A challenger to Senator Mitch McConnell has finally emerged, and John Hickenlooper and Jon Huntsman Jr. are looking for their next jobs, among other races unfolding on Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
