	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d8b1a583-da65-462b-b904-73122b4a8447">
		<rdfs:label>article-d8b1a583-da65-462b-b904-73122b4a8447</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden has selected William J. Burns, a career State Department official who led the U.S. delegation in secret talks with Iran, to run the Central Intelligence Agency.</rdfs:comment>
