	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d8b2ba2a-9f0d-4680-b32c-bb995770fe3f">
		<rdfs:label>article-d8b2ba2a-9f0d-4680-b32c-bb995770fe3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A recent endorsement of his Iran policy from Jared Kushner inflamed frustrations among Democratic allies calling for bolder action abroad.</rdfs:comment>
