	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d8b89e09-5ad5-4a54-b564-91c807e89800">
		<rdfs:label>article-d8b89e09-5ad5-4a54-b564-91c807e89800</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Attempts by candidates to discredit the integrity of the vote have “snowballed enormously” since the 2020 election, the head of the observation mission said.</rdfs:comment>
