	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d8bcb4ba-4144-4bed-a5d4-bff2da0e98e3">
		<rdfs:label>article-d8bcb4ba-4144-4bed-a5d4-bff2da0e98e3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A decision by the Trump administration to move the Bureau of Land Management’s headquarters to Colorado caused staff members to quit, according to a government watchdog report.</rdfs:comment>
