	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d8c366ae-2931-402c-9787-3e046ebeecc9">
		<rdfs:label>article-d8c366ae-2931-402c-9787-3e046ebeecc9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A panel ruled that the House had standing to pursue a constitutional lawsuit over the president’s move to spend more money on a wall than Congress had approved.</rdfs:comment>
