		<rdfs:label>article-d9665e38-f460-48b5-8197-cdf1b98cacb8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even before the president was given mood-altering drugs, there was a movement to end the commander in chief’s sole authority to launch nuclear weapons.</rdfs:comment>
