		<rdfs:label>article-d97bf61e-5c9c-4594-8484-a554b9473f3b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least 10 rockets were fired on the Ayn Al Asad air base one week after U.S. airstrikes on Iran-backed militia positions along the Syrian-Iraqi border.</rdfs:comment>
