		<rdfs:label>article-d98dc07c-6a3a-4977-bc6b-fc25be5cfe9d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Rick Bright testified that he made early appeals that the Trump administration prepare for the coronavirus. President Trump and his health secretary snapped back.</rdfs:comment>
