	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d98ed89d-802c-4940-88e5-c4c48cc9d928">
		<rdfs:label>article-d98ed89d-802c-4940-88e5-c4c48cc9d928</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>That the House panel did not provide the Justice Department with transcripts of Cassidy Hutchinson’s interviews speaks to the panel’s reluctance to turn over evidence.</rdfs:comment>
