	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9920136-16d6-4e8c-b809-3794ae2f9f48">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9920136-16d6-4e8c-b809-3794ae2f9f48</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The party has fielded 67 Black, Latino, Asian or Native American candidates for the House, by its count, and the number in Congress is almost certain to grow.</rdfs:comment>
