		<rdfs:label>article-d9940349-4f77-49e5-b84a-f288fb59085d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Their proposal was quashed amid concerns that it would violate First Amendment protections, people briefed on the plan said.</rdfs:comment>
