		<rdfs:label>article-d996fb4e-ae41-4257-8b7e-2e5ebab36b6b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Lawmakers have made an array of misleading claims about “Pelosi’s subway,” unauthorized immigrants receiving checks, school funding and the minimum wage as they debate the $1.9 trillion relief bill.</rdfs:comment>
