		<rdfs:label>article-d99d4349-708e-4525-b203-9bcfb0fad2ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Prosecutors rejected a scathing brief that portrayed their reversal in the case as a “gross prosecutorial abuse.”</rdfs:comment>
