	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9a27816-994c-4cda-81af-e391fafa3aac">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9a27816-994c-4cda-81af-e391fafa3aac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After seeing the evidence, Karen McDonald made an instinctual, and unusual, decision to charge Ethan Crumbley’s mother and father. Can she succeed?</rdfs:comment>
