	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9a76cf8-76c1-44bd-9303-5acefbeb4855">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9a76cf8-76c1-44bd-9303-5acefbeb4855</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Contentious plans to erect a wind farm off the northeastern coast of Spain are part of a tense debate over where to locate new renewable energy projects across Europe.</rdfs:comment>
