	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9b701b0-12da-49ea-a57f-c103cc244a70">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9b701b0-12da-49ea-a57f-c103cc244a70</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden is restoring Bears Ears and Grand Staircase-Escalante in Utah and a marine monument off the New England coast, all severely reduced by former President Donald J. Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c55cfad1-37a4-40de-ab47-b363a537db6a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9b72661-0661-42cf-ae01-d034c5626026">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9b72661-0661-42cf-ae01-d034c5626026</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The proposal represents an enormous effort to fight climate change, but it sidesteps the question of who will be forced to move because of rising water.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-74659e03-2c48-4140-91f4-08e5d544f77a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-31"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9bbcb16-29d5-4a8d-85e7-0e7dbe9e4cac">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9bbcb16-29d5-4a8d-85e7-0e7dbe9e4cac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The choice of Dr. Jha, an outspoken public health expert, is a sign that the White House believes the country is entering a new phase of the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
