	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9bce0bf-3cc0-4e56-a581-a0ce25ee4b73">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9bce0bf-3cc0-4e56-a581-a0ce25ee4b73</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Without the votes to change Senate rules, Democrats had no avenue for overcoming a Republican filibuster against legislation intended to offset new state voting restrictions.</rdfs:comment>
