	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9c239f7-d7c7-4429-be89-3e7487066fb6">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9c239f7-d7c7-4429-be89-3e7487066fb6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two months after the killing of Mr. Floyd, a South Minneapolis neighborhood remains a police-free zone.</rdfs:comment>
