	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9c9d4ad-998f-457c-b515-cacd29854651">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9c9d4ad-998f-457c-b515-cacd29854651</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Arbery, a 25-year-old Black man, was chased by armed white residents of a South Georgia neighborhood. They were arrested months later.</rdfs:comment>
