		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-d9d4f5ed-ccca-49f5-ac82-422477230d71">
		<rdfs:label>article-d9d4f5ed-ccca-49f5-ac82-422477230d71</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The G.O.P. candidate for governor of Pennsylvania deftly used Facebook to build a loyal right-wing fan base at the height of the pandemic. Will it be enough to win a competitive general election?</rdfs:comment>
