		<rdfs:label>article-da0c61fa-07bd-434a-8ac9-482df12ecfa9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Former Gov. John Hickenlooper of Colorado defeated Senator Cory Gardner on Tuesday, becoming the first Democrat to flip a Senate seat this cycle in the party’s quest to retake the Senate majority.</rdfs:comment>
