		<rdfs:label>article-da0ffa71-38b4-4db1-a726-c2c62c45513d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>By enacting big spending initiatives under the auspices of pandemic relief and infrastructure, and avoiding health care, President Biden may have found a way to skirt an ideologically divisive fight.</rdfs:comment>
