	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dac374ae-98e4-4ea5-852c-614bb2f18c2a">
		<rdfs:label>article-dac374ae-98e4-4ea5-852c-614bb2f18c2a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The F.B.I. said some of the 4,500 tips it received about Justice Brett Kavanaugh were given to the Trump White House, leading some Democrats to call the process a sham.</rdfs:comment>
