	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dadf1613-ef18-4764-8920-da90562f93c7">
		<rdfs:label>article-dadf1613-ef18-4764-8920-da90562f93c7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Weary voters appeared willing to give former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. a chance, but they shied away from putting Democrats in full control of Washington.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0e84c75e-7bc1-4744-83f1-7496fcf4721d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-05"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dadf9b42-78be-457d-a7ef-378c8e282948">
		<rdfs:label>article-dadf9b42-78be-457d-a7ef-378c8e282948</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Conor Lamb, who survived a Republican challenge in Pennsylvania, says Democrats were given a message on Election Day: Backlash to progressive policies risks killing their House majority.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4504805-5b5f-41c7-b157-41ff04a342ad"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dae069f9-1623-4af8-abdf-660341fdf6af">
		<rdfs:label>article-dae069f9-1623-4af8-abdf-660341fdf6af</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Trump’s return to the campaign trail poses new dangers to American democracy.</rdfs:comment>
