	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dae69971-9df5-4190-833b-e7b7e1929dd1">
		<rdfs:label>article-dae69971-9df5-4190-833b-e7b7e1929dd1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It’s a balancing act in a congressional district that stretches from liberal Detroit to Trump country downriver. At times, it seems, she pleases no one.</rdfs:comment>
