		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-10"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-daecd856-9feb-4042-ba55-ce2c1ca25cad">
		<rdfs:label>article-daecd856-9feb-4042-ba55-ce2c1ca25cad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the first foreign policy speech of his administration, the president said he would rebuild “the muscle of democratic alliances that have atrophied over the past few years of neglect and, I would argue, abuse.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-f4f38f08-6492-4112-8b82-52bd8aa6b34f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
