	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-daf9edaf-2f31-4951-b808-5f4407491809">
		<rdfs:label>article-daf9edaf-2f31-4951-b808-5f4407491809</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Since the murder of George Floyd, the racial justice movement has received millions of dollars in donations. But some chapters have questioned how those funds are spent.</rdfs:comment>
