	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-db0306f2-7b75-4907-a070-134a8e08bae0">
		<rdfs:label>article-db0306f2-7b75-4907-a070-134a8e08bae0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Defense Department’s top intelligence official said that he had not been ordered to conduct surveillance on citizens, and that he supported their right to demonstrate peacefully.</rdfs:comment>
