		<rdfs:label>article-db1b43e6-97bb-4175-b846-7c438d7196e3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Every registered voter at a precinct in the University of Central Florida in Orlando cast a ballot in the election. And then a few extra people showed up.</rdfs:comment>
