	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-db1bb804-636b-43db-ab69-adf55ec790b9">
		<rdfs:label>article-db1bb804-636b-43db-ab69-adf55ec790b9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s allies quickly closed ranks behind Sidney Powell and her pro-Trump conspiracy theory, accusing the Fox host of betrayal.</rdfs:comment>
