		<rdfs:comment>“What we need in Washington is a little more humility and trust of the people,” said Mr. Amash, a Michigan congressman and former Republican. He told us why he was seeking the Libertarian Party’s presidential nomination.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
