	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-db23609f-164d-48f9-8520-70584ff02164">
		<rdfs:label>article-db23609f-164d-48f9-8520-70584ff02164</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In addition to the “You Can’t Close America” rally in Austin, Texas, on Saturday, modest demonstrations took place in the capitals of Nevada, Indiana and Maryland.</rdfs:comment>
