	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-db2bed24-92da-4598-a7aa-ea477e57e4d4">
		<rdfs:label>article-db2bed24-92da-4598-a7aa-ea477e57e4d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. was expected to select a longtime career civil servant at the Justice Department to serve as the acting attorney general after he is sworn in on Wednesday, according to a person briefed on the decision.</rdfs:comment>
