		<rdfs:label>article-db2d34ae-be23-4297-8a6b-ae89b76d3b36</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sprawling Department of Veterans Affairs is legally designated as the nation’s backup health system and could prove vital in the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
