		<rdfs:label>article-db2fab6a-510b-4967-bb96-e77ff2c7f233</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden is rarely seen without Kamala Harris, a tangible result of his efforts to treat her as an equal stakeholder. But for now he does not intend to assign her a specific portfolio.</rdfs:comment>
