		<rdfs:label>article-db5e72fe-6c25-41f4-b868-9e4ac0e03994</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The astronaut Anne McClain had faced accusations that she had improperly accessed a bank account from the International Space Station. But prosecutors said her accuser lied about some details.</rdfs:comment>
