		<rdfs:label>article-dc3c0755-6334-4abd-98ef-15c1891c64e5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The story of her career can be explained, in part, by a series of dramatic moments during congressional hearings and primary debates. Here are five of them.</rdfs:comment>
