		<rdfs:label>article-dc3e6679-cc46-4966-8771-98b1927ce4e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Once nonexistent, campaign cash earmarked as &quot;climate donations&quot; is flowing to Joe Biden as a small but growing counterweight to the monied muscle of fossil fuels.</rdfs:comment>
