	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dc4df254-8a50-4552-87a5-5a70e81056ef">
		<rdfs:label>article-dc4df254-8a50-4552-87a5-5a70e81056ef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Do you know whether your parents or guardians will help you pay for college — and how much they might contribute? Will the amount of your aid package ultimately decide where you will enroll?</rdfs:comment>
