	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dc636345-0bba-4e5c-bb61-58e413b41aab">
		<rdfs:label>article-dc636345-0bba-4e5c-bb61-58e413b41aab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Vaccinated Californians will mostly be able to go mask-free. But there’s still some confusion.</rdfs:comment>
