	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dc638cae-b9a5-4a5f-b599-67421147502a">
		<rdfs:label>article-dc638cae-b9a5-4a5f-b599-67421147502a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Developing nations will need help with the economic and public health disruptions from coronavirus. But institutions designed to help are being hobbled.</rdfs:comment>
