		<rdfs:label>article-dc651f12-8a1a-4483-8b83-47b16285c67f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The decision to reveal who received a Paycheck Protection Program loan comes after weeks of backlash over a lack of transparency.</rdfs:comment>
