		<rdfs:label>article-dccfb30e-f64c-44ea-b6cf-29cf1b1d8ca6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Stephen K. Bannon, who is set to be sentenced on Friday, deserved a penalty harsher than the minimum term of one month in jail because he had blatantly brushed off the Jan. 6 committee’s demands, prosecutors said.</rdfs:comment>
