		<rdfs:label>article-dcd2dbbe-a157-44bb-bbfd-527ef00ecae5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Prosecutors said he provided classified information to Russian intelligence operatives for years, betraying the United States.</rdfs:comment>
