		<rdfs:label>article-dcfb6521-8141-4e52-9154-32dac68185f7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An event in Michigan was billed as an opportunity for the senator to make his case directly to black voters, who have broken strongly for Joe Biden. It didn’t work out that way.</rdfs:comment>
