	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dcff78c3-c276-460b-b9be-df7335881f1a">
		<rdfs:label>article-dcff78c3-c276-460b-b9be-df7335881f1a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Times spoke with Secretary of State Shirley Weber, who oversees the state’s elections and described few hiccups on Tuesday.</rdfs:comment>
