	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd0413fa-8e9e-4f5a-9cb9-c8af7973b037">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd0413fa-8e9e-4f5a-9cb9-c8af7973b037</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Of the nearly 240 pardons and commutations he granted during his term, only 25 came through the regular Justice Department process. The rest were a product of connections, influence and money.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9fcaaf17-51fe-4de9-aec7-f53a415e4396"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-26"/>
