	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd2cc3bb-5f06-43b0-a1fd-45971b03a343">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd2cc3bb-5f06-43b0-a1fd-45971b03a343</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Local prosecutors are referring criminal cases to the federal and tribal courts, which are now flooded with new cases.</rdfs:comment>
