	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd2e7b67-938c-4e98-bf94-274f2830fad6">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd2e7b67-938c-4e98-bf94-274f2830fad6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials coordinating the November vote vow to be ready. But lawsuits, demands for voting records and unbending believers that elections are rigged are making it harder.</rdfs:comment>
