	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd2f944f-57e1-4d50-b49f-dd4b30a783b8">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd2f944f-57e1-4d50-b49f-dd4b30a783b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the freak winter storm raged, historically marginalized communities were among the first to face power outages, experts say.</rdfs:comment>
