	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd3933f8-f4c8-450a-8744-fc1705771269">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd3933f8-f4c8-450a-8744-fc1705771269</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The announcement came after lawmakers and advocates argued that Medicare recipients had been passed over in the push to require insurers to cover the tests.</rdfs:comment>
