	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd395cf8-bdc1-4c35-a0b1-4aecfc216319">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd395cf8-bdc1-4c35-a0b1-4aecfc216319</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump will not make an in-person appearance at the United Nations General Assembly, which opens next week in New York City, his chief of staff, Mark Meadows, said on Thursday, in an apparent change in the White House’s plan.</rdfs:comment>
