	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd4811f3-3e51-4c14-b057-22a40acd2ef0">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd4811f3-3e51-4c14-b057-22a40acd2ef0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new poll found that most likely voters disagreed with the idea that the governor overstepped his authority in his response to the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
