		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-09-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd504377-3227-40eb-ac9a-b3a0f8e94932">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd504377-3227-40eb-ac9a-b3a0f8e94932</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Congress can also do more to protect the integrity of a presidential election and make progress on other issues before the current session ends.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-11"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd51d25d-a638-42f4-88a3-257fd0d31a53">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd51d25d-a638-42f4-88a3-257fd0d31a53</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The action is likely to fuel rapid inflation in Russia as it wages war in Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
