	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd5646d1-b8eb-47a0-95ba-6f9aed0babce">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd5646d1-b8eb-47a0-95ba-6f9aed0babce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Interviews at polling places in Wyoming’s bluest county, Teton, where Ms. Cheney lives, turned up a stream of voters re-registering as Republicans.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4a606035-f311-493f-9272-00230e475b23"/>
