	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd574e44-5d95-46aa-a0ce-43681ab9e734">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd574e44-5d95-46aa-a0ce-43681ab9e734</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At least 37 states allow people with certain health conditions to receive the Covid-19 vaccine, according to a New York Times survey. But a new skirmish has emerged over who will go first.</rdfs:comment>
