	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd5ba7c0-111d-4d0d-b201-a4b88dad8307">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd5ba7c0-111d-4d0d-b201-a4b88dad8307</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Above all else, activists and politicians at the gathering sought to divert pressure to support popular overhauls like expanded background checks by seizing on the issue of school safety.</rdfs:comment>
