	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dd64163d-a274-445f-97bd-92cd50471906">
		<rdfs:label>article-dd64163d-a274-445f-97bd-92cd50471906</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A key official designated President-elect Joe Biden as the apparent winner after Michigan certified his victory there and President Trump lost another court decision in Pennsylvania.</rdfs:comment>
