		<rdfs:label>article-dd658fe2-ad67-45f4-80a4-14ccf1b7c3ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Much of Mississippi galvanized around the effort to remove the state flag. Residents now want to seize on the momentum created by the triumph.</rdfs:comment>
