		<rdfs:label>article-dd706995-9a48-4c19-a2c2-2bc6aad73dce</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Removed to countries they barely knew after serving time for their crimes, the veterans hope to finally return. “Everything that I am is American.”</rdfs:comment>
