		<rdfs:label>article-dd7474c5-a43f-4f99-bd00-88577b0fd0f3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The gun violence prevention organization plans to place 38,000 silk white roses in 4,000 vases on the National Mall to commemorate the Americans killed each year by guns.</rdfs:comment>
