		<rdfs:label>article-dd7735c3-940d-4503-89e9-740271c1575a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The newly discovered, more contagious variant of the coronavirus — first seen in Britain — may have been found in a second person in Colorado, state officials said on Wednesday.</rdfs:comment>
