		<rdfs:label>article-dda48eaf-b337-4401-a9bc-53b524c3cc5b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Emmett Till’s cousin Ollie Gordon recalled him as a jokester who “loved to make people laugh” as she reflected on their childhood together ahead of what would have been his 80th birthday.</rdfs:comment>
