	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dda58de0-fcb1-4f45-83eb-8e14560dfafb">
		<rdfs:label>article-dda58de0-fcb1-4f45-83eb-8e14560dfafb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With just days remaining in his term, House Democrats have introduced an article of impeachment in Congress charging President Trump for a second time with committing “high crimes and misdemeanors,” this time for his role in inciting a mob that stormed the Capitol last week.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0d6427ef-da1b-4d64-8c55-4f2b53f3bd95"/>
