	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dde8cc50-ac08-45e9-bd05-c9a1904bad4d">
		<rdfs:label>article-dde8cc50-ac08-45e9-bd05-c9a1904bad4d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The leaders at the two-day summit in Washington will discuss a variety of topics, but the president plans to use it to show a united front against Beijing.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-05-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ddec6d02-3a3a-4a99-99f3-28da5f9fff69">
		<rdfs:label>article-ddec6d02-3a3a-4a99-99f3-28da5f9fff69</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The lawsuit was the third in recent months where the government has taken on a perceived foe of the White House.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2c183a13-1898-4deb-ad56-cc02fd034eaf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ddf12e36-a8ec-47c0-b151-ac6d12119e35">
		<rdfs:label>article-ddf12e36-a8ec-47c0-b151-ac6d12119e35</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Sixteen months into the Biden presidency, U.S. officials are still divided over what to do about a trade legacy left by President Donald J. Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b06f805-a6f6-4cda-9908-3f8ddd3a0432"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-94d58c04-d925-44a3-9534-35b73b8dc25d"/>
