	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-df15e293-a4ec-4005-a18b-7d440ba6fe6e">
		<rdfs:label>article-df15e293-a4ec-4005-a18b-7d440ba6fe6e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Catherine Cortez Masto defeated Adam Laxalt, the state’s former attorney general. Democrats now will try to add to their control of the chamber in Georgia’s runoff election on Dec. 6.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-803bdb8f-8c3c-4210-80c9-22b0af3fd2ba"/>
