		<rdfs:label>article-df1803b0-edb1-4982-81e3-8c072991b40c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jury selection began on Tuesday in the case of Stewart Rhodes, the leader of the far-right militia group, and four other members charged with seditious conspiracy in the Jan. 6 attack on the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
