	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-df1824e8-ba1e-4de9-a46b-61e2d44ebc2f">
		<rdfs:label>article-df1824e8-ba1e-4de9-a46b-61e2d44ebc2f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Want to follow the women’s gymnastics competition in Tokyo, but don’t understand the skills or how they’re scored? Here’s a guide.</rdfs:comment>
