		<rdfs:label>article-df1c4bfa-f9be-4cd2-be38-d6d33a7b9208</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“I’m not going to vote for $1.9 trillion just because it has a couple of good provisions,” Senator Roger Wicker later told reporters.</rdfs:comment>
