		<rdfs:label>article-df40112c-4327-43bd-8315-170a14abe1d7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After complaining about how she has been treated, the first lady also went on in a statement to condemn the violence at the Capitol.</rdfs:comment>
