		<rdfs:label>article-df45b2b5-47b2-4eed-9bc2-c42484258d74</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Federal scientists and lawyers, told to undo regulations that some have worked on for decades, have embedded data into technical documents that environmental lawyers are using to challenge the rollbacks.</rdfs:comment>
