		<rdfs:label>article-df4cfca9-65a0-4c82-ae07-b335737b5095</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a country already struggling with full hospitals and virus fatigue, the variant has contributed to spikes in some states.</rdfs:comment>
