	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-df519aa4-6756-4ad5-a023-d0c77b9aa450">
		<rdfs:label>article-df519aa4-6756-4ad5-a023-d0c77b9aa450</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We’re on top of the latest extreme weather in the U.S. and around the world. Follow here for news on heat waves, wildfires, storms and more.</rdfs:comment>
