		<rdfs:label>article-df5349fa-39d8-4bce-9a6c-914266ddf776</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In our last newsletter of 2020, let’s look at what Joe Biden’s emerging administration might mean for the political battles of 2021.</rdfs:comment>
