	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-df57158d-691b-4e77-a368-a7d2a7d88e8d">
		<rdfs:label>article-df57158d-691b-4e77-a368-a7d2a7d88e8d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a battleground district, even some Trump voters said they were hesitant to hold President Biden accountable for the casualties and chaos in the U.S. pullout from Afghanistan.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6cc67a-b3c2-45c5-af7a-92a423ab1249"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-30"/>
