	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-df597378-44ef-47ae-b001-e46debfdd210">
		<rdfs:label>article-df597378-44ef-47ae-b001-e46debfdd210</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“We live in a time where anti-Semitism is on the rise again in America and around the world,” Mr. Blinken said.</rdfs:comment>
