	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfa279bb-bc56-476c-9d96-0b55fa3ff7e1">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfa279bb-bc56-476c-9d96-0b55fa3ff7e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Oil and gas giants are selling off their most-polluting operations to small private companies. Most manage to escape public scrutiny.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c4d98394-1549-4853-be0d-e7afcd8ee238"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfa5a636-6750-4515-8492-b9ab097753a5">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfa5a636-6750-4515-8492-b9ab097753a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The disaster for towns on the Tittabawassee River was compounded by the effects of the coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfa8482c-29f6-4752-9e8b-11d325e59fd9">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfa8482c-29f6-4752-9e8b-11d325e59fd9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many are choosing to live elsewhere in search of cheaper housing and better amenities. They are finding growing acceptance in other communities after decades of political and social changes.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ebf4f94d-a728-4327-b424-d347782b7b17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfa90a98-c0db-46af-8ae8-aafdfcd881ed">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfa90a98-c0db-46af-8ae8-aafdfcd881ed</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A full accounting of the Capitol riot, with backing from both parties, is harder than ever to envision.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-887d1269-7020-4c8e-8dfc-eae7c464f3cb"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfa93713-f6e0-422e-96a2-eaa995d182fd">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfa93713-f6e0-422e-96a2-eaa995d182fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Reporting the truth is the only way to stop a global pandemic. Beijing just made that more difficult.</rdfs:comment>
