	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfcd1e9f-5032-47fe-86b1-443195ac733d">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfcd1e9f-5032-47fe-86b1-443195ac733d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Wednesday: Public health officials set a six-part framework for deciding how to slowly reopen the economy. Also: A dispatch from the U.S.N.S. Mercy.</rdfs:comment>
