		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfd1d5e8-e235-42a5-ba4b-fac270ee5cac">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfd1d5e8-e235-42a5-ba4b-fac270ee5cac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The trend could be a harbinger of more ballot choices in 2022, as more cities and states take aim at rising rents.</rdfs:comment>
