	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfd4709e-504a-4fab-afb8-d0792f861c5a">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfd4709e-504a-4fab-afb8-d0792f861c5a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Climate cooperation could get a boost from breakthroughs at a meeting of the world’s 20 biggest economies.</rdfs:comment>
