		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfe0af2e-741b-430b-b4a2-b625bbbdcb55">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfe0af2e-741b-430b-b4a2-b625bbbdcb55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many economists who once warned of mounting debt are now urging lawmakers to spend more to combat economic pain from coronavirus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-05-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfe42082-fd09-4d72-bc42-2ba469e192f3">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfe42082-fd09-4d72-bc42-2ba469e192f3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If Republicans take Congress, Representative Michael R. Turner says, he wants to focus on oversight and national security issues. But he is likely to face pressure from his own party.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dfe47eae-0a08-4270-adc7-bc49327d5915">
		<rdfs:label>article-dfe47eae-0a08-4270-adc7-bc49327d5915</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A group of about 70 students from the University of Texas at Austin celebrated spring break in Mexico, then returned to find that dozens had tested positive.</rdfs:comment>
