	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-dff5cd62-4d74-4635-9a52-b83cb124d207">
		<rdfs:label>article-dff5cd62-4d74-4635-9a52-b83cb124d207</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the Trump administration separated migrant parents from children at the southern border, President Biden pledged to make it up to the families.</rdfs:comment>
