	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0092843-5c5c-4671-9aa1-2b113956b25e">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0092843-5c5c-4671-9aa1-2b113956b25e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president’s proposal can be read as a second-term policy blueprint. On the future of the Affordable Care Act, it’s awfully vague.</rdfs:comment>
