	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0322a65-9c12-46ac-ab0e-8b4b17a9e634">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0322a65-9c12-46ac-ab0e-8b4b17a9e634</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A sense of dread about the variant’s rapid spread is growing even in places that had experienced a virus lull.</rdfs:comment>
