	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e03234d6-fa88-413d-9bca-cd1f26661ea1">
		<rdfs:label>article-e03234d6-fa88-413d-9bca-cd1f26661ea1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president suggested he wanted to move soon, but he also promised to listen to public health officials cautioning against relaxing restrictions prematurely.</rdfs:comment>
