		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e033cfeb-bb71-43f4-bc99-466bd8afad2d">
		<rdfs:label>article-e033cfeb-bb71-43f4-bc99-466bd8afad2d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With less coverage of politics, the usual September rush of donations slowed. “It feels almost like we have to start over,” a Democratic fund-raiser said.</rdfs:comment>
