	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0349329-1846-4cab-9fb0-a8f7e732c1da">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0349329-1846-4cab-9fb0-a8f7e732c1da</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The California Republican believes his party’s victories in 2020 came thanks to the president, not in spite of him: “He brought turnout.”</rdfs:comment>
