		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e038af3d-4687-427c-abeb-61b11f92a575">
		<rdfs:label>article-e038af3d-4687-427c-abeb-61b11f92a575</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The cost of insulin is nowhere near as contentious as just about everything else raised in the runoff, but in a state with a high diabetes rate, it has proved a powerful issue.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc5a47b7-5e7e-4d58-8ee7-caaf2f703c6a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e03ed599-5736-4edc-a429-ec4aa816a410">
		<rdfs:label>article-e03ed599-5736-4edc-a429-ec4aa816a410</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The bill has almost no chance of becoming law while President Trump is in office, but it is Democrats’ most comprehensive response to date to what they consider his abuses.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-559d35dd-0818-4064-bd03-731b6c32d473"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e03ff31a-2ff3-44cf-b1a2-5b0cb16c748e">
		<rdfs:label>article-e03ff31a-2ff3-44cf-b1a2-5b0cb16c748e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A trove of polls conducted mostly or entirely after the final presidential debate — which the Trump campaign had hoped would turn around the president’s sagging numbers — landed on Wednesday, and they offered little in the way of encouragement for President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-17ddcb21-b8ba-45a7-8e71-073c17f7026b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e008be05-6dcb-45fe-a5d2-1657eb3a638f"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0400e3b-2481-4603-8bd3-3a4f22e1b61a">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0400e3b-2481-4603-8bd3-3a4f22e1b61a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move could provide tens of thousands of people enrolled in a program that sent applicants to wait in Mexico a way to return to the United States to pursue their claims again.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dad1523a-f983-4f0f-af53-0061c7165e91"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e044bd86-12c5-4357-a023-c52122167dc8">
		<rdfs:label>article-e044bd86-12c5-4357-a023-c52122167dc8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Voters often punish a president for pushing an unpopular agenda. But President Biden has been learning that they rarely reward a president for enacting legislation.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-17ddcb21-b8ba-45a7-8e71-073c17f7026b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-27"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0482a90-d83e-4344-9b19-f078fac91884">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0482a90-d83e-4344-9b19-f078fac91884</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Florida’s governor and the former president may be headed for a 2024 showdown.</rdfs:comment>
