	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0484755-63bb-4452-8eeb-84367985e79c">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0484755-63bb-4452-8eeb-84367985e79c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The attorney general argued that the intervention was routine but did not say why the department waited 10 months to step in.</rdfs:comment>
