		<rdfs:label>article-e04a52be-4398-4450-94b1-e22e5504ea19</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Adam Schiff, the House Intelligence Committee chairman, said the agency was withholding documents from his panel, including some that might be useful in the impeachment trial.</rdfs:comment>
