		<rdfs:label>article-e04e758c-04c1-4d73-ae25-972a9626e11e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The suggestion that Lt. Col. Alexander S. Vindman should now face punishment by the Pentagon was one sign of how determined the president is to even the scales after his impeachment.</rdfs:comment>
