		<rdfs:label>article-e04f04c8-87a7-4023-a9f1-2748cdcc3286</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials might weaken a law that bans chokeholds and other police maneuvers that restrict airflow.</rdfs:comment>
