		<rdfs:label>article-e05293d0-aca6-4de3-a4ee-490d46715f22</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After weeks of failed efforts to bridge deep divides, the president pulled the plug, turning to a bipartisan group to try to salvage a chance at compromise.</rdfs:comment>
