	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e0558e4e-25ee-4ad5-bcbc-f1527db33a44">
		<rdfs:label>article-e0558e4e-25ee-4ad5-bcbc-f1527db33a44</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Donald Trump is no longer center stage. But many conservative activists are finding that the best way to raise money and keep voters engaged is to make his biggest fabrication their top priority.</rdfs:comment>
