		<rdfs:label>article-e0613535-d653-413b-92cd-455376d9fe98</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Michael R. Bloomberg is funding a last-minute spending blitz to bolster former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. in Texas and Ohio, directing millions toward television advertising in two red states that have shifted away from President Trump in the general election.</rdfs:comment>
