		<rdfs:label>article-e0670f7a-87f4-4cd9-b133-ea516781f2ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Military officials gave a grim assessment of the toll on Ukraine, saying that Russian forces were moving to decapitate the government in Kyiv.</rdfs:comment>
