	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e071b253-caa1-4145-95b0-c117b98e38a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-e071b253-caa1-4145-95b0-c117b98e38a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The number of people with the coronavirus in the United States who have died passed 300,000 on Monday, another wrenching record that comes less than four weeks after the nation’s virus deaths reached a quarter-million.</rdfs:comment>
