	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e1e4bf8b-023e-44a7-ad99-feb760492e03">
		<rdfs:label>article-e1e4bf8b-023e-44a7-ad99-feb760492e03</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In his victory speech, the president-elect said of Black voters: “You’ve always had my back, and I’ll have yours.” Many of those voters are watching to see what he does in office.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a4504805-5b5f-41c7-b157-41ff04a342ad"/>
