		<rdfs:label>article-e1e66961-0450-404a-913a-edad024a76d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The first lady was in Delano, Calif., to mark the birthday of César Chávez, the labor organizer who formed the country’s first successful farmworkers’ union.</rdfs:comment>
