		<rdfs:label>article-e1f5664c-4204-4bb6-8327-f83fc17d44e1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The rousing show of support provided another gripping scene to emerge from the coronavirus pandemic: the rank and file cheering a boss they viewed as putting their safety ahead of his career.</rdfs:comment>
