		<rdfs:label>article-e1f60dde-5c8a-4061-b4ad-ba985fa25c6d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>J.R. Majewski promotes himself to Ohio voters as a combat veteran, but the Air Force has no record of it. Now, there is evidence he was demoted for drunken driving.</rdfs:comment>
