		<rdfs:label>article-e1f90325-4909-4ed1-8a30-2f1b3fe6fd43</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With so much evidence of racism, said Marcus Ransom, the only Black man on the jury, it was not difficult to find Ahmaud Arbery’s murderers guilty of hate crimes.</rdfs:comment>
