		<rdfs:label>article-e1fce9af-c0bb-4faa-ba79-b549ae74cd5d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hospitalizations and Covid cases have increased sharply in Los Angeles since Thanksgiving. But fear — and masks — are missing this time around.</rdfs:comment>
