	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2035afa-331b-4de3-957c-5482dac905ad">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2035afa-331b-4de3-957c-5482dac905ad</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Part of John Fetterman’s appeal as the Democratic Senate nominee has stemmed from his brash sense of vitality. It’s not clear if his recent stroke and absence from the trail will affect that.</rdfs:comment>
