		<rdfs:label>article-e2043f46-a4df-4e8d-bcf2-bd88784250b7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>But President Trump’s convention speech and those of Melania Trump and Secretary of State Mike Pompeo are only the latest examples of how Mr. Trump has further blurred the lines between the government and his campaign.</rdfs:comment>
