		<rdfs:label>article-e2243558-dab6-4643-a679-609d6fcadaff</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats hope to include climate and clean energy in a second bill. It could be Biden’s last chance to pass major global warming legislation.</rdfs:comment>
