		<rdfs:label>article-e23033af-0f6e-4662-853d-471d86d1382e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Human-caused climate change had an impact on Australia’s wildfires, a new attribution study confirms. The 30 percent figure they calculated is a minimum. </rdfs:comment>
