		<rdfs:label>article-e252417d-95e9-45d1-8f09-943bde964b09</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The five Republicans on the seven-member board have taken a hands-on role in trying to defend the agency against accusations that it is trying to help the president win a second term by sabotaging voting by mail.</rdfs:comment>
