	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2712aef-eb35-4557-a1ed-d8c226a9259d">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2712aef-eb35-4557-a1ed-d8c226a9259d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Several current and former Trump advisers gathered to mingle and toast the president’s acquittal in the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
