	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2773f41-ec46-4b42-9588-1512135d5ba5">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2773f41-ec46-4b42-9588-1512135d5ba5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Much of the funding is left up to state leaders, some of whom have already pushed back on the federal government’s goals. Mr. Landrieu will be key to resolving those differences.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-456258fe-24f9-4e37-a244-c99808a00014"/>
