		<rdfs:label>article-e27ad948-e05e-46ff-b44f-ff49c15e0e40</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump’s lawyers argued against his removal in the Senate impeachment trial, saying Democrats are “asking you to tear up all of the ballots” by convicting him of high crimes and misdemeanors.</rdfs:comment>
