		<rdfs:label>article-e2a276e5-e30a-43d4-a505-b9d11ae80f00</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It has not been aired on television and there are no plans to use it as a paid advertisement for Gov. Ron DeSantis of Florida, but that may not be the point, so long as it spreads on social media.</rdfs:comment>
