		<rdfs:label>article-e2b489cd-8ef9-4467-ad22-10ad46beaef4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A 127-page joint report is the most comprehensive and detailed account to date on the intelligence, communications and policing failures around the Capitol riot.</rdfs:comment>
