	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2bcabae-24fb-4fbf-b090-79f717632650">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2bcabae-24fb-4fbf-b090-79f717632650</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An invasion force could include 175,000 troops, but U.S. officials stress that President Vladimir V. Putin’s intentions remain unclear.</rdfs:comment>
