	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2bfd4dd-6619-4b26-95f7-95546cad18ab">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2bfd4dd-6619-4b26-95f7-95546cad18ab</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The wide margin of support reflected a sense of urgency among lawmakers in both parties about shoring up the technological and industrial capacity of the United States to counter Beijing.</rdfs:comment>
