	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2c1a938-0245-4861-83f5-d84f88cb7d59">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2c1a938-0245-4861-83f5-d84f88cb7d59</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president injected new instability into his looming impeachment trial as Speaker Nancy Pelosi warned that nothing could “erase” the stain on his presidency.</rdfs:comment>
