	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2c2ae05-6fff-4f2f-ae70-e3588f9bba7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2c2ae05-6fff-4f2f-ae70-e3588f9bba7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The group of Democratic lawmakers preparing to press the case against President Trump is about half as large as and far more diverse than the team that prosecuted President Bill Clinton.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
