	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e2fc1382-4225-4b76-bea2-50844ee3f612">
		<rdfs:label>article-e2fc1382-4225-4b76-bea2-50844ee3f612</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Worried about coaxing people into pews when they’d rather be in their pajamas, some Protestant pastors are canceling Sunday services on Dec. 25.</rdfs:comment>
