	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e316d60d-6c03-4f57-998f-ae49a141600e">
		<rdfs:label>article-e316d60d-6c03-4f57-998f-ae49a141600e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With just five days to go until Nov. 3, join as Rachel Dry, a New York Times deputy politics editor, chats with politics reporters Alex Burns, Maggie Haberman, Astead W. Herndon and Lisa Lerer to discuss what to watch for and their best guess as to what will unfold.</rdfs:comment>
