		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e31904e0-40db-44e3-827e-de487bdadc45">
		<rdfs:label>article-e31904e0-40db-44e3-827e-de487bdadc45</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans plan to carry their push to reshape the nation’s electoral system into next year, with Democrats vowing to oppose them but holding few options in G.O.P.-led states.</rdfs:comment>
