	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e31f5eea-1716-4a2d-a59e-bf2a72ad81a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-e31f5eea-1716-4a2d-a59e-bf2a72ad81a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Jenner, a Republican former Olympian and transgender activist, said on Friday that she was running to challenge Gov. Gavin Newsom, a Democrat facing an all but certain recall election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
