	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e347cc31-5b60-4625-8027-f7a340e2f7f1">
		<rdfs:label>article-e347cc31-5b60-4625-8027-f7a340e2f7f1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A campaign over meth, money and accountability cost law enforcement officers in Guernsey, Wyo., their jobs. Now their lawsuits are prying open the town’s secrets.</rdfs:comment>
