	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e34b2933-4f5f-4958-af01-0d9f4f80a863">
		<rdfs:label>article-e34b2933-4f5f-4958-af01-0d9f4f80a863</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Record rainfall and mudslides forced closures just as tourism season ramped up. Virtually none of America’s national parks are untouched by extreme weather and climate change.</rdfs:comment>
