	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e34e7e6f-ef95-4a04-a3bd-f9523a24481b">
		<rdfs:label>article-e34e7e6f-ef95-4a04-a3bd-f9523a24481b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration is in talks with tribes, environmental groups and others fighting for dams to be removed from the lower Snake River in the Pacific Northwest.</rdfs:comment>
