		<rdfs:label>article-e357d903-b68d-4d0c-b0c8-007d7619af3e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Trump administration had been accused of trying to turn the federally funded news agencies into partisan mouthpieces for his presidency.</rdfs:comment>
