		<rdfs:label>article-e3587ddd-4acf-4f06-ae1d-45b812658461</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>About 340 National Guard troops are expected to deploy in support of local law enforcement before demonstrations against the election results.</rdfs:comment>
