	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e35c96eb-206f-4ace-a915-ca66ea9cf605">
		<rdfs:label>article-e35c96eb-206f-4ace-a915-ca66ea9cf605</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former president is hitting the campaign trail, beginning in Georgia on Friday night, to try to help Democrats energize voters and regain momentum in key Senate races.</rdfs:comment>
