		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e3682eca-da3f-4937-9455-f68d802c180f">
		<rdfs:label>article-e3682eca-da3f-4937-9455-f68d802c180f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>If the virus spreads in the United States, the Federal Reserve might have to cut rates. But how fiscal policymakers respond is likely to be even more important.</rdfs:comment>
