	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e368561c-7f75-44ff-95d4-994c267639f5">
		<rdfs:label>article-e368561c-7f75-44ff-95d4-994c267639f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Police officers at the University of Washington in Seattle, regarded as one of the nation’s most progressive cities, said they were the target of racist insults and harassment.</rdfs:comment>
