	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e36fb3f4-7977-4737-a937-af6e75239839">
		<rdfs:label>article-e36fb3f4-7977-4737-a937-af6e75239839</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One in four Americans has a disability, but disabled politicians are rarely on the national debate stage. That made John Fetterman’s appearance a powerful moment, but public reactions were painful.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-26"/>
