		<rdfs:label>article-e37e5be3-b97a-43b4-8ee3-2ae1918de58b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Women in the military say the horrific killing of Army Specialist Vanessa Guillen has swept the nation, galvanizing even civilians to the cause.</rdfs:comment>
