	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e3827a37-b048-4ffb-926a-5cb7d7df9d72">
		<rdfs:label>article-e3827a37-b048-4ffb-926a-5cb7d7df9d72</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gains in metropolitan areas seemed to buoy Democratic hopes. But the census data also signaled the start of congressional redistricting fights that are expected to help Republicans.</rdfs:comment>
