		<rdfs:label>article-e46cd26f-7cf8-48de-a5c3-b83c2f7133a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This miserable summer — monthlong heat waves, record-breaking floods, no more Choco Tacos — has left many Americans with only one option: surrender.</rdfs:comment>
