		<rdfs:label>article-e50a7683-e0fa-4a81-9703-373324a7d9ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Jonathan Rich said Mr. Floyd had an “exceptionally strong heart” and ruled out a drug overdose and a primary cardiac event.</rdfs:comment>
