		<rdfs:label>article-e5116046-eb00-4faa-b2a5-a6f4e2c08481</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The family of a student killed in terrorist attacks challenged a 1996 law that gives websites immunity for suits based on their users’ posts.</rdfs:comment>
