		<rdfs:label>article-e514d9a8-9ae8-4f9e-87a0-613208b0720c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Gavin Newsom also said bars and wineries should close but restaurants could stay open if they cut their occupancy in half.</rdfs:comment>
