		<rdfs:label>article-e5161a60-f270-4b0a-b1bd-169c4bf7a444</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The claim, which has been debunked numerous times, has resurged ahead of the midterm elections. Here’s why it’s still wrong.</rdfs:comment>
