		<rdfs:label>article-e51639cf-51b5-434a-a503-5ebc059dd58a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Three children have died of a mysterious syndrome linked to the virus. Trump’s support among seniors slips as the pandemic becomes more political.</rdfs:comment>
