		<rdfs:label>article-e516f33b-9b82-4c8c-b40f-ce740c91992d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More people are being released as outbreaks spread behind bars. But there is a growing conflict over who should be let out.</rdfs:comment>
