	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e51b3c83-4e71-4b89-92a8-bfe9e0320b1e">
		<rdfs:label>article-e51b3c83-4e71-4b89-92a8-bfe9e0320b1e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Scientists have reached success rates of nearly 100 percent in predicting when and where violent tornadoes will strike. That hasn’t stopped people from being killed in the ferocious winds.</rdfs:comment>
