	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e51fd2a4-c507-4fee-82a8-f0e147f92b43">
		<rdfs:label>article-e51fd2a4-c507-4fee-82a8-f0e147f92b43</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Oil-producing nations agreed to the largest production cut ever negotiated. Policymakers debated when and how to reopen businesses. And one of the largest pork processing plants in the U.S. closed after 238 employees came down with the virus.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
