	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e526b31c-270c-47e2-afe0-0c3c56fb7685">
		<rdfs:label>article-e526b31c-270c-47e2-afe0-0c3c56fb7685</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Lindsey Graham, the Judiciary Committee chairman, says Republicans have the votes to confirm the president’s choice before the Nov. 3 election, though it will still be a challenge.</rdfs:comment>
