	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e52b4536-4d19-4a1d-b1b8-e91a0a348047">
		<rdfs:label>article-e52b4536-4d19-4a1d-b1b8-e91a0a348047</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Tornadoes touched down in Maryland and in the Philadelphia suburbs. Rain-swollen rivers were still rising. Many were without power.</rdfs:comment>
