	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e52cb0e5-b5fb-47e1-9329-ea979fb35de9">
		<rdfs:label>article-e52cb0e5-b5fb-47e1-9329-ea979fb35de9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The changes outlined by the senators are intended to prevent a repeat of the effort on Jan. 6, 2021, to overturn the presidential election in Congress.</rdfs:comment>
