		<rdfs:label>article-e567e92f-2c3b-4094-a123-6d671dc957ae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With unsubstantiated claims of vote-counting errors and calls to officials in several states, the South Carolina senator seems bent on reversing Joe Biden’s clear victory over President Trump.</rdfs:comment>
