		<rdfs:label>article-e5f4abc3-2f35-4d53-8c58-acf7b6d092dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Health officials testified to Congress about the government’s pandemic response.  Swimming will be allowed at New York City beaches starting on July 1.</rdfs:comment>
