	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e6002774-efea-42f8-9861-e88e14ef4703">
		<rdfs:label>article-e6002774-efea-42f8-9861-e88e14ef4703</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Although some of the fastest growing regions in the country continued to grow, the gains were nearly erased by stark losses in New York, Los Angeles and San Francisco.</rdfs:comment>
