		<rdfs:label>article-e60b7012-7ca6-4eb1-bbb2-2445ecbc3c55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sinking of the Moskva was a major blow to the Russian fleet and the most significant combat loss for any navy in decades.</rdfs:comment>
