		<rdfs:label>article-e60ccb49-54db-49be-9b51-6fbe783d64e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden cut into Donald Trump’s margins with married men and veteran households, a Pew survey shows. But there was a far deeper well of support for Mr. Trump than many progressives had imagined.</rdfs:comment>
