		<rdfs:label>article-e60d359a-824b-4ef8-bfa9-57b56123e870</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After 20 years of diplomacy and support, American officials are now contemplating the harrowing question of whether — and how — they might engage with a Taliban government in Afghanistan.</rdfs:comment>
