		<rdfs:label>article-e616cf2e-fcc0-4eb0-8f0f-49e52ec2a2dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Two appellate judges ordered a lower-court judge to dismiss a charge against President Trump’s former national security adviser. A third judge accused them of overstepping their powers.</rdfs:comment>
