		<rdfs:label>article-e61b42ea-4199-4c51-a748-4ff1d005ce4e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mohamed Noor shot a resident who had called 911 seeking help. His conviction was seen as a rare example of an officer facing serious consequences for an unjustified shooting.</rdfs:comment>
