		<rdfs:label>article-e61c6a27-f69a-40c6-b2ad-773924934729</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Numerous obstacles make extending the school year a tough proposition, but the Biden administration wants to put billions behind it as a way of offsetting pandemic-era learning losses.</rdfs:comment>
