		<rdfs:label>article-e62e77f7-6251-450d-ae97-78b4b9772ccc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A series of missed chances by the federal government to ensure more widespread testing came during the early days of the outbreak, when containment would have been easier.</rdfs:comment>
