		<rdfs:label>article-e6392ac6-9150-476a-acfd-662fed6fb8e6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president will propose using the revenue from increasing corporate taxes to pay for eight years of ambitious spending on roads, bridges, utilities and other needs.</rdfs:comment>
