	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e66f1ffd-7b8e-404e-8dbc-365d62fd03d1">
		<rdfs:label>article-e66f1ffd-7b8e-404e-8dbc-365d62fd03d1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Brad Raffensperger, the Republican secretary of state in Georgia, told The Times that a new, disinformation-driven attempt to inspect 2020 ballots wouldn’t unearth wrongdoing, and would help restore voter confidence.</rdfs:comment>
