	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e670aa42-5f1a-423d-9d64-e858d3d9e9a5">
		<rdfs:label>article-e670aa42-5f1a-423d-9d64-e858d3d9e9a5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Carrie Severino of the Judicial Crisis Network and Roger Severino, a senior health and human services official, have worked to reshape social policy and the courts they need to uphold it.</rdfs:comment>
