	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e6721dc1-2baa-48ac-bc74-8732b4d0d509">
		<rdfs:label>article-e6721dc1-2baa-48ac-bc74-8732b4d0d509</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There is no reason to test healthy people for the virus, the C.D.C. says, but some evacuees are asking to be tested.</rdfs:comment>
