	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e675386e-58e3-47e0-98ee-70713f7c4b61">
		<rdfs:label>article-e675386e-58e3-47e0-98ee-70713f7c4b61</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It was once Jeb Bush’s base of power. But an influx of far-right activists and the radicalization of other members brought turmoil.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-120d1588-a290-47a3-9ce4-8cc42139a1ca"/>
