	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e67ac368-41ff-4a9a-8798-296b5413bebb">
		<rdfs:label>article-e67ac368-41ff-4a9a-8798-296b5413bebb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The U.S. Postal Service experienced some of its worst delays all year in the final week before the election, according to a Times project tracking first-class. An avalanche of late-arriving political pamphlets and advertisements appears to have added to backlogs for the Postal Service, after months of slowdowns.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-15a95be7-d229-425a-96b3-8a01e2c0d4f6"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-576a9017-d1c0-4a28-b730-97415c0f4ae4"/>
