		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e67eceb3-12a2-472a-8be9-a9d91d2331d0">
		<rdfs:label>article-e67eceb3-12a2-472a-8be9-a9d91d2331d0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This week’s Senate hearings underscored the fragility of a bipartisan alliance that seeks to reduce the impact of America’s vast prison complex.</rdfs:comment>
