		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e683ba0e-b6fd-494e-af9e-8c8be0a1d44b">
		<rdfs:label>article-e683ba0e-b6fd-494e-af9e-8c8be0a1d44b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A proposed California law would make it easier to hunt feral swine, the voracious “super invaders” that are the bane of some East Bay suburbs.</rdfs:comment>
