		<rdfs:label>article-e683fd35-6520-49ba-b1e5-fb20e7792695</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The proportion of those with full protection is much higher among older Americans than among younger people.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-cc485407-61fb-4f46-96a9-c260884f0314"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-15"/>
