		<rdfs:label>article-e6af39ef-e258-45af-9683-519fa3e7215a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>White House officials are universally angry with Rudolph W. Giuliani and blame him for both of President Trump’s impeachments. But he remains one of few people still willing to join Mr. Trump in the foxhole.</rdfs:comment>
