		<rdfs:label>article-e6b4edc5-191b-4772-8ab0-de2ec85e1c9b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amtrak and freight rail companies have long clashed over the use of railroad tracks, a dispute that is now playing out along the Gulf Coast, where the agency is seeking to restore service.</rdfs:comment>
