		<rdfs:label>article-e6b88c24-76c6-428a-8523-1383a253506c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The law gives parents the right to exempt their children from mask-wearing without stating a reason. It also requires a full academic year of in-person instruction.</rdfs:comment>
