	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e6da4c88-c52d-453a-8278-8b80bfbc320d">
		<rdfs:label>article-e6da4c88-c52d-453a-8278-8b80bfbc320d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Protesters of Breonna Taylor’s death are drawing on the city’s robust, if overlooked, history of civil rights struggle that has spanned generations.</rdfs:comment>
