	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e6e2a37c-f166-4f78-99d4-4120f22feaef">
		<rdfs:label>article-e6e2a37c-f166-4f78-99d4-4120f22feaef</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A red-hot economy, wildfire smoke from California and the shriveling of the Great Salt Lake are making Utah’s alarming pollution even worse.</rdfs:comment>
