		<rdfs:label>article-e74643b1-b8dd-49dc-81ae-517fc10329b9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Residents of Nebraska woke up to some of the coldest temperatures in their lives on Tuesday — as low as minus 31 degrees — and to messages from their power operators saying the companies had no choice but to implement rolling blackouts.</rdfs:comment>
