		<rdfs:label>article-e749819a-28f1-451e-bea0-0bc0eefe2e66</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats hope that a filibuster of a measure named for former Representative John Lewis of Georgia, the civil rights icon, will help build momentum for a change in Senate rules.</rdfs:comment>
