	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e74de93a-261c-47b1-a979-57bb07c48fca">
		<rdfs:label>article-e74de93a-261c-47b1-a979-57bb07c48fca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After Sandra Lindsay became the first person in the United States to receive a Covid-19 vaccination outside a clinical trial, something unexpected happened: She acquired a fan club.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6543981b-c2b3-4ac7-9248-a4fed66a1224"/>
