	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e74e3f2a-e305-482c-8f30-58150a3c2bba">
		<rdfs:label>article-e74e3f2a-e305-482c-8f30-58150a3c2bba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>American officials were alarmed by fake text messages and social media posts that said President Trump was locking down the country. Experts see a convergence with Russian tactics.</rdfs:comment>
