	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e74fcd83-6db5-49e1-8238-d9dbeb9dc971">
		<rdfs:label>article-e74fcd83-6db5-49e1-8238-d9dbeb9dc971</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Partisan alignments used to be rare when full appeals courts reconsidered the decisions of three-judge panels. But that changed in the Trump era.</rdfs:comment>
