	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e750a109-662b-4c49-8d8d-535e19e98e15">
		<rdfs:label>article-e750a109-662b-4c49-8d8d-535e19e98e15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Recent administrative guidance to hospitals said doctors could perform abortions in emergency situations if complications posed a threat to the health or life of the mother.</rdfs:comment>
