	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7551cf0-875d-4be2-99cd-36aa4d1e9dc3">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7551cf0-875d-4be2-99cd-36aa4d1e9dc3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The outbreak has closed businesses, made workers stay home and kept passengers off airplanes. That has lawmakers considering the biggest bailout in modern history.</rdfs:comment>
