	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e756cc8c-4c86-4ce9-b771-10b1f65b32ee">
		<rdfs:label>article-e756cc8c-4c86-4ce9-b771-10b1f65b32ee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the authorities appeal to the public for help in their investigation, many Muslim residents are experiencing a “managed panic.”</rdfs:comment>
