		<rdfs:label>article-e78dd879-9e0c-429c-b896-6a3b0d3be114</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In 2013, the Supreme Court said requiring domestic groups to take the pledge violated the First Amendment. The new case concerned their foreign affiliates.</rdfs:comment>
