	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7bb04b6-cd59-401f-b2c7-01b58d348f0d">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7bb04b6-cd59-401f-b2c7-01b58d348f0d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The judge in the case also ruled that the trial would remain in the Minneapolis area after the defendants sought a change of venue.</rdfs:comment>
