		<rdfs:label>article-e7be688f-5e56-46ec-9917-78045634b4e3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In taking a leading role in managing the White House’s response to the pandemic, the vice president and his team had an agenda that extended beyond public health.</rdfs:comment>
