	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7cc7649-88c0-4b64-a96b-6059aa6eab69">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7cc7649-88c0-4b64-a96b-6059aa6eab69</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The selection of Dr. Jane M. Orient as federal health officials are trying to promote a vaccine to end the coronavirus pandemic prompted harsh criticism from Senator Chuck Schumer, Democrat of New York.</rdfs:comment>
