	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7d30ef4-a42c-4fd9-addb-dd7fb410143d">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7d30ef4-a42c-4fd9-addb-dd7fb410143d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Texas congressman, who frequently refused to wear a mask, said he had probably contracted the coronavirus because he did so. His diagnosis raised questions about the spread of the virus on Capitol Hill.</rdfs:comment>
