	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7d45d74-e507-40f0-aed2-f89f0c465cc5">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7d45d74-e507-40f0-aed2-f89f0c465cc5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Census Bureau’s move to cut its collection period short by one month in the midst of an already challenging pandemic has unnerved pollsters.</rdfs:comment>
