	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7d7c34a-abc1-4c1d-8ca2-baee1ab179cc">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7d7c34a-abc1-4c1d-8ca2-baee1ab179cc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“I’m kind of angry,” said one man whose family has been without power since Monday. A winter storm caused physical damage to the electrical grid’s infrastructure as well as a surge in demand.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3d036c4f-8ad0-458c-98fa-b15acd415658"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3eed1bb9-ccbe-4a66-a2aa-5f763025707a"/>
