		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7de57fe-a190-46bc-94d0-ab40609a8f28">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7de57fe-a190-46bc-94d0-ab40609a8f28</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With enough Republican support to pass the Senate, the announcement of the Postal Service Reform Act is an unexpected indication of bipartisan compromise in a divided Congress.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-86cb289f-07a2-4230-a325-a1b201d41c50"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-05-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7e12fdd-b9b6-4416-9c65-f8d5236d883e">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7e12fdd-b9b6-4416-9c65-f8d5236d883e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many Trump supporters simply do not believe that he can or will lose. And if he does come up short, they generally say he would be justified in questioning whether Democrats manipulated the outcome.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-a324d712-ee22-4eac-bc65-fe214fd68f1e"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ef6cc7eb-b6e8-4dba-84e0-6b42579e91d0"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-09-29"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7e19eaa-000a-4ca5-8293-eb0d371ddb7c">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7e19eaa-000a-4ca5-8293-eb0d371ddb7c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hundreds of people have already died in the fighting between Azerbaijan and Armenia. Bigger neighbors can help stop the bloodshed.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7e2cad1-7929-4300-b89e-e4ef71661613">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7e2cad1-7929-4300-b89e-e4ef71661613</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One doctor dreamed he was surrounded by coughing patients. “Most physicians have never seen this level of angst and anxiety in their careers,” a veteran emergency room doctor said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-dba2e23e-e63c-4342-a6f5-8dbfb7d2f734"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7e6fe50-0a68-441e-812d-cb99176dc6f8">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7e6fe50-0a68-441e-812d-cb99176dc6f8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Stuyvesant, Brooklyn Tech and other schools across the country are under pressure to end entrance exams. Students have complicated feelings about that.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-12de0d3c-4c34-4f95-85a8-abb5edb86193"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7e8fcdf-7745-47c8-9b43-2917fee81978">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7e8fcdf-7745-47c8-9b43-2917fee81978</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden also warned North Korea that if they choose to escalate their violations of U.N. resolutions that the U.S. “will respond accordingly.”</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7ed1b1b-e868-4b2e-8414-7ef9ff262789">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7ed1b1b-e868-4b2e-8414-7ef9ff262789</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The 22-year-old poet alluded to the Broadway musical in her Inauguration Day poem.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-861f4935-495e-4276-96ce-590c11ced034"/>
