		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7f05035-1232-4280-b59e-987292148eae">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7f05035-1232-4280-b59e-987292148eae</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden’s comment at the convention that “most cops are good” and that the bad ones need to be prosecuted struck an array of activists as discordant at a moment when many are calling for transformational change.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-295dc04c-bd5c-4dba-9271-bfd8a89ba851"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-08-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7fae7a1-767e-444a-ac69-1377f584802f">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7fae7a1-767e-444a-ac69-1377f584802f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Cases of the virus were being reported around the city and in the Police Department. “Every day I drive home, I start crying,” a nurse said.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-1a82d188-eb8e-47a0-acba-db708ddcc7a3"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-03-30"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e7fafbd4-fe62-43c6-98f0-0f1e89a9b228">
		<rdfs:label>article-e7fafbd4-fe62-43c6-98f0-0f1e89a9b228</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Crowds of migrants headed for border crossings after an appeals court ruled against the Trump administration’s “Remain in Mexico” policy for asylum seekers. But their hopes were short-lived.</rdfs:comment>
