		<rdfs:label>article-e83bb21f-e95a-4b17-a0fb-c7f5b7fed834</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One of the unit’s sharpshooters killed the gunman at Robb Elementary School; its members have Special Forces-type training and often target smuggling operations.</rdfs:comment>
