	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e8469729-c5e6-4c27-9dd2-7273c68ce9d2">
		<rdfs:label>article-e8469729-c5e6-4c27-9dd2-7273c68ce9d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Weeks into the job, Mr. Meadows has confronted the same problems that frustrated his three predecessors. It hasn’t helped him with his new White House colleagues that he’s emotional and sometimes cries.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
