	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e850bc71-8f9d-48c1-bb65-d3caf15ac239">
		<rdfs:label>article-e850bc71-8f9d-48c1-bb65-d3caf15ac239</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Teachers, we’d love to hear from you. How are you keeping your classroom up and running — even over video chat?</rdfs:comment>
