	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e85719cd-b736-415b-82e3-af1a4538990f">
		<rdfs:label>article-e85719cd-b736-415b-82e3-af1a4538990f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The efforts in two critical battleground states with booming populations and 70 Electoral College votes between them represent the apex of the Republican effort to roll back access to voting.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
