	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e8849cda-3b26-44fe-9b18-5477f36cff8c">
		<rdfs:label>article-e8849cda-3b26-44fe-9b18-5477f36cff8c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Trump has presented himself as someone who seeks conflict, not conciliation, a fighter, not a peacemaker. And he has lived up to his self-image at a perilous time.</rdfs:comment>
