	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e885ba35-7992-429f-b2ff-e6de493b1715">
		<rdfs:label>article-e885ba35-7992-429f-b2ff-e6de493b1715</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Supreme Court vacancy has only injected more chaos into the election. There are opportunities and perils for both parties.</rdfs:comment>
