		<rdfs:label>article-e88b3874-5de0-44a7-9863-31022d521f6f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>We rely on The Associated Press, but in some tightly contested races, we will evaluate the A.P. race calls before declaring a winner.</rdfs:comment>
