	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e88cd03c-8416-4e6a-bf5e-5dfc59a39c41">
		<rdfs:label>article-e88cd03c-8416-4e6a-bf5e-5dfc59a39c41</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As supporters of President Trump breached the nation’s Capitol on Wednesday, hundreds of other Trump supporters across the country gathered at state capitols, in some cases prompting evacuations and law enforcement mobilizations.</rdfs:comment>
