		<rdfs:label>article-e89255eb-4fc2-4222-bc56-25db93368cd2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Several unflattering memoirs about President Trump have come out this summer, but one potentially damaging book remains on the horizon: “Disloyal,” by Michael D. Cohen, his former fixer and lawyer.</rdfs:comment>
