		<rdfs:label>article-e892817a-7b1f-4864-8dad-4af5fe89e6a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A lawyer for President Trump’s former national security adviser called the request “theater,” portraying it as legally and practically impossible.</rdfs:comment>
