		<rdfs:label>article-e8938cff-e75a-4af2-ba34-0ae1d0485f20</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The order will affect thousands of people seeking to immigrate to the United States, but it does not apply to immigrants already in the country, nor to those seeking temporary visas.</rdfs:comment>
