		<rdfs:label>article-e8a52903-d458-4a27-8830-0f5cd0977503</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With just a handful of companies making U.S. infant formula, a shutdown of Abbott’s plant had outsized impact on the supply.</rdfs:comment>
