	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e8b74549-7a1d-403e-abfa-84b0a9ab849f">
		<rdfs:label>article-e8b74549-7a1d-403e-abfa-84b0a9ab849f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>More than 40 people have lain in state in the Capitol after their deaths. Some in Congress want the civil rights icon and 17-term congressman to receive the honor, even as the building remains closed to the public.</rdfs:comment>
