		<rdfs:label>article-e8da2c80-dfbf-4660-a6b6-e50bf2e796b2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Both hurricanes made landfall in southwest Florida, and with similar wind speeds. But Ian, far larger and moving more slowly, will likely cause worse damage.</rdfs:comment>
