		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e8dde7f5-6f6f-4552-bda2-71b34f51f7b1">
		<rdfs:label>article-e8dde7f5-6f6f-4552-bda2-71b34f51f7b1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A reluctance by some liberal district attorneys to bring criminal charges against abortion providers is already complicating the legal landscape in some states.</rdfs:comment>
