	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e8dff047-fc0c-4903-8a95-1112e123f958">
		<rdfs:label>article-e8dff047-fc0c-4903-8a95-1112e123f958</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Yet for all the heart-pounding narrative of that day presented on the Senate floor, what was also striking was how many questions remained unanswered.</rdfs:comment>
