	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e8e25bae-a4cf-4baa-8487-28d06276fe77">
		<rdfs:label>article-e8e25bae-a4cf-4baa-8487-28d06276fe77</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Health officials in South Carolina said on Thursday that they had detected two cases of a more contagious variant of the coronavirus that emerged in South Africa. It was the first report of that variant being detected in the United States.</rdfs:comment>
