		<rdfs:label>article-e8e78835-44ef-4575-bc4a-486c9b684385</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Border Patrol agents once ordered an elderly Hispanic man out of his vehicle and requested his identity papers, which showed that he was a Mexican-born immigrant named Raúl H. Castro. Turns out he was Arizona’s former governor.</rdfs:comment>
