		<rdfs:label>article-e906a11f-c3ce-4d61-8045-f397abe7a667</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials nationwide were rethinking their efforts to slow the virus, which the nation’s top infectious disease expert said were “not working.”</rdfs:comment>
