	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9888260-8051-4d0b-b9e0-d3d297f27b8c">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9888260-8051-4d0b-b9e0-d3d297f27b8c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The legal reasoning that the Supreme Court’s conservative bloc is considering to end abortion rights could uproot a series of other past rulings that created modern rights.</rdfs:comment>
