	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e988c150-de64-43af-b93d-cf3b2e438da4">
		<rdfs:label>article-e988c150-de64-43af-b93d-cf3b2e438da4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The panel once planned to hold all its public hearings in June and issue a final report by September. Now, more hearings are possible and findings probably won’t be complete until December.</rdfs:comment>
