	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e98a0889-0135-40d8-b1e9-274f3b574af3">
		<rdfs:label>article-e98a0889-0135-40d8-b1e9-274f3b574af3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The story of that week, and the secret planning in the months preceding it, ranks as the most perilous chapter so far in President Trump’s three years in office.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-43071aec-9461-4281-991c-f7a69b5d74cf"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4ba1c7ec-56dd-4804-9436-b85ef07cc18e"/>
