	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9974fac-5441-481c-b296-fe030ee0f5a7">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9974fac-5441-481c-b296-fe030ee0f5a7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Thursday: Gov. Gavin Newsom announced protections for homeowners. But many renters are still on the hook. Also: Cultivating your own garden.</rdfs:comment>
