	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e99d3523-b3f1-453f-a0e6-86451d5f2b73">
		<rdfs:label>article-e99d3523-b3f1-453f-a0e6-86451d5f2b73</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On the eve of the state’s primary on Tuesday, mainstream Republicans have been vying to stop an election denier running for Senate.</rdfs:comment>
