	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9a9b5dc-6e45-4545-9bb9-4615b3dd7831">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9a9b5dc-6e45-4545-9bb9-4615b3dd7831</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>This is the first election in which a substantial number of candidates for major offices are election deniers or conspiracy theorists.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-be4a3e54-4b34-4f4b-b446-90f3692a587d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-11-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9aa884d-098d-4c23-96ac-42f84520c2de">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9aa884d-098d-4c23-96ac-42f84520c2de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ms. Healey, a Democrat, is the best known of the candidates who are running to replace Gov. Charlie Baker, a Republican who is not seeking re-election.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d3a2df06-dc48-4fab-a9d1-d1d12442e2e1"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-01-20"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9acf82e-20c5-45b4-baad-98ff2d630a89">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9acf82e-20c5-45b4-baad-98ff2d630a89</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president said he wanted to ensure the area was rebuilt in a way that made it more resilient to natural disasters that he described as a consequence of climate change.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-558cc815-e7e6-47a5-bd90-ac5a453042ba"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-74659e03-2c48-4140-91f4-08e5d544f77a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9ae573a-f4cf-4b2f-bb69-eb420a347435">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9ae573a-f4cf-4b2f-bb69-eb420a347435</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president also defended his opposition to eliminating the Senate filibuster, even though it is being used to block voting rights legislation he has championed.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6c995819-c171-430e-a414-f6167b134557"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-07-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9b011e7-6411-4ea4-8a41-d958d0b0468d">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9b011e7-6411-4ea4-8a41-d958d0b0468d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Gretchen Whitmer announced the changes a day after President Biden called for eligibility for all adults by May 1.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-ae47edf3-29dc-462d-b74b-f886ebf56402"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-03-12"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9b05159-e343-4285-81f5-d628b2d3ad09">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9b05159-e343-4285-81f5-d628b2d3ad09</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The legislation, which garnered some Republican support, would recognize same-sex marriages at the federal level. It faces an uncertain path in the Senate.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6ad17262-bcec-4f3b-b853-6b8ecf07f3d4"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-07-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9b26bb7-ea55-4e53-928e-822c03dfd18e">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9b26bb7-ea55-4e53-928e-822c03dfd18e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Pat A. Cipollone and Patrick F. Philbin are the most senior former Trump aides known to have been interviewed in the investigation into his handling of classified material.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-08-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9b48f6b-a142-48e6-a1aa-c491dd3860c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9b48f6b-a142-48e6-a1aa-c491dd3860c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden’s narrow lead in Georgia and the runoffs that will determine control of the Senate have raised questions as to whether 2020 is a Trumpian aberration or a long-anticipated political shift.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-5298104c-81c8-4a22-af1d-23823869871b"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d7a0b17f-e0aa-44c5-a995-e81e028fa879"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-08"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9b86d7b-c9db-400c-917e-681027e51407">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9b86d7b-c9db-400c-917e-681027e51407</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Food and Drug Administration on Friday authorized booster shots of both the Pfizer-BioNTech and Moderna vaccines for everyone 18 and older, opening up eligibility to tens of millions more fully vaccinated adults.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-3263b980-a580-440f-bdd2-6d7fa7bb3fab"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e4ac7a5-be1a-4937-b91e-66276e5f8dd9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9bb5ecb-3bfa-45db-9195-5509e9569911">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9bb5ecb-3bfa-45db-9195-5509e9569911</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the country waits for ballot tallies in a handful of crucial battleground states, the Trump campaign has pursued lawsuits in Michigan and Pennsylvania, and said that it would demand a recount in Wisconsin.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0e0b303b-c0b3-434e-8875-b76575779c09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6e824080-8ad3-4c0a-b254-2fc28d4e3d77"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c91cf9a3-1d2c-4954-8d84-ac52314ce23a"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-11-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9bc9da8-498d-4124-a6a6-f404f30330ea">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9bc9da8-498d-4124-a6a6-f404f30330ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As scholars consider the legacy of Donald J. Trump, it appears that even the woefully inadequate James Buchanan has some serious competition.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-19a85a44-1ec9-486d-a179-a97a1e8231de"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-23"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9bff7d2-174a-484a-abaa-42e182a36b77">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9bff7d2-174a-484a-abaa-42e182a36b77</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>American policy decisions are vital to understanding Haiti’s political instability, and why it remains the poorest country in the Western Hemisphere.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-e0dfbf0e-c179-4f28-a968-4570f9209555"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-12-19"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9c2640d-23af-41fc-8ebc-20cd2e0ad842">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9c2640d-23af-41fc-8ebc-20cd2e0ad842</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Moncef Slaoui, the chief adviser for the Trump administration’s coronavirus vaccine program, can remain a government contractor, thus shielding him from disclosure rules.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4e4ac7a5-be1a-4937-b91e-66276e5f8dd9"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-15"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9c5a431-9867-48c8-85eb-50193df5fcee">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9c5a431-9867-48c8-85eb-50193df5fcee</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president said he wanted a much larger package than the $1.8 trillion measure under discussion. The top Senate Republican said his party could not accept a deal anywhere near that big.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b06f805-a6f6-4cda-9908-3f8ddd3a0432"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-99c317df-85f6-43ae-a405-4e8c1bdcbc98"/>
