	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9d5245e-47d2-4c0f-99b5-44bd61da99c5">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9d5245e-47d2-4c0f-99b5-44bd61da99c5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In his first rally in months, President Trump made multiple statements that were false, misleading or lacked evidence.</rdfs:comment>
