	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-e9d65092-0768-4a49-b462-66e505ec7e19">
		<rdfs:label>article-e9d65092-0768-4a49-b462-66e505ec7e19</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. O’Connor succeeds Dr. Sean P. Conley, who drew criticism for misleading the public after President Donald J. Trump contracted the coronavirus last year.</rdfs:comment>
