	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-eb662485-d6d0-45bf-a850-caf811e81f22">
		<rdfs:label>article-eb662485-d6d0-45bf-a850-caf811e81f22</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Auditors in Washington State found that the mail ballots of Black voters were being rejected at four times the rate of white voters. Similar trends have been seen in other states.</rdfs:comment>
