	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-eb69ba18-03aa-4eb4-a31d-f9192112fc3b">
		<rdfs:label>article-eb69ba18-03aa-4eb4-a31d-f9192112fc3b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>No one is happy in this strange and awful time. But there is a particular circle of unhappiness reserved for people still reeling from unexpected loss in 2016.</rdfs:comment>
