		<rdfs:label>article-ebaeaaaf-26a1-4b55-aaab-e81d1eb28ff1</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As they survey a grim political landscape for their party, three senior House Democrats opt for retirement and lament the factionalism within their ranks.</rdfs:comment>
