	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ebb1d0f2-cec1-42d7-bc07-6ceac3cbd052">
		<rdfs:label>article-ebb1d0f2-cec1-42d7-bc07-6ceac3cbd052</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The findings confirm years of complaints that women have made against the department for perpetuating a culture of harassment and mishandling claims of misconduct.</rdfs:comment>
