		<rdfs:label>article-ebb4733e-4e2b-405d-bab4-003084dfa958</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The ugly fights over the two congresswomen proved that Representative Kevin McCarthy, the Republican leader, remains trapped under former President Donald J. Trump’s shadow.</rdfs:comment>
