	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ebc1b539-ea84-4cc3-b600-bdf77391866b">
		<rdfs:label>article-ebc1b539-ea84-4cc3-b600-bdf77391866b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The mayor of Surfside, Fla., said he was not “philosophically comfortable” ordering the evacuation of the building to the north.</rdfs:comment>
