	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ebcbba2a-6cbb-4c02-a202-5cf550bfb0b8">
		<rdfs:label>article-ebcbba2a-6cbb-4c02-a202-5cf550bfb0b8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Last year, the court ruled 5 to 4 that much of the state is an Indian reservation. Oklahoma wants a do-over, testing the court’s respect for the power of precedent.</rdfs:comment>
