		<rdfs:label>article-ebcfa111-b586-4eee-9773-f340700439f2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mrs. Trump used her husband’s victory in November 2016 as an opportunity to solidify her financial standing, for herself and for the couple’s son, Barron, the book says.</rdfs:comment>
