		<rdfs:label>article-ebd36db0-c9e3-4683-b074-8e9142aad648</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The sole black Republican senator cited his personal experiences with racism as a vital perspective to his party’s approach to a law enforcement overhaul.</rdfs:comment>
