		<rdfs:label>article-ebd52c99-9e8a-4219-a340-b7074ebb7e15</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The nation’s first Black-owned pool club aims to teach hundreds of children to swim this summer, helping to close a dangerous racial gap in the process.</rdfs:comment>
