		<rdfs:label>article-ebd591ba-3be4-4d1b-9b27-1b57e8cbcb3f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Ernest Shackleton’s ship Endurance was crushed by Antarctic ice in 1915. Now, a team of researchers is heading to the Weddell Sea where it went down.</rdfs:comment>
