		<rdfs:label>article-ebe0b96b-2cbf-4aad-a5bd-1033785b6b5f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“It’s respectful; this was a tragedy,” said one resident of Surfside, Fla., where a condo building collapsed.</rdfs:comment>
