		<rdfs:label>article-ebe498d3-26a3-401b-9ff4-45bdca3c5c42</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Although New York and San Francisco continue to require masks, Atlanta, Philadelphia, Chicago and the nationwide Amtrak rail system have ended mandates.</rdfs:comment>
