	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ebe63024-ff4f-4490-9099-f95531a35421">
		<rdfs:label>article-ebe63024-ff4f-4490-9099-f95531a35421</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Masterpiece Cakeshop case, involving similar issues, was argued exactly five years ago — and decided on June 4, 2018.</rdfs:comment>
