		<rdfs:label>article-ebee7f66-fd26-45a8-b3b3-60a59debccc5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Liberal groups had already ramped up efforts to win over veterans and military families in swing states, where even a small shift could prove decisive.</rdfs:comment>
