	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed3740e9-74bc-4141-965c-d62ebc3cfb0d">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed3740e9-74bc-4141-965c-d62ebc3cfb0d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A memo from Peter Navarro is the most direct warning known to have circulated at a key moment among top administration officials.</rdfs:comment>
