	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed391ac9-e512-43f5-8ed0-9e78ff7958dc">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed391ac9-e512-43f5-8ed0-9e78ff7958dc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Taliban leaders have been pressuring the Uzbek government to turn over the pilots, who fear for the safety of themselves and their families.</rdfs:comment>
