	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed39ca7d-f3ab-4dd7-8906-8cc595d2633c">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed39ca7d-f3ab-4dd7-8906-8cc595d2633c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A devastating email breach of the D.N.C. roiled Democrats in the final months of 2016. An unassuming security official made it his mission to prevent a recurrence.</rdfs:comment>
