	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed454a7e-cf11-42b6-bf3d-b2841bc82683">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed454a7e-cf11-42b6-bf3d-b2841bc82683</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Four dozen candidates, including Sarah Palin and Santa Claus, are facing a complex election schedule to follow the man who represented Alaska for 49 years.</rdfs:comment>
