	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed473ada-9963-49db-beb7-8390b6686c58">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed473ada-9963-49db-beb7-8390b6686c58</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Those left behind must grieve in a country still firmly gripped by the coronavirus pandemic. Everywhere they turn, there is a reminder of their pain.</rdfs:comment>
