	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed48e602-cf78-487a-811e-0ed5893b5881">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed48e602-cf78-487a-811e-0ed5893b5881</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. has selected Xavier Becerra, a former congressman who is now the Democratic attorney general of California, as his nominee for secretary of health and human services, ending a politically delicate search that brought complaints from the Congressional Hispanic Caucus about a lack of Latinos in the incoming cabinet.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9f6de486-2c48-474d-84c4-ae7a2ad3d34b"/>
