		<rdfs:label>article-ed529dd3-d145-4b63-b1a9-9e3b6be1920b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A remarkable undefeated season for the California School for the Deaf football team brightens a community ravaged by the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
