		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed98b0ca-3b80-488f-a286-78931f95ea0e">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed98b0ca-3b80-488f-a286-78931f95ea0e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the run-up to an August primary, a number of Republicans on the ballot in Arizona — like those in Ohio — have rushed to embrace Donald J. Trump and his stolen-election falsehoods.</rdfs:comment>
