		<rdfs:label>article-ed9b60cc-8801-4055-84aa-ab6711b31bb7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a tweet, the president said that gathering world leaders in person would be a sign of “normalization.” None immediately rejected the idea.</rdfs:comment>
