		<rdfs:label>article-ed9ba82f-b43c-42d3-8c13-5bfa432caf52</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president is traveling to Atlanta with Vice President Kamala Harris as part of an effort to sell lawmakers and the public on major voting rights legislation.</rdfs:comment>
