	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ed9cd743-ac3f-4ec4-a864-19b1b339a991">
		<rdfs:label>article-ed9cd743-ac3f-4ec4-a864-19b1b339a991</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The policy is standard in industrial shipping and sorting facilities, to minimize worker distractions.</rdfs:comment>
