		<rdfs:label>article-eda2805d-f1cf-46d7-8b17-654d1e25370b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Some Americans cheered the moves, mostly by Democratic governors, but others questioned the timing, with more than 200,000 new virus infections being reported each day.</rdfs:comment>
