	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-edb66350-5f48-454a-aeb2-25980b062ff5">
		<rdfs:label>article-edb66350-5f48-454a-aeb2-25980b062ff5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Kirsten Gillibrand, a Democrat from New York, has pushed for the legislation for years and finally has bipartisan support for the bill.</rdfs:comment>
