		<rdfs:label>article-edc2ceb4-e596-45a0-ad0f-22110720f193</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With Republicans divided and President Trump undercutting negotiations on a pandemic relief package, the majority leader is in a difficult bind, partly of his own making.</rdfs:comment>
