		<rdfs:label>article-edc31f92-2c82-412a-b84e-bf290a6f2bf8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Chad F. Wolf, the head of the department overseeing the agency leading inauguration security, announced that he would resign as acting secretary on Monday night.</rdfs:comment>
