	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-edcba472-7c85-46fc-939e-a7eeb1abf28d">
		<rdfs:label>article-edcba472-7c85-46fc-939e-a7eeb1abf28d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Why do you think there is so much interest in obsolete technologies like Polaroid instant cameras, record players, Atari game systems or VHS tapes?</rdfs:comment>
