	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-edd16792-4082-4acf-b595-b17fb90635e8">
		<rdfs:label>article-edd16792-4082-4acf-b595-b17fb90635e8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A chorus of governors from across the political spectrum is challenging the Trump administration’s assertion that the United States is well-stocked to test and care for coronavirus patients.</rdfs:comment>
