		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-edd98ba9-ccb9-43c1-89b7-530859aef269">
		<rdfs:label>article-edd98ba9-ccb9-43c1-89b7-530859aef269</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus pandemic and new requirements in Republican-led states created voting obstacles for college students this year. Yet youth participation appears to be on the rise.</rdfs:comment>
