		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-07-16"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ede01281-2109-4502-bb6f-51012ea50044">
		<rdfs:label>article-ede01281-2109-4502-bb6f-51012ea50044</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Justice Department told an appeals court that a federal judge was wrong to intervene in its investigation into the former president’s hoarding of sensitive records.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-010e943a-d70f-4929-8957-2d55ddf6a675"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-10-14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ede08f83-da3f-4449-91dd-995a1fa1ac37">
		<rdfs:label>article-ede08f83-da3f-4449-91dd-995a1fa1ac37</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a debate for Virginia governor, Mr. Fairfax, the state’s lieutenant governor, denounced Mr. McAuliffe for urging him to resign after women accused Mr. Fairfax of sexual assault in 2019.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-45f2da0f-ff11-4bf4-a433-0a1b35060358"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-04-07"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-edeaa90e-74d9-48c3-8350-2d8edbe09d3d">
		<rdfs:label>article-edeaa90e-74d9-48c3-8350-2d8edbe09d3d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Heavy rains swamped a reservoir and pushed the Pearl River over its banks, forcing evacuations.</rdfs:comment>
