		<rdfs:label>article-ee963238-b812-41b3-87f0-acfc9d8a94ca</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In interviews, dozens of frustrated Democratic officials, members of Congress and voters expressed doubts about the president’s ability to rescue his reeling party and take the fight to Republicans.</rdfs:comment>
