	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ee9ab038-6e71-4974-8a2f-a38993a9ae52">
		<rdfs:label>article-ee9ab038-6e71-4974-8a2f-a38993a9ae52</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The urge among some residents to leave because of the coronavirus may be temporary. But it follows a deeper, more powerful demographic trend.</rdfs:comment>
