	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ee9ff61c-7450-4639-a716-03795618881b">
		<rdfs:label>article-ee9ff61c-7450-4639-a716-03795618881b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>‘We have waited for all of this for so long,’ the superstar soprano said.</rdfs:comment>
