	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-eea1a9de-5955-4e2c-8464-2c344eb165a4">
		<rdfs:label>article-eea1a9de-5955-4e2c-8464-2c344eb165a4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The court dismissed a suit by the former president seeking to bar a House committee from getting his returns, but the judge stayed the ruling to allow time for an appeal.</rdfs:comment>
