	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-eea32386-c0a0-4ad7-bd4b-6fbaf0b1b32a">
		<rdfs:label>article-eea32386-c0a0-4ad7-bd4b-6fbaf0b1b32a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Half a decade after a spate of officer-involved deaths inspired widespread protest, many police unions are digging in to defend members.</rdfs:comment>
