		<rdfs:label>article-ef37fca6-2c7a-4900-8755-7aa72faae830</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The popular professor, who left Harvard in 2002 after a dispute with its president, says he may leave again if the university does not grant him tenure.</rdfs:comment>
