	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ef5597ba-e6f9-4d70-b5a0-8737de74eab8">
		<rdfs:label>article-ef5597ba-e6f9-4d70-b5a0-8737de74eab8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With official results from Iowa in limbo, Pete Buttigieg and other presidential candidates sought to put their campaigns in the most favorable light before the New Hampshire primary.</rdfs:comment>
