		<rdfs:label>article-ef6226b5-be2c-49dc-acd5-37d6f7e64d4c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The masks will be distributed at pharmacies and community health centers, but some public health experts said the effort was coming too late.</rdfs:comment>
