		<rdfs:label>article-ef68186c-1798-477d-994f-78274a60f719</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The administration says it aims to replace all of the lead pipes and service lines in the country, an effort that could cost up to $60 billion.</rdfs:comment>
