		<rdfs:label>article-ef9c7732-ae69-4a69-931a-2f4a29792271</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the view of some American diplomats, Mr. Johnson’s willingness to carry out President Trump’s request to seek the British government’s help in moving the British Open to his golf resort in Scotland was only the latest example of the envoy’s poor judgment.</rdfs:comment>
