	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-efa10e4f-77a9-45d3-ac55-3136cbb0f6b5">
		<rdfs:label>article-efa10e4f-77a9-45d3-ac55-3136cbb0f6b5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Live television viewership of Monday’s opening night of the Democratic National Convention fell by roughly 25 percent from 2016, according to Nielsen, with MSNBC emerging as the clear winner among the major networks.</rdfs:comment>
