		<rdfs:label>article-efa173be-787c-49b7-961e-d3e7e48a3209</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Charles Homans, a New York Times reporter who lived in Alaska during Palin’s ascent, reflects on the state’s astonishing political transformation.</rdfs:comment>
