		<rdfs:label>article-efa4d7a4-2955-4246-b3dd-af087535ce55</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The New York Times spoke to 10 experts in aging to paint a picture of what the next six years might look like for a person of the president’s age.</rdfs:comment>
