		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-12-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-efaec6d5-26bd-445d-9f6f-d70fb56e310b">
		<rdfs:label>article-efaec6d5-26bd-445d-9f6f-d70fb56e310b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mike Pence talked about the pandemic and the protests, but most G.O.P. convention speeches have seemed like holdovers from January.</rdfs:comment>
