	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-eff3e684-ba48-49a5-8afe-8b8d42c35544">
		<rdfs:label>article-eff3e684-ba48-49a5-8afe-8b8d42c35544</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The process bypassed the formal procedures used by past presidents and was driven instead by friendship, fame, personal empathy and a shared sense of persecution.</rdfs:comment>
