		<rdfs:label>article-f0086b44-3dfb-4f03-b248-696174730466</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senators Cory Booker, Tim Scott and Raphael Warnock brought vastly different perspectives to proceedings that highlighted the Senate’s striking lack of diversity.</rdfs:comment>
