	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f00f2636-3bed-4a32-ac33-cec8473d490e">
		<rdfs:label>article-f00f2636-3bed-4a32-ac33-cec8473d490e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Minnesota Republicans celebrated election victories with a gala party. A state senator’s death from Covid-19 underlined the consequences of the G.O.P.’s rejection of health experts’ guidance.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-c2e66850-f7bc-45ca-83ed-c0a1f8490a14"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-18"/>
