	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f018b4fd-6446-44a4-ba8c-514902ec167c">
		<rdfs:label>article-f018b4fd-6446-44a4-ba8c-514902ec167c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A new plan calls for releasing parents and their children after no more than 72 hours. Researchers say children can show symptoms of trauma after spending long periods in custody.</rdfs:comment>
