		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f01a0fd5-b000-4156-a1ca-2d7503b77b0f">
		<rdfs:label>article-f01a0fd5-b000-4156-a1ca-2d7503b77b0f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Of the more than 200 Republicans Mr. Trump has endorsed this year, many ran unopposed or faced little-known, poorly funded opponents.</rdfs:comment>
