	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f02ae4af-cccb-4964-aba3-453b840397b7">
		<rdfs:label>article-f02ae4af-cccb-4964-aba3-453b840397b7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a party retreat in Philadelphia, House Democrats hoped the president would offer a winning strategy heading into a challenging midterm election season.</rdfs:comment>
