	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f0353f47-eb3b-4702-b64b-a527e0614ba9">
		<rdfs:label>article-f0353f47-eb3b-4702-b64b-a527e0614ba9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Charles Kushner, the father of President Trump’s son-in-law Jared Kushner, admitted in an email to a close confidante on Wednesday that the president’s behavior was “beyond our control.”</rdfs:comment>
