		<rdfs:comment>Two Republican candidates, Senator Kelly Loeffler and David Perdue, whose Senate term ended Sunday, are battling to keep their seats in Georgia’s runoff election. If their Democratic challengers, Jon Ossoff and the Rev. Raphael Warnock, both win, Democrats will reclaim the Senate majority.</rdfs:comment>
