		<rdfs:label>article-f1259f57-0414-4b3e-a5bc-42e277152b9a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A majority of American voters support demonstrations on police brutality, and many see the president as ill-equipped on racial justice.</rdfs:comment>
