	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f12687d5-e7c8-40c0-b687-46c6e4a3cadc">
		<rdfs:label>article-f12687d5-e7c8-40c0-b687-46c6e4a3cadc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Volodymyr Zelensky wanted to make a dramatic move in the war against Russia. U.S. and Ukrainian officials came up with a plan.</rdfs:comment>
