	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f12ddb26-0a93-4552-9956-c80abff00026">
		<rdfs:label>article-f12ddb26-0a93-4552-9956-c80abff00026</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As millions of American students head back to their desks, the virus testing that was supposed to help keep classrooms open safely is itself being tested.</rdfs:comment>
