	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f131cac6-dea5-420c-b858-9dc20dded2de">
		<rdfs:label>article-f131cac6-dea5-420c-b858-9dc20dded2de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Young people who vote: They are the holy grail of any presidential campaign, but regularly getting them energized and excited is a yet-to-be-cracked formula.</rdfs:comment>
