		<rdfs:label>article-f18a7bec-3f3b-4aae-ab4b-cb7b469fb0e0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The renewed bid for office by Mr. Johnson, who has spread many false claims about the 2020 election and Covid, ensures that both parties will be highly invested in Wisconsin’s 2022 Senate race.</rdfs:comment>
