	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f18d0317-08f2-46cc-87e4-e2d6d47700d8">
		<rdfs:label>article-f18d0317-08f2-46cc-87e4-e2d6d47700d8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>For years, they were “sisters in service,” taking on the old guard and boosting one another’s careers. A rare open mayoral seat changed that.</rdfs:comment>
