		<rdfs:label>article-f18ec9d5-170c-4a6e-9548-0c1ac270506e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Representative Liz Cheney of Wyoming, the No. 3 House Republican, announced on Tuesday that she would vote to impeach President Trump, saying there had “never been a greater betrayal by a president of the United States” than Mr. Trump’s incitement of a mob that attacked the Capitol last week.</rdfs:comment>
