		<rdfs:label>article-f1993b77-1c86-4bf9-80e5-8ad7f7bb97bd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After 14 years in the military, Ashli Babbitt bought a pool supply company and delved into far-right politics.</rdfs:comment>
