	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f19ffdb4-0deb-46d2-b480-8ffb39d43b0a">
		<rdfs:label>article-f19ffdb4-0deb-46d2-b480-8ffb39d43b0a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president pressed the secretary, Brad Raffensperger, to “find” enough ballots for him to overturn the election.</rdfs:comment>
