	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f1a676e8-9209-43f1-856a-75f75a4e3c87">
		<rdfs:label>article-f1a676e8-9209-43f1-856a-75f75a4e3c87</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Joe Biden won all three states that held primary contests on Tuesday, forcing Bernie Sanders to reassess the future of his campaign in a race that has been upended by a public health crisis.</rdfs:comment>
