	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f1a9a198-33c3-4ca8-86f9-bbb71f6899fd">
		<rdfs:label>article-f1a9a198-33c3-4ca8-86f9-bbb71f6899fd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senator Ron Johnson, the Wisconsin Republican who tested positive for the coronavirus this week and whose state has experienced a recent record surge in virus cases, said on Saturday that he continues to oppose mask-wearing mandates.</rdfs:comment>
