		<rdfs:label>article-f3788390-9df7-45d1-a6d5-312ec5d6070a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Rick Snyder, the former governor, faces two misdemeanor counts in the crisis, which left thousands of Flint residents drinking tainted water.</rdfs:comment>
