		<rdfs:label>article-f3b2b650-e4cb-44a0-9761-f2d8553295d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>An open letter urged them to take many of the defensive steps that the federal government requires of its agencies and contractors.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-b6772619-716a-4e22-b807-36e658c83435"/>
