		<rdfs:label>article-f429d2c7-8531-4dfb-8525-c0387756a2e7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden will announce new steps on Tuesday to confront a staggering surge in coronavirus cases, including readying 1,000 military medical professionals to help at overburdened hospitals, setting up new federal testing sites, deploying hundreds of federal vaccinators and buying 500 million rapid tests to distribute free to the public.</rdfs:comment>
