	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f49ff2a5-a426-4529-a64e-e445fdeff035">
		<rdfs:label>article-f49ff2a5-a426-4529-a64e-e445fdeff035</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As coronavirus cases nationwide have plateaued, at least 20 states have committed in recent days to widening the list of people who may get a vaccine.</rdfs:comment>
