	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f4a53d85-df49-4a40-a49a-cbf894d9ee6c">
		<rdfs:label>article-f4a53d85-df49-4a40-a49a-cbf894d9ee6c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The hospital in Arizona’s Yuma County, on the border, is so overwhelmed it’s had to fly Covid-19 patients to other cities. No other region has had a higher case rate during the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-4b043cde-c9ac-41fc-91ae-7eae6c420e38"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-01-22"/>
