		<rdfs:label>article-f4ab14df-0aae-4e43-8e03-f9bf6333b07a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In the latest twists in a highly politicized case, Michael Flynn’s lawyers are trying to force a judge to end the case immediately, and the F.B.I. will weigh whether it committed misconduct.</rdfs:comment>
