		<rdfs:label>article-f4b668f5-67b9-48fb-83d4-6b0d42d542d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>It was the 13th and final scheduled federal execution under President Trump. President-elect Joseph R. Biden Jr. has said he opposes the death penalty.</rdfs:comment>
