		<rdfs:label>article-f4cf1464-d775-47d3-91af-0879a2d41f58</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Yang, who ran unsuccessfully for president in 2020 and for mayor of New York this year, said he could be more “honest” about politics if he were not a Democrat.</rdfs:comment>
