	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f4cfd3f3-b597-4b7e-8284-255fa312002b">
		<rdfs:label>article-f4cfd3f3-b597-4b7e-8284-255fa312002b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There’s no doubt who must be held responsible for attacking the Capitol and trying to overturn the results of the election.</rdfs:comment>
