		<rdfs:label>article-f4d25ad9-a30f-49be-87de-8ebf712c911d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration has been bracing for congressional investigations, cognizant of the serious political threat posed by even a narrow Republican majority in the House.</rdfs:comment>
