		<rdfs:label>article-f4d2b0de-1758-4ccd-9a50-2275499c15e9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dr. Robert M. Califf, an academic and clinical trial researcher who ran the agency in 2016, has also consulted for pharmaceutical companies.</rdfs:comment>
