		<rdfs:label>article-f4d2e26e-060c-49c6-b67e-86d955aa545a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The designation for the World War I-era killings would further fray U.S. relations with Turkey, but it is a risk the president appears willing to take to further human rights, officials said.</rdfs:comment>
