	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f4d2faaa-8d7d-42da-b43f-d48dfa54a5df">
		<rdfs:label>article-f4d2faaa-8d7d-42da-b43f-d48dfa54a5df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>How will progressive Democrats fare against moderate rivals? What signals will North Carolina Republicans send? And in Pennsylvania, will Kathy Barnette concede a loss?</rdfs:comment>
