	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f4dfd479-a177-46b8-950c-5289ce1924f0">
		<rdfs:label>article-f4dfd479-a177-46b8-950c-5289ce1924f0</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden said President Vladimir V. Putin of Russia would “never succeed in dominating” Ukraine.</rdfs:comment>
