	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f5a30672-b106-4047-8ed9-517f8f3291ea">
		<rdfs:label>article-f5a30672-b106-4047-8ed9-517f8f3291ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Pence will probably be pressed to defend President Trump’s handling of the coronavirus, and his own actions as well. Ms. Harris will have to defend not just her record, but also Joe Biden’s.</rdfs:comment>
