	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f5a4e503-dbf3-4407-9277-10443c768fbb">
		<rdfs:label>article-f5a4e503-dbf3-4407-9277-10443c768fbb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move is the latest in the Trump administration’s efforts to impose limits on Chinese students. But university officials say the government is paranoid, and that the United States will lose out.</rdfs:comment>
