		<rdfs:label>article-f5a802f9-3f82-4ed6-99b8-1181320d1db8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mayor Ted Wheeler said he wanted to “unmask” demonstrators who engaged in property destruction. The Oregon city has seen regular demonstrations since the murder of George Floyd.</rdfs:comment>
