	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f5a96acb-e393-4090-aceb-18b48fb8ef59">
		<rdfs:label>article-f5a96acb-e393-4090-aceb-18b48fb8ef59</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Religious schools should have the same access to scholarships and funds as other private schools, the justices ruled, in a victory for conservatives.</rdfs:comment>
