	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f5d1724c-5f40-4034-98f4-b7aca7c35959">
		<rdfs:label>article-f5d1724c-5f40-4034-98f4-b7aca7c35959</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Taking a cue from the battered restaurant industry during the pandemic, the Girl Scouts of the U.S.A. said this week that they would offer contactless delivery and pickup of their cookies through Grubhub.</rdfs:comment>
