	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f6091b81-a3ba-4d28-a7cd-cc590f0ca4aa">
		<rdfs:label>article-f6091b81-a3ba-4d28-a7cd-cc590f0ca4aa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“I’m going to win the election, and I will accept that result,” Kari Lake, a candidate for governor of Arizona, said on CNN. Evan McMullin said on NBC that he would never caucus with either party.</rdfs:comment>
