	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f60dc036-84fd-4d99-9918-e21e5ca25ce3">
		<rdfs:label>article-f60dc036-84fd-4d99-9918-e21e5ca25ce3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>BERLIN — Chancellor Angela Merkel of Germany refuses as a rule to comment on the internal affairs of other countries or pass judgment on their leaders. But that hasn’t stopped her from letting her face do the talking, reflecting confusion, befuddlement or exasperation regarding President Trump as the situation required. On Friday, she was at it again.</rdfs:comment>
