	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f6421731-2d20-4bc4-b5b0-07aec16c4fe5">
		<rdfs:label>article-f6421731-2d20-4bc4-b5b0-07aec16c4fe5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A federal judge declined to stay her order that Senator Lindsey Graham of South Carolina appear on Tuesday before a special grand jury in Atlanta.</rdfs:comment>
