	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f6483bf5-033c-407e-a982-0d099f8f73f5">
		<rdfs:label>article-f6483bf5-033c-407e-a982-0d099f8f73f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hospitals are stretched thin in a few hot spots, but the vaccines are working and the national outlook remains far better than during previous surges.</rdfs:comment>
