		<rdfs:label>article-f7cc25a3-1a23-4a62-a9af-240e24e86610</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Although the former United Nations ambassador calibrated her comments, her sharp criticism represented a departure from other Republicans who are believed to be considering running for president in 2024.</rdfs:comment>
