	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f838bb19-09d8-4b18-b692-cec0563fce44">
		<rdfs:label>article-f838bb19-09d8-4b18-b692-cec0563fce44</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a Times newsroom dominated by men, Linda Amster was the only researcher on one of the biggest scoops of the century. Why did her name not appear in the paper?</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-06-09"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f838fbb4-7e30-4607-82ff-313f9fd14f1c">
		<rdfs:label>article-f838fbb4-7e30-4607-82ff-313f9fd14f1c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nearly all have faced calls to resign, and only some have heeded them. But few have faced an inquiry as expansive and public as the one into the New York governor’s actions.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-9c6cc67a-b3c2-45c5-af7a-92a423ab1249"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-08-03"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f83978e2-7e94-4e57-880a-41de20425b4e">
		<rdfs:label>article-f83978e2-7e94-4e57-880a-41de20425b4e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president said any push to “fundamentally alter” the Senate’s 60-vote threshold would have to wait until after Congress passed his vast spending agenda.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-d9dd9624-a9f6-46b2-b101-110db9155c7d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-10-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f83aedf0-80f6-4247-aa62-6d1fabeaf158">
		<rdfs:label>article-f83aedf0-80f6-4247-aa62-6d1fabeaf158</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As cases surge and hospital beds fill up, federal officials said a vaccine could be distributed to as many as 24 million people by mid-January.</rdfs:comment>
