		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f83af7a9-f230-45f1-8233-1ced6d68631a">
		<rdfs:label>article-f83af7a9-f230-45f1-8233-1ced6d68631a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Facing the brunt of scrutiny in the United States, Chinese-Americans have also scrambled to help friends and family in China.</rdfs:comment>
