	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f83d8856-2564-4d16-b867-f00328f204de">
		<rdfs:label>article-f83d8856-2564-4d16-b867-f00328f204de</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The victory by Senator Catherine Cortez Masto, Democrats’ most endangered incumbent, denies Republicans the chance to capture power in the chamber.</rdfs:comment>
