		<rdfs:label>article-f8416859-5b49-465d-aad9-68032a1008cf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A liberal think tank has grown comfortable with mainstream influence. Other activists say that being “normie” means it’s selling out.</rdfs:comment>
