		<rdfs:label>article-f844206b-1f25-4f1a-a529-dc6bc7f4eef3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Mr. Buttigieg, who appears in strong position in Iowa with a month until the caucuses, continues to show fund-raising strength.</rdfs:comment>
