		<rdfs:label>article-f846afdb-5714-4fae-bd27-b685d51421d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A team of New York Times journalists fact-checked Thursday night’s debate, providing context and analysis for nearly four dozen statements by President Trump and Joseph R. Biden Jr. Their findings:</rdfs:comment>
