		<rdfs:label>article-f8581f2b-cffb-4e17-a2b9-2847cf623e89</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Democrats planned a Thursday vote on an aid package as the Treasury secretary said he hoped for a deal on a first phase of economic stimulus within 48 hours.</rdfs:comment>
