	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f858a0e3-f2ad-45ad-84d0-ea61e9c734bb">
		<rdfs:label>article-f858a0e3-f2ad-45ad-84d0-ea61e9c734bb</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The House speaker would not say how the assault on her husband had affected her thinking about whether to stay in Congress. But she said it underscored how Republicans are determined to “put a stop to me.”</rdfs:comment>
