	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f85a29be-15ae-43ed-81e8-9d31227a8d5c">
		<rdfs:label>article-f85a29be-15ae-43ed-81e8-9d31227a8d5c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The agency lacks the resources to go after rich taxpayers. For years, a single revenue agent was responsible for the audits of Donald J. Trump.</rdfs:comment>
