	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f85de59f-8b22-4084-bdfa-7c92693dc140">
		<rdfs:label>article-f85de59f-8b22-4084-bdfa-7c92693dc140</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After the Capitol was evacuated, Nancy Pelosi lashed out at the F.A.A. for its “apparent failure to notify Capitol Police of the preplanned flyover.”</rdfs:comment>
