		<rdfs:label>article-f8624591-e5a6-4b0f-8a02-af10cc6bb932</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Natasha Sarin, a protégé of Larry Summers, is taking a leading role developing tax policy at the Treasury Department — to some progressive Democrats’ chagrin.</rdfs:comment>
