		<rdfs:label>article-f864ab05-74e4-4b53-9ed1-ec888f602539</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Millions of dollars of Paycheck Protection Program loans went to China-backed businesses in critical sectors, a study found.</rdfs:comment>
