	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f86c6172-902c-4256-9aa8-a3bb6404fd4f">
		<rdfs:label>article-f86c6172-902c-4256-9aa8-a3bb6404fd4f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The climate activist and former vice president announced his support on Earth Day and said, “If you want to start solving the climate crisis, this is not rocket science.”</rdfs:comment>
