		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-22"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f870fd16-05c6-4f7b-ae3d-29bdb3df8e8b">
		<rdfs:label>article-f870fd16-05c6-4f7b-ae3d-29bdb3df8e8b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Even as financial institutions vowed to mobilize trillions in capital toward clean energy, developing countries say they are still struggling to pay the costs of adapting to the dangers of global warming.</rdfs:comment>
