		<rdfs:label>article-f8730e3d-8258-4ded-917d-09d2feea2cfe</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>About 48 million American children are not eligible for a coronavirus shot. Their parents face difficult choices as school starts.</rdfs:comment>
