		<rdfs:label>article-f877c610-709f-4793-9013-33df3d6df517</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The department says the school’s admissions practices violated the Civil Rights Act of 1964. Yale’s president says the allegation was based on “inaccurate statistics and unfounded conclusions.”</rdfs:comment>
