	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f87cbbc2-35cb-4876-ac39-07cee4805497">
		<rdfs:label>article-f87cbbc2-35cb-4876-ac39-07cee4805497</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hacking, like war, is the continuation of politics by other means, but without the inevitable sacrifice of lives.</rdfs:comment>
