		<rdfs:comment>Friday: Testing capacity is still a major hurdle to reopening, but California is getting closer. Also: PG&amp;E’s chief executive said he’ll retire.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-738c55e5-1f96-4b93-8c70-fc8c1c8c9119"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-24"/>
