	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f89449ab-e252-4397-aab1-9459a6d03acd">
		<rdfs:label>article-f89449ab-e252-4397-aab1-9459a6d03acd</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The national security spokesman, John Kirby, said that it was unclear if the munitions had reached Russia, but that in any case, they would not “change the course of the war.”</rdfs:comment>
