	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f894862d-5663-48d4-81f9-040b483627a8">
		<rdfs:label>article-f894862d-5663-48d4-81f9-040b483627a8</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Nearly everyone in Jefferson Parish, next to New Orleans, was experiencing problems with their water service after the power went out. Lines for bottled water were growing.</rdfs:comment>
