	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f895d564-d204-4bf9-b62e-00410b674d8c">
		<rdfs:label>article-f895d564-d204-4bf9-b62e-00410b674d8c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A mural on the city’s main thoroughfare that honors the spirit of the protests was the result of a contest in which students chose their favorite rendering, and helped paint it.</rdfs:comment>
