		<rdfs:label>article-f899252c-e96d-4d61-a565-05d49d3c5311</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Dozens of activists and bystanders paying their respects at the site where Mr. Floyd was killed ran from the area on Tuesday morning after a series of loud bangs rang out.</rdfs:comment>
