	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f899e34e-161c-4190-86c8-b489e9ab61df">
		<rdfs:label>article-f899e34e-161c-4190-86c8-b489e9ab61df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Once President Biden picks a nominee, Mr. Jones will introduce her to senators and prepare her for hearings.</rdfs:comment>
