	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f89d4a75-cc2c-488f-8b5d-c6425b4e81fc">
		<rdfs:label>article-f89d4a75-cc2c-488f-8b5d-c6425b4e81fc</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>“Can you imagine if I had a secret Chinese bank account?” the former president asked, referring to a recent Times report, as he returned to the campaign trail in Philadelphia to stump for Joe Biden.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-7479f929-0522-4f1f-a391-dcdb5f4e726c"/>
