	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f89fe861-d9a3-41ad-9b6f-aa1b5cecf93f">
		<rdfs:label>article-f89fe861-d9a3-41ad-9b6f-aa1b5cecf93f</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Our reporters are following all of the exchanges and fact-checking the two candidates, providing context and explanation.</rdfs:comment>
