	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8a8b60d-b39d-4944-8d4b-51e6a230ef9e">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8a8b60d-b39d-4944-8d4b-51e6a230ef9e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Senators working to overhaul the law said recent revelations about former President Donald J. Trump’s efforts to overturn the 2020 election made their work even more crucial.</rdfs:comment>
