	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8aad54f-4a27-4c14-8a88-b7997cf38fd3">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8aad54f-4a27-4c14-8a88-b7997cf38fd3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The former White House aide provided crucial insight into what President Donald J. Trump was doing and saying during the Jan. 6 attack on the Capitol and in the days before.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-0e84c75e-7bc1-4744-83f1-7496fcf4721d"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2022-06-28"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8ab209d-38d2-4a63-abee-aa33ba3f559c">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8ab209d-38d2-4a63-abee-aa33ba3f559c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Getting first shots in arms, globally, is more important than any booster program.</rdfs:comment>
