	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8aeb73f-eabd-4d07-a3fa-28de2b9f5dba">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8aeb73f-eabd-4d07-a3fa-28de2b9f5dba</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A year ago, Joe Biden was on a grim bus tour through Iowa, joined by many old friends, including Tom Vilsack and John Kerry. Now Mr. Biden wants to bring some of the crew back to Washington with him.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-577cfa39-5806-4396-ae24-cdf4ba406715"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-8eb0923f-854c-4241-9d79-040d1aeeb0c0"/>
