		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8b2450f-a03f-40bc-aa93-7958a7e95868">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8b2450f-a03f-40bc-aa93-7958a7e95868</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The suit in federal court, which argues that the ban denies medically at-risk children equal access to a safe education, could set a national precedent.</rdfs:comment>
