	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8b457f9-338a-4bea-ac40-f365c88dc7d6">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8b457f9-338a-4bea-ac40-f365c88dc7d6</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Compared with the presidential debate, this one was almost normal — including the sharply partisan divide over who came out on top.</rdfs:comment>
