	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8b7aaa8-ee2c-4e61-a2ad-5fa19ecda6f5">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8b7aaa8-ee2c-4e61-a2ad-5fa19ecda6f5</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A multiracial coalition brought the senator’s long-promised political revolution to vivid life, for perhaps the first time in the 2020 race.</rdfs:comment>
