		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-04-17"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8c63bc9-1d2a-4fce-9285-00d5d79fa428">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8c63bc9-1d2a-4fce-9285-00d5d79fa428</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>U.S. officials are vague about when and how they might punish new Russian aggression. President Vladimir V. Putin may doubt their resolve.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-6f60db0f-4977-4567-b7bd-9abe5d4a35e8"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-fc2c2b47-32c2-43a0-8e5f-dd4e72335932"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2021-11-25"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-f8c6ea0d-465c-4fad-8c1a-bafc926d729a">
		<rdfs:label>article-f8c6ea0d-465c-4fad-8c1a-bafc926d729a</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Medicaid Re-entry Act ought to become law, regardless of the fate of Build Back Better.</rdfs:comment>
