		<rdfs:label>article-f95073f0-f809-49b8-869b-1fdd2dbe1878</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Scant precedent and gaps in written procedures make the rules for calling witnesses in President Trump’s impeachment trial debatable.</rdfs:comment>
