		<rdfs:label>article-f95bb3ec-1964-47ca-9ed8-caccb473fd6c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The action was largely symbolic, but it allowed Republicans to press an attack on Democrats that is likely to be central to their midterm election campaigns.</rdfs:comment>
