		<rdfs:label>article-f9812a48-549b-42a1-b8bf-989d50d79639</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Millions of doses of coronavirus vaccine are still sitting in freezers, allocated in excess to nursing homes or stockpiled for later use. Now states are claiming them.</rdfs:comment>
