		<rdfs:label>article-f9895d23-f7a3-4b27-942c-269411a0fd21</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Police departments have tried to ban or severely limit the use of chokeholds and neck restraints. But in Minneapolis, a knee pressing on a neck led to a man’s death.</rdfs:comment>
