		<rdfs:label>article-f992024b-17d8-44bb-b267-9fe7e62ae9df</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>With job losses, record coronavirus numbers and politics in turmoil after the storming of the Capitol, the president-elect pressed for quick passage of a stimulus package to help struggling Americans.</rdfs:comment>
