		<rdfs:label>article-fa2f4043-1b54-4b1b-87b2-90b9ef2c894c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>At a White House event, President Trump mischaracterized a Biden policy proposal and declared, “the suburban destruction will end with us.” A college will require Mike Pence and other attendees to wear masks at a campaign event.</rdfs:comment>
