	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fb6257ea-4fae-4f41-b68a-dabfbdf2d2a2">
		<rdfs:label>article-fb6257ea-4fae-4f41-b68a-dabfbdf2d2a2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Biden administration is watching for any moves by China to close off the Taiwan Strait, and they would prefer that Nancy Pelosi cancel her planned trip.</rdfs:comment>
