	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fd0620b8-9181-4979-95f4-72ab8e61dc7d">
		<rdfs:label>article-fd0620b8-9181-4979-95f4-72ab8e61dc7d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Almost seven million people were being told to boil their water as another barrage of sleet and snow approached. FEMA has sent the state bottled water, blankets and generators.</rdfs:comment>
