	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fd666c0f-9b14-47d2-b46b-de3a9166e0a9">
		<rdfs:label>article-fd666c0f-9b14-47d2-b46b-de3a9166e0a9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s ambitious plan to increase corporate taxes does more than just reverse much of the overhaul pushed through by his predecessor. It also offers a profoundly different vision of how to make the United States more competitive and how to foot the bill.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-2b1db0aa-b05c-4711-bba6-bc79569f5883"/>
