	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fda85ea4-729f-4688-93e9-507a1fe63861">
		<rdfs:label>article-fda85ea4-729f-4688-93e9-507a1fe63861</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Hours after his positive test for Covid-19, President Trump did not appear on a scheduled call with governors from across the country early Friday afternoon, and Vice President Mike Pence took his place on the call.</rdfs:comment>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasAuthor rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;author-049fb7b6-9066-46e6-b432-7450b1cd6746"/>
