		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublishDate rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;date-2020-10-02"/>
		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fda98a77-5dd7-4fe3-8eb1-a85de254f139">
		<rdfs:label>article-fda98a77-5dd7-4fe3-8eb1-a85de254f139</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The Republican-drawn map intentionally split strongholds of Democratic and Black voters, a judge ruled. The State Supreme Court will review the decision.</rdfs:comment>
