	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdaf9fc0-0abf-4fab-b0ad-86be32eeed00">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdaf9fc0-0abf-4fab-b0ad-86be32eeed00</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As unions decline and their members maintain their affections for Donald J. Trump, Democrats like Representative Marcy Kaptur find their base of support eroding quickly.</rdfs:comment>
