	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdb36ac1-f9a6-4cfb-89d6-2eef49340f62">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdb36ac1-f9a6-4cfb-89d6-2eef49340f62</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Team members were not properly trained, lacked necessary gear and moved freely around and off military bases where Americans were quarantined, a complaint says.</rdfs:comment>
