	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdb373b0-5837-4c09-8907-3af15aa7d359">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdb373b0-5837-4c09-8907-3af15aa7d359</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Biden’s nominee to be assistant secretary of health, who is transgender, and a House member whose daughter is transgender, drew separate attacks from Republican lawmakers.</rdfs:comment>
