	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdb64ad4-7f04-45d4-83a5-67e6d62fd3ea">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdb64ad4-7f04-45d4-83a5-67e6d62fd3ea</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>He also called on Congress to pass a federal law that protects the right to an abortion.</rdfs:comment>
