	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdb6872c-1023-4026-a0fd-2e0394a87a03">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdb6872c-1023-4026-a0fd-2e0394a87a03</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A family from India froze to death just yards away from crossing into the United States from Canada. Desperate migrants are trying their luck on the northern border.</rdfs:comment>
