		<rdfs:label>article-fdb7d2aa-121e-4400-a2f3-ffb023ca7f60</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The pharmaceutical giant Merck &amp; Co. agreed to help manufacture Johnson &amp; Johnson’s coronavirus vaccine, in a deal partly brokered by the White House.</rdfs:comment>
