		<rdfs:label>article-fdba281f-aa66-4ce7-a0b2-f9bf02563838</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Amtrak says it needs more money to avoid slashing service on routes in areas where the rail network is often the only mode of long-distance public transportation.</rdfs:comment>
