		<rdfs:label>article-fdbaf23f-39d1-4ae3-b820-9d8ff568f458</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A commission appointed by Congress will recommend that expanding selective service registration to women is a “necessary and fair step.”</rdfs:comment>
