	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdcddc11-f1d0-4088-9866-e8cde5902d1d">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdcddc11-f1d0-4088-9866-e8cde5902d1d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The president visited California after weeks of silence on its wildfires and blamed the crisis only on poor forest management, not climate change. “I don’t think science knows” what is happening, he said.</rdfs:comment>
