		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdd27443-f5d8-4b65-8888-549e270d7e22">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdd27443-f5d8-4b65-8888-549e270d7e22</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>There might have been better ways to handle the situation, but officials did what they had to do.</rdfs:comment>
