		<rdfs:label>article-fded9a09-1925-41cb-a456-179e82711c5d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Retirements nationwide were up by 45 percent and resignations by 18 percent in the 12-month period ending in April.</rdfs:comment>
