	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdee4ace-2b7f-4e89-95ff-b78b835ad8d4">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdee4ace-2b7f-4e89-95ff-b78b835ad8d4</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In an inauguration scaled back first by the pandemic and then by security concerns related to the attack at the Capitol earlier this month, President Biden continued with one inaugural tradition on Wednesday: exiting the presidential limo and strolling down Pennsylvania Avenue.</rdfs:comment>
