		<PoliticalJournalism:hasPublisher rdf:resource="&PoliticalJournalism;NewYorkTimes"/>
	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdefde53-65c0-40ec-afc9-1b8b75ac41d2">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdefde53-65c0-40ec-afc9-1b8b75ac41d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Jerome H. Powell, who is well liked across the political spectrum, is presiding over the fastest interest rate increases in generations, with another one expected this week.</rdfs:comment>
