		<rdfs:label>article-fdf01416-899a-4f60-a3f6-e443382ccda9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>A ballot measure in Minneapolis would disband and replace the city’s troubled Police Department. Even some voters who want change think it goes too far.</rdfs:comment>
