	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fdf1141f-3216-4b49-8997-74bec8f4d723">
		<rdfs:label>article-fdf1141f-3216-4b49-8997-74bec8f4d723</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Republicans seem to feel less feisty than when they were cruising into the summer.</rdfs:comment>
