		<rdfs:label>article-fe00becb-c1b0-42c8-9912-7d5a35366aaf</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As the rest of the nation shelters in place, the first Americans to recover from the virus test drive immunity.</rdfs:comment>
