	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fe071c23-f333-46bb-9332-9bb649d14791">
		<rdfs:label>article-fe071c23-f333-46bb-9332-9bb649d14791</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The premise seemed to be a politically savvy one: find an everyman bar owner in a battleground state whose shuttered business was struggling to survive during the coronavirus pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
