	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fe15d94a-381a-4d11-95e5-66d72b83dac2">
		<rdfs:label>article-fe15d94a-381a-4d11-95e5-66d72b83dac2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>One of the key arguments on behalf of the men accused of murdering Ahmaud Arbery is that they were trying to make a citizen’s arrest permitted under a Civil War-era Georgia law.</rdfs:comment>
