	</PoliticalJournalism:Article>
	
	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-fe182e07-107f-4003-ac22-3fe78df8a0c9">
		<rdfs:label>article-fe182e07-107f-4003-ac22-3fe78df8a0c9</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Contrary to misunderstandings, the actions fall short of ordering meatpacking facilities to reopen despite Covid-19 outbreaks among workers.</rdfs:comment>
