		<rdfs:label>article-fe1dcc76-ed0a-434e-9fb9-55752f466a32</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump on Thursday cheered the actions of a federal task force that killed Michael Reinoehl, an antifa activist from Portland, Ore., who had been wanted in the fatal shooting of a far-right Trump supporter.</rdfs:comment>
