		<rdfs:label>article-fe38ba7c-df03-4b05-897b-a585deda14d3</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Many of the jurors said they had already seen body camera video of Ms. Potter, a former police officer in Brooklyn Center, Minn., fatally shooting Daunte Wright after seeming to mistake her gun for her Taser.</rdfs:comment>
