		<rdfs:label>article-fe39ad12-4429-4b42-987a-f64ea04a489e</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The agency will also allow vaccine recipients to pick which vaccine they want as a booster, endorsing a mix-and-match approach.</rdfs:comment>
