		<rdfs:comment>Our reporters provided live updates and analysis on Monday night during the first and only debate between Gov. Ron DeSantis of Florida and his challenger in his re-election bid, Charlie Crist. The debate between Mr. DeSantis, a Republican, and Mr. Crist, a Democrat, was held in Fort Pierce, Fla., on the same day that in-person early voting got underway in some of the state’s biggest counties.</rdfs:comment>
