	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ff7e6602-17b2-4d07-a7c1-37cd5b3dc11d">
		<rdfs:label>article-ff7e6602-17b2-4d07-a7c1-37cd5b3dc11d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus has spread into the most remote villages, a reminder of earlier pandemics that ravaged the state. Now there is a rush to deliver vaccines in time.</rdfs:comment>
