	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ff7fa93a-c904-4e20-b63a-b0ebf9bfed97">
		<rdfs:label>article-ff7fa93a-c904-4e20-b63a-b0ebf9bfed97</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Los Angeles County, San Francisco and the state as a whole have issued emergency declarations because of the growing outbreak.</rdfs:comment>
