	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ff820edd-9950-4d45-b501-ff28115a1a48">
		<rdfs:label>article-ff820edd-9950-4d45-b501-ff28115a1a48</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The move effectively stripped Ms. Greene, who represents Georgia’s 14th congressional district, of her influence in Congress.</rdfs:comment>
