	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ff82c9ca-56ef-4a63-a3cb-35c6cf4f17b7">
		<rdfs:label>article-ff82c9ca-56ef-4a63-a3cb-35c6cf4f17b7</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>After millions lost power during a winter storm, lawmakers have held marathon hearings, prosecutors have started criminal investigations and residents have asked for accountability.</rdfs:comment>
