		<rdfs:label>article-ff84e430-eefd-4d7a-bae6-f6e057a07655</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The parents of millions of American schoolchildren are not fluent in English, presenting an extra challenge to learning at home.</rdfs:comment>
