		<rdfs:label>article-ff8ac918-a0df-4fbd-99aa-74bc94065e88</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The midterms’ results showed the limits of “Team Crazy,” in the words of Representative Peter Meijer — one of many harsh judgments coursing through a demoralized Republican Party.</rdfs:comment>
