		<rdfs:label>article-ff8bc400-ff0a-4a7f-8dc6-ec3c6f649907</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The race between Senator Raphael Warnock and his Republican challenger, Herschel Walker, will be decided in a Dec. 6 runoff.</rdfs:comment>
