	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ff9ce486-0325-46fc-8bc7-44ada63a0d38">
		<rdfs:label>article-ff9ce486-0325-46fc-8bc7-44ada63a0d38</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>As Russia attacks Ukraine, a school’s mission becomes about more than teaching the language; it’s about protecting the culture. “It’s our people, it’s our tradition, it’s our language. It’s our everything.”</rdfs:comment>
