	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ffa862ce-47f7-42d0-82fe-6a56a5b3dcac">
		<rdfs:label>article-ffa862ce-47f7-42d0-82fe-6a56a5b3dcac</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>President Trump has employed provocative and sometimes incendiary words and images to focus attention on demonstrations and away from the human and economic costs of the pandemic.</rdfs:comment>
