	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ffb6e8cc-3520-4958-a4e4-2cd812dc1ece">
		<rdfs:label>article-ffb6e8cc-3520-4958-a4e4-2cd812dc1ece</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Gov. Kate Brown of Oregon said that hospitals were at risk of becoming overwhelmed. She authorized as many as 1,500 troops to support health care workers.</rdfs:comment>
