	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ffc3aede-08ff-47a0-b60d-7f7109fedbfa">
		<rdfs:label>article-ffc3aede-08ff-47a0-b60d-7f7109fedbfa</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The state has had a top-two system for a decade with a goal of electing more moderate officials, but it may work better in theory than practice.</rdfs:comment>
