		<rdfs:label>article-ffd76b8c-858a-4924-9070-b660c1d5a31c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>Officials and strategists warned that if a wide partisan gap over mail voting continues in November, Republicans could be at a disadvantage.</rdfs:comment>
