		<rdfs:label>article-ffdb3a53-1675-4ab9-bc35-2a3a5d334562</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>In a conversation with Kara Swisher, the billionaire entrepreneur talks space-faring civilization, battery-powered everything and computer chips in your skull.</rdfs:comment>
