	<PoliticalJournalism:Article rdf:about="&PoliticalJournalism;article-ffdbc026-6951-4506-ac46-39297ca19a6d">
		<rdfs:label>article-ffdbc026-6951-4506-ac46-39297ca19a6d</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>California’s efforts to at once contain the coronavirus and the economic devastation trailing in its wake have converged in the Inland Empire.</rdfs:comment>
