		<rdfs:label>article-ffdfd947-c805-44ac-8d43-257f6fc993d2</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The politician who talked the most about progressive change is now wrestling with a nationwide movement he didn’t start.</rdfs:comment>
