		<rdfs:label>article-ffe1507a-75a2-4113-9d41-9e6c5e0e566b</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>On the day of President Biden’s inauguration, John Eastman suggested looking for voting irregularities in Georgia — and asked for help in getting paid the $270,000 he had billed the Trump campaign.</rdfs:comment>
