		<rdfs:label>article-ffe17a25-e4e5-48bc-836a-d2c1e3c7976c</rdfs:label>
		<rdfs:comment>The coronavirus pandemic is forcing the military to consider creating a quarantine zone at the court compound to allow proceedings to continue in the case of the alleged 9/11 plotters.</rdfs:comment>
